  [11018120] = "Trying to find the truth, I feel I'm getting involved in something I shouldn't.",
  [11018200] = "I need a detail-oriented person to help me organize the files.",
  [11018211] = "%s organizes everything swiftly, to your delight.",
  [11018212] = "%s misfiles a lot of things, to your chagrin.",
  [11018213] = "%s throws away everything important and keeps everything trivial.",
  [11018214] = "%s accidentally spills everything on the floor and has to start over.",
  [11018219] = "I'll do it myself. That's the spirit, right?",
  [11018220] = "It feels like the truth is right in front of your eyes.",
  [11019000] = "Now that I'm done with City News, it's time to finish filming some indie cases I've taken up on the side!",
  [11019001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11019002] = "I finally realize how hard it is to do a ghost reality show!",
  [11019100] = "While filming on the second floor, spooky cries ring out on the ground floor...",
  [11019111] = "%s sprinkles salt around the place and the cries stop.",
  [11019112] = "%s starts chanting some mumbo jumbo to absolutely no avail.",
  [11019113] = "%s claims the ghost is European, which does not fall into the jurisdiction of his practice.",
  [11019114] = "%s wants to lead everyone in a song to show strength and unity.",
  [11019119] = "Leave the crying noise alone.",
  [11019120] = "We have to be more prepared for this next time… Nevermind, there's no next time.",
  [11019200] = "The team wants to hire someone for narration and commentary. Who do you choose?",
  [11019211] = "%s's clever, timely commentary adds levity to the suspense, making the show very interesting.",
  [11019212] = "%s is too melodramatic and comes off as fake.",
  [11019213] = "%s goes way off topic and doesn't even talk about the old house.",
  [11019214] = "%s offers nothing but stuff straight out of horror fiction.",
  [11019219] = "I can handle the role! I won a story-telling contest in elementary school, you know.",
  [11019220] = "Fear stands for \"False Expectation Appearing Real.\"",
  [11020000] = "For the new City News segment, I should interview several celebs and make it an entertainment special.",
  [11020001] = "I can no longer come up with creative ideas. I feel like my brain is going rusty. Suddenly, a silhouette appears in my head...",
  [11020002] = "First time in the North Pole. It's way too cold! Achoo!",
  [11020100] = "It's boring at the North Pole. Bring someone with a great sense of humor along.",
  [11020111] = "%s, an actor, is tight with you and helps you get on the set.",
  [11020112] = "%s is a complete dullard. Sometimes you don't even notice the person's on the team.",
  [11020113] = "%s is very pessimistic with much depressing thoughts to share.",
  [11020114] = "%s is a sasaeng, so you're both chased out.",
  [11020119] = "Your tight budget allows for only necessary personnel. Too bad, but it's going to be a boring trip.",
  [11020120] = "It's going to be tough, but I hope the crew will cheer up.",
  [11020200] = "You still can't get close to the celebs. Perhaps you should bribe their makeup artists?",
  [11020211] = "%s, a makeup artist for many celebs, helps you get what you want.",
  [11020212] = "%s is just a new makeup artist who doesn't know anyone.",
  [11020213] = "%s is reckless enough to get lost in the snow as well.",
  [11020214] = "%s is callous and feels no need to find the missing person.",
  [11020219] = "You decide to turn the team around and go back for the lost cameraman, which postpones the shoot.",
  [11020220] = "Regardless, leave no one behind!",
  [11021000] = "The interviews in the dressing room not only earned me some contacts but also provided me lots of new ideas for variety shows. I might try a new direction in our new kids show...",
  [11021001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11021002] = "It's a wrap. Hope everyone finds a true love.",
  [11021100] = "Ask someone to get some gifts for the kids to keep them happy while filming.",
  [11021111] = "%s buys the kids cute plushies that bring smiles a mile wide.",
  [11021112] = "%s buys a math exercise book. The kids start crying...",
  [11021113] = "%s buys lots of candy, but the parents aren't too happy as it might cause toothaches.",
  [11021114] = "%s designs an outfit that shows way too much skin.",
  [11021119] = "No good candidates available, so you have to handle the wardrobe yourself.",
  [11021120] = "For the sake of the show, I need the kids on my side!",
  [11021200] = "To ensure the safety of the kids, you also need medical personnel on the spot.",
  [11021211] = "%s is professional and great with kids.",
  [11021212] = "%s is an excellent doctor, but very mean towards the kids.",
  [11021213] = "%s keeps telling the kids that they're ill because demons have possessed them.",
  [11021214] = "Instead of helping, %s just causes more problems.",
  [11021219] = "Maybe preparing some first-aid kits will do the job.",
  [11021220] = "A good makeup is just as important as a good dress.",
  [11022000] = "Everything I learned at the filming site can be used in the live matchmaking show I'll be producing later!",
  [11022001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11022002] = "Well, stars are people too, albeit unapporachable people.",
  [11022100] = "The contestants need to be dressed well. Who shall design the women's outfits?",
  [11022111] = "%s is tight with you and helps you get on the set.",
  [11022112] = "%s is just an extra and can't help you.",
  [11022113] = "%s feels it's too much trouble to get you in.",
  [11022114] = "%s wants to sneak in too, but they kick both of you out rather quickly.",
  [11022119] = "Nothing you can do but try to smooth talk the security. It's already dark outside when they let you inside the studio.",
  [11022120] = "Just making it in is good enough for the day.",
  [11022200] = "You'll also need a great makeup artist. Who shall it be?",
  [11022211] = "%s has great rapports with the stars and hooks you up.",
  [11022212] = "%s is just a part-timer and unable to help.",
  [11022213] = "%s thinks too highly of self to lend you a hand.",
  [11022214] = "%s is a con artist and almost tricks you into being an accomplice.",
  [11022219] = "You try to contact their agents but eat one rejection after another.",
  [11022220] = "Never thought it would be this hard!",
  [11023000] = "I guess I'm now part of the Project X team. I'll work hard to make this program more exciting!",
  [11023001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11023002] = "Running errands outside in the scorching-hot summer really takes a toll on you!",
  [11023100] = "Kiro's wearing a mascot outfit, but it can still be dangerous. Someone should watch over him.",
  [11023111] = "%s is the perfect professional for this situation!",
  [11023112] = "%s's dramatic actions end up attracting even more attention.",
  [11023113] = "%s conceals Kiro perfectly—now not even YOU can find him!",
  [11023114] = "%s can't handle the heat and abandons the post.",
  [11023119] = "Guess Kiro will have to handle it himself.",
  [11023120] = "Ugh, acting as backup sure was difficult!",
  [11023200] = "You need someone good-looking on your team to appear in a scene. Who will it be?",
  [11023211] = "%s does modeling and is perfect for the job.",
  [11023212] = "%s is a severe hunchback and draws criticisms online.",
  [11023213] = "%s is a camera hog and ruins the show.",
  [11023214] = "%s doesn't have the looks.",
  [11023219] = "No crew member fits this description.",
  [11023220] = "This is a great opportunity to build up my own fanbase!",
  [11024000] = "That was quite the experience. I wonder what will happen next?",
  [11024001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11024002] = "What an exhausting day! I guess I get tired way too easily.",
  [11024100] = "What a hot day! Maybe someone would know a cool, quiet place where you can rest.",
  [11024111] = "%s knows everything about this city and points out the perfect location.",
  [11024112] = "%s guides you to a mall. It's cool, but not very quiet!",
  [11024113] = "%s can't come up with any ideas.",
  [11024114] = "%s doesn't know this city well and can't help you.",
  [11024119] = "You decide to just check the map on your phone.",
  [11024120] = "Taking a rest feels great!",
  [11024200] = "Kiro's makeup is coming off. Who do you ask to help?",
  [11024211] = "%s spruces up Kiro's makeup within seconds.",
  [11024212] = "%s didn't bring a makeup kit and can't do a thing.",
  [11024213] = "%s makes Kiro look like a clown.",
  [11024214] = "%s doesn't know anything about makeup and flees in horror.",
  [11024219] = "I'm not bad at applying makeup, so might as well do it myself!",
  [11024220] = "Kiro looks good without makeup, but we still gotta make sure he looks his best!",
  [11025000] = "Our company is now experienced enough to film documentaries! My team will be heading to Antarctica to film, while I provide backup from afar.",
  [11025001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11025002] = "Antarctica... wow, looks cold...",
  [11025100] = "Life in Antarctica can be boring. You need a crew member with a sense of humor!",
  [11025111] = "%s is a fence and easily tracks down leads for you.",
  [11025112] = "%s tries for days in vain.",
  [11025113] = "%s finds you nothing but counterfeits.",
  [11025114] = "%s loathes you, so forget about it.",
  [11025119] = "You can't find any, so you resort to getting images off the net.",
  [11025120] = "It was universal currency but slowly faded from circulation.",
  [11025200] = "A cameraman is lost in the blizzard. Send someone brave to find him!",
  [11025211] = "%s answers all your questions about the ancient coins.",
  [11025212] = "%s has no idea what they are.",
  [11025213] = "%s pretends to be knowledgeable and passes on many false information.",
  [11025214] = "%s runs off in the middle of night with all the money…",
  [11025219] = "You have no one handy to help you. Matching images one-by-one online is your sole recourse.",
  [11025220] = "They're right, knowledge is power.",
  [11026000] = "The documentary was well-received. It's time to film another one! The theme should be... money!",
  [11026001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11026002] = "It's good to helm a web series for the first time despite having no prior experience whatsoever!",
  [11026100] = "The premise is a time-traveling youth becoming a hero. Anybody fitting the role?",
  [11026111] = "%s is a terrific actor and perfect for the part.",
  [11026112] = "%s is a bad actor but very good looking, receiving mixed reviews online.",
  [11026113] = "%s is chosen at the last second and becomes a target of ridicules online.",
  [11026114] = "%s has a terrible attitude, refuses to rehearse lines and delays production at every turn.",
  [11026119] = "You only have enough budget for a newbie with no fan following.",
  [11026120] = "It is a skin-deep world...",
  [11026200] = "Who do you get to write the script?",
  [11026211] = "%s is both fast and good. You're very satisfied with the work.",
  [11026212] = "%s writes a good script but procrastinates. When you call for the latest draft on the fifteenth time, you're told the cat ate it.",
  [11026213] = "%s writes fast but the draft is incoherent, worse than a grade schooler's essay.",
  [11026214] = "%s is a horrendous writer and blows you off every day with a new excuse.",
  [11026219] = "Buy an average script online.",
  [11026220] = "Writers who are on time are worth their weight in gold.",
  [11027000] = "The company received a commission to film a low-budget online drama. I can't make it to the shoot, but this is still a splendid opportunity!",
  [11027001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11027002] = "It's good to start filming a web series for the first time despite having no prior experience whatsoever!",
  [11027100] = "The filming's about to start when the lead actor has schedule conflict…",
  [11027111] = "%s negotiates for you and successfully navigates the problems.",
  [11027112] = "%s errs in the communication and delays the filming by ten days.",
  [11027113] = "%s's negotiation lets the series begin shootng on time, but the tactics used infuriate many of the lead actor's fans.",
  [11027114] = "%s negotiates you into losing the lead actor.",
  [11027119] = "To accommodate the lead actor, you must reschedule filming.",
  [11027120] = "Looks and talent... both are important!",
  [11027200] = "A supporting actor suffers a fracture. You're down to a crew member for backup…",
  [11027211] = "%s has a knack for acting and makes the series better.",
  [11027212] = "%s looks the part but sorely lacks acting chops. A wax figure would've been an improvement.",
  [11027213] = "%s actually does a decent job, but doesn't look the part and gets negative reviews for that.",
  [11027214] = "%s is so hammy that even you can't stand it.",
  [11027219] = "With no actor available, you're forced to cut the role out, making the series inconsistent and getting it panned everywhere.",
  [11027220] = "You can't do without either the lead or the support.",
  [11028000] = "The filming for the online drama has begun! Looks like it's going well so far.",
  [11028001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11028002] = "The filming is going quite smoothly! It's like we've mastered a new skill.",
  [11028100] = "Who do you choose to do the actors' makeup?",
  [11028111] = "%s is an expert who styles the actors impeccably.",
  [11028112] = "%s isn't shabby, but lacks originality.",
  [11028113] = "%s is much more creative than talented, giving every role the same avant-garde treatment whether necessary or not.",
  [11028114] = "%s is neither good nor creative. Every actor ends up looking the same as background extras.",
  [11028119] = "You bring in a few temp makeup artists from the studios for the time being.",
  [11028120] = "No handsome face can overcome a bad makeup job.",
  [11028200] = "You need someone to make eyedrops for the lead actress who can't cry on demand.",
  [11028211] = "The solution from %s works very well, the lead actress is crying up a storm.",
  [11028212] = "The audience isn't feeling the eyedrops from %s.",
  [11028213] = "The lead actress sheds very fake tears from %s's solution.",
  [11028214] = "The eyedrops from %s don't work at all and even give the actress an infection.",
  [11028219] = "No specialist, just tell the actress to think of something sad, like losing her purse.",
  [11028220] = "Crying scenes are hard to do and I know she gave it her all.",
  [11029000] = "The filming is in progress. It will be done soon!",
  [11029001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11029002] = "Can't believe such a wondrous civilization could vanish without a trace…",
  [11029100] = "Your funding is not enough and need someone lucky to buy a lotto ticket for you.",
  [11029111] = "%s is your lucky charm and you win enough from lotto for your trip to the Mayan ruins.",
  [11029112] = "%s buys you a winning ticket, but the amount isn't nearly enough.",
  [11029113] = "%s hits the lowest level and gets you two dollars.",
  [11029114] = "%s cheats you out of the ten bucks you gave him.",
  [11029119] = "You decide to play the lotto yourself and... lose.",
  [11029120] = "I feel very lucky lately. Just imagine all the shows I can do with the jackpot!",
  [11029200] = "It's a dangerous path to the Mayan ruins. You need protection.",
  [11029211] = "%s takes you safely to the ruins unharmed.",
  [11029212] = "The eyedrops from %s makes the emotions seem fake to the audience.",
  [11029213] = "%s is a poor fighter who can't even handle a chihuahua.",
  [11029214] = "%s gets into a squabble with you on the way and leaves.",
  [11029219] = "You think you can go it alone only to get hurt time and time again.",
  [11029220] = "Never imagine how tough this trip is!",
  [11030000] = "You have to communicate with Standards & Practices when doing a documentary on uppers.",
  [11030001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11030002] = "Never knew uppers have such bad side effects…",
  [11030100] = "You need someone to explain the dangers of uppers to your audience.",
  [11030111] = "%s elaborates in extensive details and offers many examples in the athletic field.",
  [11030112] = "%s doesn't know much beyond the principles and stutters to explain the basics.",
  [11030113] = "%s has only superficial knowledge on the subject and gives boring examples.",
  [11030114] = "%s supports the use of uppers and completely disagrees with your and the show's view.",
  [11030119] = "You can't find a suitable guest since it's a topic no one wants to get into in front of a camera.",
  [11030120] = "Just say no to drugs.",
  [11030200] = "You need an expert to demonstrate an experiment with uppers.",
  [11030211] = "%s knows a lot about the subject and demonstrates with ease.",
  [11030212] = "%s is unfamiliar with the experiment and thoroughly messes it up.",
  [11030213] = "%s clumsily breaks many test tubes.",
  [11030214] = "%s spectacularly botches the experiment and blows up the lab.",
  [11030219] = "You think the experiment will only make more people interested in uppers and ditch the idea.",
  [11030220] = "Any experiment has to be taken seriously.",
  [11031000] = "Bring camera into entertainers' cribs and show how they live alone.",
  [11031001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11031002] = "Wheter an entertainer or not, life is life.",
  [11031100] = "Some entertainers don't let their lazy side shown. Get someone to convince them.",
  [11031111] = "%s talked many stars into doing it.",
  [11031112] = "%s speaks to a lot of people but no one agrees.",
  [11031113] = "Some stars were interested, but after talking to %s.",
  [11031114] = "%s isn't popular or knows any stars.",
  [11031119] = "You had to do the legwork yourself to get people to do the show.",
  [11031120] = "I understand why they don't want their privacy out in the open.",
  [11031200] = "Who do you want to help you brainstorm activities and events for single stars?",
  [11031211] = "%s gets a lightbulb over the head and comes up with many interesting activities.",
  [11031212] = "%s spends hours and can only think of throwing a dinner party.",
  [11031213] = "%s spends hours and doesn't have any idea at all.",
  [11031214] = "%s tunes you out and doesn't even hear your questions.",
  [11031219] = "You try to go it alone but just can't come up with anything creative.",
  [11031220] = "Ow, my brain can't take it anymore!",
  [11032000] = "You want a show starring a hot Internet fortune-telling master who solves the viewers' problems.",
  [11032001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11032002] = "The original focus is on paranormal adventures, but turns into mediating disputes rather quickly...",
  [11032100] = "A caller has a problem with missing cakes. Who do you send with the master?",
  [11032111] = "%s investigates and discovers it was the viewer's roommate who ate the cakes every night.",
  [11032112] = "%s is not proficient with this kind of programs and the dull, boring camera angles verify it.",
  [11032113] = "%s just doesn't get it and spends way too long to finally find out it was the viewer's roommate who ate the cakes every night.",
  [11032114] = "Neither %s and the master can figure out the mystery, until the viewer's roommate confessing to eating the cakes.",
  [11032119] = "No one is accompanying the master so it's a solo mission.",
  [11032120] = "Gotta keep an eye on your roommate!",
  [11032200] = "The viewer and the roommate are fighting on air. Who do you get to peacemake?",
  [11032211] = "%s is a great mediator and convinces the roommate to admit fault. The two make up and are friends again.",
  [11032212] = "%s could have saved the breath since the words made no difference at all. The viewer and the roommate are still quarreling.",
  [11032213] = "%s gets off on the wrong foot and makes the matter worse.",
  [11032214] = "%s gets into a heated argument with the roommate to make for a very awkward segment.",
  [11032219] = "You can't do anything but watch the squabble escalate.",
  [11032220] = "Cake or friendship, that is the question.",
  [11033000] = "You're shooting a commercial for a famous manufacturer's new mustard-stuffed biscuit.",
  [11033001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11033002] = "Of course, the mustard biscuit clears your sinuses in a hurry...",
  [11033100] = "The ad calls for someone with the gumption to eat the biscuits nonstop.",
  [11033111] = "%s almost eats till he drops and provides memorable shots.",
  [11033112] = "%s hates mustard and doesn't even touch it.",
  [11033113] = "%s takes one bite and refuses.",
  [11033114] = "%s can't stop tearing after a bite.",
  [11033119] = "No volunteers so you have to do it yourself and get a tummy ache.",
  [11033120] = "You can't really eat… too many… of these at a time...",
  [11033200] = "You want an editor to help improve the CG in your commercial.",
  [11033211] = "%s refines the CG into a life-like experience.",
  [11033212] = "%s is grossly overpaid at any price.",
  [11033213] = "%s botches the file at the last minute.",
  [11033214] = "%s is unprofessional and doesn't finish the job.",
  [11033219] = "No one's qualified in-house, so you end up spending a lot of money hiring a freelancer.",
  [11033220] = "I always have admiration for those specializing in special effects.",
  [11034000] = "I crammed for a whole week on French because the latest episode of City News features a lot of local news.",
  [11034001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11034002] = "It seems my French can still use some improvement.",
  [11034100] = "You need a host who is a proficient French speaker…",
  [11034111] = "%s reads from the teleprompter flawlessly.",
  [11034112] = "%s trips over a lot of words and comes off less than professional.",
  [11034113] = "%s is too jittery when speaking French and unable to fully present the content.",
  [11034114] = "%s knows very little French beyond the alphabets.",
  [11034119] = "No suitable candidates available. You can only force the host to memorize the script.",
  [11034120] = "Language is a vital tool for communication.",
  [11034200] = "You need a report who's on call 24/7 for a show.",
  [11034211] = "%s is very reliable and never slacks off.",
  [11034212] = "%s hates outbound assignment and finds any excuse not to go.",
  [11034213] = "%s always takes the opportunity for personal pleasure and doesn't concentrate on work.",
  [11034214] = "%s never goes on the actual assignment but scours the net for relevant--albeit unverified--reports.",
  [11034219] = "No one's going to take work over family. You just have to do the best you can yourself.",
  [11034220] = "Yeah, it is inhumane to send anyone out on the road practically all year long.",
  [11035000] = "I tried the interesting nitrogen puffs that made me breathe smoke out of my nose, and I want to do a feature on it!",
  [11035001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11035002] = "It's very interesting and satisfying to explore new, cool things on the foodie front.",
  [11035100] = "They sold out of nitro puffs after how long I've been waiting in line?",
  [11035101] = "What rotten luck! I'll go home now.",
  [11035102] = "Wait, next door has chicken fillet…",
  [11035103] = "Interview the lucky last customer!",
  [11035111] = "The day's delay will cost you a lot.",
  [11035112] = "The chicken fillet is only so-so.",
  [11035113] = "A young passerby gladly agrees to an impromptu tasting. The fun, genuine interaction garners a big crowd!",
  [11035120] = "Creativity sometimes comes in simple forms.",
  [11035200] = "Who do you get to give \"nitro puff\" a grander, flashier name?",
  [11035211] = "The new name is a novel mix of English and Chinese that draws a myriad of curious foodies instantly!",
  [11035212] = "The new name is too weird and doesn't even sound like something one would eat.",
  [11035213] = "The new name isn't bad, but says nothing about the nitro puffs.",
  [11035214] = "The new name is a bust. Sale plummets to new low.",
  [11035219] = "\"Nitro Puffs\" isn't bad, either. It's simple and to the point.",
  [11035220] = "A good name is not about exaggeration but concisiveness.",
  [11036000] = "You want to film a video on AIDS prevention as a public service.",
  [11036001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11036002] = "AIDS is a serious disease that everyone should be aware of and protect themselves from.",
  [11036100] = "You want someone who can persuade AIDS patients to appear in the video…",
  [11036111] = "%s convinces them with ease. The video is a go.",
  [11036112] = "%s spends a lot of time but is still unable to convince them.",
  [11036113] = "%s is AIDS-phobic and refuses to speak to them face-to-face.",
  [11036114] = "%s feels you're exploiting the patients and declines to help.",
  [11036119] = "After thinking it over, you may be invading the patients' privacy so you give up on the idea.",
  [11036120] = "If only there's a way for the patients to recover from AIDS completely…",
  [11036200] = "You want to find someone who can communicate with kindergarteners about AIDS.",
  [11036211] = "%s gets the undivided attention of all the kids for a wonderful segment.",
  [11036212] = "%s tries hard but fails catch any kid's attention.",
  [11036213] = "%s scares the kids with a mean voice.",
  [11036214] = "%s dislikes children and doesn't want to speak to them.",
  [11036219] = "You think you can handle this easy task yourself, but…",
  [11036220] = "Don't try to guess or outguess kids.",
  [11037000] = "You're producing a marriage counseling show and it's turning into an arena… Looks like you need extra security.",
  [11037001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11037002] = "Half of success is getting off to a good start.",
  [11037100] = "Who do you pick to be the counselor of your new marriage counseling show?",
  [11037111] = "%s is fair and sincere, garnering a lot of approvals.",
  [11037112] = "%s can't articulate worth beans and draws ire online.",
  [11037113] = "%s is too wishy-washy to be liked by viewers.",
  [11037114] = "%s doesn't say a word throughout and may as well be a fly on the wall.",
  [11037119] = "No suitable candidates so you're forced to drop the role. The show is now without topicality.",
  [11037120] = "\"Experience\" is the best persuasion.",
  [11037200] = "Who do you get to do the logo for a new show?",
  [11037211] = "%s designs the perfect, eye-catching logo for the show.",
  [11037212] = "%s knows diddly-squat about logo design and draws up an ugly icon.",
  [11037213] = "%s designs a gaudy logo that's more appropriate for a shady nightclub.",
  [11037214] = "%s designs a logo that actually an eyesore and drags the progam off-air with it.",
  [11037219] = "Without an expert, you use a sample logo from a design program and receive criticisms for unprofessionalism.",
  [11037220] = "A successful logo is as much psychological as it is visual.",
  [11038000] = "Hubby attacks wife for neglecting chores, she attacks him back for working a dead-end job. It's hard doing a show.",
  [11038001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11038002] = "It's exhausting watching married couples fight all day.",
  [11038100] = "You need a witty, funny guy to host the show…",
  [11038111] = "%s lightens the mood and makes the show a blast with timely jokes.",
  [11038112] = "%s sours the stage with awkward jokes.",
  [11038113] = "%s resorts to obnoxious pratfalls and annoys everybody.",
  [11038114] = "%s has stagefright and doesn't say a peep.",
  [11038119] = "For lack of a better choice, you settle on a mundane host, which makes for an uninteresting show.",
  [11038120] = "Laughter is the best medicine for conflicts as well.",
  [11038200] = "You have to get someone to separate a brawling couple during taping…",
  [11038211] = "%s stops both dead in their tracks. The taping continues uneventfully.",
  [11038212] = "%s doesn't put more effort than a just a few words into it. Not working at all.",
  [11038213] = "%s is reckless and tackles a special guest instead to interrupt taping.",
  [11038214] = "%s is at a loss and gets knocked around by wild swings from the couple, then a ride to the emergency room.",
  [11038219] = "You have to try to stop the fight yourself but is absolutely ineffectual.",
  [11038220] = "Never thought it could be so dangerous in studios too.",
  [11039000] = "The counselor gets struck by the wife after lambasting her husband. The couple then leaves the disarrayed studio.",
  [11039001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11039002] = "It's harder to be together than be in love.",
  [11039100] = "You have to find a makeup artist for the wife…",
  [11039111] = "%s gives the woman a gorgeous makeover. Her husband's attitude toward her also improves.",
  [11039112] = "%s gives the woman a shabby makeup job that horrifies the audience.",
  [11039113] = "%s makes the woman up like a sultry temptress that totally clashes with her personality.",
  [11039114] = "%s doesn't apply sufficient makeup to compensate for the woman's haggard countenance.",
  [11039119] = "You don't think makeup is necessary, so nothing goes awry.",
  [11039120] = "The society nowadays is still unfriendly to women sometimes.",
  [11039200] = "You have to choose an expert to assess the couple's marriage…",
  [11039211] = "%s systematically points out their mistakes and offers practical solutions.",
  [11039212] = "%s gives superficial explanations and no details.",
  [11039213] = "%s makes blunt accusations that unnerve everyone.",
  [11039214] = "%s gives profound yet useless advice that hurt the show.",
  [11039219] = "You let the host say a few simple words that seem to hit home.",
  [11039220] = "It takes two people to raise one family.",
  [11040000] = "Will viewers like a program that shows how gorillas live?",
  [11040001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11040002] = "Gorillas are actually very smart animals.",
  [11040100] = "You need an animal expert who can discern gorillas' emotions.",
  [11040111] = "%s understands animals very well and have no problem figuring out how gorillas think.",
  [11040112] = "%s dislikes animals and makes all the wrong guesses.",
  [11040113] = "%s irks a gorilla and gets chased around by it.",
  [11040114] = "%s makes a wrong conjecture that leads to a gorilla getting hurt during filming.",
  [11040119] = "You decide to film the gorillas from distant and no physical contact whatsoever.",
  [11040120] = "Got to ensure the gorillas' freedom as well as the film crew's safety.",
  [11040200] = "You need someone who can capture the gorillas clearly on camera from far away.",
  [11040211] = "%s is a consummate professional to whom this is merely routine.",
  [11040212] = "%s is discovered by the apes and chased through the forest.",
  [11040213] = "%s is not nearly skilled enough and the images come out blurry.",
  [11040214] = "%s fears gorillas and takes off running the other way.",
  [11040219] = "Without a suitable candidate, you take a chance shooting up close and almost get hurt.",
  [11040220] = "Shooting documentaries is a tiring, dangerous and thankless job!",
  [11041000] = "There's always something interesting happening in every corner of a city that is tailor-made for a show.",
  [11041001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11041002] = "Look around and one will see moving stories everywhere.",
  [11041100] = "Who do you go to for leads on touching human-interest stories?",
  [11041111] = "%s is hooked up to the grapevines and knows every rumor in the city.",
  [11041112] = "%s doesn't care for it one bit and is totally the wrong person to ask.",
  [11041113] = "%s isn't friends with you and refuses to tell you anything.",
  [11041114] = "%s is highly unpopular and the exact opposite of a rumormonger.",
  [11041119] = "Since no one can help, you decide to just find some old ladies and gossip with them every night.",
  [11041120] = "Never thought so much could happen in just one day!",
  [11041200] = "You want a newswriter who can convey the full emotion of these news stories…",
  [11041211] = "%s offers writing so moving, you weep.",
  [11041212] = "%s takes a formal approach and falls way short of your expectations.",
  [11041213] = "%s simply makes up stuff solely to elicit sentimentality.",
  [11041214] = "%s is putting you off and can't be tracked down.",
  [11041219] = "You can't find anybody and are compelled to abandon the idea.",
  [11041220] = "Every big city has little things that move people to tears…",
  [11042000] = "The show calls for stars to live 24 hours in blindness. Toward the end of taping, some guests are already in tear mode.",
  [11042001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11042002] = "It finally wraps after a sleepless night.",
  [11042100] = "A participant wants to quit halfway into filming. Get someone to calm him down.",
  [11042111] = "%s talks the participant into accepting your advice and resuming the challenge.",
  [11042112] = "%s can't persuade the participant from quitting. Nothing you can do but find a new participant.",
  [11042113] = "%s only makes the participant angry and tells you to call the agent.",
  [11042114] = "%s depresses the participant and it negatively impacts the show.",
  [11042119] = "You talk to the participant and manage to get a relunctant \"yes\".",
  [11042120] = "Stars nowadays want to be treated like emperors! Do they take me for an eunuch?",
  [11042200] = "Who do you want to be in charge of editing the show?",
  [11042211] = "%s dials the levity up to eleven with unsurpassed editing.",
  [11042212] = "%s turns in a decent job, but the fun is toned down to documentary level.",
  [11042213] = "%s has never edited a reality show and does a sloppy job.",
  [11042214] = "%s not only cuts out the funny but leaves in the outtakes, making viewers doubt the show's authenticity.",
  [11042219] = "You have to do the edit the footages yourself and that makes for a bland product.",
  [11042220] = "Post-production saves your butt.",
  [11043000] = "I want a show that features the host rant on the hottest pop song of the week.",
  [11043001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11043002] = "I like a lot of the new songs!",
  [11043100] = "You need a strict person to time the show down to 0.1 second.",
  [11043111] = "%s is incredibly thorough, which leads to a flawless show.",
  [11043112] = "%s is too careless and the show ends with the song still playing in mid-riff.",
  [11043113] = "%s is overly strict and makes everyone unhappy.",
  [11043114] = "%s doesn't care at all and throws the show's pacing completely off.",
  [11043119] = "You don't trust anybody but yourself to do this, but almost fainted from overexertion.",
  [11043120] = "Regardless, no error is tolerated for the show!",
  [11043200] = "You want someone to talk to a distributor about showing the program on buses.",
  [11043211] = "%s has a silver tongue and pushes the idea through.",
  [11043212] = "%s stutters and lacks confidence. The distributor is concerned.",
  [11043213] = "%s is too glib and offends the distributor.",
  [11043214] = "%s feels the distributor is condescending and gets into a huge argument that sours the negotiation.",
  [11043219] = "You negotiate with the distributor yourself and get the contract at a higher cost.",
  [11043220] = "This move will definitely broaden the show's visibility.",
  [11044000] = "The audience is requesting Lucien on the relaunched Miracle Finder, specifically following up on mentalism.",
  [11044001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11044002] = "The viewers respond overwhelmingly positive to the show. It's going to be a mega hit!",
  [11044100] = "You need someone to edit an intro clip on mentalism.",
  [11044111] = "%s quickly finishes editing a clip that contributes greatly to the show.",
  [11044112] = "%s is sloppy and still cannot finish the job.",
  [11044113] = "You asked the wrong person, %s does not know how to edit videos.",
  [11044114] = "%s is a slacker who takes long naps in the office.",
  [11044119] = "You edit the clip yourself for a whole night, getting bags under your eyes.",
  [11044120] = "Editing sure… is… time-consuming…",
  [11044200] = "You need someone to warm up the audience before the show. Who do you get?",
  [11044211] = "%s whips the crowd into a frenzy to start the show.",
  [11044212] = "%s gets the crowd's attention but you can hear a pin drop. Awkward!",
  [11044213] = "%s has the audience busting up, so much that they don't pay attention to the show itself!",
  [11044214] = "%s cools the audience instead. No heat at all.",
  [11044219] = "You give it a try yourself, getting a couple polite chuckles and that's it.",
  [11044220] = "You need a lively crowd for a show to succeed!",
  [11045000] = "You're making a video about Lou Gehrig's Disease to urge help for the victims--difficult for it has be scientific too.",
  [11045001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11045002] = "All the afflicted are very strong-willed. Not sure I could hold on if it were me.",
  [11045100] = "The ALS victim's roof is leaking. You decide to find someone to repair it.",
  [11045111] = "%s repairs it with no sweat, even applying a new coat of paint.",
  [11045112] = "%s fails to fix the roof. You're a sad panda.",
  [11045113] = "%s renovates it into something nice, but it still leaks.",
  [11045114] = "%s inadvertently falls off the roof and gets seriously hurt.",
  [11045119] = "You can't find anyone for the job, then gets flak for not trying to help.",
  [11045120] = "Their living condition is much too substandard…",
  [11045200] = "You hope to get donations to improve their quality of life.",
  [11045211] = "%s follows your suggestion and makes a donation.",
  [11045212] = "%s doesn't want to \"waste\" any money on this.",
  [11045213] = "%s gives only a token amount.",
  [11045214] = "%s just doesn't want to help, period.",
  [11045219] = "You decide to start a public fundraiser, but you lack both recognition and influence.",
  [11045220] = "Perhaps they'll live longer given sufficient funding.",
  [11046000] = "Goldman refers you to a projects that scours the land for skills on the verge of becoming lost.",
  [11046001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11046002] = "Hope they won't be lost and get passed on to future generations.",
  [11046100] = "You need a smart special guest who's a quick study…",
  [11046111] = "%s is very sharp and picks up the fundamentals for the art of papercutting right away.",
  [11046112] = "%s is a klutz and nearly gives the old lady a heartattack.",
  [11046113] = "%s is totally disinterested in papercutting.",
  [11046114] = "%s mocks the craft of papercutting and earns scornful stares.",
  [11046119] = "You can't find anyone smart so you'll have to wing it.",
  [11046120] = "The problem is the master is very old and you don't want to strain her...",
  [11046200] = "You talk to a journalist friend about showcasing your handiwork in a newspaper.",
  [11046211] = "%s can pull some strings and make it happen.",
  [11046212] = "%s wants to help, but he is too low on the ladder.",
  [11046213] = "%s believes the effort is futile and declines to help.",
  [11046214] = "%s says it counts as an ad and must be paid accordingly.",
  [11046219] = "You don't know anyone in the field and must forego the print media.",
  [11046220] = "The master will be happy to see the work featured in newspaper.",
  [11047000] = "Publicizing the masters of these soon-to-be-lost arts fills me with a tremendous sense of accomplishment.",
  [11047001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11047002] = "I saw shadow puppetry occasionally when I was little, but now it's almost extinct.",
  [11047100] = "Get someone to persuade the old shadow puppeteer to perform again.",
  [11047111] = "%s breaks down the benefits and successfully entices the old man.",
  [11047112] = "%s cannot coax the old man regardless what is said.",
  [11047113] = "%s feels the old man is a fool and leaves in a huff.",
  [11047114] = "%s goes too far with words and gets kicked out by the old man.",
  [11047119] = "You decide to convince the old man yourself and he grudgingly accepts after a long talk.",
  [11047120] = "The old man is very old-fashioned and refuses to face the camera.",
  [11047200] = "Where are you going to find the kids to watch the old man's performance?",
  [11047211] = "%s talks to preschool teachers and kids, and they all agree to come.",
  [11047212] = "%s scatterbrainedly tells the teachers it's a donkey skin exhibition and gets ignored.",
  [11047213] = "%s weeps upon learning the shadow puppets are made from donkey skin.",
  [11047214] = "%s totally forgets to mention it.",
  [11047219] = "You go to kindergartens yourself to recruit an audience and almost fail.",
  [11047220] = "Nobody said organizing kids for a field trip is easy.",
  [11048000] = "The show is airing its last few episodes, but it has raised a lot of awareness for the soon-to-be-lost arts and craft!",
  [11048001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11048002] = "Movable typography is simply marvelous!",
  [11048100] = "You need a hardy companion to interview an old man in the mountains with you.",
  [11048111] = "%s accompanies you into the mountains without a complaint.",
  [11048112] = "%s can't hang and starts griping halfway through.",
  [11048113] = "%s gets a yellow streak and runs, abandoning you in the wilderness.",
  [11048114] = "%s pisses and moans throughout the trip and neither of you are happy.",
  [11048119] = "You can't predict what your staff is going to do, so pray and hope for the best.",
  [11048120] = "Endurance is a precious quality in a person.",
  [11048200] = "Who would have the tools to fix the movable type instrument you broke?",
  [11048211] = "%s carries many tools on person and quickly hands you the right one.",
  [11048212] = "%s stares at you like it's not part of the job description.",
  [11048213] = "%s not only doesn't help, but ridicules your miscue.",
  [11048214] = "%s brushes you off. You feel awkward.",
  [11048219] = "You confess your mistake to the old man, who's not very happy.",
  [11048220] = "I'm really, terribly sorry…",
  [11049000] = "The new episode features treasure hunting with psychics, but mysteriously, the location keeps getting colder...",
  [11049001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11049002] = "It's rather unsettling to know someone among the crowd is geninuely psychic.",
  [11049100] = "Do you know any real psychic?",
  [11049111] = "%s doesn't hesitate to come on the show and puts on a brilliant performance.",
  [11049112] = "%s is neither a psychic or medium, good for only blathering on stage.",
  [11049113] = "%s practically destroys the set in a supposed \"trance\" to halt the taping.",
  [11049114] = "%s is overly competitive and gets into a scuffle with others.",
  [11049119] = "Guess we'll pass the guests' intuition off as psychic abilities…",
  [11049120] = "There are truly people gifted with supernatural abilities.",
  [11049200] = "You send an assistant to bury a treasure in a remote spot…",
  [11049211] = "%s hides the treasure well. Only a few manage to find it.",
  [11049212] = "%s \"buries\" the treasure in a rather obvious spot, making the point moot.",
  [11049213] = "%s buries the treasure twenty feet underground. Some manage to locate it, none can unearth it.",
  [11049214] = "%s forgets where the treasure is hidden.",
  [11049219] = "You decide to hide the treasure yourself and get lost in the mountain late at night.",
  [11049220] = "Treasure hunt is such a fun game.",
  [11050000] = "The new episode features the life of an ancient king according to historical accounts and royal descendents.",
  [11050001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11050002] = "Wonder just how luxurious a life the king could lead thousands of years ago?",
  [11050100] = "You need someone well-connected to hook you up with a noble.",
  [11050111] = "%s hooks you up with the prince of a neighboring country, who tells you stories about his great-great-great-great-great grandfather.",
  [11050112] = "%s finds you a con artist who cheats people out of money by claiming to be royalty.",
  [11050113] = "%s can't get in touch with any noble and ducks your calls.",
  [11050114] = "%s tries to pass himself off as a prince.",
  [11050119] = "You think you have enough historical documents that you don't need interview subjects.",
  [11050120] = "Wow, never imagined there would be stories nobody knew behing it...",
  [11050200] = "Who do you get to compose the music score for your documentary?",
  [11050211] = "%s nails it, pairing the documentary with majestic tunes.",
  [11050212] = "%s opts for budget scores that go with the theme like oil and water.",
  [11050213] = "%s plagarizes music and embarrasses the project.",
  [11050214] = "%s composes an odd piece that kills the ear.",
  [11050219] = "You go the conservative route and choose classical melodies familiar to viewers.",
  [11050220] = "A good soundtrack will greatly enhance any film.",
  [11051000] = "In the time of crisis, we decide to make a series of foodie shows online to attract attention.",
  [11051001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11051002] = "Pigging out all day… so stuffed…",
  [11051100] = "Find a friendly interpreter to translate for a foreign participant.",
  [11051111] = "%s is a jolly sort who translates all questions for him.",
  [11051112] = "%s dislikes talking to anyone and refuses to translate for you.",
  [11051113] = "%s gets into a spat with the foreign participant and soon parts ways.",
  [11051114] = "%s hates your guts, so forget about doing anything for you.",
  [11051119] = "You resort to hiring a novice interpreter who does a passble job.",
  [11051120] = "Interpretation requires quick reaction as well as a friendly attitude.",
  [11051200] = "You need someone to handle travel arrangements for several foreign participants…",
  [11051211] = "%s is a natural and has everything running smoothly",
  [11051212] = "%s hasn't a clue about cultural difference, putting early birds and night owls in the same room.",
  [11051213] = "%s books a small crappy lodging that makes for an uncomfortable stay.",
  [11051214] = "%s breaks your bank by booking a very expensive hotel.",
  [11051219] = "You decide to do it yourself and make a plethora of mistakes.",
  [11051220] = "An idol is beyond perfection in the heart of many a fan.",
  [11052000] = "The web foodie show is killing it! Gotta rush next season into production!",
  [11052001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11052002] = "The way to get someone to like a country is through the stomach.",
  [11052100] = "A lady gets food poisoning, have someone look after her.",
  [11052111] = "%s is very caring to speed up her recovery.",
  [11052112] = "%s is careless and complicates her condition.",
  [11052113] = "%s always picks on the sick and aggravates her illness.",
  [11052114] = "%s is already sound asleep when the patient asks for some water.",
  [11052119] = "You have no one to spare so you must care for her yourself at the expense of filming delays.",
  [11052120] = "Come on, everyone needs TLC when they're sick!",
  [11052200] = "You need a judge who is popular and loves food...",
  [11052211] = "%s arrives with a huge controversy in tow.",
  [11052212] = "%s doesn't have the juice to score publicity or ratings.",
  [11052213] = "%s has a bad rep. The show takes a big hit.",
  [11052214] = "%s turns you down. You're very disappointed.",
  [11052219] = "You feel no need to have a marquee name. The result is an awful rating.",
  [11052220] = "Why do the stars eat so little these days? What am I to do?",
  [11053000] = "You have to carry on for Willow who, after eating all around the city, now gets queasy at the mere sight of food…",
  [11053001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11053002] = "Whoever said \"Food is the universal law most persistent and inexorable\" knew what he was saying!",
  [11053100] = "You need a lighting specialist to make the food even more appealing.",
  [11053111] = "%s gets it just right for an enticing presentation.",
  [11053112] = "%s chars the food with the heat from the lights.",
  [11053113] = "%s only makes the lighting painful to the eyes.",
  [11053114] = "%s accidentally breaks the light to force you to postpone filming.",
  [11053119] = "No suitable candidate so you have to drop the idea.",
  [11053120] = "Good food still needs good presentation.",
  [11053200] = "You want someone to compose a catchy, joyous theme song for your new show.",
  [11053211] = "%s pens a delightful melody that captures your intent.",
  [11053212] = "%s offers a melancholy tune more suitable for a Greek tragedy.",
  [11053213] = "%s produces a grotesque number with uneven rhythm.",
  [11053214] = "%s fills the lyrics with expletives not suitable for television.",
  [11053219] = "No suitable candidate, so no music for you.",
  [11053220] = "Music adds another dimension to a show!",
  [11054000] = "It's a show about putting humans and animals under one roof and see what kind of bond develops between them.",
  [11054001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11054002] = "The filming was successful. The red pandas really stole the show!",
  [11054100] = "You want someone who's comfortable around baby pandas so to not spook them...",
  [11054111] = "%s puts on a panda outfit and gets mobbed by baby pandas.",
  [11054112] = "%s looks so mean that baby pandas keep a healthy distance.",
  [11054113] = "%s has germophobia and refuses to even touch the baby pandas.",
  [11054114] = "%s are rough with baby pandas and eventually hurts them.",
  [11054119] = "No suitable candidate so you spend a lot of time slowly getting close to baby pandas yourself.",
  [11054120] = "Baby pandas are a blessing and treasure to the world! So adorable!",
  [11054200] = "You need someone patient to housetrain a baby panda…",
  [11054211] = "%s takes care of the baby panda with utmost dedication.",
  [11054212] = "%s can't stand getting hands dirty and leaves before the day's even up.",
  [11054213] = "%s is allergic to work, leaving a filthy baby panda behind.",
  [11054214] = "%s is a space cadet and almost drops the baby panda on its head!",
  [11054219] = "It takes a lot of effort to care for babies, pandas are no exception.",
  [11054220] = "They're so cute, I want to bring one home with me!",
  [11055000] = "You're shooting a documentary on garbage: where they come from, where do they go. It makes you enviromentally conscious.",
  [11055001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11055002] = "Didn't realize how much hard work it is to dispose of garbage!",
  [11055100] = "You need someone to pacify the two gangs fighting near the garbage dump…",
  [11055111] = "%s has street cred and solves the problem easily.",
  [11055112] = "%s tries to persuade them and ends up black-and-blue.",
  [11055113] = "%s thinks it's too dangerous and doesn't want to help.",
  [11055114] = "%s hates you and coaxes both to gang up on you.",
  [11055119] = "It's a risk you'd rather not take, so just wait it out.",
  [11055120] = "Don't get why they're fighting over a garbage dump…",
  [11055200] = "You need someone who can stand the stench of the dump for filming…",
  [11055211] = "%s buckles down like a trooper the whole way.",
  [11055212] = "%s adds to the putridness with a lot of vomit.",
  [11055213] = "%s doesn't even want to set foot inside the dump.",
  [11055214] = "%s runs off and abandons you.",
  [11055219] = "No suitable candidates. You resort to mandating a staff member.",
  [11055220] = "I understand, the smell is simply unbearable!",
  [11056000] = "The new show centers on famous designers renovating neglected houses. It's shame how people let classics dilapidate.",
  [11056001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11056002] = "Some of the homes simply look marvelous after renovation!",
  [11056100] = "To conserve budget, you want someone to negotiate a furniture sponsorship…",
  [11056111] = "%s hits all the good points and lands you a contract.",
  [11056112] = "%s says not one word that helped the negotiation.",
  [11056113] = "%s is too slick and turns the sponsor off.",
  [11056114] = "%s crosses wires with you, preferring dollars over quality.",
  [11056119] = "You do it yourself and get shortchanged out of a lot of bucks.",
  [11056120] = "Nothing to eat on this island! Still, I have to live how the participants live!",
  [11056200] = "An architect wants to design a Alternateen home, but who would let his own house…",
  [11056211] = "%s consents immediately. You can hear him happy laughter miles away.",
  [11056212] = "%s declines because he doesn't think his ideal Alternateen home can be done.",
  [11056213] = "%s thinks the house is Alternateen enough and turns you down.",
  [11056214] = "%s hates all Alternateens and doesn't even give you the time of day.",
  [11056219] = "You can't find anyone who likes Alternateen, forcing you to abandon the project.",
  [11056220] = "Wonder what a Alternateen house is like?",
  [11057000] = "The show's premise has stars spending one week with the military. It's tough getting up at 4 every morning to set up…",
  [11057001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11057002] = "The last three days have been brutal, but everyone gritted their teeth and made it through.",
  [11057100] = "You want someone athletic with fighting skills to try special ops training…",
  [11057111] = "%s is athletic enough to hang with the grueling drills.",
  [11057112] = "%s barely exercises and almost faints from the training.",
  [11057113] = "%s is insolent and insubornate, getting kicked out soon enough.",
  [11057114] = "%s is not one for military life and goes AWOL.",
  [11057119] = "You pick a weaker star because you think he needs some toughen up. That nearly turns into a tragedy.",
  [11057120] = "Special ops training is just too much for the average Joes!",
  [11057200] = "You need someone who has the guts and brawn to survive the training.",
  [11057211] = "%s is tough enough to handle several days of hard training.",
  [11057212] = "%s has no gumption and quits before the training even starts.",
  [11057213] = "%s holds on for a couple days then washes out.",
  [11057214] = "%s doesn't even bother showing up after learning what the show is about.",
  [11057219] = "Without no suitable candidate, you're forced to lower the standard but it also devalues the show.",
  [11057220] = "Regardless, the show's authenticity must be preserved.",
  [11058000] = "The new show cribs from the Escape Room fad. Participants must solve the puzzle to exit the room.",
  [11058001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11058002] = "Wow, didn't think anyone would be clever enough to escape!",
  [11058100] = "You need someone to devise interesting puzzles...",
  [11058111] = "%s loves adventure stories and creates puzzles that are neat and thrilling.",
  [11058112] = "%s isn't fond of adventurous or thrilling stuff and designs bland challenges.",
  [11058113] = "%s is too vanilla to make anything interesting.",
  [11058114] = "%s declines because it's not up their alley.",
  [11058119] = "No suitable candidate, so you have to forego the bold in favor of the old tried-and-true...",
  [11058120] = "An escape room has to have a dash of horror to be interesting!",
  [11058200] = "You want participants who are elite intellectuals for the show...",
  [11058211] = "%s is MacGyver incarnate and puts up an awesome performance.",
  [11058212] = "%s is not very smart and loses quickly.",
  [11058213] = "%s is a smart aleck who earns the ire of everyone.",
  [11058214] = "%s is very passive and would've been better not here at all.",
  [11058219] = "You decide not to handpick participants. The show ends up missing a sense of urgency.",
  [11058220] = "Really smart people are always even smarter than I thought they are.",
  [11059000] = "Thanks to Kiro's help, we can now produce singing-competition shows with proficiency and confidence.",
  [11059001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11059002] = "I envy those who can sing so well!",
  [11059100] = "You need a great singer to be a judge on the show...",
  [11059111] = "%s is an experienced crooner with a great voice who's perfect for the role.",
  [11059112] = "%s sings off-note sometimes, not authoritative enough to be a judge.",
  [11059113] = "%s gets bad word-of-mouth and drags the show down.",
  [11059114] = "%s plays favorites and ruins the competition.",
  [11059119] = "You decide to forego any judge and use viewer polls instead.",
  [11059120] = "You need judges for a competition to be legit.",
  [11059200] = "You need someone to handle the sound and music for the singing competition…",
  [11059211] = "%s is a vet at this and arranges everything without breaking a sweat.",
  [11059212] = "%s plays an entirely music than planned.",
  [11059213] = "%s plays the songs in wrong order.",
  [11059214] = "%s plagarizes other's sound effects.",
  [11059219] = "Without a suitable candidate, you're forced to use interns and chaos ensues…",
  [11059220] = "Finger crossed that nothing goes wrong on the music side of things!",
  [11060000] = "You want to try my hands on limited series for TV, but can't find a good script. How about an open call for one?",
  [11060001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11060002] = "It's unconventional, but discovering new writers and classics is a rewarding proccess.",
  [11060100] = "Who are you getting to man the promotion on social media?",
  [11060111] = "%s is innovative and industrious, getting good words out and drawing many new fans.",
  [11060112] = "%s is a hard worker but short on creativity. It's just \"meh\" on the social media front.",
  [11060113] = "%s is highly on marketing experience but low on social media, making for a struggling campaign.",
  [11060114] = "%s is both marketing- and Internet-challenged, not even getting any \"Like\".",
  [11060119] = "It's doubly difficult to promote without an online presence.",
  [11060120] = "Aren't we too co-dependent on the web…?",
  [11060200] = "Who are you getting to shoot the publicity photos?",
  [11060211] = "%s takes clear, stunning photos. And fast too.",
  [11060212] = "%s gets too much background in the shots to be helpful.",
  [11060213] = "%s turns out to be a fan of an actress on set and takes photos of her exclusively.",
  [11060214] = "%s overexposes every shot. None of the pictures are usable.",
  [11060219] = "No publicity shots. The world gets snippets only from fan posts.",
  [11060220] = "No phase of filmmaking is more important than the others!",
  [11061000] = "You receive a commission from your alma mater to film the school singing competition. It brings back memories.",
  [11061001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11061002] = "No matter how often you do this, the youthful competitive spirit and passion still gets you every time.",
  [11061100] = "The organizers want you to recommend a pro stylist for the participants.",
  [11061111] = "%s delivers a star performance with a distinct style for everyone.",
  [11061112] = "%s practically dresses participants up like hillbillies to a jeering crowd.",
  [11061113] = "%s advocates inner beauty by making the participants plain as water.",
  [11061114] = "%s can't style self out of a wet paper bag and gets death threats from participants.",
  [11061119] = "Let the participants choose for themselves how they want to look.",
  [11061120] = "Appearance is only skin deep, it's the skills and abilities that count!",
  [11061200] = "Who you pick to train and coach participants for the competition?",
  [11061211] = "%s provides valuable aids and guidance to the participants.",
  [11061212] = "%s coaches the participants into having a Cockney accent.",
  [11061213] = "%s loses temper on the participants every day, making them drop out one by one.",
  [11061214] = "%s manages to talk half of the participants into pursuing other interests instead.",
  [11061219] = "The uneven talent of the participants takes a toll on spectator interest of the competition.",
  [11061220] = "It's only a campus competition, just do your best.",
  [11062000] = "It's your first live outdoor show spotlighting the beauty of nature. Good luck!",
  [11062001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11062002] = "The wilderness is unpredictable, but also exciting.",
  [11062100] = "You need an outdoor survival expert for a guide…",
  [11062111] = "%s leads the team assuredly down a path!",
  [11062112] = "%s rips shirt on a branch and starts wailing.",
  [11062113] = "%s seems skilled until walking straight into a quicksand.",
  [11062114] = "%s feels the job's too risky and flat out refuses.",
  [11062119] = "Everyone relies on intuition to get through the adventure and make the show come off very real.",
  [11062120] = "Please, don't try this at home… or outdoor.",
  [11062200] = "Someone has to guard the gear as you camp for the night…",
  [11062211] = "%s is vigilant and nothing is missing.",
  [11062212] = "%s is too busy stargazing to notice the monkeys stealing all the luggage.",
  [11062213] = "%s gets lazy and sets up a security camera--which is taken as well.",
  [11062214] = "%s needs to get beauty sleep in and coerces Willstrong as replacement.",
  [11062219] = "No one wants guard duty, so you must do it yourself between swatting mosquitoes.",
  [11062220] = "Things that seem easy usually are very hard to do.",
  [11063000] = "I should start with the trailer to promote a superstar bio-pic.",
  [11063001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11063002] = "You probably won't reach perfection, but you should always try.",
  [11063100] = "You need someone to design the poster for the bio-pic…",
  [11063111] = "%s composes an original, amazingly eye-catching poster.",
  [11063112] = "%s offers a poster that's kind of cheesy.",
  [11063113] = "%s signs up for ad design lessons. The movie will end its run before the course is done.",
  [11063114] = "%s gets very frustrated at own design and smashes a mouse apart.",
  [11063119] = "You don't need a poster for the trailer, just play the damn thing!",
  [11063120] = "Posters? We don't need no stinkin' posters!",
  [11063200] = "You need someone to fill a three-second gap in the trailer…",
  [11063211] = "%s impeccably splices in the three seconds needed.",
  [11063212] = "%s uses sound effects but carelessly makes the clip run long.",
  [11063213] = "%s touches up all the scenes but it's still three seconds short.",
  [11063214] = "%s takes apart the hard drive, then wonders why the whole trailer disappeared.",
  [11063219] = "You turn in a trailer with missing three seconds by deadline. This costs everybody their bonus for the season.",
  [11063220] = "Heed the proverb, time IS money.",
  [11064000] = "To make the new documentary better, I'm going to film interviews at international schools.",
  [11064001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11064002] = "Kids growing up under different cultures will have different perspectives to offer.",
  [11064100] = "Who do you choose as the interpreter to accompany the production crew?",
  [11064111] = "%s flawlessly translates everything. The filming proceeds smoothly.",
  [11064112] = "%s is more interested in playing bodyguard. No school personnel want to come near.",
  [11064113] = "%s is too shy to even speak a word.",
  [11064114] = "%s no-shows and leaves you out to dry.",
  [11064119] = "I doubled as the translator the whole way. Got the job done, but dead tired.",
  [11064120] = "When will telepathic communication become a reality?",
  [11064200] = "A Chinese American student wishes to learn more about China…",
  [11064211] = "%s weaves a lively account that fully immerses the kid.",
  [11064212] = "%s just hands the kid a traditional Chinese costume.",
  [11064213] = "%s demonstrates ancient auguring technique and frightens the kid.",
  [11064214] = "%s gets into a staredown with the kid.",
  [11064219] = "Knowledge has no bounds, so study hard!",
  [11064220] = "Home is wherever your heart is.",
  [11065000] = "I'm on-assignment for a daily morning news program.",
  [11065001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11065002] = "Stick to the protocols and you can solve just about any unexpected hiccups.",
  [11065100] = "You need a replacment anchor due to an emergency…",
  [11065111] = "%s is a very experienced broadcaster and fills in with ease.",
  [11065112] = "%s makes a talk show out of a serious news cast.",
  [11065113] = "%s stutters and has to repeat a sentence four, five times.",
  [11065114] = "%s has a face made for radio. The program receives endless complaints.",
  [11065119] = "The program is slammed and fined for too much dead air.",
  [11065120] = "The FCC is way too strict…",
  [11065200] = "The producers wants someone to create a new opening theme for City News...",
  [11065211] = "%s submits an outstanding score that makes the producers very happy.",
  [11065212] = "%s takes the rock-and-roll route that clashes with the program's premise.",
  [11065213] = "%s designs a exquisite dessert for City News which does not help at all.",
  [11065214] = "%s believes City News is doomed to cancellation and gets booted out of the studio.",
  [11065219] = "City News is left to play the old theme.",
  [11065220] = "Man, even a news program is keen on having a good soundtrack. We got to keep up!",
  [11066000] = "After surveying viewers, I decide to create a show featuring renowned beauticians making over Plain Janes.",
  [11066001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11066002] = "Seeing how ravishing the ladies are after their makeovers, I wish I can get one myself!",
  [11066100] = "The show needs an experienced cosmetician to makeover the ladies…",
  [11066111] = "%s transforms the ladies with astonishing personalized makeovers.",
  [11066112] = "%s is a one-trick pony. Everyone seems to come off an assembly line for a very boring show.",
  [11066113] = "%s refuses to share personal tips and techniques on air.",
  [11066114] = "%s is incompetent. The makeovers are make-nots.",
  [11066119] = "No expert is necessary when any ol' makeup artist will do.",
  [11066120] = "I want to sign up too…",
  [11066200] = "You want an experienced sound guy for a show…",
  [11066211] = "%s kills it on sound effects that lead the audience's emotions at appropriate places.",
  [11066212] = "%s has a style that's polar opposite of the show.",
  [11066213] = "%s messes up the timing and throws off both the host and the show's pacing.",
  [11066214] = "%s is too enthralled by the show and forgets to do the job.",
  [11066219] = "No need for specialist. Sound effects aren't the key, anyway.",
  [11066220] = "Good timely sound effects should be shared.",
  [11067000] = "Production starts on \"Prettiest Girl on Campus\" and I got the hottest boy band for special guests.",
  [11067001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11067002] = "Some of the participants have stagefright, but everything turns out okay at the end.",
  [11067100] = "You need someone to recruit the prettiest of schoolgirls for the competition…",
  [11067111] = "%s not only tracks down information but recruits several hot schoolgirls.",
  [11067112] = "%s finds pretty girls all right, but they're not in school…",
  [11067113] = "%s is a poor judge of character when it comes to pretty schoolgirls.",
  [11067114] = "%s has no clue where nor how to start.",
  [11067119] = "No help needed, just ask around and you'll know who's the prettiest girl for each school.",
  [11067120] = "Comparisons are odious.",
  [11067200] = "Several participants are suddenly having second thoughts. Do you…",
  [11067201] = "Lay the pros and cons out for them.",
  [11067202] = "Talk, give up if they still refuse.",
  [11067203] = "Find out their reasons for quitting.",
  [11067211] = "Still hesitant, but at least the participants remain on the show.",
  [11067212] = "The show doesn't do as well as expected because certain popular participants pulled out at the last minute.",
  [11067213] = "Their concerns dispelled, the participants' positive performance makes the show a ratings buster.",
  [11067219] = "The show is only average.",
  [11067220] = "Call me the Great Persuader for talking that many participants back into the show!",
  [11068000] = "To improve a foodie show, I got a famous food critic on the panel.",
  [11068001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11068002] = "Always feels like 10 pounds heavier after tasting all the food on the show.",
  [11068100] = "You need a guide familiar with various customs and geography for the program…",
  [11068111] = "%s is knowledgeable with every place you go and even able to provide tidbits known only to locals, adding much to the show.",
  [11068112] = "%s isn't familiar with local customs and terrain, wasting a lot of time and energy going round and round.",
  [11068113] = "%s has a peculiar notion of gourmet food and shows you only illicit, underground dishes.",
  [11068114] = "%s is directionally challenged and here only for the money.",
  [11068119] = "It's most interesting when you explore food on your own without someone to lead you.",
  [11068120] = "Hope someday I can travel the world, too.",
  [11068200] = "You need a host who can break down dish ingredients and isn't camera-shy…",
  [11068211] = "%s stokes viewers' appetite with precise lowdown and fun facts on every dish.",
  [11068212] = "%s has unmeetable demands and pans every dish. The show cannot continue.",
  [11068213] = "%s is both inarticulate and camera shy. The program suffers.",
  [11068214] = "%s doesn't get the dishes and knows not how to critique them.",
  [11068219] = "You get the truest verdict from the initial reaction of an ordinary person, something you won't get from food critics.",
  [11068220] = "Take me on a eating binge!",
  [11069000] = "I've been doing groundwork on the upcoming Pork Ramen Ad for a brand-name manufacturer.",
  [11069001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11069002] = "The commercial made me drool after I finished shooting it.",
  [11069100] = "You want an actor who can convey how tasty the instant noodle is.",
  [11069111] = "%s is an old-hand at eating for the camera. The performance makes everyone hungry.",
  [11069112] = "%s is a very poor actor and kills any desire to chow down.",
  [11069113] = "%s acts like a diva, refusing to retake before quitting.",
  [11069114] = "%s is not an actor nor can act.",
  [11069119] = "Do we really need professional actors for this?",
  [11069120] = "Maybe I can give it a try on empty stomach…",
  [11069200] = "You need an electrician for the blackout in studio…",
  [11069211] = "%s quickly discovers the source of the problem and fixes it for filming to continue.",
  [11069212] = "%s drags feet and delays shooting. The manufacturer is incensed.",
  [11069213] = "%s fixes the shortcircuit but charges an exorbitant rate.",
  [11069214] = "%s only gets the job halfway done before disappearing.",
  [11069219] = "No electrician is called, the filming keeps postponing, and you're eventually sued for breach of contract.",
  [11069220] = "Great, the damn thing has to pick now to peter out. Thanks, Murphy's Law!...",
  [11070000] = "You're reporting from refugee camps and quarantine zones in warring countries. A dangerous assignment, but worth it.",
  [11070001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11070002] = "Hope there will be no more wars in the world, and the poverty, hunger, and disease in warzones will soon end.",
  [11070100] = "You need a correspondent brave enough and articulate enough for this assignment…",
  [11070111] = "%s recounts all situations in vivid, succinct detail.",
  [11070112] = "%s is too verbose and runs overtime with every report.",
  [11070113] = "%s is biased and unable to report with the objectivity required in journalism.",
  [11070114] = "%s doesn't have the courage for frontline reporting.",
  [11070119] = "You try your hand at live report and fail miserably.",
  [11070120] = "You have to be mentally strong to describe things while bullets fly about you!",
  [11070200] = "You need a medic to treat crew members who contracted disease in quarantine…",
  [11070211] = "%s not only provides the remedy but vaccines too. The patients quickly recover.",
  [11070212] = "%s is relatively inexperienced and needs many tries, slowing down the production schedule.",
  [11070213] = "%s is worried about catching the disease and refuses to treat patients.",
  [11070214] = "%s makes the patients worse.",
  [11070219] = "After unsuccessfully trying to tough it out, the crew has to quit and return home for treatment.",
  [11070220] = "Hope everyone will be OK and there's no needless sacrifice.",
  [11071000] = "The show invites experts on the Internet to discuss various virus attacks and countermeasures.",
  [11071001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11071002] = "It's fascinating, makes me want to learning how to code too!",
  [11071100] = "The show needs an experienced person to schedule segments…",
  [11071111] = "%s lays out a captivating sequence that also demonstrates the power of the Internet.",
  [11071112] = "%s puts out one banal segment after another. The audience leaves halfway into taping.",
  [11071113] = "%s doesn't get the Internet, offering segments long on gimmick but short on substance.",
  [11071114] = "%s knows not one thing about computer technology yet still tries to boss people around, driving all the panelists off the show.",
  [11071119] = "The show drones on without a logical progression. Certain high-brow segments have the audience scratching their head.",
  [11071120] = "Good writers save shows. You can't substitute quality!",
  [11071200] = "You need a writer to script lines for the taciturn guests on the show.",
  [11071211] = "%s scripts awesome banters and creates a fun atmosphere for the show!",
  [11071212] = "%s can't script lines at all.",
  [11071213] = "%s offers lines better for a drama series than a variety show.",
  [11071214] = "%s writes difficult lines as the guests struggle to say them.",
  [11071219] = "The guests seem to try to outdo each other in keeping silence. A very awkward show.",
  [11071220] = "Hmm, starting to feel I'm whining too much…",
  [11072000] = "Ask experts to reveal the consequences for divulging personal information online.",
  [11072001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11072002] = "Nowadays, security risk pervades every corner of the web…",
  [11072100] = "You need someone to collect cases of exposing personal information online…",
  [11072111] = "%s gathers many classic and specific examples to make the program more convincing.",
  [11072112] = "%s finds a lot of cases that are off-topic.",
  [11072113] = "%s tracks down only rumors and urban legends.",
  [11072114] = "%s misses the deadline entirely, forcing the segment to be scrapped.",
  [11072119] = "Although no case is given to illustrate the point, the experts are good enough to carry the segment.",
  [11072120] = "Can't believe someone can find your address from just a selfie!",
  [11072200] = "You need a replacement for the malfunctioning computer for the show...",
  [11072211] = "%s not only gets the original fixed at a shop, but returns with a backup.",
  [11072212] = "%s is slow of foot. The taping already starts when he gets back.",
  [11072213] = "%s carelessly breaks the fixed computer and the backup too.",
  [11072214] = "%s forgets to come back after delivering the computer for repair.",
  [11072219] = "No one's available so you have to take the computer in for repair yourself.",
  [11072220] = "You make it in the nick of time.",
  [11073000] = "You're working with a renowned university to broadcast lectures that include general education courses.",
  [11073001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11073002] = "Learning is the fastest way to broaden one's horizon. Gosh, I miss my college days!",
  [11073100] = "You need an authoritative and scholarly host for the program…",
  [11073111] = "%s brings sense of humor to encourage learning.",
  [11073112] = "%s is a boring instructor.",
  [11073113] = "%s is too radical in both opinion and instruction.",
  [11073114] = "%s offers no reason for viewers to tune in.",
  [11073119] = "The program has viewers, but would have many more if it had an outstanding host.",
  [11073120] = "Wouldn't it be wonderful is all classes can be taken remotely?",
  [11073200] = "You need someone to survey the viewers for opinion and desirable contents…",
  [11073211] = "%s accurately compiles viewer preferences for the program to make proper adjustments.",
  [11073212] = "%s surveys demographics more likely to watch other types of programming.",
  [11073213] = "%s designs a survey that leaves out viewer preferences.",
  [11073214] = "%s knows neither how to write a questionnaire nor conduct a survey.",
  [11073219] = "Just do the survey. If we have viewers, great. If not, we'll figure something out.",
  [11073220] = "All of a sudden I get this tremendous appreciation for my old teachers.",
  [11074000] = "Everyone wants to make more money, but how? Well, let an expert tell you.",
  [11074001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11074002] = "It's risky to play the stock market so be cautious with your investment.",
  [11074100] = "The show needs a financial expert to explain the current stock market…",
  [11074111] = "%s clearly and thoroughly explains everything from basic investment principles to risks and benenits.",
  [11074112] = "%s only dabbles in stock and providing misleading info.",
  [11074113] = "%s gloats about the success of own investments that goes over the viewers' head.",
  [11074114] = "%s absconded with investors' money the day before the show.",
  [11074119] = "Instead of experts, you get several staff members to discuss their own investment failures.",
  [11074120] = "I feel I have more to learn…",
  [11074200] = "You need someone to sub for the ill host…",
  [11074211] = "%s doesn't miss a beat in leading the panelist and taking questions from the audience.",
  [11074212] = "%s hardly speaks a word and lets the panelist hijack the show.",
  [11074213] = "%s doesn't comprehend the panelist. Both go off on their own tangent.",
  [11074214] = "%s gets the time wrong and is late, causing the show to be cancelled.",
  [11074219] = "You host it yourself and do an OK job.",
  [11074220] = "There will be an alternate host at every taping from now on.",
  [11075000] = "For the weekly movie review show, we'll give our best rant without worrying about offending anyone.",
  [11075001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11075002] = "Sometimes we do go apologize to resonsible parties for overly harsh reviews in person. Do you know we even have a budget for that too?",
  [11075100] = "You need an avid film buff with a sharp tongue to write script for the show…",
  [11075111] = "%s not only has a sharp tongue, but offers objective movie analyses with a dash of humor.",
  [11075112] = "%s is disorganized with the written word.",
  [11075113] = "%s has not watched enough movies and tends to grasp at straw.",
  [11075114] = "%s procrastinates, making scheduling the show difficult.",
  [11075119] = "The show proceeds without a script.",
  [11075120] = "I don't mind offending someone with a bad review, as long as it's poignantly scripted.",
  [11075200] = "You need an editor to piece together cringeworthy or exciting clips from films.",
  [11075211] = "%s does a perfect job putting clips together.",
  [11075212] = "%s compiles blurry clips that actually hurt the show.",
  [11075213] = "%s does as little editing as possible.",
  [11075214] = "%s seem to edit on a whim. The final cut is terrible.",
  [11075219] = "You resort to just getting someone who knows how to use the editing software, and it shows...",
  [11075220] = "It's hard to get good help these days.",
  [11076000] = "You're doing an episode on Internet celebrities on an expose show.",
  [11076001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11076002] = "We can even pipeline this? Awesome! Lucky the subject is willing to grant us permission.",
  [11076100] = "You need someone with a big fanbase and willing to go air to be the subject.",
  [11076111] = "%s has many fans and works with the production crew well. The show attracts a load of viewers.",
  [11076112] = "%s is just a normal guy looking to become an Internet celeb through the program.",
  [11076113] = "%s refuses to reveal any skeleton in the closet on camera, under any condition and regardless of your offer.",
  [11076114] = "%s has a dispute with the crew during the shoot and breaks the camera.",
  [11076119] = "Can't get any Internet celeb. The episode fails.",
  [11076120] = "Looks better in person than in photo, and the photo was nice!",
  [11076200] = "You need a cameraman who can stay with the crew the whole way.",
  [11076211] = "%s keeps up and captures many excellent footages.",
  [11076212] = "%s blocks either the subject or the lighting, even breaks stuff at one point.",
  [11076213] = "%s gets a lot of dead space on film, missing what you needed almost completely.",
  [11076214] = "%s is too fixated on getting the celeb's autograph to notice the lens fogging up. The footages are all blurry.",
  [11076219] = "The result of not getting a professional cameraman is program cancellation.",
  [11076220] = "Kudos to the tireless cameraman and everyone on the crew!",
  [11077000] = "Sail with a scientific expedition to the polar region to film the wondrous lifeforms on land and undersea.",
  [11077001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11077002] = "The filming condition is super precarious, but you still manage to get numerous precious shots.",
  [11077100] = "You need someone to treat the seasick people in your crew.",
  [11077111] = "%s hands out miracle pills that halt nausea right away.",
  [11077112] = "%s offers conventional medicine that only alleviates the symptoms for a couple days.",
  [11077113] = "%s passes out laxatives by mistake, adding diarrhea to the list of problems.",
  [11077114] = "%s is a swindler who slips you a bunch of candy.",
  [11077119] = "Tough it out! We don't need no stinkin' medicine!",
  [11077120] = "I feel ten pounds lighter…",
  [11077200] = "You need someone to fix the broken heater in base camp...",
  [11077211] = "%s wastes no time getting the heater back in shape.",
  [11077212] = "%s sets the system at 86 degrees to make the camp feel like a sauna.",
  [11077213] = "%s not only fails to repair it but shortciruits the electrical system.",
  [11077214] = "%s says it's too cold outside to come over.",
  [11077219] = "You kind of get it working again yourself, but it's not operating at full capacity.",
  [11077220] = "Geez, it's… freezing… in… here!",
  [11078000] = "You're making a period martial arts flick set in the Tong dynasty.",
  [11078001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11078002] = "The martial arts world goes by the rule of \"you do what you have to do,\" whether you want to or not.",
  [11078100] = "Who do you choose as the historical consultant for the flick?",
  [11078111] = "%s is well-versed in the era and ensures authentic details for the movie.",
  [11078112] = "%s specializes in the Ming dynasty and is not particularly familiar with Tong.",
  [11078113] = "%s makes unnecessary revisions to throw the screenplay out of whack.",
  [11078114] = "%s talks a good game but makes all the wrong decisions.",
  [11078119] = "The script, sets and costumes are all plagued with historical inaccuracies.",
  [11078120] = "The devil's in the details, if you want a quality pic and avoid gripes.",
  [11078200] = "Who do you get to handle \"wire-fu\" for the movie?",
  [11078211] = "%s has the touch to move people to the right spot.",
  [11078212] = "%s is not very precise as the actors often end up off-screen.",
  [11078213] = "%s treats it like a game and \"flies\" actors around on whims.",
  [11078214] = "%s is sloppy and causes actors to get hurt.",
  [11078219] = "Safety first, no wires, even the fights will come off weaker…",
  [11078220] = "I want to fly around on wires too!",
  [11079000] = "You're shooting a public service message on anti-domestic violence, specifically encouraging victims to seek help.",
  [11079001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11079002] = "We shouldn't turn \"love\" into something that hurt someone we love.",
  [11079100] = "Who do you choose to play the part of domestic abuse victim?",
  [11079111] = "%s fully conveys the desperation and helplessness of a victim.",
  [11079112] = "%s can't stay in character and breaks out giggling several times.",
  [11079113] = "%s feels the part is a bad fit for her image and declines.",
  [11079114] = "%s can weep but not act.",
  [11079119] = "You take the part yourself and, although not a pro, the emotions come off genuine enough to do the job.",
  [11079120] = "It's harder to cast for a public service message than a regular commercial!",
  [11079200] = "Who do you choose to do makeup on the domestic abuse victim?",
  [11079211] = "%s applies a makeup so realistic, it stuns many crew members.",
  [11079212] = "%s goes overboard and makes it look fake.",
  [11079213] = "%s has the victim appearing as if she walked right out of a zombie movie.",
  [11079214] = "%s forgets to bring the makeup kit.",
  [11079219] = "No makeup artist necessary. Don't need cuts and bruises to show the consequences of domestic violence.",
  [11079220] = "No artist available so do the best you can.",
  [11080000] = "The show examines the changes in Chinese society in recent years, with a focus on the common folks.",
  [11080001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11080002] = "China has gone through drastic changes and people there are a living better life.",
  [11080100] = "Who do you choose to be the host and primary reporter for the show?",
  [11080111] = "%s is articulate, succinct and appealing.",
  [11080112] = "%s stutters and doesn't speak clearly in front of a camera.",
  [11080113] = "%s glosses over too many details when reporting.",
  [11080114] = "%s adds own commentary to make a report subjective.",
  [11080119] = "You resort to doing it yourself and turn in an average performance.",
  [11080120] = "You really have to know a bit of everything to qualify to work in media!",
  [11080200] = "You need someone who can manipulate special lenses for difficult camera work…",
  [11080211] = "%s handles it with ease, getting the perfect shot every time.",
  [11080212] = "%s is not familiar with special effects and makes numerous mistakes.",
  [11080213] = "%s feels your cameras are inferior, thus not enabling him to demonstrate his superior skills.",
  [11080214] = "%s is clumsy and breaks the camera.",
  [11080219] = "No suitable candidate available. Production is postponed.",
  [11080220] = "Mother, give me a break for a change!",
  [11081000] = "The show aims to discover talented people with otherwise ordinary jobs and provide them with a platform to show off.",
  [11081001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11081002] = "Wow, everyone's so talented! I hope I can be special like them one day!",
  [11081100] = "Production unit needs a lighting specialist to handle complicated spotlights…",
  [11081111] = "%s works through it without a problem and makes every performer look better.",
  [11081112] = "%s doesn't know anything about lighting techniques and is more interested in chatting with the sound guy.",
  [11081113] = "%s ruins the show's festive mood with rather somber, subdued lighting.",
  [11081114] = "%s fails to reach the desired effect and, worse yet, manages to damage the equipment.",
  [11081119] = "Good performers should only require adequate lighting.",
  [11081120] = "Gosh, I wish I can do everything!",
  [11081200] = "While in production, a sponsor decides to withdraw from the show. Do you…",
  [11081201] = "Offer data that ensure a return.",
  [11081202] = "Explain your hardship to sponsor.",
  [11081203] = "Go off on the sponsor for reneging.",
  [11081211] = "The data thoroughly convinces the sponsor it's a great deal, who even doubles the ante.",
  [11081212] = "The sponsor is moved and says maybe next time before withdrawing.",
  [11081213] = "The sponsor doesn't withdraw this time, but will never sponsor your shows in the future.",
  [11081219] = "Insufficient backing means the show is running on a tight budget.",
  [11081220] = "It's almost impossible to keep sponsors wishing to leave!",
  [11082000] = "For a fun language show, I hired famous comedians and talk show troupers.",
  [11082001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11082002] = "I laughed so hard at the taping to give my abs a nice workout!",
  [11082100] = "A guest no-shows and you need a temp to stand in...",
  [11082111] = "%s fires off endless repartees and steals the show.",
  [11082112] = "%s is an all-around square peg trying to fit into a round hole.",
  [11082113] = "%s is adequate, though no one quite get the point.",
  [11082114] = "%s is practically a ghost on the show.",
  [11082119] = "The guest panel is missing one person, leading to speculations from viewers.",
  [11082120] = "Problems aren't always funny at the time they happen…",
  [11082200] = "You need someone professional to put together a promo clip for this new show…",
  [11082211] = "%s combines the best snippets with cool taglines to get lots of links.",
  [11082212] = "%s makes a promo that garners far less attention than desired.",
  [11082213] = "The promo is bashed universally for being too cute and gimmicky.",
  [11082214] = "The promo offers nothing interesting.",
  [11082219] = "Everyone is depressed that the show didn't take off as expected.",
  [11082220] = "We live in an era of great skeptics…",
  [11083000] = "I get the assignment to produce a music video for a hot girl band's new single.",
  [11083001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11083002] = "Wow, those sweet lips and slender thighs would turn even a woman's head!",
  [11083100] = "You need someone to generate dreamy effects for the music video...",
  [11083111] = "Girls just love the magic %s put into the effects.",
  [11083112] = "%s uses stock footages for the video to make it unwatchable.",
  [11083113] = "%s does a fairly good job, too bad in the wrong style.",
  [11083114] = "%s talks a great game but can't back it up one bit.",
  [11083119] = "The dreamy effects actually aren't impossible to do without a specialist, anyway…",
  [11083120] = "Wow, the girls are pretty and talented. You can count me as a fan!",
  [11083200] = "Who do you get to choreograph the dancing for the music video?",
  [11083211] = "%s choreographs artistic steps that synch flawlessly with the video.",
  [11083212] = "%s is not a good dancer and actually sprains own ankle demonstrating the routine.",
  [11083213] = "%s is a fantastic tap dancer… just not quite the romantic theme the video strives for.",
  [11083214] = "%s gives conflicting directions. The girls quit in frustration.",
  [11083219] = "The singers all have basic dance training, just let them do their own thing.",
  [11083220] = "See how magnificient it is when you dance with youthful passion?",
  [11084000] = "You manage to book an exclusive interview with the leads starring in the classic series \"Every Move You Make\"...",
  [11084001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11084002] = "I'm so ecstatic about getting a superstar I admired for a long time to come on my show!",
  [11084100] = "You need a host who asks great questions and knows a lot about this series.",
  [11084111] = "%s stays on topics interesting to fan and has a good chemistry with the star.",
  [11084112] = "%s delves into too much detail and gets only two questions in for the interview.",
  [11084113] = "%s gets the star to play along on many games and hardly asks anything about the new movie.",
  [11084114] = "%s cannot host at all and is just here to get autographs.",
  [11084119] = "You decide to handle this yourself after memorizing the script (and reciting it in your dreams). It turns out OK.",
  [11084120] = "I'm going to watch the original again after the interview.",
  [11084200] = "Who's setting up props for the star to reenact original movie's telepathy scene?",
  [11084211] = "%s sets it up in the shortest time possible to the best effect possible.",
  [11084212] = "%s figures out the setup but doesn't know where to get the materials for it.",
  [11084213] = "%s has not seen the movie and no idea what props are required.",
  [11084214] = "%s reserves a red-eye flight to try and borrow the original props from the director.",
  [11084219] = "The telepathy reenactment is dropped and takes a certain luster off the show.",
  [11084220] = "Good ideas still require practical execution.",
  [11085000] = "Just got a gig to produce a detective-mystery reality show. I'm nervous and excited at the same time!",
  [11085001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11085002] = "Although the outcome of a reality show cannot be dictated, the general course can still follow a script.",
  [11085100] = "Who do you choose to write a thrilling, exciting, suspenseful script?",
  [11085111] = "%s scripts a multi-layered, nonstop roller coaster ride that dazzles the participating stars.",
  [11085112] = "%s buys every detective mystery on the shelf for research purpose… and never does more with it.",
  [11085113] = "%s creates an excellent suspense thriller, too bad it's a 30-episode series.",
  [11085114] = "%s has never read any thrillers and is scared out of wits after reading one.",
  [11085119] = "You can't get a script so someone else gets the reality show.",
  [11085120] = "You know, I read a lot of mystery novels when I was young…",
  [11085200] = "Odd noises come from the \"murder scene\" set next door in a late shoot. Do you…",
  [11085201] = "No one else's going, so I might as well do it myself.",
  [11085202] = "Get someone brave to check it out with you.",
  [11085203] = "Nope, didn't hear anything, can't make me check.",
  [11085211] = "You're so spooked that you slip and take a nasty fall.",
  [11085212] = "After checking, you discover a loose fence is making the noise. False alarm.",
  [11085213] = "Everyone on set is afraid and words of a haunting start to spead.",
  [11085220] = "Shooting a thriller late at night will test anyone's nerves…",
  [11086000] = "You get a renowned escape artist for an difficult underwater escape challenge on a show.",
  [11086001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11086002] = "It's too heart-pounding. I'm breaking out in sweat here!",
  [11086100] = "You need a strong swimmer to spot the escape artist.",
  [11086111] = "With %s spotting, the probability of casualty drops to 0.01% for the escape artist.",
  [11086112] = "%s jumps in to rescue, only for the escape artist to drag him down.",
  [11086113] = "%s seems robust but is strictly a landlubber and can't swim a lick.",
  [11086114] = "%s is weak and a worse swimmer, raising doubts about the show in the escape artist's mind.",
  [11086119] = "Gotta believe in the escape artist's ability to succeed without a lifeguard.",
  [11086120] = "Man, I can't figure how the escape artist did it even seeing it up close! Unreal!",
  [11086200] = "The show needs a camera experienced with filming underwater.",
  [11086211] = "%s gets crystal-clear shots underwater, showing the escape artist's every move as if in daylight.",
  [11086212] = "%s has never done an underwater shoot. The camera shakes badly and even disturbs the escape effort.",
  [11086213] = "%s forgets to even remove the cover from lens and gets no usable footage.",
  [11086214] = "%s just stands in front of the tank and watches in silence, applauding when the escape succeeds.",
  [11086219] = "You can have any cameraman shoot from outside the tank, it just won't feel the same.",
  [11086220] = "Acts of survival are best seen live!",
  [11087000] = "The featured guests for the latest epiode of a show on the lives of scholars are foreign psychologists.",
  [11087001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11087002] = "The human subsconscious is such a mysterious yet wondrous thing...",
  [11087100] = "You need a director who can both convey the life of a scholar and embellish it.",
  [11087111] = "%s documents the psychologist's life faithfully and entertainingly through an unique perspective.",
  [11087112] = "%s directs a film as flat as a laundry list, with shaky camera work to boot.",
  [11087113] = "%s has been making comedies for thirty years and unfortunately this documentary is no exception.",
  [11087114] = "%s has no instinct for directing, but is awed by the psychologist's vast knowledge and wants to serve as his assistant.",
  [11087119] = "You can't even get a director, causing the angry psychologist to lash out publicly.",
  [11087120] = "The first step to filmmaking is getting the right director.",
  [11087200] = "Who do you choose to edit the raw footage?",
  [11087211] = "%s pieces together a wonderfully paced product that offers a faithful account of the psychologist.",
  [11087212] = "%s feels nothing is right and demands a reshoot.",
  [11087213] = "%s focuses too much on drama and loses sight of what a documentary should be.",
  [11087214] = "%s seems to believe editing is just putting all the raw footages togther, resulting in a gigantic, bloated product.",
  [11087219] = "The director takes on the editing job too and wears self out.",
  [11087220] = "Making a documentary is hard, making an interesting documentary is even harder.",
  [11088000] = "This is a show about the search for lake monsters.",
  [11088001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11088002] = "There's a truth no one knows behind every revelation.",
  [11088100] = "You need a marinelife expert to decipher the culprit's species...",
  [11088111] = "%s identifies the creature quickly and informs viewers of its capacity to inflict damage.",
  [11088112] = "%s is very knowledgeable but also slow to ponder, taking a lot of time to finally figure out what the creature is.",
  [11088113] = "%s spots the creature right away but struggles to identify it.",
  [11088114] = "%s just makes up stories and is no expert in any sense of the word.",
  [11088119] = "You send a photo to a museum curator but never get a reply.",
  [11088120] = "How come these creatures all looked pretty much alike?",
  [11088200] = "You need a seasoned captain to sail a ship and look for creatures in the lake…",
  [11088211] = "%s valiantly chases after any monstrous fish the crew spots and is a boon to the program.",
  [11088212] = "%s is a decent captain but turns the boat away whenever there's a big fish around.",
  [11088213] = "%s is courageous but lacks the ability to captain a ship.",
  [11088214] = "%s gets woozy upon boarding and is better off waiting on shore.",
  [11088219] = "You're not going to find monster, ever, without expert assistance.",
  [11088220] = "Sigh, it's true not every captain has the looks of a Johnny Depp.",
  [11089000] = "You're making a public service announcement to encourage fitness and exercising.",
  [11089001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11089002] = "I have to exercise more too and stay in shape!",
  [11089100] = "Who do you choose to star in the announcement?",
  [11089111] = "%s is a recently medalled world-class athlete with massive popular appeal and star quality.",
  [11089112] = "%s runs out of gas after running 20 feet and does not a convincing athlete make.",
  [11089113] = "%s has only training in mind and no time for the project.",
  [11089114] = "%s decides to challenge self to walk 100k steps a day and lands in the hospital three days later.",
  [11089119] = "You catch a lot of flak for unable to get an athlete for a fitness announcement.",
  [11089120] = "They deserve to be in the spotlight for all the tears and sweat from hard training.",
  [11089200] = "You need a watchdog to ensure the commercial goes without a hitch…",
  [11089211] = "%s diligently inspects every little detail and rectifies every little problem.",
  [11089212] = "%s is too careless and lets too many mistakes slip into the announcement.",
  [11089213] = "%s knows nothing about making commercials and is unable to detect problems before they happen.",
  [11089214] = "%s dozes off in every inspection, leaving drools all over the equipment.",
  [11089219] = "An accident occurs on the set, costing you tens of thounsands in workers' comp.",
  [11089220] = "The proverb is right about the devil's in the details!",
  [11090000] = "You create a runway model competition, with the winner featured on a magzine cover and getting a modeling contract.",
  [11090001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11090002] = "How rare is a girl with a figure as wonderful as her fashion sense?",
  [11090100] = "Which model with some recognition do you want to invite as a contestant?",
  [11090111] = "%s participating in the show becomes the hottest new, which blows up the number of applicants.",
  [11090112] = "%s has never been a model and thinks you got the wrong person.",
  [11090113] = "%s doesn't thinks very highly of this show and rejects the offer unceremoniously.",
  [11090114] = "%s vacuously stumbles into the competition and vacuously stumbles right out of it.",
  [11090119] = "The competition features no one special and the winner is rather average herself.",
  [11090120] = "You can definitely tell the difference in an accomplished model.",
  [11090200] = "You need a fashion designer to offer advice to the models…",
  [11090211] = "%s dispenses impeccable professional recommendations to each model and greatly enhances the show.",
  [11090212] = "%s prefers only one style, causing the models to rely on themselves.",
  [11090213] = "%s keeps stressing sophistication and it annoys models with a different style.",
  [11090214] = "%s is more keen on following the models around.",
  [11090219] = "The magazine should have a fashion designer to spare.",
  [11090220] = "I want to join so I can wear different gorgeous outfits everyday!",
  [11091000] = "We just created an escape room show that partners stars with regular people!",
  [11091001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11091002] = "Live broadcast is too taxing on the brain. Better to go with pre-tape.",
  [11091100] = "You need a designer to devise stages suitable for the participants.",
  [11091111] = "%s creates both easy and hard puzzles to keep thing moving at a breezy pace.",
  [11091112] = "%s designs puzzles that are way too hard for anyone to solve.",
  [11091113] = "%s makes cakewalks that even the uneducated can solve. The show generates no interest.",
  [11091114] = "%s devises unplayable puzzles with gaping logic holes.",
  [11091119] = "You copy other escape rooms. Some viewers say they've seen it before and change channel.",
  [11091120] = "Seeing them struggle to solve it makes me want to join in and help!",
  [11091200] = "You decide to hire an experienced stage designer to add more thrills to the set.",
  [11091211] = "%s melds the stage and puzzle together as one for unbelievable verisimilitude.",
  [11091212] = "%s sets up a stage contrary to the show's genre that evokes only laughter.",
  [11091213] = "%s constructs a formal set that's more suitable for a somber newscast.",
  [11091214] = "%s makes a big mess and exposes the puzzles' secrets at the same time.",
  [11091219] = "Don't aim for bells and whistles. Simple, easy-does-it is what sells these days.",
  [11091220] = "The fake blood looks so real!",
  [11092000] = "This show renovates the houses of families with financial problems and fulfills their wish for a upgraded home.",
  [11092001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11092002] = "Improve your environment, improve your outlook.",
  [11092100] = "You need an interior designer who can turn an owner's home into a dream house…",
