  [11183100] = "You need a sound engineer to modulate the atmosphere for show effect.",
  [11183111] = "%s showed strong improvising ability and great music skills, being able to maneuver the emotion of the audience.",
  [11183112] = "%s showed poor music skills, making many mistakes when playing the instruments.",
  [11183113] = "%s played improper music for serious topics, thus spoiling the atmosphere and affecting the filming progress.",
  [11183114] = "%s couldn't even find the switch of the electric piano.",
  [11183119] = "The key for a talk show doesn't lie in sound effects and music. They are not necessarily a must for a show.",
  [11183120] = "A program involves so many parts and any problem in any part can be overwhelming.",
  [11183200] = "Choose an assistant to revise the line drafts considering background information and things related.",
  [11183211] = "The knowledgeable %s timely found many faults in the lines and revised them, thus avoiding problems.",
  [11183212] = "%s corrected the lines with his wrong logic, resulting in the host awkwardly facing self-contradiction when filming.",
  [11183213] = "Although well-learned, %s added many contents that were irrelevant to the theme of the show.",
  [11183214] = "%s's thought was totally not in tune with that of the scriptwriters. They couldn't communicate at all.",
  [11183219] = "You are not erudite, but as practice makes perfect, you can try to do it by yourself.",
  [11183220] = "Careless review can not only affect the filming crew, but may even spoil the show.",
  [11184000] = "Each filmed guest would carry a microsized microphone and camera to display the daily lives of different individuals.",
  [11184001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11184002] = "Whether poor, ordinary, or rich, life is not easy for anyone.",
  [11184100] = "Choose a professional equipment handler to follow the filmed guests and adjust the filming equipment.",
  [11184111] = "The highly skilled %s not only solved the problems perfectly but also didn't intervene the filmed guest's normal life and work.",
  [11184112] = "%s fell into a dispute with the guest due to inappropriate remarks.",
  [11184113] = "%s broke the equipment, so the filming could hardly go on.",
  [11184114] = "%s overslept and missed the filming.",
  [11184119] = "Luckily, as you knew how to film, you managed to carry through with an effort.",
  [11184120] = "Indeed, without firsthand experience, one can't understand the feeling and tiredness of other professions.",
  [11184200] = "You need a video editor for post-production so that the show meets broadcast standards.",
  [11184211] = "%s's editing displayed the fatigue and bitterness of the guests' lives, and also highlighted some happy moments in their lives.",
  [11184212] = "%s wrongly added the company's competitor's watermark on the video.",
  [11184213] = "The sound in all post-production videos %s was erased.",
  [11184214] = "%s's computer crashed due to low configuration, resulting in the loss of many important files.",
  [11184219] = " Without any available video editor, you had to learn editing immediately.",
  [11184220] = "How I wish I were omnipotent!",
  [11185000] = "It is really a challenge to adapt a famous novel into a literary film that is award-worthy.",
  [11185001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11185002] = "Shooting a literary film is really depressing. It involves reflecting from many aspects you have never experienced before.",
  [11185100] = "Which experienced screenwriter do you choose to read and revise the script with the crew?",
  [11185111] = "With deep understanding of the novel, %s the script was precise and appropriate, maximally meeting the requirements of the crew.",
  [11185112] = "%s hadn't read the novel and adapted it without logical coherence, dissatisfying the fans of the novel and the audience.",
  [11185113] = "After %s adapted the novel, the script lines were influent and full of errors, causing troubles for the filming.",
  [11185114] = "Thinking it was too laborious to work in the crew, %s fled on the first day.",
  [11185119] = "You had to film according to the novel.",
  [11185120] = "I'm willing to pay ten times the salary for a great screenwriter.",
  [11185200] = "Which chef do you choose to cook for all the eating scenes?",
  [11185211] = "%s cooked exquisite and delicious food, meeting the filming requirement and wining praises from the actors.",
  [11185212] = "%s cooked good-looking food which didn't tasted good.",
  [11185213] = "%s always cooked different kinds of terrible food.",
  [11185214] = "%s got scalded carelessly.",
  [11185219] = "You could also order take-outs.",
  [11185220] = "I also wanna to eat. Can you leave me some?",
  [11186000] = "A popular cosmetic brand entrusted us to film a promotional ad for its latest products, but I was very worried about how to make an ad that suits the brand's quality.",
  [11186001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11186002] = "There's a beautiful lady, lovely, with clear eyes.",
  [11186100] = "The actress was allergic to the product. Find an expert immediately to treat her.",
  [11186111] = "%s soon treated the allergy, and the filming continued.",
  [11186112] = "The treatment %s used took effect slowly, which affected the filming.",
  [11186113] = "%s didn't treat the allergy. Instead, the actress was allergic to the drugs he provided.",
  [11186114] = "%s became allergic as well and couldn't carry out treatment.",
  [11186119] = "Only the products could be filmed since the actress was allergic, and a large sum of penalty was paid.",
  [11186120] = "The celebrity still had to smile through her shooting though she's allergic. It's not easy being a star...",
  [11186200] = "To design a makeup to match the classical-style of the brand, you needed a stylist.",
  [11186211] = "%s designed an amazing look, and the ad was well received.",
  [11186212] = "The make-up %s designed exposed actress's facial flaws, displeasing her fans.",
  [11186213] = "The make-up %s designed didn't match the style of the product.",
  [11186214] = "%s confused the shading powder with foundation and messed up the make-up design.",
  [11186219] = "A natural look is not necessarily a bad idea for the ad. Designing a style without makeup is also fine.",
  [11186220] = "I need to ask the stylist for some advice.",
  [11187000] = "A show that interviews the production crew of newly released movies and shows and to unearth for you, behind the scenes stories.",
  [11187001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11187002] = "I heard so many gossips but unfortunately I couldn't share them with others!",
  [11187100] = "The show needed a long-term host with a strong ability to improvise.",
  [11187111] = "%s could always gain information that the audience are interested in from the guests during the interview.",
  [11187112] = "%s always neglected his work and instead asked the guests for photos and signatures.",
  [11187113] = "%s was inarticulate and had difficulty communicating with the guests.",
  [11187114] = "%s was not used to the stage and couldn't go onto the stage due to excessive nervousness.",
  [11187119] = "Why not let the guests chat with one another...",
  [11187120] = "I would really want to produce an episode where the guests chat with one another with no host.",
  [11187200] = "Choose a competent interview draft editor for the show.",
  [11187211] = "%s always have a deep understanding of the works to be interviewed and prepared the drafts with adequate key points.",
  [11187212] = "%s pursue asking tough questions and offended the guests.",
  [11187213] = "The questions in the draft %s wrote were all trite and boring.",
  [11187214] = "%s always procrastinated and vanished on the day of deadline for his draft.",
  [11187219] = "A good host can make up for half an editor.",
  [11187220] = "Every day, I rack my brain for new ideas. Making a show featuring hots topic is not that easy.",
  [11188000] = "The show interviewed the eighth-dan kendo master, detailedly recording and introducing Japanese kendo.",
  [11188001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11188002] = "The kendo practitioners were really handsome and determined. I hoped to become such a determined person.",
  [11188100] = "Find a person to help get sponsorship necessary for the shooting of an excellent documentary.",
  [11188111] = "%s got sponsorship very efficiently, so the filming team had sufficient financial support.",
  [11188112] = "%s got sponsorship from the nextdoor spicy hot pot restaurant.",
  [11188113] = "There was miscommunication between %s and the sponsor at the later stage and the sponsor planned to withdraw their investment halfway.",
  [11188114] = "%s didn't know what sponsorship was and failed to prepare the relevant documents.",
  [11188119] = "Can't a program be well filmed without sponsorship?",
  [11188120] = "Money is not everything, but without money, you can do nothing.",
  [11188200] = "To assure quality of the documentary, a skilled translator was needed to be with the crew.",
  [11188211] = "%s was proficient in Japanese and knew kendo, so the filming went on smoothly.",
  [11188212] = "%s knew nothing about kendo, causing many problems during communication.",
  [11188213] = "As something went wrong in %s's application for visa and passport, %s couldn't follow the crew to Japan.",
  [11188214] = "%s could speak Korean, but not Japanese.",
  [11188219] = "Can a Japanese dabbler replace this position temporarily?",
  [11188220] = "There are many terminologies. Without preparation, how can we film it properly?",
  [11189000] = "A documentary featuring the lives of all kinds of pets, including not only common pets like cats and dogs but also rare birds and reptiles.",
  [11189001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11189002] = "Although pets are adorable, we have to work within our capabilities!",
  [11189100] = "To avoid any accident, you needed an animal expert to accompany the filming.",
  [11189111] = "%s got along well with little animals and perfectly solved all kinds of problems.",
  [11189112] = "%s got bitten by the animals and claimed for compensation.",
  [11189113] = "%s didn't pacify the animals, but messed up the site instead.",
  [11189114] = "%s was scared of all animals and even needed to be pacified by others.",
  [11189119] = "Leave it to chance. Hope that all the animals remain docile.",
  [11189120] = "Pets are really cute, but not when they're making trouble.",
  [11189200] = "To film the cuteness of animals, you needed a director for spot dispatch and filming.",
  [11189211] = "%s had a proper hold on lens languages and managed the filming organized.",
  [11189212] = "%s spent a lot of money on filming unnecessary scenes which were not used in the end.",
  [11189213] = "%s had a bad temper and the filming crew were less enthusiastic.",
  [11189214] = "%s only knew photography and knew little about directing.",
  [11189219] = "I also learned directing before. Let me try...",
  [11189220] = "There is a distinct difference between knowing photography and directing...",
  [11190000] = "Opening your eyes, you found yourself actually sitting on a bench at Verdant Plaza. It snowed and blanketed the world in pure white. You stood up blankly and walked ahead...",
  [11190001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11190002] = "The stillness made you feel a little uneasy...",
  [11190100] = "You felt it strange that music rang without spurting water when passing by the music fountain. You decided to...\n",
  [11190101] = "Go close to figure out what happened.",
  [11190102] = "Stand still and wait for the streaming water.",
  [11190103] = "Walk away as it might be frozen.",
  [11190111] = "Water suddenly spurted out from the frozen pipe, and you got all wet.",
  [11190112] = "You waited for two hours, but nothing happened.",
  [11190113] = "You haven't walked far when water started streaming at the water fountain, which looked so beautiful.",
  [11190120] = "The beautiful fountain should only be admired from a distance, not profaned by close approach.",
  [11190200] = "At the sidewalk, you found the traffic lights spoiled and had stopped at the 39th second... How would you cross the road?",
  [11190201] = "Wait and see before crossing.",
  [11190202] = "Take the pedestrian bridge.",
  [11190203] = "Take the underground passage",
  [11190211] = "As no car passed by, you managed to cross the intersection.",
  [11190212] = "As the bridge iced over, you fell down when walking on the bridge.",
  [11190213] = "The entrance of the underground passage was blocked by heavy snow.",
  [11190220] = "It's not suitable to travel during a snowy day like this.",
  [11191000] = "Roaming in the snow, you didn't see anyone else and began to wonder whether you were the only one left in the city...?",
  [11191001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11191002] = "I felt like a protagonist in a doomsday blockbuster.",
  [11191100] = "It snowed heavily and the wind was hurting your cheeks. Looking at the snow-covered street ahead, you decided to...",
  [11191101] = "Call a taxi with your phone.",
  [11191102] = "Wait for the snow to subside by the roadside.",
  [11191103] = "Continue walking.",
  [11191111] = "No drivers accepted your order, and you had to go on walking.",
  [11191112] = "You were stuck in the snow that got heavier and couldn't find the direction.",
  [11191113] = "You gritted your teeth and continued to walk towards Finance Street.",
  [11191120] = "No matter how heavy the snow is, I must keep walking ahead!",
  [11191200] = "You finally reached Finance Street, only to find the gate of your office tightly locked... What would you do?",
  [11191201] = "Smash the glass door and go in.",
  [11191202] = "Call your colleagues.",
  [11191203] = "Get lost in thought.",
  [11191211] = "Without any tools available, you had to smash with your hands and your hands swelled.",
  [11191212] = "None of them answered your call. All you got was engaged signals.",
  [11191213] = "You rest your chin on your handing, beginning to suspect whether you were still in your dreams.",
  [11191220] = "I'd better rely on myself.",
  [11192000] = "At the other end of the Finance Street silently stood the LFG Building. To verify what you have guessed, you decided to go and see...",
  [11192001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11192002] = "No matter how tired you are, don't stay hungry!",
  [11192100] = "Unexpectedly, the door of LFG was wide open. No one was here on the first floor, and the elevator had stopped working. You decided to...",
  [11192101] = "Walk up by stairs to check it out.",
  [11192102] = "Press the fire alarm to see if anyone was upstairs.",
  [11192103] = "Leave.",
  [11192111] = "When you climbed up to the 30th floor, you were very exhausted but still didn't see anybody.",
  [11192112] = "The fire alarm kept ringing, but nobody came running down.",
  [11192113] = "Obviously, you are also the only one here.",
  [11192120] = "I should have guessed it...",
  [11192200] = "Walking out of LFG, you confirmed that you were still in your dream. Before thinking further, your stomach started growling. You decided to...",
  [11192201] = "Find something to eat at the convenience store.",
  [11192202] = "It's so cold, let me look for a hotpot restaurant.",
  [11192203] = "Whatever, just stay hungry. This is a dream after all.",
  [11192211] = "No one was in the convenient store. You left some changes and took a loaf of bread.",
  [11192212] = "The hotpot restaurant was closed. You were drooling looking at the restaurant poster.",
  [11192213] = "You were too starved to walk and almost fainted.",
  [11192220] = "You'll only have the strength to explore on a full stomach!",
  [11193000] = "What should you leave the dreamland? After recalling the movies and books on hypnosis and subconsciousness, you turned back towards the Loveland University.",
  [11193001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11193002] = "Erm... It seemed a bit inappropriate to be reminiscing college life now?",
  [11193100] = "Upon entering Loveland University, the Bulletin Board caught your attention and you saw at the first glance...",
  [11193101] = "Join us at the Bioscience Research Club!",
  [11193102] = "Get Discounts for every 100 dollars of take-out!",
  [11193103] = "The Student Union is looking forward to your joining in!",
  [11193111] = "Sweeping across the Bulletin Board, you walked to the Lucien Bioscience Research Center.",
  [11193112] = "Looking at the advertising poster, you felt hungry again...",
  [11193113] = "You couldn't help reminiscing your college life.",
  [11193120] = "Is 'certificate' on every bulletin board?",
  [11193200] = "You reached the Lucien Bioscience Research Center, only to find the fully packed files were gone. You decided to...",
  [11193201] = "Check each room for the files.",
  [11193202] = "Just leave.",
  [11193203] = "Check it out at the school library.",
  [11193211] = "You found nothing. Sometimes, extrapolating is really an important skill to learn.",
  [11193212] = "After walking out of the Research Center, the wind and snow seemed to become heavier.",
  [11193213] = "You were at loss somewhat as the library was empty without any books.",
  [11193220] = "It's so quiet in Loveland University...",
  [11194000] = "The fruitless seeking perplexed you even more. When you came to your sense, you found yourself closed to the Public Security Bureau of Loveland City.",
  [11194001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11194002] = "Don't tell me I would freeze to death here...",
  [11194100] = "A few police cars were parked before the police department. After thinking, you decided to...",
  [11194101] = "Take a group photo since this is a rare opportunity.",
  [11194102] = "Ignore them and directly walk towards the gate.",
  [11194103] = "Try to start the engines as it was really too cold to walk.",
  [11194111] = "After filtering the photo, you wanted to post them online but kept failing.",
  [11194112] = "With a slight push, you opened that station gate and walked in.",
  [11194113] = "How could you drive without any key? What a fanciful idea!",
  [11194120] = "Cars can't move at all on the snow covered roads.",
  [11194200] = "The police station was also empty. You were almost used to such scenes already. Suddenly, a loud sound came from the glass gate behind !",
  [11194201] = "You cried out \"Help\"!",
  [11194202] = "You turned around to see what had happened.",
  [11194203] = "No matter what it is, first hide!",
  [11194211] = "No matter how loud you cried out, nobody would come to save you.",
  [11194212] = "The glass door had been blown by the wind to pieces and the shards were blown towards you.",
  [11194213] = "You hid in the corner and found that the sound came from the glass door smashed by the wind.",
  [11194220] = "As taught in the horror movies, hiding first in case of any danger is the right thing to do!",
  [11195000] = "Just as you were starving and cold in a snowy night, a sudden ray of light appeared in the sky. It was in the direction where the B.S. Group Building was...",
  [11195001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11195002] = "It felt as if I had finally completed the missions of a survival game...",
  [11195100] = "That light soon faded. Dazed, you sat on the ground, hugging your knees, deciding to...",
  [11195101] = "Go and see, as continue staying there can't solve the problem.",
  [11195102] = "Give up and leave it to chance.",
  [11195103] = "You are perplexed about what to do...",
  [11195111] = "When you reached the B.S. Group Building, that light reappeared.",
  [11195112] = "You sat there dully till the midnight, losing consciousness.",
  [11195113] = "After it got completely dark, you sat there and fell asleep.",
  [11195120] = "Only adventurers can break new ground.",
  [11195200] = "The golden rays of light formed a door shape, with complete darkness in the center, you decided to...",
  [11195201] = "Walk in slowly and gradually.",
  [11195202] = "Go to other places for safety.",
  [11195203] = "Cry loudly, \"What the hell are all these...\"",
  [11195211] = "The rays of light shrouded you and warmed you...",
  [11195212] = "You were frozen by the icy frost and couldn't go anywhere",
  [11195213] = "After crying for a long time, you felt tired and laid on the ground, gradually losing consciousness.",
  [11195220] = "Only the braves can harvest hopes.",
  [11196000] = "Was what that person said on the phone true? Have you totally been forgotten by the world?",
  [11196001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11196002] = "How could this happen?",
  [11196100] = "You were confused and perplexed. To confirm if Kiki had really forgotten you, you decided to...",
  [11196101] = "Tell her one of her past embarrassments .",
  [11196102] = "Tell her your name.",
  [11196103] = "Look for your photo together.",
  [11196111] = "Kiki exclaimed with great surprise, \"How do you know! Are you a stalker?\"",
  [11196112] = "Kiki tilted her head. \"So? Who are you?\"",
  [11196113] = "In your photo album, you realized all your group photos vanished.",
  [11196120] = "Are you really... not kidding me?",
  [11196200] = "You froze and were unwilling to believe this. Were there any other ways to prove your identity?",
  [11196201] = "Ask her about other colleagues.",
  [11196202] = "Talk about the new project your company was preparing for.",
  [11196203] = "Tell her you know her monthly salary.",
  [11196211] = "Kiki blinked and thought you had been some collaborative partner.",
  [11196212] = "Kiki thought you stole trade secrets and contacted the security.",
  [11196213] = "Kiki frowned, \"Are all headhunters nowadays so arrogant?\"",
  [11196220] = "So, this is the very feeling of being forgotten...",
  [11197000] = "The passersby were in a hurry and everyone seemed to have a specific destination except for you. Stepping forward, you suddenly saw a familiar figure...",
  [11197001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11197002] = "Respecting the old and protecting the young came first in any circumstances!",
  [11197100] = "Wasn't the man across the street Minor? On a second thought, you decided to...\n",
  [11197101] = "Wave at him.",
  [11197102] = "Call out his name.",
  [11197103] = "Cross the street to greet him.",
  [11197111] = "Minor didn't see you waving at all, walking further away as he yawned.",
  [11197112] = "The car honks were so loud that Minor didn't hear you.",
  [11197113] = "You hurried to run towards the zebra crossing.",
  [11197120] = "It's really important to be observant and alert!",
  [11197200] = "At the crossing, an old woman staggered to you. At this very moment, the traffic light turned green, you decided to...",
  [11197201] = "Ask her if she needed help.",
  [11197202] = "Held her hand to cross the street.",
  [11197203] = "Ignore her and go find Minor first.",
  [11197211] = "The old woman said, \"No, thanks.\" So, you hurried to cross the road, but didn't find Minor.",
  [11197212] = "The old woman didn't intend to cross the street at all. As you stood still for some time, Minor walked far away.",
  [11197213] = "The old woman fell. You rushed to hold her and had no time to go to find Minor.",
  [11197220] = "Anyway, we still should help the old.",
  [11198000] = "When LFG Building came into your sight, you felt at loss. Then, a car stopped at the gate of LFG. The man getting off the car was actually Goldman!",
  [11198001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11198002] = "One of the daily missions of the president assistant was to reject others.",
  [11198100] = "You wanted to go to see Goldman, but was stopped by a security guard. What would you do?",
  [11198101] = "Tell him you wanted to see Victor.",
  [11198102] = "Tell him you were a journalist.",
  [11198103] = "Tell him you wanted to see Goldman.",
  [11198111] = "The security guard replied with contempt, \"Is it up to you?\"",
  [11198112] = "The security guard glanced at the press card in your hand and let you in.",
  [11198113] = "The security guard was perplexed, \"Who are you?\"",
  [11198120] = "It is still quite important to bring your ID with you.",
  [11198200] = "You stopped Goldman who turned back and looked at you with somewhat confusion. What should you say now?",
  [11198201] = "\"I'm from a film company.\"",
  [11198202] = "\"I'm an acquaintance of Victor's.\"",
  [11198203] = "\"We're distantly related.\"",
  [11198211] = "Goldman had a short chat with you out of courtesy and you found that he also forgot about you.",
  [11198212] = "Goldman fake smiled and told you he had to listen to such words so many times every day.",
  [11198213] = "Goldman called security and threw you out of the building.",
  [11198220] = "I kept having a strong sense of deja vu...",
  [11199000] = "You passed by a crowded zone and learned from the passersby that a movie was being shot here. That man standing beside the director's chair... Wasn't he Savin?!",
  [11199001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11199002] = "I suddenly thought that it was not easy being a fan.",
  [11199100] = "Now that Savin was here, could he have news about Kiro? As you were thinking, you decided to...",
  [11199101] = "Rush into the crowd to ask Savin.",
  [11199102] = "Act as a fan to squeeze into the crowd.",
  [11199103] = "Disguise as a take-out delivery person to enter the site.",
  [11199111] = "Did you think the security guards in suits and sunglasses were easy to fool?",
  [11199112] = "Stop acting. You didn't even have light boards or banners.",
  [11199113] = "Although you had to pay for the costly take-out expenses, at least you got in.",
  [11199120] = "The security at the site is so strict...",
  [11199200] = "Finally, you entered the site. You found Savin and said to him...",
  [11199201] = "\"Did you become a director? Awesome!\"",
  [11199202] = "Where is Kiro???''",
  [11199203] = "\"Mr Agent, do you remember me?\"",
  [11199211] = "Savin waved his hands, signaling you not to talk nonsense at the site.",
  [11199212] = "Savin took you as a crazy fangirl and called the security.",
  [11199213] = "Savin thought for a while and asked whether you were a new employee of the B.S. Group.",
  [11199220] = "When on earth will Kiro be back...",
  [11200000] = "It was getting dark and was still snowing heavily. You walked aimlessly on the road in a trance and came to the orphanage full of memories.",
  [11200001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11200002] = "The snowmen the children made were quite lovely.",
  [11200100] = "In the yard, a bunch of children were making snowmen. You walked up to ask them while they looked at you with vigilant eyes...",
  [11200101] = "\"Hello, do you remember me?\"",
  [11200102] = "\"Do you know Lucien?\"",
  [11200103] = "\"Hey little ones, do you want sweets?\"",
  [11200111] = "The children shook their heads blankly.",
  [11200112] = "A little girl nodded and said that Lucien had just gone there that day.",
  [11200113] = "The children scattered in all directions and shouted, \"There's an evil lady!\"",
  [11200120] = "Fair enough ... children had better not talk to strangers!",
  [11200200] = "You planned to ask further, but the orphanage director suddenly appeared and you decided to...",
  [11200201] = "Talk about the shows you've produced before.",
  [11200202] = "Talk about the development of the orphanage.",
  [11200203] = "Explain to him that you were not a human trafficker.",
  [11200211] = "The orphanage director was in doubt, \"Wasn't the show produced by Anna?\"",
  [11200212] = "The orphanage director mistook you for a sponsor representative and showed immense gratitude.",
  [11200213] = "That's what every human trafficker says. Get out of here!",
  [11200220] = "It's been a long time since I last saw the orphanage director.",
  [11201000] = "The street lights at the Verdant Plaza were on. You held a cup of hot coco, sat at the bench of the Plaza, and thought about what to do next...",
  [11201001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11201002] = "You suddenly felt like going into live streaming...",
  [11201100] = "Gazing at the streetlamps, you got lost in thought. Suddenly, you heard a woman screaming at the near distance. Startled, you decided to...",
  [11201101] = "OMG, ask for an ambulance!",
  [11201102] = "Go closer cautiously to observe the situation.",
  [11201103] = "Quivering from fear.",
  [11201111] = "Was directly asking for an ambulance over the top? Better call the police first.",
  [11201112] = "You realized that it was actually Hollow who screamed.",
  [11201113] = "You cowered on the bench as the screaming came closer and closer.",
  [11201120] = "Why do I always encounter such strange things...",
  [11201200] = "Hollow held up her phone and screamed with joy, \"Thank you for your gifts! I love you all!\" Seeing such a scene, you decided to...",
  [11201201] = "Ask her to shut up.",
  [11201202] = "Ask her if she remembered you and Gavin.",
  [11201203] = "Ask her if live streaming is profitable.",
  [11201211] = "Hollow complained tearfully to her fans who asked you to shut up through bullet screen comments.",
  [11201212] = "Hollow said, \"Of course, I remember the handsome police officer Gavin! But who are you?\"",
  [11201213] = "Hollow whipped her hair and said, \"It's fine I guess, since I have many fans.\"",
  [11201220] = "How I wish I could be as confident as Hollow.",
  [11202000] = "The alley was complicatedly constructed, just like a maze. You zigzagged around and couldn't find the exit. When you turned into another alley, you came across someone...",
  [11202001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11202002] = "Perhaps, everyone had a hipster period.",
  [11202100] = "That man shouted, \"Wuts up?\" Then, you realized he was Punkilles and immediately answered...",
  [11202101] = "\"Sry\"",
  [11202102] = "\"Sorry\"",
  [11202103] = "\"Why don't look where you are going?!\"",
  [11202111] = "Punkilles was very satisfied with your reply and forgave you.",
  [11202112] = "Punkilles shot a glance at you and shook his head, \"Rly outd8d.\"",
  [11202113] = "Punkilles got very angry and punched you.",
  [11202120] = "It's really hard to understand the Alternateens' behaviors.",
  [11202200] = "Punkilles seemed to have forgotten about you too, and he asked again if you would apply for a card with \"80% Dis\". You decided to...",
  [11202201] = "Apply for a card.",
  [11202202] = "\"No, thanks.\"",
  [11202203] = "\"Ov cors.\"",
  [11202211] = "You paid 9999 dollars for the card originally priced at 8888 dollars.",
  [11202212] = "You waved your hand awkwardly and slipped away quickly.",
  [11202213] = "After applying for the card, you went for a crazily cool hair style.",
  [11202220] = "Tony should compete with Punkilles some time.",
  [11203000] = "In the chaotic scene with fires and smokes, the night swallowed everything and you could not see Gavin at all.",
  [11203001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11203002] = "Gavin... Where are you?",
  [11203100] = "Rationally, you knew you should leave, but you hesitated and couldn't make a decision...",
  [11203101] = "Decide to go to find Gavin.",
  [11203102] = "Stay and wait on the same spot.",
  [11203103] = "Go back to ask someone for help.",
  [11203111] = "You pulled yourself up and plucked up the courage to walk towards the direction Gavin left.",
  [11203112] = "You stayed in place and waited for a while. You started becoming more panicked and didn't know what to do.",
  [11203113] = "You decided to go back and ask someone for help, but no one who was fleeing for life agreed to do that.",
  [11203120] = "It's high time that I made up my mind.",
  [11203200] = "Having twisted your left ankle, every step was torture but you couldn't just seek aimlessly, so you decided to...",
  [11203201] = "Walk towards the river-crossing bridge.",
  [11203202] = "Walk towards a safe riverbank.",
  [11203203] = "Walk long the direction where the crowd came from.",
  [11203211] = "The crack of the bridge floor was still widening, and anther loud bomb frightened you so much that you quickly changed directions.",
  [11203212] = "The crowd by the riverbank had early dispersed. You looked for Gavin as you were walking ahead.",
  [11203213] = "As the crowd fled outwards in panic, you couldn't squeeze in at all and had to change direction.",
  [11203220] = "A wise man knows his own limitations.",
  [11204000] = "Was the explosion of the river-crossing bridge really just an accident? You, who were involved, didn't believe such statement and decided to explore the truth.",
  [11204001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11204002] = "The truth was always hidden among the mist, puzzling people.",
  [11204100] = "When seeking for clues near the explosion site, you spotted a disguised journalist in a baseball cap.",
  [11204101] = "You walked up to him and asked directly.",
  [11204102] = "You asked him without exposing his identity.",
  [11204103] = "You pretended to be a peer to cotton up to him.",
  [11204111] = "Although startled, the disguised journalist drew close and whispered to you that he would like to tell you a secret.",
  [11204112] = "The disguised journalist equivocated when answering your questions.",
  [11204113] = "The disguised journalist inspected you with a watchful eye, thinking that you were there to get some scoop.",
  [11204120] = "Sometimes, courage is more important than strategies.",
  [11204200] = "You discovered that this journalist seemingly knew about many things. Currently, what you wanted to know from him the most is...",
  [11204201] = "Information on the river-crossing bridge.",
  [11204202] = "The cause of the explosion.",
  [11204203] = "The condition of the casualties.",
  [11204211] = "The journalist told you unceasingly about a bunch of history and data of the bridge. You thought you could as well google it back home.",
  [11204212] = "The journalist mysteriously told you that according to his inside information, signs of explosives were found under the bridge pier.",
  [11204213] = "After hesitating for a while, the journalist honestly told you that he didn't know, either.",
  [11204220] = "Asking a good question is the key to solving a problem.",
  [11205000] = "It didn't stop snowing. You were overwhelmed by fatigue and cold and could only choose to go back home first before planning for your next step.",
  [11205001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11205002] = "Why don't I have a magical teleportation device?",
  [11205100] = "Due to the explosion of the river-crossing bridge, the subway station was suspended and you had to go home through other means of transport.",
  [11205101] = "Go to another road to take the bus.",
  [11205102] = "Go to the next crossing to take a taxi.",
  [11205103] = "Walk ahead to ride a shared bike.",
  [11205111] = "You waited for dozens of minutes, but failed to squeeze onto that bus.",
  [11205112] = "Although taxis were operating, you saw no empty ones in the rush hour.",
  [11205113] = "You finally found a ridable bike and unstably took off in it.",
  [11205120] = "It's a basic quality to be adaptable!",
  [11205200] = "You were just upon reaching home but unfortunately, the road ahead was blocked, so you decided to...",
  [11205201] = "Ignore it and keep going ahead.",
  [11205202] = "Take a further road.",
  [11205203] = "Take the side path without street lights.",
  [11205211] = "You bypassed the blockade tape but were soon 'invited' out by the staff.",
  [11205212] = "You took a detour and returned home smoothly.",
  [11205213] = "The lane without street lights was so dark that you fell down heavily after just several steps.",
  [11205220] = "Wise men suit their actions to the times.",
  [11206000] = "All sorts of unknown seemed like the deepest darkness. You were unclear about what was hidden underneath it, but you know you wouldn't stop.",
  [11206001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [11206002] = "Why don't I have a magical teleportation device?",
  [11206100] = "Lucien was not in the Research Center. What should you do next?",
  [11206101] = "Give up looking for him as it was very dangerous.",
  [11206102] = "Go directly to the predicted place.",
  [11206103] = "Wait for him to come back at the gate of the Research Center.",
  [11206111] = "You were ready to go back home, but half way back, you thought you couldn't give up.",
  [11206112] = "You decided to go directly to the old address of the Ultima Bioresearch as you had a hunch that Lucien must be there.",
  [11206113] = "You waited for a long time at the gate till the patrolling security drove you out.",
  [11206120] = "I can't just easily give up.",
  [11206200] = "On the way to the Research Center, you suddenly heard someone talking about \"EVIL\", so you decided to...",
  [11206201] = "Find that person and ask him what EVIL was.",
  [11206202] = "Tail after that person to check his identity.",
  [11206203] = "Leave quickly for safety.",
  [11206211] = "That person looked at you contemptuously and went away without answering.",
  [11206212] = "You found out that he was just an ordinary person. For fear of being noticed, you stopped tailing after him.",
  [11206213] = "Fearing that the person was there for you, you paced up and left the crowd.",
  [11206220] = "I have an ominous premonition...",
  [11207000] = "You escaped from the Research Center, but danger is still lurking nearby. Before Lucien took action again, you must run as far as you could!",
  [11207001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11207002] = "Pant... Pant ... So ... so exhausted...!",
  [11207100] = "Shortly after you began running, you felt that your power suppressing Lucien vanished. Then, you...",
  [11207101] = "Turned back to have a look.",
  [11207102] = "Use the power once again.",
  [11207103] = "Keeping running without turning back.",
  [11207111] = "Your eyes met with a pair of eyes staring at you from behind the window as you turned back. You almost tumbled due to fear.",
  [11207112] = "You stopped, wanting to use the power again, only to find that you couldn't do it at all anymore.",
  [11207113] = "You ran ahead in full speed and soon felt that you got away from the staring behind you.",
  [11207120] = "It's better to be cautious at that critical moment.",
  [11207200] = "The fierce running exhausted you, so you could only find a place to rest.",
  [11207201] = "A cafe by the roadside.",
  [11207202] = "An unobtrusive alley ",
  [11207203] = "Under a tree by the roadside.",
  [11207211] = "Sitting by the window in a corner, you observed outside watchfully, but saw no suspicious person passing by after a long time.",
  [11207212] = "You realized that it was a blind alley walking into it, so you rushed out to find another resting place.",
  [11207213] = "A little rascal passing by kicked at the tree trunk, and the load of snow on the tree fell on you.",
  [11207220] = "At such moment, you should believe your intuition!",
  [11208000] = "You seemed to be temporarily out of danger, but you knew nothing about your current situation. On a second thought, you decided to find an Evolver to understand the situation.",
  [11208001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11208002] = "Was an EVIL ... an Evol?",
  [11208100] = "You arrived at the hospital where Dr. Song worked, but she was not in the office, so you decided to...",
  [11208101] = "Wait for her standing in the corridor ",
  [11208102] = "Wait for her sitting in the office.",
  [11208103] = "Ask others where she is and go to find her.",
  [11208111] = "Soon, you realized that you aroused quite a bit of attention, so you quickly went back into the office.",
  [11208112] = "When Dr. Song got back, she was surprised to see you and didn't calm down until you told her why you were there.",
  [11208113] = "You searched the whole hospital and finally found that Dr. Song was already back to the office.",
  [11208120] = "This is the only thing we can do now...",
  [11208200] = "Dr. Song was surprised when you pointed out her identity as an Evolver and asked you what you wanted to know from her...",
  [11208201] = "The situation of Evolvers",
  [11208202] = "Whether the flu affair existed",
  [11208203] = "Who are the EVILs?",
  [11208211] = "\"I don't have any specific news, but our situation is as dangerous as tightrope walking.\" Dr. Song whispered.",
  [11208212] = "\"The flu occurs every year. It's nothing special.\" Dr. Song said indifferently.",
  [11208213] = "Dr. Song's face suddenly turned pale. It was after a long while before she said, \"We ... are the EVILS.\"",
  [11208220] = "Is it true that \"the less you know, the safer you are\"?",
  [11209000] = "Leaving the hospital, you felt an unspoken fear from what Dr. Song told you just now. It's an unknown force hiding in the dark while you were in the light... What should you do next?",
  [11209001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11209002] = "A brave youth stepped on the journey to the southeast...",
  [11209100] = "Shaw sent a message to warn you not to head southeast. You again reached the crossing, you decided to...",
  [11209101] = "Head on to the southeast.",
  [11209102] = "Toss a coin to decide.",
  [11209103] = "Send a message to ask why you shouldn't go to the southeast.",
  [11209111] = "You ignored what Shaw said in his message and headed on to the southeast.",
  [11209112] = "You tossed the coin three times. Two heads, one tail. You decided to head on to the southeast.",
  [11209113] = "Shaw replied with \"It's a secret\". You couldn't help feeling that you were being too naive to have asked him.",
  [11209120] = "After all, a suggestion is just a suggestion... right?",
  [11209200] = "Although you were heading to the southeast again, you hadn't determined your destination. After hesitating for a while, you decided to...",
  [11209201] = "Go back to Ultima Bioresearch to search for clues.",
  [11209202] = "Go to the river-crossing bridge to explore the truth.",
  [11209203] = "Give up thinking.",
  [11209211] = "You decided against this idea once is appeared in your mind, as you couldn't confirm whether Lucien has left or not.",
  [11209212] = "What you could do then was to discover the truth about the explosion, so you resolutely went towards the bridge.",
  [11209213] = "You decided to just go with the flow then found yourself heading to the river-crossing bridge.",
  [11209220] = "Look before you leap.",
  [11210000] = "Dozens of hours had passed since the bridge explosion, but no cause of the accident was reported by the authority. With the gradual increase of casualties, you couldn't wait anymore.",
  [11210001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [11210002] = "Did such an ambiguous attitude hint some shocking secret?",
  [11210100] = "You came to the police station again but the officers were too busy to entertain you.",
  [11210101] = "Take a number and wait for the service staffs.",
  [11210102] = "Ask a passerby.",
  [11210103] = "Look for Officer Landsman with your press card.",
  [11210111] = "Looking at the three-digit waiting number, your heart sank.",
  [11210112] = "The passerby looked at you with surprise and told you he was just a cleaner.",
  [11210113] = "You easily found Officer Landsman who had just returned to the station.",
  [11210120] = "Execution is also very important!",
  [11210200] = "Officer Landsman replied ambiguously. What should you do so that he would speak the truth?",
  [11210201] = "Seriously point out that the public has a right to know.",
  [11210202] = "Politely ask him to speak some truth.",
  [11210203] = "Tell Officer Landsman that you would expose this matter if he refused to speak truth.",
  [11210211] = "After hesitating for a while, Officer Landsman told you he didn't know either, as this matter was currently top secret.",
  [11210212] = "Officer Landsman accepted all your compliments, but just chuckled without saying anything.",
  [11210213] = "Rather than taking you \"threat\" seriously, Officer Landsman told you the interview time was over.",
  [11210220] = "It's necessary to impose proper pressure on him.",
  [11211000] = "Following the exposure of the superpowers, comments on the internet became more and more uncontrollable. Soon, some organized protest marches appeared on the street.",
  [11211001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [11211002] = "Those involved in this event were not only ordinary persons, but also super natural powers, probably.",
  [11211100] = "On the way home, the taxi driver chatting about current affairs with you. You thought that you might learn some info from him...",
  [11211101] = "Anything strange happened recently?",
  [11211102] = "Anything else happened on the day of the bridge explosion?",
  [11211103] = "Has the oil price risen again?",
  [11211111] = "The driver whispered mysteriously: I've came across many enigmatic passengers deep into the night recently.",
  [11211112] = "The driver shook his head and said with lingering fear, \"Luckily I wasn't driving at the time. It's really dreadful.\"",
  [11211113] = "The driver laughed and told you that he would not give you any discount.",
  [11211120] = "Taxi drivers are always that talkative.",
  [11211200] = "You were stuck in the traffic jam halfway. The driver complained that it was caused by that group of protesters again. You decided to...",
  [11211201] = "Ask the driver to take a detour.",
  [11211202] = "Glance form the distance through the window.",
  [11211203] = "Get off the car to see.",
  [11211211] = "Based on his years of experience, the driver took a detour and left the place. You could only hear the noises of the crowd behind in a distance.",
  [11211212] = "Blocked by vehicles from all directions, you couldn't see the group of protesters.",
  [11211213] = "You got off the car and soon saw the massive group of protesters shouting \"Not to superpowers.\"",
  [11211220] = "Watch out for road rage when driving...",
  [11212000] = "The world which you thought would never change had showed invisible signs of changes. You thought that you had control in the future, but the series of changes were telling you",
  [11212001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [11212002] = "The world had changed and couldn't be what it used to be!",
  [11212100] = "Unable to find out the reason for buying stakes of HBS from Victor, you could only try some other ways. So, you chose to...",
  [11212101] = "Visit LFG to understand the situation.",
  [11212102] = "Visit Loveland TV which had cooperated with HBS before.",
  [11212103] = "Visit the temporary office of HBS in Loveland City for more information",
  [11212111] = "You mingled with the crowd of journalists and asked questions, but all the answers were information that the public had already known.",
  [11212112] = "You weren't too hopeful, but surprisingly got to know that LFG had been in contact with HBS since half a year ago.",
  [11212113] = "There were only a few people were in the huge office. Just as you were feeling it strange, you were asked to leave by the staff.",
  [11212120] = "Well begun is half done.",
  [11212200] = "Walking on the road, you saw traffic jams and protesters everywhere. Suddenly, you saw a familiar figure and you...",
  [11212201] = "Chased after him without hesitation.",
  [11212202] = "Hesitated if it was your illusion.",
  [11212203] = "Called out to stop that man.",
  [11212211] = "You chased after him immediately and saw Eli getting in the car, disappearing down the road.",
  [11212212] = "After rubbing your eyes, you found that the figure was gone.",
  [11212213] = "Just as you called out, the figure resembling Eli picked up his pace and disappeared into the crowd.",
  [11212220] = "I don't think it's a mistake, but ... why was he here?",
  [11213000] = "It is finally noon break. How are you planning to investigate now that you have infiltrated the Special Task Force?",
  [11213001] = "There are too many disguises in the world... I was tired of staying perfect. When I was dispirited, I suddenly remembered what he said...",
  [11213002] = "Opportunity knocks but once. Only by seizing it can you get the clues",
  [11213100] = "Your employee card has limited access, so you had to...",
  [11213101] = "Try your luck",
  [11213102] = "Secretly change to a logged in computer",
  [11213103] = "Give up trying",
  [11213111] = "Three consecutive failures would trigger an alert, so you gave up after failing two times",
  [11213112] = "Logged in the system smoothly",
  [11213113] = "The colleague just happened to come back from lunch and you lost the chance to investigate",
  [11213120] = "Can't Shaw just give me higher privilege?!",
  [11213200] = "Just as you just found some clues, you heard footsteps from behind, so you...",
  [11213201] = "Hide under the table in a hurry",
  [11213202] = "Close the pages and delete the browser history",
  [11213203] = "Try to make up a reasonable excuse",
  [11213211] = "You got up after you heard the footsteps leave, but hit your head severely",
  [11213212] = "That person was just passing by and there was no actual danger",
  [11213213] = "Your reason was believed, but you were pulled away for something else",
  [11213220] = "Fortunately, it was just a false alarm...",
  [11213300] = "During the investigation, the computer was infected by virus. You decided to...",
  [11213301] = "Try to run the antivirus software",
  [11213302] = "Keep browsing and let the virus be",
  [11213303] = "Perform a force shutdown",
  [11213311] = "The computer resumed to normal",
  [11213312] = "The virus paralyzed the system, and the investigation had to stop",
  [11213313] = "The computer couldn't be forcibly shut down and the crash triggered an alert",
  [11213320] = "The Special Task Force firewall is too weak...",
  [11214000] = "On your way home, the familiar notification sound rang on your phone...",
  [11214001] = "There are too many disguises in the world... I was tired of staying perfect. When I was dispirited, I suddenly remembered what he said...",
  [11214002] = "Although Shaw can be a little aggressive when he speaks, he is still quite trustworthy!",
  [11214100] = "It was an email from Shaw! You decided to...",
  [11214101] = "Read it when you get home and you distract yourself by listening to music",
  [11214102] = "Eagerly open the file at once",
  [11214103] = "Secretly move to the last row before opening it",
  [11214111] = "Seeing you didn't reply, Shaw sent you several more messages",
  [11214112] = "The bus suddenly braked, and your phone fell onto the ground",
  [11214113] = "The last row was full, so you had to give up",
  [11214120] = "I'm really curious about what the email says...",
  [11214200] = "Shaw kept sending you messages, and you chose to...",
  [11214201] = "Sound out the purpose of his action tonight",
  [11214202] = "Just chat with him casually",
  [11214203] = "Ignore the messages and put your phone in your handbag",
  [11214211] = "He seemed to saw through your purpose at once and changed the topic",
  [11214212] = "He revealed some information unconsciously, and you quickly noted them down",
  [11214213] = "The phone vibrated crazily, and only quieted down until a long while later",
  [11214220] = "It's really not easy to wangle information out of him...",
  [11214300] = "You were on a wrong bus, so you had to get off midway. You decided to...",
  [11214301] = "Hail a taxi to send you back home",
  [11214302] = "Walk home along the same path",
  [11214303] = "See if there is any bus back",
  [11214311] = "You got home in time, and was lost in thought while thinking about everything you had been through",
  [11214312] = "It was so dark that you got lost",
  [11214313] = "You waited at the bus station for a long time, but it didn't come",
  [11214320] = "I really wish I could shrink into inches",
  [11215000] = "Everyone must overcome the weakness in their hearts before obtaining the truth",
  [11215001] = "There are too many disguises in the world... I was tired of staying perfect. When I was dispirited, I suddenly remembered what he said...",
  [11215002] = "Gavin seems completely different...",
  [11215100] = "The flaming scene underneath was the explosion site. You looked at Gavin who used to be afraid of fire with concern and...",
  [11215101] = "Directly asked him if he's still afraid of fire",
  [11215102] = "Believe that he can overcome the fear",
  [11215103] = "Asked him to leave the scene for others to handle",
  [11215111] = "Gavin rolled his eyes, ''You confused me with someone else''",
  [11215112] = "Gavin didn't seem to be afraid, but you weren't sure if he was pretending to be calm",
  [11215113] = "Gavin insisted on going to the crime scene, and there was no room for negotiation",
  [11215120] = "He seems to have even fewer weaknesses now...",
  [11215200] = "The electricity towers fell down one by one, and there were signs of avalanche on the cliff!",
  [11215201] = "Clutched Gavin's collar with fear",
  [11215202] = "Directly told Gavin",
  [11215203] = "You were too nervous to say anything",
  [11215211] = "Gavin smacked your hand and away ''What's your problem?''",
