  [11339312] = "Gavin was surprised by your choice.",
  [11339313] = "Okay. Just do it as you said.",
  [11340000] = "Healthcare workers have always been angels in our hearts. We followed a few doctors and nurses closely to reveal the ordinary and heroic day of healthcare angels.",
  [11340001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11340002] = "While we are all well and healthy, please remember those who have been racing against death.",
  [11340100] = "We want to follow the healthcare workers without disturbing their work, which requires the director's good organization.",
  [11340111] = "As a professional documentary director, %s minimized the disruption caused by cameras when documenting the day of healthcare workers authentically.",
  [11340112] = "%s focused too much on the shooting effects and often disturbed the doctors and nurses.",
  [11340113] = "%s didn't plan the shooting route well and ended up collecting useless footage.",
  [11340114] = "%s was perfunctory and the final film was terrible.",
  [11340119] = "We couldn't find a professional director, so the shooting had reached an impasse.",
  [11340120] = "The camera needs to convey reality, not images.",
  [11340200] = "After the shoot, we also need to interview the doctors and nurses to listen to their thoughts.",
  [11340211] = "%s was professional and courteous, the interview with the healthcare workers was easy and natural like a chat.",
  [11340212] = "%s was too serious, making the healthcare workers nervous too.",
  [11340213] = "%s only asked questions according to the script. It felt like a formal Q&A.",
  [11340214] = "%s would only make jokes and chitchatting and never got to the subject.",
  [11340219] = "Doing an interview is too much work. Let's just have the healthcare workers read out a script.",
  [11340220] = "The healthcare angels have beautiful hearts.",
  [11341000] = "A bar street was newly opened in Loveland City. We immediately conducted a store visit to promote any goodies we found.",
  [11341001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11341002] = "The shooting was finally completed, which was enough to make us dizzy without any alcohol.",
  [11341100] = "We wanted to find a frequent visitor of the bars to understand the bar street better.",
  [11341111] = "%s knew each bar very well and gave us a systematic introduction to the features and pricing of each bar.",
  [11341112] = "%s usually only went to the same bar, so he couldn't provide information about other bars.",
  [11341113] = "%s lived near the street but knew nothing about the area.",
  [11341114] = "%s's family was very strict. He had never entered a bar once.",
  [11341119] = "We didn't find a single piece of information. Let's just get some first-hand experience.",
  [11341120] = "It's my first time having a systematic and detailed understanding of the types and characteristics of bars.",
  [11341200] = "Several drunkards are surrounding a lady. Go help her!",
  [11341211] = "%s turned out to be a combat fighter, beating up the drunkards in no time.",
  [11341212] = "%s went overboard and got the drunkards injured and had to pay compensation.",
  [11341213] = "%s rushed up aggressively, only to be beaten up with one punch.",
  [11341214] = "%s were weak and simply didn't dare to go forward.",
  [11341219] = "It's better to stay away from trouble.",
  [11341220] = "Women must protect themselves when they go out!",
  [11341300] = "You fell in love with a bar after shooting the show. You invited Gavin to go together. What drink do you think he had ordered for you?",
  [11341301] = "Cocktail",
  [11341302] = "Beef Soup",
  [11341303] = "Mineral Water",
  [11341311] = "Don't worry, it's non-alcoholic.",
  [11341312] = "Gavin was surprised by your choice.",
  [11341313] = "Gavin was surprised by your choice.",
  [11342000] = "Detective fiction and films have recently become popular. We selected a few excellent works to present.",
  [11342001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11342002] = "When will that most classic detective work end?",
  [11342100] = "To delve into the various knowledge in the plot, we need to invite professional writers to carry out analysis and interpretation.",
  [11342111] = "%s had adapted several detective films. His professional analysis was mesmerizing.",
  [11342112] = "%s adaptations didn't include detective works. He could only analyze the relationships in the films.",
  [11342113] = "%s was an obscure screenwriter, only bragging about themselves the whole time.",
  [11342114] = "%s rambled and sent everyone to sleep in no time.",
  [11342119] = "We couldn't find any suitable writers, so we had to copy some other shows.",
  [11342120] = "A different perspective gives a different scenery.",
  [11342200] = "Well-chosen music will work well with the commentary.",
  [11342211] = "The music %s chosen worked perfectly for the commentary, making it very engaging.",
  [11342212] = "%s had a great taste in music, but it just wasn't suitable for the commentary.",
  [11342213] = "%s only chose some detective movie interludes, which was quite boring.",
  [11342214] = "%s chose popular background music for short video clips, making the commentary very seem hideous.",
  [11342219] = "We only randomly chose some eerie sound effects, hoping to make it seem more intimidating.",
  [11342220] = "Some music can instantly give goosebumps when the first note sounds.",
  [11343000] = "The Special Task Force will produce a public service film on safety in public places, and our company is responsible for its shooting and promotion.",
  [11343001] = "The whole company took this project very seriously. The various teams have started the preparation...",
  [11343002] = "Public safety is a serious matter. We hope to raise the public's awareness.",
  [11343100] = "The shooting happened to be in the peak season of tourism in Loveland City. To prevent any potential crisis from large crowds, we should pay attention to evacuating the crowd and security work.",
  [11343111] = "%s had worked as a security guard for many years and was very experienced. No chaos happened on the set.",
  [11343112] = "%s was short-tempered and violently evacuated the crowd, which upset the onlookers.",
  [11343113] = "%s misjudged the number of onlookers and couldn't handle the overwhelming crowd.",
  [11343114] = "%s himself got lost in the crowd and even lost one of his shoes.",
  [11343119] = "The crowd was difficult to control, so we had no choice but to change the shooting location.",
  [11343120] = "The shooting of a public safety film needs to pay attention to public safety too.",
  [11343200] = "The public service film entered the promotion stage. To boost the rating, we need a well-known celebrity with a positive image.",
  [11343211] = "%s was a popular and scandal-free idol.",
  [11343212] = "%s had many fans but wasn't wildly popular, who got boycotted by many people.",
  [11343213] = "%s wasn't very well-known and didn't help to increase the ratings.",
  [11343214] = "%s was a notorious celebrity. It's tough to even work with him.",
  [11343219] = "We couldn't find anyone suitable, so we could only give up.",
  [11343220] = "There seemed to be an increasing number of celebrities passionate about charity work.",
  [11344000] = "The annual medical check-up help to know the indexes of our body. How do we read the health signs our body tells us in everyday life? We invited professionals to film a popular science show.",
  [11344001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11344002] = "Health is the foundation of everything. We wish everyone healthy and well.",
  [11344100] = "As the person in charge of the science show, I need to guarantee the guests are knowledgeable.",
  [11344111] = "%s had been in the medical research field for many years. He was knowledgeable and humorous. The viewers had benefited greatly from it.",
  [11344112] = "%s was knowledgeable yet not good at communicating. The viewers fell asleep.",
  [11344113] = "%s only talked about unscientific and unproven folk remedies, which was very misleading.",
  [11344114] = "%s never had any stage experience and was so nervous that he couldn't speak.",
  [11344119] = "If we find any random person to read a script and pretend to be an expert. It's just a matter of time before we get exposed.",
  [11344120] = "A speaker should be professional as a responsibility to the viewers.",
  [11344200] = "Before the show is aired, some footage got leaked and taken out of context as \"pseudoscience\". We need to manage the PR crisis.",
  [11344211] = "%s was experienced in PR and used various resources to clarify and present the facts and quickly calmed down the public.",
  [11344212] = "%s attacked the rumor mongers with marketing accounts. It increased its popularity, but many people remained against the show.",
  [11344213] = "%s found some random people to clarify it online but to no avail.",
  [11344214] = "%s deleted the negative comments, only provoked more negative comments.",
  [11344219] = "The innocent will always be vindicated. Time will tell the truth.",
  [11344220] = "Rumor is easy to create but hard to break.",
  [11345000] = "In the era of fast-paced life, online concert is becoming mainstream entertainment. We also tried to run an online live concert.",
  [11345001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11345002] = "The concert had a good turnout. It turned out that online viewers started to sing together...",
  [11345100] = "The standard of lighting is very high in order to create an atmosphere on Livestream.",
  [11345111] = "%s had precise control of the lighting and made the viewers feel as if they were there.",
  [11345112] = "%s only ever managed lighting in live concerts and was a little overwhelmed.",
  [11345113] = "%s was very unprofessional. The lighting effects went wrong for a couple of close-ups.",
  [11345114] = "%s used a disco effect, creating an incoherent atmosphere in the concert.",
  [11345119] = "It should be fine if we just use the normal lighting in live concerts.",
  [11345120] = "The right amount of lighting can immerse the viewers.",
  [11345200] = "In this online broadcast, a well-known guest can significantly increase the popularity of the concert.",
  [11345211] = "%s was beautiful and had a great voice, bringing many views to the concert.",
  [11345212] = "%s asked for a whopping price and was notorious for being rude and arrogant.",
  [11345213] = "%s had a scandal recently. More people dislike him than support him.",
  [11345214] = "%s was a Z-list nobody. No one remembered him in the entertainment industry.",
  [11345219] = "We found a celebrity who couldn't carry a tone. The lip-synching got exposed and ridiculed.",
  [11345220] = "After hiring celebrities, the budget was tight again...",
  [11345300] = "When watching an online concert with Kiro, you bought some snacks to share with him...",
  [11345301] = "Donuts",
  [11345302] = "Braised Pork Belly",
  [11345303] = "Mineral Water",
  [11345311] = "A perfect time for some dessert!",
  [11345312] = "Kiro looked at it and thought perhaps it wasn't a bad choice.",
  [11345313] = "Kiro looked at it and thought perhaps it wasn't a bad choice.",
  [11346000] = "To encourage more people with reduced mobility to get out of their homes, we collaborated with the Loveland City Council to make a public service film called \"Let Love Travel\".",
  [11346001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11346002] = "The world is a wonderful place, so we need to encourage more people to come out and enjoy its beauty.",
  [11346100] = "To make people resonate with the show, we need an actor to portray the helplessness of reduced mobility.",
  [11346111] = "%s's acting was vivid and natural, portraying a strong and optimistic character.",
  [11346112] = "%s had just played a triathlon champion role, making the audience find it difficult to see him in a different role.",
  [11346113] = "%s overacted and was very out of character.",
  [11346114] = "%s has no acting experience and was very timid in front of the camera.",
  [11346119] = "We found a random actor. The result wasn't satisfactory.",
  [11346120] = "It's a blessing to be born healthy.",
  [11346200] = "We need a professional to write profound and catchy content.",
  [11346211] = "It took no time for %s to come up with a brainwashing and spot-on ad slogan, which went viral.",
  [11346212] = "%s hoped to write educational content, but it's so lengthy to be remembered.",
  [11346213] = "%s's writing was too rough and mediocre.",
  [11346214] = "%s's long-winded essay didn't seem to have a main point.",
  [11346219] = "It should be fine if we just tweak a buzzword.",
  [11346220] = "Remember the quote that made you cry most recently?",
  [11347000] = "Do you believe in the existence of prehistoric civilizations? We have explored the legends of \"prehistoric civilizations\" through myths that had been passed on...",
  [11347001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11347002] = "We might not be able to explore everything, but this will broaden our world.",
  [11347100] = "The truth is often hidden in the fog, so we delved into many materials and legends.",
  [11347111] = "%s carried out a logical and rigorous investigation and soon found a lot of relevant information.",
  [11347112] = "% failed to discern the lies from the truth and filter out any inaccurate information.",
  [11347113] = "%s was good at fabricating information.",
  [11347114] = "%s simply didn't know where to start.",
  [11347119] = "It's too hard to carry out an investigation. Let's just copy from other shows.",
  [11347120] = "How small is mankind over such a long history.",
  [11347200] = "Mankind never stopped speculating about prehistoric civilizations. We have edited some relevant clips for comparison.",
  [11347211] = "%s was efficient and quickly put together a video we needed.",
  [11347212] = "%s had trouble choosing what clip to include. The final video was too long.",
  [11347213] = "%s didn't have great editing skills. The video didn't make much sense.",
  [11347214] = "%s fell asleep when editing, which had delayed a lot of work.",
  [11347219] = "Speculations have no credibility. No need to mention it.",
  [11347220] = "The human imagination might not be close to the truth, but close to our hearts.",
  [11348000] = "After Kiro had announced that he'd focus on composing new songs, the internet exploded with comments. We need to bring it under control.",
  [11348001] = "The matter is urgent and quick preparations are needed.",
  [11348002] = "Regardless, Kiro will always be that shining star in the film industry.",
  [11348100] = "The overwhelming doubts and speculations needed PR management.",
  [11348111] = "%s calmed down the netizens through clever PR tactics and resolved the crisis perfectly.",
  [11348112] = "%s bought a marketing account to post a response, but it triggered a new wave of doubts and debates.",
  [11348113] = "%s only deleted the comments but couldn't suppress people's urge for discussion.",
  [11348114] = "%s was short-tempered and only provoked more negative comments.",
  [11348119] = "It's better to do nothing and wait for the storm to settle.",
  [11348120] = "A clever response can sometimes be more powerful than a head-on fight.",
  [11348200] = "In the face of the journalists' questions and the fans' enthusiasm, the speaker must remain rational at all times.",
  [11348211] = "%s remained calm and rational and responded sincerely.",
  [11348212] = "%s's response was a little harsh, which offended many media and viewers.",
  [11348213] = "%s panicked under the strong pressures of the reporters and forgot his speech.",
  [11348214] = "%s got carried away by emotions and said many things that shouldn't be said.",
  [11348219] = "Let the boss handle situations like this.",
  [11348220] = "It was a petrifying Q&A session. I was numb by the end of it.",
  [11349000] = "It is inevitable to be nostalgic of the youthful years as one grows older. Come and see if you share the same \"childhood memories\" with these interviewees.",
  [11349001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11349002] = "Childhood might have left us, but those memories would be with us for the rest of our lives.",
  [11349100] = "The interviewees are inevitably a little nervous when they first arrive. We need an outgoing person to get them to open up.",
  [11349111] = "%s was outgoing and quickly bounded with the interviewees.",
  [11349112] = "% was very talkative and went off on a tangent.",
  [11349113] = "%s was not very talkative and couldn't communicate well with the interviewees.",
  [11349114] = "%s came across as unfriendly and made the interviewees even more scared.",
  [11349119] = "It's okay. Just let the interviewees warm up themselves.",
  [11349120] = "The team was ready to warm up the atmosphere!",
  [11349200] = "The microphone suddenly malfunctioned during the interview. Let's get a professional to repair it.",
  [11349211] = "%s had been working in logistics for many years. He figured out the issue right away and solved it quickly.",
  [11349212] = "%s was very forgetful and left the toolbox in the warehouse.",
  [11349213] = "%s stared at it for ages and finally said this was beyond his skills.",
  [11349214] = "%s slapped the microphone hard, which didn't do much.",
  [11349219] = "It's time-consuming, but let's buy a new one.",
  [11349220] = "I wish we put more effort into checking it at the start...",
  [11350000] = "Do you like electronic devices? Many people are obsessed with cold electronic devices. We have hence got many interesting technological inventions.",
  [11350001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11350002] = "Believe in technology and welcome a fascinating future.",
  [11350100] = "Presentations could be boring. Let's try to introduce the interesting aspects of these inventions humorously.",
  [11350111] = "%s presented the \"practical\" tips of these technological inventions with hilarious jokes.",
  [11350112] = "%s dubbed it in a funny way, but the content wasn't interesting.",
  [11350113] = "%s only read the script seriously without any sense of humor.",
  [11350114] = "%s murmured and couldn't even present normally.",
  [11350119] = "We couldn't find anyone, so we could only have subtitles.",
  [11350120] = "Some technological inventions are actually \"toxic\".",
  [11350200] = "We interviewed random people on the street about their views on these technological inventions.",
  [11350211] = "%s has a lot of interviewing experience. People were very happy to cooperate.",
  [11350212] = "%s was too serious in the interviews and made the interviewee nervous.",
  [11350213] = "%s was an introvert and embarrassed to interview people.",
