  [11350219] = "No one was willing to be interviewed, we could only interview our own staff.",
  [11350220] = "I never thought there would be so many \"tech enthusiasts\".",
  [11351000] = "The filming of the film \"Time Box\" is approaching, which tells the story of an office worker who got trapped in one day.",
  [11351001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11351002] = "If I'm trapped in a day, I hope it will be the day before the deadline...",
  [11351100] = "The character was witty and daring. We need a peculiar person to play the role.",
  [11351111] = "%s was quirky and perfect for this role.",
  [11351112] = "%s was a quirky dancer but knew nothing about acting.",
  [11351113] = "%s was more suitable for a serious role and had no talent for a quirky one.",
  [11351114] = "%s always dreamed of being an actor but had poor acting and couldn't remember his lines.",
  [11351119] = "The investor threatened to withdraw the funds if we didn't use the actor they wanted, so we had to give in.",
  [11351120] = "According to statistics, a disputable role was more loved by the audience.",
  [11351200] = "The crew's stylist suddenly took a day off. We need a professional to save the day.",
  [11351211] = "%s had strong business skills. His design was stylish and in line with the character.",
  [11351212] = "%s's design was good-looking but mediocre.",
  [11351213] = "%s created a look for the actors to his liking, making them all look identical.",
  [11351214] = "%s's design could only be described in one word: eyesore.",
  [11351219] = "Styling is just a small matter. Just let the actors dress up themselves.",
  [11351220] = "The actor can be good-looking, but the stylist's sense of beauty needs to be decent too.",
  [11351300] = "You invited Lucien to watch the premiere of this movie together. You asked him what he would bring if he had a time machine. He answered...",
  [11351301] = "Camera",
  [11351302] = "Sunscreen",
  [11351303] = "Lunchbox",
  [11351311] = "To record the unknown at any time.",
  [11351312] = "Lucien smiled and didn't say anything.",
  [11351313] = "Lucien smiled and didn't say anything.",
  [11352000] = "Today, the death of an old movie star stirred up a heated discussion online. People grieved and sparked the topic of \"time reset theory\"—Many claimed they had read similar articles. Has the group's memory been misplaced? Or has time been reset?",
  [11352001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11352002] = "If time had been reset, what kind of life did I once live before the reset?",
  [11352100] = "It's difficult to evaluate different opinions. We hired an expert to analyze several possibilities for such an event to occur.",
  [11352111] = "%s was well-reasoned and very persuasive.",
  [11352112] = "%s made rational speculations and judgments but was very tedious.",
  [11352113] = "%s made bold, groundless guesses. Many people thought he was making things up.",
  [11352114] = "%s dared to make up anything to draw attention and turned things into horror stories.",
  [11352119] = "It's safer to pick a few mainstream views to discuss.",
  [11352120] = "If time was just an axis in a coordinate, who could move the points on it easily?",
  [11352200] = "We need a friendly person to conduct a street interview to find out the public's opinion.",
  [11352211] = "%s was friendly, and the passersby found him very likable.",
  [11352212] = "%s was friendly but timid, not bold enough to talk to strangers.",
  [11352213] = "%s looked fierce and scared passersby away.",
  [11352214] = "%s was distracted and ran off to play during the interview.",
  [11352219] = "Since the street interview didn't get anywhere, let's just find out what people think online.",
  [11352220] = "It turns out so many people support the \"time reset theory\"...",
  [11353000] = "Spring has arrived and is welcomed by people in different ways. We collected many stories about \"spring\" on the streets.",
  [11353001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11353002] = "The warm spring breeze may be late, but the spring in our hearts has already arrived.",
  [11353100] = "After the discussion has started, the crew received an overwhelming number of submissions. It will take some perseverance to process them all.",
  [11353111] = "%s had the endurance and patience to handle all these submissions in a short time.",
  [11353112] = "%s worked diligently, but he was not efficient enough to finish it in time.",
  [11353113] = "%s was not patient and skipped many excellent submissions.",
  [11353114] = "After staring at the pile of submissions for a while, %s fell asleep.",
  [11353119] = "No one is willing to do the hard work, so I have no choice but to do it myself.",
  [11353120] = "The colorful spring is only longed for after a long winter.",
  [11353200] = "During an outdoor shoot, a woman's wallet got stolen. Get a fast runner to retrieve it for her!",
  [11353211] = "%s was a sportsman and quickly retrieved the wallet for its owner.",
  [11353212] = "%s was a fast-runner but had no sense of direction and soon got lost.",
  [11353213] = "%s didn't like to exercise and ran out of breath very quickly.",
  [11353214] = "%s was too timid to stand up for justice.",
  [11353219] = "It's better to stay away from trouble.",
  [11353220] = "To help others is to help yourself.",
  [11353300] = "You planned a spring trip with Lucien. He reminded you to bring...",
  [11353301] = "VR Gear",
  [11353302] = "Hairstyling Card",
  [11353303] = "Hygiene Mask",
  [11353311] = "Lucien smiled and didn't say anything.",
  [11353312] = "Lucien smiled and didn't say anything.",
  [11353313] = "Be sure to take precautions.",
  [11354000] = "Recently, a blogger received a fan submission claiming a bizarre paranormal event near his home in the middle of the night. We decided to investigate the scene and uncover the truth.",
  [11354001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11354002] = "It turned out to be a big fat cat who blatantly stole away the bacon in front of the person's home.",
  [11354100] = "At the start of our investigation, the crew had started telling paranormal stories, making many people panic. We have to find someone rational to calm the crew down.",
  [11354111] = "%s is rational and persuasive, calming the crew down in no time.",
  [11354112] = "%s didn't believe in ghosts and tried to educate the crowd on a scientifically correct worldview, but no one listened.",
  [11354113] = "%s usually didn't even dare to watch horror movies and was trembling with fear.",
  [11354114] = "%s sang, \"Ghosts I fear, but Ghosts hurt me not\". The spooky singing had led to many mental breakdowns in the crew.",
  [11354119] = "It might be better for the show if we just let the spooky atmosphere spread.",
  [11354120] = "The atmosphere is spot on, which made the not-so-scary story incredibly horrifying...",
  [11354200] = "Just when everyone started to be more relaxed after a long wait, a strange sound rang out in the bush nearby. Find someone brave to check it out!",
  [11354211] = "%s is bold and immediately approached the bush carefully with the camera.",
  [11354212] = "%s is a bold but goofy. When he wanted to check it out, he ran too fast and fell flat on his face.",
  [11354213] = "%s cheered for himself while his feet were glued to the ground.",
  [11354214] = "%s shouted \"Ahhhhhh!\" and ran away in a flash.",
  [11354219] = "The crew stared at each other. No one dared to volunteer.",
  [11354220] = "When the crew was scared to death, a loud \"meow\" sounded in the bush.",
  [11355000] = "It's the nostalgic graduation season again. Remember the scratch papers at school? We posted on social media to collect stories about those papers.",
  [11355001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11355002] = "Ordinary things may make you smile years later as parts of memory.",
  [11355100] = "After the submission deadline, we will select some content to be shared by professional hosts on the show.",
  [11355111] = "%s has a beautiful and heartfelt voice, bringing fresh and relatable campus stories alive.",
  [11355112] = "%s is known for being a quick speaker. The audience's focus was all on his speed and tone and ignored the content.",
  [11355113] = "%s voice was monotone and unemotional, putting the audience to sleep.",
  [11355114] = "%s stammered and didn't come across as a professional host, making it hard to listen.",
  [11355119] = "Electronic voice playback was all we could use. It felt like it was missing something.",
  [11355120] = "The beautiful voice made the story extra moving.",
  [11355200] = "We even chose someone to share their story on the spot. The more real the story was, the more the audience could relate.",
  [11355211] = "%s told a heartfelt story about confessing love on scratch paper, which was simple but moving.",
  [11355212] = "%s story was too simple and straightforward, but it didn't seem engaging enough.",
  [11355213] = "%s's story was over-dramatic and complicated relationships. It was obvious that it was made up.",
  [11355214] = "%s's story was illogical and confusing. No one understood the story.",
  [11355219] = "None of the scripts fit the criteria. Maybe it's best to consider canceling this session.",
  [11355220] = "What about you? Do you remember the name you wrote countless times on the scratch papers?",
  [11356000] = "Sometimes being overly enthusiastic can be stressful to others. We started a post on this topic.",
  [11356001] = "I'm gradually running out of new concepts. When my brain is getting rusted, someone's figure emerges in my head...",
  [11356002] = "A sense of appropriateness is important when interacting with people, and mutual respect is the cornerstone.",
  [11356100] = "We have invited experts to explain from the psychological perspective why people need distance from each other.",
  [11356111] = "%s is full of knowledge. The audience benefited from explanations from various perspectives.",
  [11356112] = "%s is knowledgeable but very stubborn and even argued with a guest who held a different perspective.",
  [11356113] = "Some things %s said were just unproven rumors and not very convincing.",
  [11356114] = "%s has no relevant knowledge and got kicked out of the stage by the audience as soon as he spoke.",
  [11356119] = "We couldn't find any expert. Let's do it ourselves and hope for the best.",
  [11356120] = "The loss of appropriateness and distance can sometimes discourage the desire to communicate.",
  [11356200] = "True knowledge comes from practice. We invited guests to work with experts to see the psychological changes at different distances. It is said that sensitive and attentive people notice the difference more.",
  [11356211] = "%s is very attentive. He described the changes in his feelings, which verified the expert's statement.",
  [11356212] = "%s is sensitive but introverted, not expressing his feelings precisely enough.",
  [11356213] = "%s is often too friendly and would be very enthusiastic even with strangers.",
  [11356214] = "%s rushed up and gave the expert a massive hug, which scared the expert.",
  [11356219] = "Feelings are difficult to describe and impossible to verify, so it's impossible to empathize.",
  [11356220] = "Perhaps everyone has a different comfortable social distance.",
  [11357000] = "Hide-and-seek is a nostalgic memory for many people, but it's also a \"psychological trauma\" for some. We started a post on social media about the joys and sorrows of hide-and-seek.",
  [11357001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11357002] = "Listening to these horrible experiences online has ruined this childhood game for me...",
  [11357100] = "It takes some perseverance to screen through the large number of submissions.",
  [11357111] = "%s spent a lot of time reading and filtering the submissions one by one and eventually selected some fantastic content.",
  [11357112] = "%s doesn't have great work efficiency. After a few days and nights of hard work, he finally got ill and hospitalized.",
  [11357113] = "%s started off fairly seriously, but then started to lose patience and missed a lot of great submissions.",
  [11357114] = "%s didn't take work seriously and didn't select good quality content.",
  [11357119] = "No one was willing to take on such big workload. Just let the team randomly pick submissions with similar word count.",
  [11357120] = "Some funny hide-and-seek experiences made me laughed so much at night.",
  [11357200] = "To make the topic more influential, we hired a well-known celebrity to share their thrilling experience of hide-and-seek as a child.",
  [11357211] = "%s has a large fan base and his story was fascinating, drawing a lot of attention and making it go viral.",
  [11357212] = "%s just had a scandal, which affected the comments and discussions. No one paid attention to our topic.",
  [11357213] = "%s didn't get much attention and only had on a small group of fans who brought a tiny amount of traffic.",
  [11357214] = "%s is a Z-list celebrity who only brought trouble and refused to cooperate.",
  [11357219] = "The cooperation with the celebrity didn't get anywhere. The post never got any attention.",
  [11357220] = "A hide-and-seek player who can't tell a story isn't a good celebrity.",
  [11357300] = "You and Lucien are playing hide-and-seek with the children in the orphanage. What item will Lucien prepare as a \"ghost\"?",
  [11357301] = "Sleep Mask",
  [11357302] = "Notebook",
  [11357303] = "Binoculars",
  [11357311] = "Ready or not, here I come.",
  [11357312] = "Lucien shook his head gently and explained the rules to you once more.",
  [11357313] = "Lucien shook his head gently and explained the rules to you once more.",
  [11358000] = "There was a sudden major power cut throughout the city, and we decided to follow up the story immediately to calm down the public.",
  [11358001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11358002] = "This is the first-hand information from this visit. We will continue to follow up this incident.",
  [11358100] = "To find out more about the situation, we came to the Loveland City Power Station. Let's send a friendly-looking person to find out more first.",
  [11358111] = "%s is friendly, communicated well with the power station staff, and learned a lot.",
  [11358112] = "%s looks friendly but not good with words, and got driven away after failing to get his point across.",
  [11358113] = "%s comes across as scary. The staff mistook him as a thug and kicked him out.",
  [11358114] = "%s looks fierce and has a loud voice, which scared everyone away.",
  [11358119] = "The staff at the power station seems to be very grumpy. Let's just not disturb them.",
  [11358120] = "Only transparent information can offset the panic caused by uncertainties.",
  [11358200] = "During the power cut in the city, the battery on the cameras is about to run out. What will you do?",
  [11358211] = "%s suddenly remembered there was a spare camera with sufficient battery and took us to fetch it. We managed to complete the shoot.",
  [11358212] = "%s thought of continuing to shoot with the phone, but the product was still not as good.",
  [11358213] = "%s didn't think of any useful ideas. The second half of the shoot could only be presented in the form of text.",
  [11358214] = "%s violent tapped on the dead camera and broke it.",
  [11358219] = "What a shame. We had no choice but to end the interview early.",
  [11358220] = "This was only a minor setback for us compared to the inconvenience the power cut has caused to the city.",
  [11359000] = "Today's modeling technology has made it possible to create a virtual city. We interviewed several professionals to present the stories behind this job.",
  [11359001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11359002] = "It's ultimately these living, breathing people who create these amazing virtual worlds. Their voices deserve to be heard.",
  [11359100] = "Find an enthusiastic and cheerful person to get acquainted with the few experts before the interview starts, which will help the interview go much smoother.",
  [11359111] = "%s is very good at communicating with people. His enthusiastic influence has made the experts feel more at ease.",
  [11359112] = "%s was too friendly and talkative, which made people a little uneasy.",
  [11359113] = "%s comes across as very cold and never got enthusiastic enough.",
  [11359114] = "%s blushes when talking to people. It took some mental preparation before he could even go up and say hello to the experts.",
  [11359119] = "I heard that many experts don't have a good temperament. Let's not do any additional interaction.",
  [11359120] = "People full of enthusiasm are like suns in the crowd.",
  [11359200] = "We will present the model city at the end of the show, which will need some appropriate background music.",
  [11359211] = "%s's music was ephic, which worked well with the visual effects.",
  [11359212] = "%s selection of music was average. No major mistakes, but not amazing.",
  [11359213] = "%s choice of music didn't fit the theme or the model.",
  [11359214] = "%s selected an exotic, Latin song, instantly turning the magnificent model into a resort advertisement.",
  [11359219] = "It's too troublesome to choose the music. Let's just use the background music from similar clips.",
  [11359220] = "Virtual worlds are too realistic today. How do to distinguish between reality and virtual worlds?",
  [11360000] = "Many heart-warming moments happened in the mist. The kind children, the helpful strangers, the dedicated workers... These moments are worth being recorded.",
  [11360001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11360002] = "The lingering mist might temporarily veil people's eyes, but it can't stop the love and kindness of the world...",
  [11360100] = "Shooting in such extreme weather in the mist is a test of the skills of the photographer.",
  [11360111] = "%s has traveled with the team to all corners of the earth and is familiar with shooting in extreme weather.",
  [11360112] = "%s is inexperienced in dealing with foggy shooting conditions, so the results were average.",
  [11360113] = "%s ignored the impact of the mist on the shooting and didn't capture a thing in the footage.",
  [11360114] = "%s has no experience in photography and has no idea what to do in this foggy weather.",
  [11360119] = "The foggy weather had too much of an impact on the shoot, making it impossible to shoot smoothly.",
  [11360120] = "Since so many people still trudging in the fog, there is no reason for us to be held back by the difficulties.",
  [11360200] = "During the shoot, a low animal roar suddenly sounded in the mist...",
  [11360211] = "%s clapped his hands toward the mist, then a white puppy ran out of the mist cheerfully wagging its tail.",
  [11360212] = "%s tried to lure the animal out with food but got lost on the way to the convenience store.",
  [11360213] = "%s isn't good with animals and failed to get the animal's guard down.",
  [11360214] = "%s got bitten by a dog when he was a child and was petrified by the low growl in the fog.",
  [11360219] = "We can't even take care of ourselves, let alone the animals. Let's shoo it and continue shooting.",
  [11360220] = "It turned out to be a lost puppy. With the help of the crew, it has successfully returned home.",
  [11360300] = "You sneaked out with Kiro for a late-night snack, but the weather is very foggy. What will you bring?",
  [11360301] = "Headphone",
  [11360302] = "Flashlight",
  [11360303] = "A Hat",
  [11360311] = "Kiro looked at you in confusion but still took your bag full of stuff.",
  [11360312] = "Make sure you don't let go, Miss Chips!",
  [11360313] = "Kiro looked at you in confusion but still took your bag full of stuff.",
  [11361000] = "There is a language in life that plays an important role in communication but is often overlooked—body language. We filmed a science show to introduce the \"grammar\" of body language.",
  [11361001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11361002] = "It was another day of great learning. I have to start observing the \"subtext\" conveyed by people's bodies.",
  [11361100] = "What do the subconscious body languages mean? We've invited some psychologists to decode for you.",
  [11361111] = "%s explained from a psychological perspective with a live presentation, which was fascinating to listen to.",
  [11361112] = "%s brought a psychology textbook to give a live lecture, sending the audience to sleep.",
  [11361113] = "%s knows little about psychology. The audience didn't agree with the several examples he shared.",
  [11361114] = "%s knows nothing about psychology and completely made it up.",
  [11361119] = "We didn't manage to invite experts and could only find someone who knew a little about the subject.",
  [11361120] = "Body language conveys more information than one might think.",
  [11361200] = "During the interaction session, someone excited from the audience wanted to do a difficult action and ended up dislocating his shoulder. Hurry up and find someone to deal with the emergency.",
  [11361211] = "%s was very calm in the face of the sudden situation, pressed the dislocated arm, and magically put it in place.",
  [11361212] = "%s knows a little about medicine but forgot what to do because of nervousness.",
  [11361213] = "%s acted confidently but only made the injured in more pain.",
  [11361214] = "After a decent examination, %s politely said that he didn't know how to treat it.",
  [11361219] = "The injured was screaming, the staff was in a panic, and the audience was watching the drama. It was just full of chaos.",
  [11361220] = "This proved that body language that is too intense and carefree is likely to have adverse effects.",
  [11361300] = "You're going to the gym with Kiro. What protective gear should you bring for him to prevent injuries?",
  [11361301] = "Body Warmer",
  [11361302] = "Portable Mirror",
  [11361303] = "Sports Armguard",
  [11361311] = "Kiro looked at you in confusion but still took your bag full of stuff.",
  [11361312] = "Kiro looked at you in confusion but still took your bag full of stuff.",
  [11361313] = "You even thought of this! You're so thoughtful, Miss Chips!",
  [11362000] = "While society is advancing at a rapid pace, some corners of the world had been left behind in time. We decided to present these forgotten corners with aerial photography.",
  [11362001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11362002] = "At the fork in the road between the old and the new world, time seems to have frozen in this moment...",
  [11362100] = "We need someone attentive and with a unique perspective to find those forgotten corners.",
  [11362111] = "%s was attentive and provided us with many locations that fit the topic.",
  [11362112] = "%s was thoughtful but overly self-centered. All the locations he looked for were related to his memories, which other couldn't relate to.",
  [11362113] = "%s is inattentive and rarely notices the hidden corners of the city.",
  [11362114] = "%s is insensitive to his surroundings and has no sense of direction, who wasn't of any help at all.",
  [11362119] = "With all the effort, we still didn't manage to find anywhere that fit the requirements.",
  [11362120] = "It's probably not a forgotten corner if it can be remembered so easily.",
  [11362200] = "The use of aerial photography technology will require a thorough preparation to avoid breakdowns during the shoot.",
  [11362211] = "%s has been doing drone maintenance for many years. With him here, the whole crew felt more at ease.",
  [11362212] = "%s's was impeccable on a technical level, but he was inexperienced in working with the crew and had a lot of problems with communication.",
  [11362213] = "%s wasn't skillful enough. All sorts of problems happened during the shoot.",
  [11362214] = "%s slacked at work and showed no professionalism, forcing the filming to stop several times.",
  [11362219] = "We have no choice but to hire a professional team, but the budget would have to be changed again.",
  [11362220] = "The results of the aerial photography made me feel that all the efforts were worthwhile.",
  [11363000] = "Kiro was invited to do a promotional speech for a charity project, and we will be responsible for the live recording.",
  [11363001] = "Before the live stream started, the channel was already crowded with viewers waiting for the broadcast to begin. What a super popular idol Kiro is.",
  [11363002] = "Hopefully, this live stream can encourage more people to join the charity work to help those in need.",
  [11363100] = "Since this live stream is a charity project, the celebrity is required to dress in a decent and smart outfit.",
  [11363111] = "The outfit %s prepared was simple yet high-class, in which Kiro looked fantastic.",
  [11363112] = "%s prepared a flamboyant stage outfit, making even Kiro frown.",
  [11363113] = "The suit %s prepared was too old-fashioned and dated.",
  [11363114] = "%s was too careless and mistakenly brought his vacation beach pants and flip-flops to the scene.",
  [11363119] = "Kiro's outfit in the live stream was picked on in some malicious comments online that day.",
  [11363120] = "But... Kiro would look handsome even in a bin bag!",
  [11363200] = "Halfway through the live stream, a bunch of malicious live comments suddenly appeared on the channel to falsely accuse Kiro of fake rumors to slander him in front of millions of viewers.",
  [11363211] = "%s managed the channel in a timely and orderly manner to delete the malicious comments, block the users involved, and quickly restored peace to the channel.",
  [11363212] = "%s lost his cool in the face of a large number of malicious comments and mistakenly blocked innocent viewers, which upset the audience.",
  [11363213] = "%s failed to organize and manage the malicious comments in time, which flooded in wave after wave.",
  [11363214] = "%s was so engrossed in Kiro's handsome face that he didn't even notice what was happening on the live stream channel.",
  [11363219] = "A large number of haters and fans attacked each other with verbal abuse. The live stream channel was a mess.",
  [11363220] = "It turns out that hating someone can be even crazier than loving someone.",
  [11364000] = "There are always many \"lies\" in the workplace we all understand but never speak of. We started an interactive post on social media to collect the lies people have heard from their bosses.",
  [11364001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11364002] = "Seeing everyone so enthusiastically ranting about their bosses, I can't help but look closer to the avatars to see if my employees were in there...",
  [11364100] = "To draw attention to the post, we invited a celebrity who was known for his sarcasm.",
  [11364111] = "%s's rant was witty and to the point, which the audience found funny and could relate to.",
  [11364112] = "%s is known for his sarcasm but has no experience in the workplace. The content wasn't spot on enough.",
  [11364113] = "%s isn't sharp enough and turned the rant about the workplace into a complaint forum.",
  [11364114] = "%s is wild and carefree, who quickly went off-topic and didn't match the style and theme.",
  [11364119] = "Found a few random celebrities, but the effect wasn't very satisfactory.",
  [11364120] = "One has to have gone through it themselves to understand the joys and sorrows of city workers.",
  [11364200] = "After the submission deadline, we selected a series of interesting contents to be edited into short videos, hoping to get a good number of views.",
  [11364211] = "%s's edited clips were light-hearted and funny, which soon went viral.",
  [11364212] = "%s's clips included too much, which made them seem tedious and no longer seem light-hearted.",
  [11364213] = "%s simply put the content together. No editing skills whatsoever, and the clips were dull and tedious.",
  [11364214] = "%s's edited video is not only painful to watch but also hard to understand.",
  [11364219] = "Let's just pick random music to go with the content and get it over with.",
  [11364220] = "Hilarious video with funny music. Playing on repeat is recommended.",
  [11365000] = "Recently, someone fell into the water next to a bridge under repair, who was fortunately rescued by a road worker taking a break nearby. We will report the news at the scene.",
  [11365001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11365002] = "Hopefully, the good people will receive the thanks and rewards they deserve.",
  [11365100] = "When we arrived, the scene was already crowded with onlookers and needed to be cleared to ensure smooth filming and safety.",
  [11365111] = "%s evacuated the crowd with ease and quickly kept the scene in order.",
  [11365112] = "%s got security guards to drive away the crowd, which upset the people and caused arguments.",
  [11365113] = "%s tried to persuade the crowd to step back, but people didn't pay any attention to him.",
  [11365114] = "%s tried to evacuate the crowd by himself and almost got pushed into the river.",
  [11365119] = "We set up the camera and waited for the crowd to leave on their own, which wasn't until dark.",
  [11365120] = "The crowd's nosiness isn't to be underestimated...",
  [11365200] = "After getting consent, we had a special interview with the kind road worker.",
  [11365211] = "%s interview style is friendly and natural. Under his guidance, the nervous worker told the whole story of his rescue.",
  [11365212] = "%s's interview style was very blunt, making the worker slightly overwhelmed by his intensive questions.",
  [11365213] = "%s asked a few irrelevant questions and then didn't know what to say. The interview then came to a standstill.",
  [11365214] = "%s kept talking over the worker to hide his nervousness, turning the interview into his stand-up comedy show.",
  [11365219] = "The interview ended after a few hurried questions, which felt a bit rushed.",
  [11365220] = "Deciding to save when seeing someone in danger doesn't come naturally to everyone.",
  [11365300] = "You and Gavin are going for a walk by the river on a very sunny day. What should you bring?",
  [11365301] = "Sunglasses",
  [11365302] = "Ice cream",
  [11365303] = "Cosmetic Bag",
  [11365311] = "Walk behind me if it's too bright.",
  [11365312] = "Gavin gave a helpless smile and placed his baseball cap on your head.",
  [11365313] = "Gavin gave a helpless smile and placed his baseball cap on your head.",
  [11366000] = "Recently, a test claiming to train reverse thinking has become popular on the internet. We invited a psychological expert and people who have done the test to report on this.",
  [11366001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11366002] = "Thinking outside the box may solve many problems.",
  [11366100] = "The psychologist wants a brainy assistant with whom he could easily interact on the show.",
  [11366111] = "%s might be young, but he already has many experiences on the show and is smart and witty enough to work with the expert.",
  [11366112] = "%s seems smart but has never been on the show before and got very nervous in front of the camera.",
  [11366113] = "%s is very slow and won't be able to work well with the expert.",
  [11366114] = "%s is very clumsy and often breaks things.",
  [11366119] = "I couldn't find a good assistant so had no choice but to recommend myself.",
  [11366120] = "Being an assistant doesn't seem to be an easy job...",
  [11366200] = "The filming is about to start. You suddenly remembered some important files were left upstairs in the office. Send someone to get it!",
  [11366211] = "%s is a swift runner and got the file in time without causing any delay.",
  [11366212] = "%s ran a little too fast and accidentally fell at the stairway and was taken to the hospital.",
  [11366213] = "%s isn't very fit and the show had to be delayed by the time he brought the file over.",
  [11366214] = "%s got lost and ran to the wrong floor, making the whole staff wait for a long time.",
  [11366219] = "I had to go upstairs to find it myself, it's a little slower but at least I know what I'm doing...",
  [11366220] = "Emergencies really are a test of one's mind...",
  [11367000] = "The mist has finally lifted after many days. The latest report has been released by the Loveland City Observatory and the air-quality control agency. The latest information will be announced on our official website.",
  [11367001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11367002] = "The sun is finally out. Hopefully, it will also brighten up the mood of the people of Loveland City.",
  [11367100] = "To ensure the authority and authenticity of the test report, we have invited the most authoritative expert in the industry to interpret it.",
  [11367111] = "%s is one of the most prestigious professors in the meteorological field and deserves to take on this job.",
  [11367112] = "%s is a well-known expert and scholar but has recently been ill.",
  [11367113] = "%s isn't very well-known in the field, so his words didn't carry much credibility.",
  [11367114] = "%s has become notorious for calling himself an expert and scamming on the internet.",
  [11367119] = "We didn't manage to invite any authoritative experts, so let's just read out the report ourselves.",
  [11367120] = "As an official media, the information we publish is credible.",
  [11367200] = "The real-time announcement on the official website needs to be formal and positive.",
  [11367211] = "%s's copywriting is solid and motivating, making the readers feel encouraged and positive afterward.",
  [11367212] = "%s's language was too enthusiastic and incoherent, making the copy not formal enough.",
  [11367213] = "%s's copy is more like a notice that came across stiff and swallow.",
  [11367214] = "%s's text was full of spelling and grammar mistakes and simply couldn't be used.",
  [11367219] = "The unpolished text was published and received negative feedback from the readers.",
  [11367220] = "The gloom is over, and our tomorrow will be better.",
  [11368000] = "The Laws and Regulations Channel has recently launched a science program with the Special Task Force, and we will be responsible for the publicity.",
  [11368001] = "This is going to be hard work, but we'll rise to the challenge.",
  [11368002] = "Hopefully, this will help people to know more about the law and make our home a better place.",
  [11368100] = "The first step of our plan is to publish the trailer on major social media platforms, of which the publicity text is key.",
  [11368111] = "%s's copy is concise and witty, bringing a lot of attention to the show.",
  [11368112] = "%s copywriting is so attention-seeking that it has been mocked by the netizens.",
  [11368113] = "%s's copy is too average and forgettable.",
  [11368114] = "%s is very pleased with his own copy, which no one but himself could understand.",
  [11368119] = "The trailer was published without any publicity text and failed to draw any attention.",
  [11368120] = "Big News! The collaboration between the Laws and Regulations Channel and the Special Task Force has been successful! Don't miss out!!!",
  [11368200] = "We plan to conduct a street interview to understand the public's acceptance of shows about laws.",
  [11368211] = "%s is friendly and eloquent. The interviewed passersby were willing to cooperate.",
  [11368212] = "%s was slightly pushy when asking questions, which made the interviewees feel overwhelmed.",
  [11368213] = "%s is introverted, awkward with strangers, and unable to ask a single question.",
  [11368214] = "%s looks stocky and fierce. People were avoiding him on the street.",
  [11368219] = "The street interview didn't go well, and we failed to get the information we wanted.",
  [11368220] = "I didn't realize that legal shows are popular among young people nowadays.",
  [11369000] = "The Game of Hunters has ended. The official announcement has been released, and we need to compile news on this topic.",
  [11369001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11369002] = "May the devil who thinks he can manipulate people be brought to justice soon, to console the deceased and their families.",
  [11369100] = "Compiling bits and pieces of news together is a task that requires perseverance.",
  [11369111] = "%s has always been incredibly resilient at work and has completed the compilation with high efficiency.",
  [11369112] = "%s is patient but inefficient and delayed the whole project.",
  [11369113] = "%s often gets distracted at work and fell asleep after organizing information for two hours.",
  [11369114] = "%s got really frustrated as soon as he saw the information and didn't get anywhere with the task.",
  [11369119] = "Let's just organize the materials in chronological order and forget about it. No point wasting time and effort here.",
  [11369120] = "Those vivid words have once again made people understand how cruel the \"game\" was.",
  [11369200] = "When interviewing the victims' families, one needs to be tough enough to stand the emotional drains and pain.",
  [11369211] = "%s led us through this task with toughness and determination.",
  [11369212] = "%s looked unmoved when faced with the traumatized family, which was criticized as cold-blooded by netizens.",
  [11369213] = "%s failed to keep calm the whole time and had to stop the interview after several emotional breakdowns.",
  [11369214] = "%s is sensitive and fragile, and refused it straight away.",
  [11369219] = "After a few interviews, everyone felt a weight on their heart.",
  [11369220] = "The end of a tragic incident doesn't mean its damage stops here.",
  [11370000] = "Recently, telecom fraud has become prevalent. A common tactic is to steal the victim's contact information and pretend to be someone they know. We decided to make a short film to remind people of information security.",
  [11370001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11370002] = "The shoot is finally over. Hopefully, it will warn people to be more vigilant and stay away from telecom fraud.",
  [11370100] = "We plan to shoot a short commercial to promote fraud prevention, which will need a good director.",
  [11370111] = "%s is a famous short film director, whose style is witty and profound.",
  [11370112] = "%s's work is mainly slow-paced and artsy, which doesn't quite fit this project.",
  [11370113] = "%s is a recent graduate with no fame and experience, but it saved us a lot of money.",
  [11370114] = "%s is troublesome and arrogant but incompetent.",
  [11370119] = "Appointed a director recommended by others, which made the shoot \"hellishly\" difficult.",
  [11370120] = "The unreliability of the director is basically a fraud on the audience.",
  [11370200] = "In the short film, phone call fraud victims use humorous ways to trick the telecom frauds, which requires witty and humorous lines.",
  [11370211] = "The funny lines designed by %s are hilarious and sarcastic.",
  [11370212] = "%s lines are funny but not good enough to trick the frauds.",
  [11370213] = "%s tried to incorporate some funny movie lines and online jokes, which ended up sounding very awkward.",
  [11370214] = "The lines written by %s were boring and illogical, which was very embarrassing to watch.",
  [11370219] = "We copied lines found online, which were quickly exposed by the audience.",
  [11370220] = "The official shooting will be full of joy.",
  [11370300] = "Victor received a phone call while driving. Seeing that he doesn't have a spare hand, what will you use to help him?",
  [11370301] = "USB Flash Drive",
  [11370302] = "Digital Tablet",
  [11370303] = "Bluetooth Headphone",
  [11370311] = "Victor raised an eyebrow and took what was needed instead.",
  [11370312] = "Victor raised an eyebrow and took what was needed instead.",
  [11370313] = "Just put on the headphone. No need to hold your arm up all the time.",
  [11371000] = "Prison plays an important role in the process of establishing the legal system. We have compiled historical stories of famous prisons around the world and used them as a starting point to promote law.",
  [11371001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11371002] = "As the legal system has been continuously improved, the humanitarianism is more evident in the \"merciless\" law.",
  [11371100] = "The descriptions of the prison vary in various texts, so we have invited a historian to uncover the truth as much as possible.",
  [11371111] = "%s has deep knowledge of the history of countries around the world, especially in terms of institutions, which helped a lot in the making of the short film.",
  [11371112] = "%s knows about the local history but not much about other countries.",
  [11371113] = "%s have only read a few history books and have a very superficial understanding of the various stages of the legal system.",
  [11371114] = "%s is obsessed with historical fictions and insisted that those fictions were real history.",
  [11371119] = "We don't have any experts to give us professional views and couldn't discern whether the several historical hypotheses were true.",
  [11371120] = "The Rashomon effects in the official and unofficial history are sometimes more confusing than crime fiction.",
  [11371200] = "The shooting is about to start. It needs to be set up according to the historical records to replicate the prison set as much as possible.",
  [11371211] = "%s is responsible for building the set according to historical records and doing his best to replicate the details, making one feels like they were in a real prison.",
  [11371212] = "The set %s built looks real, but there are many safety hazards that caused many accidents during the shoot.",
  [11371213] = "%s omitted many decorative details and built a set that didn't look real.",
  [11371214] = "%s built the set based on his imagination and preferences, which made the set very different to the one described in the historical records.",
  [11371219] = "It should be fine if we find some period drama and copy their prison set.",
  [11371220] = "Trying to restore every detail is the insistence of each \"OCD\" crew.",
  [11372000] = "What can be done in one second? We will make a short film on \"The Significance of One Second\" to encourage people to make the most of their time.",
  [11372001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11372002] = "When I think of wasting so many seconds when I space out, I feel a deep regret...",
  [11372100] = "How to stress the significance of one second? What kind of story can happen in one second? All this will depend on the clever ideas from the scripter.",
  [11372111] = "%s is a talented scripter in the industry who writes impressive stories.",
  [11372112] = "%s is competent but has a bad temper, and often argues with the crew or actors. No one wants to go near him.",
  [11372113] = "%s's recent films have received bad criticism. People say he has passed his peak.",
  [11372114] = "%s isn't a creative writer, so it makes absolutely no sense to ask him to write the script.",
  [11372119] = "We let the director improvise without a script, but the director said he couldn't do it.",
  [11372120] = "A good script will make the audience's heart beat with every suspense and twist in the plot.",
  [11372200] = "The quality of the short film is okay, but it didn't get many views for some reason. Perhaps it is time to put more effort into publicity and marketing.",
  [11372211] = "%s is very good at marketing and the number of views skyrocketed with his help.",
  [11372212] = "%s bought lots of searches and posted many posts in a short time, causing a backlash from the audience.",
  [11372213] = "%s wanted to buy views to build momentum for the short film, only to find that the price was much higher than the budget.",
  [11372214] = "%s found some of his relatives to give good reviews on the film, which didn't make much impact.",
  [11372219] = "Without good marketing tactics, the short film failed to draw any attention.",
  [11372220] = "Even if the most excellent work needs to be \"seen\" before being approved.",
  [11372300] = "Victor is going to teach you how to bake. What is the best item to carry with you to keep an eye on the time?",
  [11372301] = "Apron",
  [11372302] = "Cat Food",
  [11372303] = "Watch",
  [11372311] = "Victor raised an eyebrow and took what was needed instead.",
  [11372312] = "Victor raised an eyebrow and took what was needed instead.",
  [11372313] = "Looks like you're determined to do it this time.",
  [11373000] = "LFG has recently updated its brand image promotion plan, and we will cooperate with LFG's PR department to shoot an image promotion film.",
  [11373001] = "We took the stressful publicity work and always feel like there is a pair of eyes watching...",
  [11373002] = "I've been working very hard shooting the promotional video. It's good that it's finally coming to an end.",
  [11373100] = "Promotional videos are all very similar. This time, our company worked together to come up with an innovative shooting plan.",
  [11373111] = "%s proposed a solution that promotes LFG's brand image innovatively.",
  [11373112] = "%s's shooting plan is very distinct from other promotional videos, but it's not formal enough.",
  [11373113] = "%s submission was average and unimpressive.",
  [11373114] = "%s wants to attract attention with a shooting plan that's simply dreadful.",
  [11373119] = "The shooting plan was pretty much like any other plan. The CEO was very displeased.",
  [11373120] = "Profit is the top motivation for creation. We strongly advice the client to pay more!",
  [11373200] = "We need extras for the promotional video whose images and manners fit LFG's business culture.",
  [11373211] = "%s is experienced in both acting and office work and has no scandals. He is well suited for this shoot.",
  [11373212] = "%s is an online celebrity, whose temperament does not quite match LFG's elite style.",
  [11373213] = "%s is an ordinary office worker who can't even walk naturally in front of the camera.",
  [11373214] = "%s has some scandals recently and will endanger LFG's reputation.",
  [11373219] = "It's better to use LFG's employees than actors.",
  [11373220] = "It's rare for celebrities not to make any major mistakes these days.",
  [11374000] = "After the last Game of Hunters, Loveland City Council responded immediately by launching the live program Post-disaster Relief with the media.",
  [11374001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11374002] = "We saw many touching moments in the live program. Let's wait to watch tomorrow's program.",
  [11374100] = "An excellent photographer was needed to record shocking or moving pictures during the rescue.",
  [11374111] = "%s's stirring pictures with human touch moved all the viewers.",
  [11374112] = "As %s was a photographer working at a wedding studio, the pictures taken by %s looked dreamy and sweet.",
  [11374113] = "%s was not a qualified photographer. The composition of %s's pictures was confusing with no hero or villain or storyline.",
  [11374114] = "%s looked quite the part by holding the camera and pressing the shutter many times, only to find the lens cap wasn't taken off.",
  [11374119] = "The photographer we hired with a huge sum of money ran away and took away the program team's equipment.",
  [11374120] = "Was there a look in the eyes of a person in a photo that you would remember for a long time?",
  [11374200] = "After the disaster, what needed rescue was not only the injured bodies but the broken minds.",
  [11374211] = "%s was professional and friendly, helping victims and their families regain confidence in life.",
  [11374212] = "%s was famous in the industry, but he was abroad. The program team had to wait for him.",
  [11374213] = "%s knew nothing about psychology and only spoke empty words of comfort.",
  [11374214] = "%s was unanimously denounced online for %s's harsh attitude toward the victims during the program.",
  [11374219] = "No relevant expert was found. We'd better first show care for the victims from other aspects.",
  [11374220] = "Mental diseases, like physical ones, should be treated promptly.",
  [11375000] = "Fishermen reported recently an unknown island in the sea near Loveland City. Some suspect it's a mysterious area for scientists to study aliens...",
  [11375001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11375002] = "Please stay tuned for the next program to find out the truth.",
  [11375100] = "We must first investigate the nearby waters to uncover the mystery of the small island.",
  [11375111] = "%s investigated from many angles and soon got a lot of information about the nearby waters.",
  [11375112] = "%s was a private detective. %s was good at investigating family cases, but he knew little about geography.",
  [11375113] = "%s went out to investigate for days but came back with nothing.",
  [11375114] = "%s decided to go out to sea to investigate. He lost his way and asked someone to rescue him.",
  [11375119] = "No direction for the investigation was found. The investigation reached a deadlock.",
  [11375120] = "Only a few clues were obtained after extensive investigations. What made this island so mysterious?",
  [11375200] = "We visited the village of the fishermen who reported the island. The villagers stared at us with vigilance.",
  [11375211] = "%s looked friendly and soon talked enthusiastically with the villagers.",
  [11375212] = "%s had a social phobia and was too scared to say a word after seeing the villagers' stares.",
  [11375213] = "%s looked fierce. The villagers were afraid to approach him.",
  [11375214] = "%s tried to befriend the villagers, but the villagers kept a distance from him.",
  [11375219] = "We showed our identity to interview the villagers, but they refused to be interviewed.",
  [11375220] = "Under our detailed inquiries, a villager revealed a surprising secret...",
  [11376000] = "Last night, fishermen reported having heard explosions from the island and saw it was ablaze. Insiders said the incident was a counterattack by the aliens being tested.",
  [11376001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11376002] = "The truth became known to all. Rumors would be quashed by science.",
  [11376100] = "To understand the situation, we immediately sent reporters to interview witnesses.",
  [11376111] = "The veteran interviewer %s was articulate and elegant and raised many valuable questions.",
  [11376112] = "%s was aggressive during the interview. The fishermen witnessing the scene were too scared to answer his questions.",
  [11376113] = "%s asked many questions, but none of them hit the nail on the head.",
  [11376114] = "%s gushed out speculations to the witnesses, and the interviewees couldn't get a word in edgewise.",
  [11376119] = "Witnesses refused to be interviewed, so we returned without getting any useful information.",
  [11376120] = "The occurrence of bizarre events one after another made us wonder: Was the rumor not totally ungrounded?",
  [11376200] = "We invited experts to explain the facts behind the series of phenomena.",
  [11376211] = "We were enlightened by the explanation of %s, who had been engaged in geographic research for years.",
  [11376212] = "%s knew little about the nearby geography, so there were unreasonable points in his theory.",
  [11376213] = "%s hemmed and hawed for a long time without providing any convincing explanation, so %s was kicked out.",
  [11376214] = "%s exaggerated the gossip and retold it. %s's trick was soon seen through by the audience.",
  [11376219] = "The invited \"expert\" was a charlatan, who ran away after realizing his lies didn't make sense.",
  [11376220] = "I wondered what the audience would think after knowing the completely unexpected truth.",
  [11377000] = "To inspire citizens' vitality, a charity foundation would hold a charity soccer match with a couple of other companies. They promised to donate all the proceeds from the match to the victims of Game of Hunters.",
  [11377001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11377002] = "Everything was ready. Hope the match could be a success.",
  [11377100] = "Security was the top priority for hosting an event.",
  [11377111] = "%s had years of rich security work experience and a meticulous attitude. We were comfortable with him overseeing security.",
  [11377112] = "%s was complained of his rude attitude toward the people.",
  [11377113] = "%s's perfunctory attitude toward work and inadequate security measures were hidden safety risks.",
  [11377114] = "%s accidentally treated the audience as suspects and made a fool of himself.",
  [11377119] = "Inadequate security measures brought chaos to the site.",
  [11377120] = "Maintaining order was a premise and guarantee of safety.",
  [11377200] = "During the warm-up, the soccer suddenly flew out of the field toward a child on the sidelines...",
  [11377211] = "%s stepped forward and protected the child by kicking away the soccer.",
  [11377212] = "%s threw the child to the ground. The child wasn't hit by the ball but got injured.",
  [11377213] = "%s immediately pounced on the ball but failed to catch it.",
  [11377214] = "%s hid under the chair when seeing the ball flying over.",
  [11377219] = "Without the time to react, the child got a lump on the head.",
  [11377220] = "Soccer had no eyes. Parents, please take care of your children.",
  [11377300] = "You and Victor planned to go on adventures during the program. What essential items would you take?",
  [11377301] = "Flashlight",
  [11377302] = "Thermos",
  [11377303] = "Beauty Device",
  [11377311] = "Don't play with fire. Let me take care of it.",
  [11377312] = "Victor frowned, \"It seems you can't tell the difference between adventure and regimen.\"",
  [11377313] = "Victor frowned, \"It seems you can't tell the difference between adventure and regimen.\"",
  [11378000] = "Breaking news. The opening ceremony of the soccer match themed \"Rebuilding Homeland\" was attacked!",
  [11378001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11378002] = "Lawbreakers were ready to make trouble. What awaited them was the severe punishment of the law.",
  [11378100] = "The site was in chaos. A thug rushed to the audience with a dagger. At this critical moment...",
  [11378111] = "The brave %s rushed up to subdue the thug.",
  [11378112] = "%s tried to stop the thug but was kicked away by him.",
  [11378113] = "%s tried to stop the dagger-wielding thug, but %s found he couldn't move at all.",
  [11378114] = "%s ran away faster than anyone else after spotting the thug.",
  [11378119] = "Ordinary people couldn't handle such a dangerous situation. Leave it to the police.",
  [11378120] = "What a thrilling moment. Fortunately, no one got hurt in the end.",
  [11378200] = "The attack against the opening ceremony set tongues wagging for a moment. Our PR skills were put to the test.",
  [11378211] = "%s spoke right away on behalf of the organizers and %s's calm and sincere words won unanimous praise.",
  [11378212] = "Worried the attack would damage the foundation's image, %s tried to whitewash it but caused much resentment.",
  [11378213] = "%s was eager to calm things down by removing it from the trending list, but aroused the curiosity of the public.",
  [11378214] = "%s spared no effort to suppress and refute the popcorn-munching people, causing discontent from many parties.",
  [11378219] = "We'd better stay away from trouble and wait for public opinion to calm down.",
  [11378220] = "I believed we could get people's understanding and support after they knew the truth.",
  [11379000] = "Development of technology and the Internet enabled a greater number of film studios to support employees to work from home. We made a documentary to record their way of working.",
  [11379001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11379002] = "Going out or working from home was a personal choice. Hope that we could all find one that suits us in work and life.",
  [11379100] = "Statistics showed that people preferring to work from home had social phobia to some extent. Jovial people may communicate with them more effectively.",
  [11379111] = "%s was cheerful and jovial. Under his influence, the people who were documented agreed to participate in the filming.",
  [11379112] = "%s was a chatterbox that kept talking without caring about others' feelings.",
  [11379113] = "%s was introverted and couldn't light up the room.",
  [11379114] = "After %s told a dry joke, the audience was embarrassed.",
  [11379119] = "Instead of having small talk, we'd better start working right away.",
  [11379120] = "Even a person with a social phobia would become a chatterbox when it came to their favorite topics.",
  [11379200] = "The documentary focused on the way of working, so it may be boring. Editing skills were needed to make it taut and interesting.",
  [11379211] = "%s was a genius at editing, and his clips were always interesting and compelling.",
  [11379212] = "%s added many special effects and music as highlights to the documentary, making it nondescript instead.",
  [11379213] = "%s's clips were plain and tedious, too flat without any twists.",
  [11379214] = "The documentary edited by %s was hard to understand due to its awkward splicing and confusing logic.",
  [11379219] = "A documentary should focus on the facts, so it didn't have to be interesting.",
  [11379220] = "The narrative rhythm of a documentary should be naturally paced like breathing in order for the audience to feel comfortable.",
  [11380000] = "A foreign research team recently released a product powered by cool tech and claimed it could help users revive sweet memories. We were invited to the launch site.",
  [11380001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11380002] = "An amazing product powered by cool tech. Remember to contact us if you're interested!",
  [11380100] = "We invited industry experts to introduce the effect and safety of this product.",
  [11380111] = "%s was a big name in the industry and his words could convince most people.",
  [11380112] = "%s was a prestigious expert, but %s's reputation was ruined by the endorsement of fake products.",
  [11380113] = "%s was never involved in high technology, so his words were not convincing.",
  [11380114] = "%s was a habitual liar, so the audience didn't believe him at all.",
  [11380119] = "No expert agreed to be present. It's better to have the R&D team introduce the product.",
  [11380120] = "Revive sweet memories... What would that feel like?",
  [11380200] = "Inviting online celebrities to experience the product would probably make the publicity more effective.",
  [11380211] = "%s enjoyed a good reputation and image, attracting a lot of attention to the product.",
  [11380212] = "%s was an online celebrity who became popular because of local style videos. It was inappropriate for %s to promote a high-tech product.",
  [11380213] = "%s was a has-been. Probably no one would recognize %s on the street.",
  [11380214] = "%s was on the list of tainted stars. If %s was invited to promote the product, the program would probably be prohibited from being aired.",
  [11380219] = "We couldn't afford to pay a star. Just invite ordinary people to experience the product.",
  [11380220] = "Seeing the happy face of the young male star, I suddenly wanted to try it.",
  [11380300] = "The breakfast you prepared for Gavin looked monotonous, so you took out...",
  [11380301] = "Cold Medicine",
  [11380302] = "Jam",
  [11380303] = "Mushroom",
  [11380311] = "Gavin paused for a moment and gave you half of his food.",
  [11380312] = "It was dangerous for you to use the knife. I would apply the jam for you.",
  [11380313] = "Gavin paused for a moment and gave you half of his food.",
  [11381000] = "Time for the annual Campus Sports Meet that students were crazy about! We were invited to record young energetic students in a day to help you relive the wonderful campus life.",
  [11381001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11381002] = "Did you think of your youth when seeing the figures running fast on the playground? Were you on the playground back then?",
  [11381100] = "A photographer must run as fast as athletes to take pictures during the sprint. Who could do that?",
  [11381111] = "%s was a sprint champion and could run steadily with a camera on the shoulder.",
  [11381112] = "%s ran fast but %s would drop the camera when running.",
  [11381113] = "%s was weak. After running a few steps, %s was left behind by the athletes.",
  [11381114] = "%s was not athletic and never got any score in sports.",
  [11381119] = "The photographers were not good runners. They'd better wait at the finish line to take pictures.",
  [11381120] = "The photographer who followed the athletes was the real champion!",
  [11381200] = "During the race, a girl fell and bruised her knee. She needed emergency treatment.",
  [11381211] = "%s was adept at treating wounds and carried a medicine box. The girl's wound was properly treated.",
  [11381212] = "%s was so clumsy that %s wrapped a lot of gauze around the girl's leg.",
  [11381213] = "%s knew nothing about medical treatment and couldn't tell the difference between trauma medicine and cold medicine.",
  [11381214] = "%s was born with hematophobia, so %s fainted at the sight of the wound.",
  [11381219] = "We couldn't do anything about it. We asked the girl to handle it herself.",
  [11381220] = "Young athletes, be careful during the race!",
  [11381300] = "You visited Gavin when he was on a night shift. What would you bring to him?",
  [11381301] = "Pain Spray",
  [11381302] = "Delivery Box",
  [11381303] = "Homemade Bento",
  [11381311] = "Gavin paused for a moment and gave you half of his food.",
  [11381312] = "Gavin paused for a moment and gave you half of his food.",
  [11381313] = "...Are these all for me?",
  [11382000] = "After Game of Hunters was over, Special Task Force increased patrols in Loveland City and solved potential dangers.",
  [11382001] = "To follow the daily patrols of Special Task Force 24 hours a day to take pictures, we made a lot of preparations.",
  [11382002] = "We learned from the filming that Special Task Force and other departments had made great efforts for our safety. We must protect ourselves.",
  [11382100] = "Strong perseverance and determination were essential to achieve round-the-clock filming of Special Task Force's inspections.",
  [11382111] = "%s showed great perseverance in the face of arduous tasks and led team members to complete the filming task.",
  [11382112] = "%s worked hard all day, but none of %s's clips was exciting.",
  [11382113] = "%s complained of the hot weather and always asked for a rest.",
  [11382114] = "%s followed the wrong person during the filming, and the clips %s made were useless.",
  [11382119] = "%s asked for sick leave after learning of the task and didn't come to work for several days.",
  [11382120] = "The sense of accomplishment after the completion of the tough task was irreplaceable.",
  [11382200] = "During a patrol of Special Task Force, a furtive figure suddenly appeared in the camera...",
  [11382211] = "%s immediately rushed to subdue the suspect.",
  [11382212] = "%s reported the incident to nearby Special Task Force members, but the suspect disappeared.",
  [11382213] = "%s immediately rushed to chase the suspect but tripped over a rock.",
  [11382214] = "%s screamed with excitement and scared away the suspect.",
  [11382219] = "It's better to stay away from trouble.",
  [11382220] = "The suspect was a tourist who got lost and didn't want to go brown. What an own goal.",
  [11383000] = "Novel cool tech became trending. We would air a program on cutting-edge technology to bring you more interesting info.",
  [11383001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11383002] = "The program was an eye-opener. We would have a promising future if we could always think out of the box.",
  [11383100] = "We should invite \"eccentric\" people to join our discussion on this mind-blowing program.",
  [11383111] = "%s was regarded as an \"eccentric\" person. %s would hit the nail on the head when discussing topics on technology and the future.",
  [11383112] = "%s wore Afro-hair and used textspeak. No one could understand his words.",
  [11383113] = "%s's arguments were so ordinary and moderate that they failed to meet the requirements of the program.",
  [11383114] = "%s pretended to be oddball and interesting, but people easily saw through %s's poor acting skills.",
  [11383119] = "Not everyone would accept an oddball. We'd better not invite an oddball.",
  [11383120] = "Ideas with different starting points would spark wisdom.",
  [11383200] = "Children's simple ideas may bring us different inspirations.",
  [11383211] = "%s's naive and simple ideas brought joy and inspiration to the audience.",
  [11383212] = "%s was too young to clearly express ideas, so %s wasn't suitable for the program.",
  [11383213] = "%s entered the entertainment industry at an early age, and %s's words were no different from those of adults.",
  [11383214] = "%s began to play a game after coming on stage and ignored the adults' words.",
  [11383219] = "Children were out of control on stage, while adults were more reliable.",
  [11383220] = "Sometimes we would be amazed by the visions and perspectives with which children explored the world.",
  [11384000] = "Human experiments were essential to the development of medicine, but there were ethical issues. We must regulate human experiments with clear medical ethics. We invited experts to unveil the mystery of human experiments...",
  [11384001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11384002] = "We knew little about human experiments. We'd like to pay tribute to the medical experts.",
  [11384100] = "Discussing controversial medical ethics issues posed a demanding test for the host's knowledge and control.",
  [11384111] = "%s was a skilled host. %s's dialogues with the experts were wonderful and appropriate.",
  [11384112] = "%s was renowned for a sharp tongue. The tricky questions %s raised embarrassed the experts.",
  [11384113] = "%s never worked as a host. %s was overwhelmed by several rounds of Q&A.",
  [11384114] = "Due to the lack of preparations, %s didn't understand the experts' topics and failed to handle them.",
  [11384119] = "The unprofessional host was criticized by the audience.",
  [11384120] = "An excellent host would be the mainstay of a talk show.",
  [11384200] = "Halfway through the interview, the big screen in the studio went black. Who could solve the problem?",
  [11384211] = "%s had been involved in logistics for years and soon found out the problems and fixed them.",
  [11384212] = "The careless %s mistakenly touched a part during repair, damaging the circuit and delaying more time.",
  [11384213] = "%s didn't find out the problems after checking for a long time.",
  [11384214] = "%s forgot to turn off the power supply during the inspection, which almost caused a more serious accident.",
  [11384219] = "No one fixed the black screen due to a sudden malfunction. The program had to be suspended.",
  [11384220] = "Alas, we should have double-checked all the details before recording...",
  [11385000] = "Evolvers with different abilities lived in Loveland City. What was the strangest Evol ability you've seen?",
  [11385001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11385002] = "Online participants actively participated in the discussions, which was an eye-opener. What peculiar Evol ability have you seen around you? Join our discussion!",
  [11385100] = "Numerous contributions were received after the topic was announced. A conscientious person was needed to sort out the highlights from the discussions.",
  [11385111] = "%s had a keen eye and never missed any interesting contributions. The contributions %s picked were brilliant.",
  [11385112] = "%s was careful but inefficient. Everyone was waiting for him to finish his job.",
  [11385113] = "%s was too careless and missed many interesting contributions.",
  [11385114] = "%s had no patience to read through all the contributions, but only picked some randomly and handed them over.",
  [11385119] = "There was a serious shortage of manpower. We'd better randomly pick some contributions.",
  [11385120] = "The world was full of wonders. Evol was more peculiar than I could have ever imagined.",
  [11385200] = "The topic's influence would be enhanced significantly if online celebrities participated in discussing the topic.",
  [11385211] = "%s was an online celebrity adept at dissing. His posts were quite fun and stirred up controversy.",
  [11385212] = "%s had some popular appeal on the Internet, but failed to resonate with the audience or provoke a heated discussion.",
  [11385213] = "%s was a Z-list celebrity. The posts by %s were soon ignored and forgotten.",
  [11385214] = "%s made things up to pander to the crowd, which was soon seen through by online participants.",
  [11385219] = "No suitable candidate was found. We'd better not invite online celebrities to promote the topic.",
  [11385220] = "There were quite a few interesting and talented online celebrities these days.",
  [11385300] = "Lucien stopped suddenly and held out his hand when demonstrating for you a little experiment. What should you give him?",
  [11385301] = "Tube",
  [11385302] = "Tissue",
  [11385303] = "Fruits",
  [11385311] = "A reaction would occur soon. Don't blink.",
  [11385312] = "Lucien smiled awkwardly and took a test tube from behind you.",
  [11385313] = "Lucien smiled awkwardly and took a test tube from behind you.",
  [11386000] = "We would inevitably encounter differences or even trust crises in interpersonal interactions. Would you argue for yourself if doubted or misunderstood?",
  [11386001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11386002] = "We hoped you could handle a trust crisis rationally and resolve it in a clever way.",
  [11386100] = "We invited extrovert pals to share stories about misunderstandings between themselves and others.",
  [11386111] = "%s shared an interesting and intriguing story that was well received.",
  [11386112] = "%s enjoyed sharing with others but wasn't a good storyteller. %s often rambled on one detail without stop.",
  [11386113] = "%s was very shy and didn't like to talk much, and became nervous when telling stories.",
  [11386114] = "%s spoke inarticulately, giving the audience a hard time understanding him.",
  [11386119] = "No suitable candidate was found. The session on sharing stories was canceled.",
  [11386120] = "A trust crisis may arise due to a trivial matter while it's very difficult to clear the air.",
  [11386200] = "Now experts would teach you how to rationally deal with trust crises between people.",
  [11386211] = "%s analyzed from a rational point of view with clear logic, making the audience enlightened.",
  [11386212] = "%s's words were so boring that the audience fell asleep.",
  [11386213] = "%s's words were so emotional that the audience doubted their credibility.",
  [11386214] = "%s cited a few real-life extreme cases, which didn't explain the problem well.",
  [11386219] = "The experts' preaching didn't provide much help to the audience.",
  [11386220] = "If one could calm down to analyze rationally before an emotional outburst, a good many disputes may not arise to begin with.",
  [11387000] = "R&D department of Special Task Force would cooperate with the media for the first time to reveal the daily routine of researchers.",
  [11387001] = "The public thought R&D department was mysterious and inaccessible. Today we would visit the lab together to unveil the mystery of researchers.",
  [11387002] = "Turned out so many interesting things would happen in the lab every day. Stay tuned for the program if you're interested.",
  [11387100] = "There were a good many expensive and precise instruments in the lab. We must be careful when filming.",
  [11387111] = "%s always did things meticulously. Under his supervision, no accidents happened during the filming.",
  [11387112] = "%s became overcautious after knowing the instruments' price and thus missed many wonderful scenes.",
  [11387113] = "%s knocked over a flask accidentally while filming moving footage, causing quite a commotion.",
  [11387114] = "%s and companions were kicked out by the researchers for their rough and tumble in the lab.",
  [11387119] = "To be on the safe side, let's shoot outside the lab.",
  [11387120] = "After seeing the price tag on the instruments, we realized we couldn't afford them.",
  [11387200] = "During the filming, important data in the lab needed to be sent out immediately. The researchers were too busy with their own work and thus needed our help.",
  [11387211] = "%s was prudent and decisive. We were at ease with him delivering the data.",
  [11387212] = "%s was a dawdler. It would be too late after he delivered the data.",
  [11387213] = "%s returned after going out for a long time because %s forgot to ask the destination.",
  [11387214] = "%s was careless and lost the data immediately after walking out of the lab.",
  [11387219] = "If you couldn't take the heavy responsibility, don't rush to help.",
  [11387220] = "Accepting the urgent task at the last minute made me nervous!",
  [11388000] = "Many citizens became homeless due to Game of Hunters. Some unscrupulous housing agencies took advantage of the opportunity to raise the rent. The program team made secret visits.",
  [11388001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11388002] = "Unscrupulous agents raised the rent to benefit themselves. That behavior would lead to their demise.",
  [11388100] = "The person making the secret visit needed to disguise as a white-collar worker in a rush to rent houses, so the person should have good acting skills.",
  [11388111] = "%s's acting was so natural that didn't feel off at all. And the agent didn't have the slightest doubt.",
  [11388112] = "%s's acting was pompous and emotional, making the agent feel weird.",
  [11388113] = "%s's acting was so stiff that it sounded like %s was reciting lines, which aroused the agent's suspicion.",
  [11388114] = "%s was unsophisticated and soon told the truth after being tricked by the agent.",
  [11388119] = "The actor was recognized. The secret visit failed.",
  [11388120] = "After much effort, we finally... managed to muddle through.",
  [11388200] = "Our filming staff waiting in the neighborhood was noticed by the agent. How to deal with that?",
  [11388211] = "%s pretended to be a blogger who shot short videos and muddled through.",
  [11388212] = "%s fled immediately, but the agent was alerted.",
  [11388213] = "%s was so nervous after being questioned that %s couldn't even speak clearly.",
  [11388214] = "%s thought the visit had been exposed and confessed everything on the spur of the moment.",
  [11388219] = "The unscrupulous agent realized something was wrong and shut us all out.",
  [11388220] = "No matter how cunning the enemy was, we must rise to the challenge and overcome it.",
  [11389000] = "Sanitation standards of different hotels varied. Therefore, we made secret visits to several starred hotels. Whether they were just fancy covers or indeed worth their prices, follow our camera to find out.",
  [11389001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11389002] = "We helped you knew the sanitation of major starred hotels. But it was up to you to tell if they were worth that much.",
  [11389100] = "For starters, we examined the check-in and reputation of some luxury hotels, hoping to get a preliminary understanding.",
  [11389111] = "%s examined from many aspects and got accurate data.",
  [11389112] = "%s examined with great fanfare, making the investigation alarming.",
  [11389113] = "%s only went through previous comments on the review app, which were of some value as reference but too one-sided.",
  [11389114] = "%s didn't know a clue how to start the investigation and still found nothing even after a few days.",
  [11389119] = "Few useful data were obtained after the investigation.",
  [11389120] = "Hotels may whitewash themselves, but users who had used their services wouldn't lie for them.",
  [11389200] = "During the secret visit, it was necessary to pay close attention to the sanitation of every key area.",
  [11389211] = "%s had a sharp eye and could find any corner that hid filth and dirt.",
  [11389212] = "%s observed too blatantly, which aroused the suspicion of the hotel staff.",
  [11389213] = "%s only saw superficial things but didn't observe any details.",
  [11389214] = "%s was careless and checked in while completely forgetting the purpose of the visit.",
  [11389219] = "The visitors found nothing due to the lack of the ability to observe.",
  [11389220] = "It was necessary to start with the details to judge whether a hotel's sanitation was up to par.",
  [11390000] = "Recently, a good many companies attracted public attention in the name of Evol service. Not a few customers said the service did bring them convenience that was on par with high tech. We visited a hotel to shoot and find out the facts.",
  [11390001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11390002] = "This visit to the hotel was pleasant. Evol created so many conveniences and business opportunities for people's life.",
  [11390100] = "A friendly-looking person was needed to chat with the hotel owner and customers to understand the situation.",
  [11390111] = "%s looked friendly and was adept at chatting with others.",
  [11390112] = "%s looked nice but timid. %s couldn't muster the courage to ask questions.",
  [11390113] = "%s looked forbidding. People would keep a distance after seeing him.",
  [11390114] = "%s looked fierce and spoke rudely. People would avoid talking to him.",
  [11390119] = "Failed to strike up a conversation and didn't get the desired information.",
  [11390120] = "Being likable was a rare gift that was well sought after.",
  [11390200] = "During the visit, a disgruntled customer barged in. Facing the tense situation, we needed to mediate the dispute from a neutral perspective.",
  [11390211] = "%s spoke impartially with rational logic and secured both sides' conviction. The matter was resolved soon under his mediation.",
  [11390212] = "%s tried to solve the conflict but offended both sides because of improper wording.",
  [11390213] = "%s was too obviously biased against one side. The other side refused to accept %s's meditation.",
  [11390214] = "%s acted as a mouthpiece and fanned the flames. The conflict escalated once again.",
  [11390219] = "It's better not to get involved in this dispute. Leave it to themselves.",
  [11390220] = "Tastes differ. Sometimes Evol services would annoy customers.",
  [11390300] = "You went out on a trip with Kiro but worried he wouldn't sleep well in the hotel. What did you bring for him?",
  [11390301] = "Self-heating Hot Pot",
  [11390302] = "Pillows",
  [11390303] = "Fridge Magnets",
  [11390311] = "Kiro blinked in disbelief but took the thing you handed him.",
  [11390312] = "Wow, Miss Chips knew me best!",
  [11390313] = "Kiro blinked in disbelief but took the thing you handed him.",
  [11391000] = "Rapid technological development facilitated the constant upgrading of toys. Rubik's Cube, as a childhood memory, was still one of the kids' favorite toys now. We invited Rubik's Cube experts to share interesting stories...",
  [11391001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11391002] = "In our opinion, you've felt the charm of Rubik's Cube, which has been popular for years. Try it if you're interested.",
  [11391100] = "The program focused on Rubik's Cube. Good lighting would highlight the unpredictable mystery of Rubik's Cube on camera.",
  [11391111] = "The lighting by %s made the Rubik's Cube in the expert's hands shine like an eye-catching magic prop.",
  [11391112] = "%s's lighting was too dim to highlight the mysterious atmosphere, making it hard to see the moves of the Rubik's Cube.",
  [11391113] = "%s's lighting was common, and the effect was barely unsatisfactory.",
  [11391114] = "%s's lighting was like that of a disco hall, and the audience was dazzled.",
  [11391119] = "The engineer with poor lighting ability failed to produce the desired effect.",
  [11391120] = "It looked like the Rubik's Cube with changing colors was injected with magic.",
  [11391200] = "At the end of the program, we needed a child to learn to play Rubik's Cube on stage.",
  [11391211] = "%s was cute and clever. The process in which %s learned to play Rubik's Cube was amusing.",
  [11391212] = "%s was too young to hold a Rubik's Cube and was not suitable for playing the game.",
  [11391213] = "%s mastered the skills of playing Rubik's Cube and played it very well.",
  [11391214] = "%s lost temper on the stage after learning for a while, making a total mess.",
  [11391219] = "No children agreed to come on stage. We'd better cancel this part.",
  [11391220] = "Seeing that children quickly mastered the skills of playing Rubik's Cube, I wanted to have a try.",
  [11392000] = "Retro-nostalgia had regained momentum recently. Buzz was created as online participants recalled their past youth.",
  [11392001] = "Well, I was all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts started to drift, a familiar figure came to my mind...",
  [11392002] = "You like retro nostalgia? Any interesting story of your youth? Tell us your story.",
  [11392100] = "We invited a fashion designer to talk about the skills and advantages of wearing nostalgic style clothes.",
  [11392111] = "%s knew a lot about nostalgic designs and provided us with valuable matching skills.",
  [11392112] = "%s pursued high-end design concepts. The clothes recommended by %s were not suitable for daily life.",
  [11392113] = "%s knew little about clothing styles and didn't offer any useful advice.",
  [11392114] = "Few people could appreciate %s's abnormal dressing styles.",
  [11392119] = "Without a professional fashion designer, we had to make things up based on our intuition about fashion.",
  [11392120] = "The logic and principles of aesthetics are worth studying for life.",
  [11392200] = "Now let's invite a young rocker to introduce his dressing style and story.",
  [11392211] = "%s was a good storyteller fond of wearing nostalgic clothes. The audience was fascinated by %s's story.",
  [11392212] = "The ardent rocker %s disdained to tell stories and was adept at taunting the audience.",
  [11392213] = "%s imitated the dressing style of rockers and had no interesting stories to share.",
  [11392214] = "The barber %s was mistaken for a rocker and was invited because of his nostalgic hairstyle.",
  [11392219] = "The rock singer overslept, so our program had to be canceled.",
  [11392220] = "Rock 'n Roll would always be the most nostalgic and trendy thing.",
  [11392300] = "Kiro was fascinated by the kids playing Rubik's Cube on the street. What did you secretly buy for him?",
  [11392301] = "Star-shape Candy",
  [11392302] = "Oden Hotpot",
  [11392303] = "Rubik's Cube",
  [11392311] = "Kiro blinked in disbelief but took the thing you handed him.",
  [11392312] = "Kiro blinked in disbelief but took the thing you handed him.",
  [11392313] = "Give me more time. I would make it right away!",
  [11393000] = "The company made a medium- and long-term strategy after Kiro suspended performing activities and it would hold a presentation at a future date.",
  [11393001] = "Finally, it was time for the presentation. Don't make any mistakes.",
  [11393002] = "The presentation was a success. Finally, I felt at ease.",
  [11393100] = "VIPs and partners would join the presentation. Their relationships were complex. We must arrange seats properly.",
  [11393111] = "%s sorted out the relationships between important people. There was no mistake in the seat arrangement.",
  [11393112] = "%s arranged for two hostile partners to sit next to each other, making them very embarrassed.",
  [11393113] = "%s arranged the seat randomly, upsetting many attendees.",
  [11393114] = "%s's carelessness resulted in a serious shortage of seats and irreparable losses.",
  [11393119] = "To avoid trouble, we'd better allow them to find their own seats.",
  [11393120] = "To hold a perfect event that satisfied everyone was an arduous task.",
  [11393200] = "The circuit failed suddenly during the presentation. The audience in the dark hall grew uneasy.",
  [11393211] = "%s had rich experience in logistics maintenance. The circuit returned to normal after his debugging.",
  [11393212] = "%s quickly found the problem but couldn't repair the circuit because the tools were not ready.",
  [11393213] = "%s was unskilled and at a loss at the malfunctioning circuit.",
  [11393214] = "%s knew nothing about repairing circuits but tried to solve the problem, almost causing a serious accident.",
  [11393219] = "No solution was available. We had to suspend the presentation.",
  [11393220] = "The law of life was that anything you fear may go wrong would go wrong.",
  [11394000] = "Many photos of celebrities in public places have been circulating. Many fashion business uses this opportunity to release variety shows related to celebrity casual wear.",
  [11394001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11394002] = "Follow us to learn more fashion tips to be the new wannabes.",
  [11394100] = "We have invited an excellent fashion stylist to give us tips for celebrity fashion.",
  [11394111] = "%s's tips were widely praised for being smart and practical.",
  [11394112] = "%s's style seemed too over-the-top. Not casual enough.",
  [11394113] = "%s only knew how to copy the celebrities' outfits without any original ideas.",
  [11394114] = "%s has no fashion sense whatsoever.",
  [11394119] = "The stylists can't make it. We can only find a random person to fill in.",
  [11394120] = "I never knew so much effort can be put into an outfit! I've got to learn this!",
  [11394200] = "Just before the show started, a fashion model sprained her ankle. We need a handsome model to fill in.",
  [11394211] = "%s made no mistakes with his handsome look and many years of modeling experience.",
  [11394212] = "%s is good-looking but has zero modeling experience. He was nervous and even tripped.",
  [11394213] = "%s is too short and failed to show the aura of the outfit.",
  [11394214] = "%s looks slightly creepy, which degraded the outfit.",
  [11394219] = "Without anyone to fill in, all we can do is use a projected image to show the outfit.",
  [11394220] = "Leave the professional things to the professionals.",
  [11395000] = "The comeback concert of superstar Kiro has become the talk of the town. The whole internet is talking about Kiro, bringing a new height to his popularity.",
  [11395001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11395002] = "Everything is in full swing. No one will be let down.",
  [11395100] = "The brilliant stage in this concert requires high-quality lighting.",
  [11395111] = "%s is an internationally acclaimed gaffer. The lighting created a visual enjoyment under his control.",
  [11395112] = "This was the first time %s had managed such a large stage. Many mistakes were made due to the lack of experience.",
  [11395113] = "%s created too many special effects. The lighting had lost the layers and focus.",
  [11395114] = "%s wanted a colorful stage, bringing the colors to a new peak of ugliness.",
  [11395119] = "There was a blackout during the lighting testing. The whole stage was filled with darkness.",
  [11395120] = "No bright stage can outshine Kiro.",
  [11395200] = "Kiro presented himself in a dozen outfits in the concert for various stage effects.",
  [11395211] = "%s had designed many classic stage outfits. The designs for this concert were stunning.",
  [11395212] = "%s's creativity had run out after designing a couple of outfits.",
  [11395213] = "%s's designs looked all the same.",
  [11395214] = "%s's designs were very outdated.",
  [11395219] = "Without a suitable designer, the fitting has to be postponed.",
  [11395220] = "Which style of Kiro will you pick?",
  [11396000] = "The news about Kiro has stirred a storm on the internet and various social media platforms with lopsided opinions. Was the news a truth or a lie?",
  [11396001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11396002] = "The internet is full of lies. Please use your own discernment before attacking people online.",
  [11396100] = "The truth will come to light. We will carry out an investigation to unearth the truth.",
  [11396111] = "%s was quick and accurate in his investigation and found reliable evidence.",
  [11396112] = "%s had many speculations, but never found evidence to prove them.",
  [11396113] = "%s used extreme means in the investigation and got reported.",
  [11396114] = "After many days of investigation, %s found nothing.",
  [11396119] = "The investigation isn't going anywhere.",
  [11396120] = "Evidence is the best trump card.",
  [11396200] = "To minimize the impact of the news, we took effective PR measures.",
  [11396211] = "%s was fast and ruthless, proving Kiro's innocence with the twists and turns of the incidents and gaining support.",
  [11396212] = "%s's tactics of deleting online comments and paying influencers were too obvious and brought a backlash.",
  [11396213] = "%s missed the timing to clarify the matter.",
  [11396214] = "%s decided to argue with the netizens himself but made no difference.",
  [11396219] = "The debates couldn't be stopped. Kiro's reputation has been seriously tarnished.",
  [11396220] = "It's time to fight back!",
  [11396300] = "One practice after another, you notice Kiro is getting exhausted. What will you give him?",
  [11396301] = "Energy drink",
  [11396302] = "A Hat",
  [11396303] = "Notebook",
  [11396311] = "Now I can get recharged!",
  [11396312] = "Kiro blinked in bewilderment and took out an energy drink from his bag.",
  [11396313] = "Kiro blinked in bewilderment and took out an energy drink from his bag.",
  [11397000] = "Concert \"Star\" was held as planned despite the debates. We will record the concert in the form of a documentary.",
  [11397001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11397002] = "Kiro is the brightest star. He is the best.",
  [11397100] = "With many people coming to the concert, the security check is crucial to prevent any prohibited items.",
  [11397111] = "%s took his job seriously and didn't miss any prohibited items.",
  [11397112] = "%s is too harsh and received many complaints.",
  [11397113] = "%s couldn't manage the large crowd of people and did the check casually.",
  [11397114] = "%s was distracted by chatting with the female fans and forgot about his job.",
  [11397119] = "The weak security check resulted in many potential hazards.",
  [11397120] = "Safety is always the highest priority.",
  [11397200] = "In the interaction session, the fan had mistaken the title of one of Kiro's songs. How will you deal with this awkward situation?",
  [11397211] = "%s responded with wit and turned awkwardness into humor.",
  [11397212] = "%s tried to deal with it by changing the subject but made it even more awkward.",
  [11397213] = "%s bluntly pointed out the fan's mistakes and embarrassed them in front of everyone.",
  [11397214] = "%s sneered, \"How can you get it wrong? Are you sure you're Kiro's fan?\"",
  [11397219] = "No one was there to resolve the awkward situation.",
  [11397220] = "Hey fan, copy Kiro's song name ten times!",
  [11398000] = "Concert \"Star\" ended on a perfect note. We want to interview the audience to show people their feelings.",
  [11398001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11398002] = "The concert has ended, but we will never forget its wonder and beauty.",
  [11398100] = "The audience was thrilled after the concert. An enthusiastic interviewer will do a good job.",
  [11398111] = "The enthusiastic %s quickly mingled with the excited fans.",
  [11398112] = "%s was too enthusiastic and talkative that fans mistook him for a salesman.",
  [11398113] = "%s was too reserved in front of the excited fans.",
  [11398114] = "%s was terrified by the large group of fans and escaped to his own comfort zone.",
  [11398119] = "The reserved interviewer made even the interviewees feel awkward.",
  [11398120] = "If you like Kiro, then you're part of the family!",
  [11398200] = "Two fans began to argue in the interview. Let's try to calm them down before the tension mounts.",
  [11398211] = "%s quickly separated the two and avoided a fight.",
  [11398212] = "%s was too strong and pushed both of them onto the floor.",
  [11398213] = "%s was too late. The two already started fighting.",
  [11398214] = "%s was terrified himself and hid away.",
  [11398219] = "The confrontation intensified, and the police had to get involved.",
  [11398220] = "It's fine for fans to disagree, but never to fight.",
  [11399000] = "We have invited an astronomer to explain the mysterious meteor shower.",
  [11399001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11399002] = "Is the meteor shower a sign of good luck?",
  [11399100] = "The interviewer must have a level of astronomic knowledge to conduct an insightful interview.",
  [11399111] = "%s is an astronomy enthusiast and had a thought-provoking chat with the astronomer.",
  [11399112] = "%s was eager to show off his knowledge and constantly interrupted the expert.",
  [11399113] = "%s knew nothing about astronomy and simply didn't know what to say.",
  [11399114] = "%s was not well-educated and asked many stupid questions.",
  [11399119] = "The lack of interaction in the interview made it very awkward.",
  [11399120] = "A professional interviewer should find out more about the interviewee before the interview.",
  [11399200] = "We needed to document this meteor shower with photographs to understand it better.",
  [11399211] = "%s's photos were praised for being romantic yet realistic.",
  [11399212] = "%s's photos were too artistic and over-edited.",
  [11399213] = "%s took the photos with the wrong angles and failed to capture the full view of the meteor shower.",
  [11399214] = "%s knew nothing about photography and only took a few blurred photos on his phone.",
  [11399219] = "No satisfactory photos were found.",
  [11399220] = "Did you make a wish?",
  [11400000] = "Several residents in the same area suffered from convulsions. We rushed to the site to find out more.",
  [11400001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11400002] = "Here is everything we found at the site. Please stay tuned for more updates.",
  [11400100] = "We invited the paramedics involved in the incident to find out more about the illness.",
  [11400111] = "%s's concise and professional explanations helped us to understand the situation.",
  [11400112] = "%s was not eloquent and used many jargons.",
  [11400113] = "%s was only a temp hired to carry the stretcher and had no clues about what happened.",
  [11400114] = "%s seemed to have only got to the scene and had no idea what happened.",
  [11400119] = "The paramedics were still working. Let's just wait.",
  [11400120] = "Always be on the front line for the truth.",
  [11400200] = "The convulsions had led to a large panic. As media workers, we must report unbiasedly to guide the public.",
  [11400211] = "%s's copy was objective, without trying to manipulate the public with words.",
  [11400212] = "%s's copy didn't have much substance and was mostly rambling.",
  [11400213] = "%s seemed neutral but his words were slightly manipulative.",
  [11400214] = "%s's copy was subjective and could easily cause panic.",
  [11400219] = "The report was too biased and got warned by several related departments.",
  [11400220] = "Being rational is the basic quality of media workers.",
  [11401000] = "The Special Task Force held a press conference when the leaflets appeared and claimed that the leaflets were all rumors, hoping to remind the public to discern the truth.",
  [11401001] = "It's time for the reporters to ask questions. All our questions will soon be answered.",
  [11401002] = "The press conference has come to an end. Please email the Special Task Force for any further questions.",
  [11401100] = "To educate the public on how to discern the reliability of the information, we invited an expert to debunk the content of the leaflet.",
  [11401111] = "%s is the top in the industry and trusted by the public.",
  [11401112] = "%s is too old to attend the event in person. The recorded video was not as effective.",
  [11401113] = "%s was not authoritative enough. The audience was only half-convinced.",
  [11401114] = "%s was not well-known. The audience didn't buy it.",
  [11401119] = "Without an authoritative expert, the Special Task Force's claim seemed less solid.",
  [11401120] = "A trusted person will only take one sentence to calm people down.",
  [11401200] = "A reporter seemed agitated in the Q&A session and wanted to rush up to the stage.",
  [11401211] = "%s was quick enough to stop the reporter to calm him down.",
  [11401212] = "%s was too heavy-handed. The reporter lay on the floor and demanded compensation.",
  [11401213] = "%s was too weak and couldn't even squeeze through the crowd.",
  [11401214] = "%s panicked and wanted to escape.",
  [11401219] = "With no one to step in, the situation got out of control.",
  [11401220] = "The ability and courage to deal with emergency are the key qualities.",
  [11402000] = "Boxing has become a popular sport in recent years. Let's learn the charm of boxing from well-known boxers.",
  [11402001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11402002] = "Can you feel the hormones in the show? Let's get boxing!",
  [11402100] = "We invited some traditional martial art masters to see what happens when boxing and martial arts are brought together.",
  [11402111] = "%s had solid skills, which made the combat excellent entertainment for the audience.",
  [11402112] = "%s only knew performing martial art, which had no use in actual combats.",
  [11402113] = "%s had only learned a few moves from watching action films.",
  [11402114] = "It only took one move to defeat %s.",
  [11402119] = "Since we can't find any martial arts masters, we'll only have the boxer do the show alone.",
  [11402120] = "The two types of fighting made an intense and exciting show.",
  [11402200] = "To get a higher show rating, we need a celebrity to be our guest to try out boxing as a demonstration of the thrill of the sport.",
  [11402211] = "%s is a well-known celebrity who was fit enough for boxing training.",
  [11402212] = "%s is well-known but unfit, too weak for such an intense sport.",
  [11402213] = "%s had too many scandals and had a bad impact on the show.",
  [11402214] = "%s is a Z-list celebrity and won't help much with the rating.",
  [11402219] = "No celebrities were willing to come. The proposal got dropped.",
  [11402220] = "Viewers love seeing celebrities boxing in sweat.",
  [11402300] = "You and Gavin chatted until late at night. He said he was getting sleepy, so you give him...",
  [11402301] = "A Pillow",
  [11402302] = "A Water Bottle",
  [11402303] = "Bunny Ears",
  [11402311] = "My arm will be your pillow.",
  [11402312] = "Gavin gave you a resigned smile and got what he needed for himself.",
  [11402313] = "Gavin gave you a resigned smile and got what he needed for himself.",
  [11403000] = "The first snow has arrived in Loveland City. Is the person next to you still the same as last year...?",
  [11403001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11403002] = "Search \"First Snow Memories\" to share your story. Perhaps your Mr. or Mrs. Right is just waiting around the corner...",
  [11403100] = "The selection of location is key to capture the beauty of the first snow.",
  [11403111] = "%s chose a beautiful, out-of-the-world scene that was just perfect for the first snow.",
  [11403112] = "%s selected some artistic scenes that felt slightly lifeless.",
  [11403113] = "The locations %s chose were slightly chaotic, which ruined the beauty of the first snow.",
  [11403114] = "The scenes %s chose were too awful that the photographer refused to take any pictures.",
  [11403119] = "We ended up choosing a random place. The feedback wasn't great.",
  [11403120] = "What do you associate with the first snow?",
  [11403200] = "The first snow and food make a great combination. We invited some food bloggers to share food that goes well with the first snow.",
  [11403211] = "As a well-known food blogger, %s chose some tasty food to have when the first snow falls.",
  [11403212] = "The food %s chose was greasy and heavily spiced. One could hardly associate it with the first snow.",
  [11403213] = "Without much knowledge about gourmet, the food %s chose was too ostentatious.",
  [11403214] = "%s thought of ice cream whenever it snowed. But he ate too much of it and ended up in hospital.",
  [11403219] = "Failed to find a suitable food blogger, so I'll have to do it myself.",
  [11403220] = "What would you like in your first dinner in the first snow?",
  [11403300] = "When you told Gavin a joke in the cafeteria, food went down the right way and gave Gavin a coughing fit. What will you give him?",
  [11403301] = "A Necktie",
  [11403302] = "A Drink",
  [11403303] = "A Pillow ",
  [11403311] = "Gavin gave you a resigned smile and got what he needed for himself.",
  [11403312] = "Thank you. The joke was funny.",
  [11403313] = "Gavin gave you a resigned smile and got what he needed for himself.",
  [11404000] = [[
Many fishermen found lights cutting across under the sea.
Let's explain this mysterious phenomenon with science.]],
  [11404001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11404002] = "The truth was discovered all of a sudden. The answer turned out to be a surprise, yet it made so much sense...",
  [11404100] = "The show's script must be full of suspense to keep people on the edge of their seats.",
  [11404111] = "The script %s wrote was full of suspense and captivating.",
  [11404112] = "%s wrote a captivating script, but the content was too exaggerated, which could be risky.",
  [11404113] = "%s's script was boring, empty, and failed to capture attention.",
  [11404114] = "%s's script was full of grammar and spelling mistakes, which didn't seem professional.",
  [11404119] = "The show was accused of plagiarism.",
  [11404120] = "A good script is the best advertisement.",
  [11404200] = "Our thorough investigation slowly unearthed the truth. Suitable music is key at this point.",
  [11404211] = "%s's choice of music was perfect for the scene.",
  [11404212] = "%s's music was too upbeat, which made it lose a sense of suspense.",
  [11404213] = "%s chose creepy music, which was called \"hellish\" by the netizens.",
  [11404214] = "%s chose a pop song he loved, which completely ruined the scene.",
  [11404219] = "I'm out of ideas. Let's look at similar shows for reference.",
  [11404220] = "Any background music that helped you immerse into the world in just one second?",
  [11405000] = [[
Are there any unknown civilizations in this world?
We have invited some authoritative experts to explore this unsolved mystery.]],
  [11405001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11405002] = "This episode only leaves you want to find out more! Perhaps one day these mysteries will all be solved...",
  [11405100] = "A rational host will discern various theories online and stay unbiased.",
  [11405111] = "%s had a rational and thoughtful discussion with the expert and asked many good questions for the viewers.",
  [11405112] = "%s was too skeptical of anything the expert said.",
  [11405113] = "%s showed no discernment of his own in the whole discussion.",
  [11405114] = "%s became an unknown civilizations enthusiast and quit his job on the spot to become an explorer.",
  [11405119] = "Without a rational and professional host, the show received bad reviews.",
  [11405120] = "Don't blindly believe everything written in books.",
  [11405200] = "To produce a professional science show, repeated reviews are needed to check for any false information and mistakes.",
  [11405211] = "%s was known for his thoroughness and would not miss a single detail.",
  [11405212] = "%s used a magnifying glass to check through every single frame, resulting in a delay in airing the show.",
  [11405213] = "%s tried his best but still missed some issues.",
  [11405214] = "%s carried out the task carelessly without paying much attention.",
  [11405219] = "The show was aired without any review. Several obvious mistakes got severely criticized by the academia circle.",
  [11405220] = "Ensuring correct information was the basic ethics of media workers.",
  [11406000] = [[
The last episode received many good reviews.
The crew decided to strike while the iron was hot and encouraged science and unknown enthusiasts to explore new ideas and directions.]],
  [11406001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11406002] = "Believe in science and be brave to explore to write our future.",
  [11406100] = "We have invited some scholars to answer our questions.",
  [11406111] = "%s is an experienced scholar in the field who taught the views profound knowledge.",
  [11406112] = "%s is too arrogant to answer viewers' questions.",
  [11406113] = "%s doesn't seem to know the topic well enough to answer the questions well.",
  [11406114] = "%s was a fake expert who got popular from a viral video.",
  [11406119] = "The invited expert got busted for being an academic fraud, and the show got boycotted.",
  [11406120] = "A truly talented person is able to demonstrate the beauty of knowledge.",
  [11406200] = "Someone from the audience was too nervous that he forgot to ask his question. We need a friendly host to encourage him.",
  [11406211] = "%s was friendly and encouraging, which calmed the person down to ask his question.",
  [11406212] = "%s kept pushing the person to speak, only making him more nervous.",
  [11406213] = "%s simply waited for the person to speak, bringing the situation to a standstill.",
  [11406214] = "%s scorned the person's nervousness, which upset the audience.",
  [11406219] = "With the host failing to turn the situation around, we received fewer questions from the audience.",
  [11406220] = "Seeing the person being nervous made me feel awkward for them.",
  [11407000] = [[
Many have found that the stars have become brighter, even shooting stars have become not so rare anymore.
Our livestream show will document our skies 24/7.]],
  [11407001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11407002] = "It's believed that stars bring blessings. Hope our show will bring you good luck.",
  [11407100] = "The staff members need to monitor the skies during the livestream. It requires perseverance to observe for a few hours.",
  [11407111] = "%s had the perseverance to finish the job quickly.",
  [11407112] = "%s had an all-nighter the day before the livestream and accidentally fell asleep.",
  [11407113] = "%s got bored very quickly and started watching livestream dancing.",
  [11407114] = "%s doesn't suit this job and soon gave up.",
  [11407119] = "It's just filming the sky. It should be fine if no one watches...",
  [11407120] = "This livestream will calm your soul.",
  [11407200] = "After the livestream, we wanted to edit the livestream footage into a video to show the changes in the sky.",
  [11407211] = "%s was great at editing and managed to display the beauty of the night sky.",
  [11407212] = "%s kept many still shots, which made it very boring.",
  [11407213] = "%s didn't prioritize shots and deleted the shooting stars, which was the highlight of the footage.",
  [11407214] = "%s had no idea how to edit and made a mess.",
  [11407219] = "The video was poorly edited and received not much attention.",
  [11407220] = "Let's enjoy the beauty of nature.",
  [11407300] = "This evening with just the two of you, Lucien wanted to star gaze with you. What will you bring?",
  [11407301] = "A Map",
  [11407302] = "Cotton Candy",
  [11407303] = "Binoculars",
  [11407311] = "Lucien shook his head and took the binoculars behind you.",
  [11407312] = "Lucien shook his head and took the binoculars behind you.",
  [11407313] = "I'll gaze at you while you stargaze.",
  [11408000] = "Loveland City Council and Bioscience Research Center are leading an \"Innovative Science Show\" together to educate the public and debunk recent fake news.",
  [11408001] = "The preparation for a science show isn't easy. Hope everything will go well.",
  [11408002] = "Hope our society will move toward science and stay away from fake news.",
  [11408100] = "An erudite expert is needed for our science show.",
  [11408111] = "%s has been working in the research center for many years as a professor, more than competent for this job.",
  [11408112] = "%s is arrogant and refused to teach people with no scientific knowledge.",
  [11408113] = "%s is still learning himself. No one really knows what he was talking about.",
  [11408114] = "%s knows nothing about science and are not interested in science events in the slightest.",
  [11408119] = "Without a knowledgeable expert, the show wasn't as effective as it could be.",
  [11408120] = "The same facts weigh differently depending on who the speaker was.",
  [11408200] = "The projector stopped working when the expert was using it.",
  [11408211] = "%s had been involved in logistics for years and soon found out the problems and fixed them.",
  [11408212] = "%s quickly identified the problem but forgot to bring his toolbox.",
  [11408213] = "%s couldn't figure out what the problem was and caused a long delay.",
  [11408214] = "%s checked the circuit with trembling hands and broke the circuit of the entire studio.",
  [11408219] = "With the projector, the expert's presentation didn't go well.",
  [11408220] = "Professional equipment is needed for a professional show.",
  [11409000] = "If you had a chance to time travel, at which point in time would you want to go?",
  [11409001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11409002] = "Did the show provoke any thoughts? Leave your comments to get a chance to win a prize!",
  [11409100] = "We are conducting street interviews to find out people's answers to this question. A friendly face will suit the job.",
  [11409111] = "People were willing to be interviewed due to %s's friendliness.",
  [11409112] = "%s is slightly introverted and timid during the interviews.",
  [11409113] = "%s seems unapproachable and scared away many people.",
  [11409114] = "%s looks scary. People ran away from him when he tried to ask questions.",
  [11409119] = "The interviews didn't go well. We have to resort to some other means.",
  [11409120] = "A friendly face can go a long way.",
  [11409200] = "The answers we received were very similar. We needed some distinctive ideas.",
  [11409211] = "%s is rebellious and often thinks outside the box. His thoughts were very impressive.",
  [11409212] = "%s is too harsh and scorned our questions without giving an answer.",
  [11409213] = "%s might look hipster, but his thoughts were very mainstream.",
  [11409214] = "%s gave a boring answer we had heard countless times.",
  [11409219] = "We got no exciting answers from the interviews. Perhaps people did think the same.",
  [11409220] = "If time machines did exist, perhaps there would be a \"travel wave\" at a certain point in time.",
  [11410000] = "Radiation exists everywhere. How does it cause harm to human bodies? Let's get an expert to give us an answer.",
  [11410001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11410002] = "Panic and following the crowd is never a wise choice in the face of rumors. Science is the way.",
  [11410100] = "We conducted some small experiments to show the impact of radiation. A meticulous person is needed to record the data.",
  [11410111] = "%s is very thorough. The data was recorded without any mistakes.",
  [11410112] = "It took %s a few times to finish checking the record, which caused a delay in the schedule.",
  [11410113] = "%s had tried his best but still made a few mistakes.",
  [11410114] = "%s is very careless and made mistakes in the first line.",
  [11410119] = "The mistakes in the data made it impossible to draw a conclusion.",
  [11410120] = "A tiny mistake is enough to affect the result of the experiment.",
  [11410200] = "The projector stopped working when the expert needed to use it. It needed to be repaired as soon as possible.",
  [11410211] = "%s soon figured out the issue and repaired it.",
  [11410212] = "%s didn't tell anyone about his negligence in maintaining the equipment, which caused a huge delay.",
  [11410213] = "%s was not skilled enough and took ages to figure out what the issue was.",
  [11410214] = "%s examined the projector for ages, then told us to get it repaired at the repair shop.",
  [11410219] = "The expert had no choice but to continue without the presentation.",
  [11410220] = "Negligence in maintaining equipment comes with a heavy price.",
  [11411000] = "Meetings are a test of our reasoning and communication skills, which is an abstruse knowledge in itself.",
  [11411001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11411002] = "I have learned a lot from filming this show. I hope it will be the same for the viewers too.",
  [11411100] = "Hosting requires reasoning and communication skills. We've invited an experienced host to share his journey with us.",
  [11411111] = "%s shared everything about his training over the years.",
  [11411112] = "%s believes that hosts only need to be quick-witted, not reasoning.",
  [11411113] = "%s often plays the comedian role in variety shows and has never been a host before.",
  [11411114] = "%s has demonstrated how awful it would be when one did not have any logic or communication skills.",
  [11411119] = "The plan was scrapped due to insufficient funding.",
  [11411120] = "Looks like it takes years of training to make a host.",
  [11411200] = "It is said that one's communication skills depend on personality. We have invited an extroverted guest to prove this.",
  [11411211] = "%s is very outgoing and got the audience very excited.",
  [11411212] = "%s likes to ramble and lost people's attention.",
  [11411213] = "%s isn't very talkative and was lost for words after greeting the audience.",
  [11411214] = "%s was too nervous to talk, making the whole room very awkward.",
  [11411219] = "The guest was too nervous and canceled last minute.",
  [11411220] = "Everyone has a different starting point due to personalities, but only the diligent ones will finish the race.",
  [11411300] = "You ask Victor how to hear voice messages on the phone. What will you place on Victor's hand?",
  [11411301] = "Spaghetti",
  [11411302] = "A Phone",
  [11411303] = "Jellybean",
  [11411311] = "Victor raised an eyebrow and took the item you gave him.",
  [11411312] = "I'll only show you once. Watch.",
  [11411313] = "Victor raised an eyebrow and took the item you gave him.",
  [11412000] = "Have you ever had any prophetic dreams? How do dreams and reality connect to each other?",
  [11412001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [11412002] = "There is so much to explore when it comes to the connection between dreams and reality. Feel free to share your story on our website.",
  [11412100] = "It's said that dreams affect children more. We have invited a child to share his dreams and stories.",
  [11412111] = "%s shared his stories very naturally in a child-like fun way.",
  [11412112] = "%s is too young to speak fluently. It was very difficult to understand what he was saying.",
  [11412113] = "%s simply read the script written by the scripter. The audience couldn't resonate with the made-up stories.",
  [11412114] = "%s had stage fright and ran away last minute.",
  [11412119] = "The kid was flustered on the stage and cried for mommy.",
  [11412120] = "I often had nightmares and was too scared to go to sleep when I was a kid.",
  [11412200] = "We have invited a psychologist to explain the connection between dreams and reality.",
  [11412211] = "%s is a psychology professor who shared much interesting and insightful knowledge.",
  [11412212] = "%s likes to show off with many jargons and made it difficult to understand.",
  [11412213] = "%s mentioned many unproven and questionable theories and opinions.",
  [11412214] = "%s manipulated the audience's emotions and exaggerated like a fraud.",
  [11412219] = "Without an expert, we can only do some research ourselves.",
  [11412220] = "Shows need to be both fun and factual.",
  [11412300] = "You are watching a time-travel movie with Victor on the sofa. What will you place on his hand?",
  [11412301] = "Pudding",
  [11412302] = "Cat Food",
  [11412303] = "A Mirror",
  [11412311] = "I've made a lot for you. There are in the kitchen.",
  [11412312] = "Victor raised an eyebrow and took the item you gave him.",
  [11412313] = "Victor raised an eyebrow and took the item you gave him.",
  [11413000] = "The Loveland City Council and LFG organized an earthquake drill together to train enterprises in dealing with crises.",
  [11413001] = "A drill is enough to save many lives when the real crisis comes.",
  [11413002] = "I hope today's drill will never need to be put into practice.",
  [11413100] = "The drill was very realistic. We even simulated the earthquake scene.",
  [11413111] = "%s's scene design was very realistic and made the drill feel more real.",
  [11413112] = "%s focused too much on simulating the scene and neglected safety.",
  [11413113] = "%s didn't put much effort into designing the scene, which made the drill less effective.",
  [11413114] = "%s bought cheap, low-quality props, which led to many accidents.",
  [11413119] = "It's just a drill. Let's just wing it without any props.",
  [11413120] = "The drill was very professional. People remembered to protect themselves in the face of danger.",
  [11413200] = "A lady in high heels sprained her ankle and needed a first-aider.",
  [11413211] = "%s used to be a surgeon and helped the injured without any mistakes.",
  [11413212] = "%s knows some medical skills but does not have any first aid kit with him.",
  [11413213] = "%s rubbed the lady's ankle and made it worse.",
  [11413214] = "%s knows nothing about first-aid and dared not to help.",
  [11413219] = "No one knew what to do. It's better to get her to the hospital.",
  [11413220] = "It might just be a drill, but it's still important to protect yourself.",
  [11414000] = "The recent violin concert has led to a musical fervor in the number of parents looking to have their children master this elegant instrument. The musical training agencies thus became so popular. However, some experts point out that forcing your children to learn can cause counterproductive results.",
  [11414001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11414002] = "Sometimes, it's more important to be patient and let a child develop their own interests and hobbies rather than forcing it upon them.",
  [11414100] = "During our interview outside the training agencies, we found that many mothers with children were quite apprehensive and refused to participate. Perhaps someone with a really friendly-looking face would help them feel more at ease.",
  [11414111] = "%s has a very affectionate smile. Many parents and children are happy to be interviewed by him.",
  [11414112] = "%s is very friendly but is slightly shy, so making conversation with strangers was somewhat difficult for him.",
  [11414113] = "%s looks very distant and unapproachable. Most tried to steer clear of him when they saw him.",
  [11414114] = "%s looks very mean and frightening. A few of the children burst into tears when they saw him.",
  [11414119] = "No one was willing to take part in the interview. The whole morning had been a fruitless ordeal.",
  [11414120] = "Smiling all day makes the face somewhat... stiff.",
  [11414200] = "Learning an instrument takes years of practice and hard work to perfect. Having an accomplished musician on the show will certainly provoke a lot of thoughts and inspiration. That's why the show invited one such individual to talk about his journey from childhood and give opinions on the recent \"Musical Fervor\" that seems to have taken the city by storm.",
  [11414211] = "%s is a known musician. His stories of hard work and his journey to get to where he is today moved many.",
  [11414212] = "%s is a somewhat unknown talent. Most of the audience did not buy his boasts about his professional expertise.",
  [11414213] = "%s is an industry expert. However, he lacks basic social skills and is often silent, and finds it difficult to converse with people.",
  [11414214] = "%s is notorious for plagiarizing the work of others. His appearance was met with immediate disdain from the audience.",
  [11414219] = "The musician had to cancel at the last minute due to some emergencies. The show has been canceled as well.",
  [11414220] = "The greatest accomplishments require the greatest perseverance and determination. Success is never handed to you on a silver platter.",
  [11415000] = "The project to restore the Cliff Manor is falling on the shoulders of LFG and will start soon. However, there is still no official word from LFG. Stay tuned for additional coverage.",
  [11415001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11415002] = "How will LFG redefine the ruined Cliff Manor? Keep your eyes peeled and find out.",
  [11415100] = "The project is yet to begin, and negative rumors about LFG are already starting to circulate. Could there be any merits to those claims, or are they mere preposterous rumors? Our specialists are here to find out.",
  [11415111] = "%s's team is very professional and quickly uncovered the truth.",
  [11415112] = "%s used very unethical methods and was quickly halted by law enforcement agencies.",
  [11415113] = "%s pretended to have something big but, in reality, did not produce anything concrete.",
  [11415114] = "%s was a con man and ran with our money.",
  [11415119] = "The investigation produced no concrete evidence. The rumors continued to run wild.",
  [11415120] = "When faced with rumors and conspiracies, we must not let baseless accusations cloud our critical thinking.",
  [11415200] = "The reception to LFG winning the project is mixed. There are expectations and queries. Therefore, we have invited an expert here today to dissect what this means for the future of LFG's strategic plan.",
  [11415211] = "%s is an expert on the economy. His logical reasoning won the overwhelming approval of the audience.",
  [11415212] = "%s used a lot of jargon, and most of the audience had no clue what he was talking about.",
  [11415213] = "%s had a lot of biased opinions. Most of the audience doubted his credibility.",
  [11415214] = "%s spoke complete nonsense. His incoherent speech had a fuzzy logic and made a huge fool out of himself.",
  [11415219] = "We could not find a relevant expert to invite. The whole show was an underwhelming disappointment.",
  [11415220] = "The ability to dissect and piece back a complete picture from such an ordinary proposal. Perhaps this is what it means to be an expert at something.",
  [11415300] = "The night grows late, but Victor is still busy with his financial statements. What should you bring him?",
  [11415301] = "Coffee",
  [11415302] = "Sunglasses",
  [11415303] = "Red packets",
  [11415311] = "You've honed your coffee brewing skills.",
  [11415312] = "Victor shook his head as he grabbed what you needed.",
  [11415313] = "Victor shook his head as he grabbed what you needed.",
  [11416000] = "Breaking news of the amusement park: a guest accidentally struck a staff in costume while touring a haunted house attraction. Injuries and further disputes were reported. We'll be on the scene with more news as the situation progresses.",
  [11416001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11416002] = "Never thought the job of dressing up in a haunted house would be such a hazardous profession...",
  [11416100] = "To keep the news fresh, a professional team was dispatched to the scene immediately.",
  [11416111] = "%s kept his professionalism while staying appropriately humorous and the news was a joy to watch.",
  [11416112] = "%s did not arrive on the scene fast enough, and another news crew took the story.",
  [11416113] = "%s was overly stiff with the questions and ran into communication troubles during the interview.",
  [11416114] = "%s was too insensitive with the questions and was booed by the audience.",
  [11416119] = "When the news team rushed to the scene, everyone involved had already left.",
  [11416120] = "Professionalism is about being constantly ready to rush to the scene at first notice!",
  [11416200] = "The situation was starting to get tense. We need someone who can smartly diffuse the situation and ease the mood.",
  [11416211] = "%s was very charismatic. Under his words, the tense situation was diffused immediately.",
  [11416212] = "%s was very biased during his mediation. This has led to a disgruntled party.",
  [11416213] = "%s told a really dry joke and made the situation even more awkward.",
  [11416214] = "%s fanned the flame instead of diffusing the situation. A fight almost broke out.",
  [11416219] = "Neither side would back down. Our camera was damaged during the ensuing scuffle.",
  [11416220] = "The two parties shook hands and called it even. Sometimes it takes a little fight to get to know each other.",
  [11417000] = "The railings on a high-rise apartment suddenly collapsed. Thankfully, it occurred late into the night, and no one was injured. Reports suggest that the railing was in complete disrepair. The manager of the apartment complex has vowed to check all remaining railings for signs of aging and the need for replacements.",
  [11417001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11417002] = "Defective railings of a high-rise apartment put the lives of its occupants at great risk. We'll be closely monitoring the story to bring you any updates.",
  [11417100] = "A photographer was dispatched to document the broken and other aging railings to paint a clear picture of the situation for the viewers.",
  [11417111] = "%s is a skilled and seasoned photographer. He accurately depicted the danger of aging railings.",
  [11417112] = "%s is a professional photographer, but his fear of heights prevented him from filming on higher floors.",
  [11417113] = "%s is an amateur cameraman. His photos were completely blurry and unusable.",
  [11417114] = "%s didn't snap a single photo and almost dropped the camera downstairs.",
  [11417119] = "The photos were terrible, and nearly none were very useful.",
  [11417120] = "The railings were clearly showing signs of aging and degradation. This grave negligence of safety must be brought to attention!",
  [11417200] = "The cameraman scuffed his arm while trying to take the photos. He needs someone with the correct knowledge to stop the bleeding.",
  [11417211] = "%s simply bandaged the photographer. The bleeding stopped almost immediately.",
  [11417212] = "%s left the first-aid kit inside the car. A lot of time was wasted trying to fetch it.",
  [11417213] = "%s tried to treat the wound, but it wasn't very effective.",
  [11417214] = "%s is scared of blood and fainted on the spot.",
  [11417219] = "No one has any medical experience. Looks like we have to rush him to the hospital now.",
  [11417220] = "Having basic medical knowledge and not needing it is better than needing it and not having it.",
  [11418000] = "Today is an open tour day for the Loveland City Helicopter Club. Many elementary schools in the city organized tours for their students. It was many kids' first experience on a helicopter, and excitements were clearly visible on their faces. We have a special film crew on site to hear what these adorable kids have to say about this exciting experience.",
  [11418001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11418002] = "Kids these days are getting all sorts of extracurricular activities. It makes other people kind of jealous.",
  [11418100] = "Some of the kids are a little shy being on camera for the first time. An outgoing reporter would surely get them to talk.",
  [11418111] = "%s was very outgoing and quickly became friends with the children.",
  [11418112] = "%s was very talkative. So much so that the kids didn't even get a chance to speak.",
  [11418113] = "%s was a little shy and couldn't get the kids to talk a lot.",
  [11418114] = "%s always scared the kids. None of the children were willing to talk to him.",
  [11418119] = "The children were a little shy and didn't say a lot. It was somewhat disappointing.",
  [11418120] = "Those who get along with kids must also have a child's heart within.",
  [11418200] = "There are a lot of children today. The children in excitement would easily cause a stampede and the club is understaffed. To ensure everyone's safety, the club asked us to help maintain order.",
  [11418211] = "%s has been a security guard for many years. With him around, everyone completed the tour in an orderly fashion.",
  [11418212] = "%s was a little too hardline, and many children started crying out of fear.",
  [11418213] = "%s had no idea what to do when faced with such a big group of kids and was in a small panic.",
  [11418214] = "%s got so entranced in the helicopters that he forgot all about his job.",
  [11418219] = "Without proper order, the whole ordeal was a chaotic mess.",
  [11418220] = "The sound of children really starts to give you mental stress after listening to it for an entire day.",
  [11419000] = "Breaking news today: a case of burglary has been reported at the city hospital today. The thief was apprehended on the spot as he tried to sneak into the patient's room for stealing. Our reporter is now on the scene.",
  [11419001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11419002] = "If the safety and security of the hospital cannot be guaranteed, it'll make it difficult for the patients to recover. Hopefully, similar occurrences will not happen again.",
  [11419100] = "There are patients who require rest staying at the hospital. Whoever goes there needs to be extra patient and careful.",
  [11419111] = "%s was very considerate of the patients while conducting the interview.",
  [11419112] = "%s was overly cautious, and the whole interview felt rushed.",
  [11419113] = "%s was rash and careless and got booted out of the patient's room since he is too noisy.",
  [11419114] = "%s ignored the patient's obvious signs of fatigue and pressed on for more answers. The patient's family filed a complaint.",
  [11419119] = "The interview had to be called off as it became too noisy and intrusive. The team had to leave in shame.",
  [11419120] = "Before you do anything, consider the feelings of others. This is also to help yourself.",
  [11419200] = "During the interview, the thief suddenly broke free and began to escape. In the heat of the moment—",
  [11419211] = "%s sprung up and pinned the thief to the ground without too much effort.",
  [11419212] = "%s ran after the thief immediately but got lost and came back empty-handed.",
  [11419213] = "%s ran after the thief but quickly ran out of breath due to a lack of exercise.",
  [11419214] = "%s was completely frozen in fear and could not react at all.",
  [11419219] = "Before we realized it, the thief had gotten away.",
  [11419220] = "You criminal! You won't get away!",
  [11420000] = "According to our sources, Ms. Cai, a renowned glassblower, will be participating in the latest art show with her newest artworks in Loveland City. We have an exclusive interview today with Ms. Cai to learn more about her artistic philosophy.",
  [11420001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11420002] = "The beauty of glassware is much like the life of its creator, clear and radiant.",
  [11420100] = "The success of an interview is very much dependent on the skill of the host giving it.",
  [11420111] = "%s has conducted many successful interviews throughout the year. The entire show went off without a hitch.",
  [11420112] = "%s used to be a talk show host. In order to get higher ratings, some of the questions asked were somewhat offensive.",
  [11420113] = "%s was inexperienced, and the conversation soon dried up.",
  [11420114] = "%s blabbed on and didn't even give the guest a chance to talk.",
  [11420119] = "The unprofessional host completely ruined the show.",
  [11420120] = "A successful host knows when to speak and even when to listen.",
  [11420200] = "When the topic gets emotional, properly placed music will help the guest speak more openly and help get the audience into the same mood.",
  [11420211] = "%s masterfully played the correct tune and accentuated the atmosphere.",
  [11420212] = "%s understood music but lacks experience when using the machine. There were quite a few blunders on sound effects.",
  [11420213] = "%s played it safe and just looped one soundtrack.",
  [11420214] = "%s ruined the entire mood by playing a laughter sound effect when the guest was talking about something emotional.",
  [11420219] = "Perhaps adding sound effects on live TV wasn't such a good idea. Maybe adding the music during post-production is safer.",
  [11420220] = "Once the BGM started, everyone had to get in some mood!",
  [11420300] = "Kiro said he was starving after filming a commercial. What should you get him?",
  [11420301] = "A power bank",
  [11420302] = "A yo-yo",
  [11420303] = "A slice of cake",
  [11420311] = "Kiro looks slightly confused as you gave him what was in your hand, but he still took it anyway.",
  [11420312] = "Kiro looks slightly confused as you gave him what was in your hand, but he still took it anyway.",
  [11420313] = "Did you make this yourself? It looks delicious!",
  [11421000] = "Recent reports show an increasing amount of prank calls are being made to the city's fire department. A spokesperson of the fire control organ today urged citizens to refrain from such gross misuse of public resources...",
  [11421001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11421002] = "Those who disdain the law will eventually be punished by it.",
  [11421100] = "To get a better picture, our reports have gone to the street to gauge the public consensus.",
  [11421111] = "%s has done many successful interviews in the past and successfully collected public opinion.",
  [11421112] = "%s chose a somewhat secluded location and failed to gather a lot of opinions with a low workpiece ratio.",
  [11421113] = "%s lacked interview experience and gave questions that were too long and dull.",
  [11421114] = "%s looked so menacing that people ran away, thinking that they were getting mugged.",
  [11421119] = "The street interview was somewhat unsuccessful, and nothing of value was obtained.",
  [11421120] = "Those who cry wolf are destined to be consumed by their misdeeds.",
  [11421200] = "According to reports, people called in with fake emergencies tying up valuable police resources because they lacked legal knowledge and the cognition of the consequences. The show invited a guest to educate the public legal knowledge on the dangers of falsifying emergencies.",
  [11421211] = "%s understands the law very well and gave a very detailed presentation on the consequences of such rash behavior.",
  [11421212] = "%s understands the law quite well but got carried away and talked about something completely irrelevant.",
  [11421213] = "%s crammed in as much knowledge as he could on the last day but still forgot quite a few key points, so he made so many mistakes.",
  [11421214] = "%s became over-dramatic by blowing things way out of proportion. He was instantly dismissed.",
  [11421219] = "Without an expert, one could only look up and recite lines from the law book.",
  [11421220] = "Ignorance sometimes is as same as wrongdoing.",
  [11422000] = "Kiro's fan club is urging all Sodas to keep up the good work and refrain from buying over-priced tickets from scalpers. This move was very well received among Kiro's fans.",
  [11422001] = "With Kiro's concert drawing ever closer, it is even more important that proper measures be taken against scalpers in an effort to rid them once and for all.",
  [11422002] = "After this, hopefully, no one will become victims of scalping anymore.",
  [11422100] = "Upgrading the ticket sale system by implementing a real-name system to eradicate scalping at its root.",
  [11422111] = "%s is very tech-savvy and quickly upgraded the system.",
  [11422112] = "%s is reasonably confident but fears that it could not be done in a timely manner.",
  [11422113] = "%s ran into several severe bugs during the upgrade process, and the whole thing had to be halted.",
  [11422114] = "%s spent a few days trying to upgrade the system but failed in the end.",
  [11422119] = "The time was too tight, and the plan had to be scrapped.",
  [11422120] = "One ticket, one person. Say no to scalping.",
  [11422200] = "The fan club also wanted to shoot a video to urge fans to stop buying over-priced tickets from scalpers. They want help from a cameraman to help with the video.",
  [11422211] = "%s had superb camera skills and even ended the filming process indoors with high quality.",
  [11422212] = "%s was good with a camera, but the lighting could've used a little work.",
  [11422213] = "%s was a little shaky with the camera, but it didn't affect the end product too much.",
  [11422214] = "%s was terrible with the camera. The finished product was an unwatchable mess.",
  [11422219] = "Unable to find a proper cameraman, the club members had to make do with what they had by themselves.",
  [11422220] = "\"Sodas\" are the best fans. Just like Kiro is the best idol.",
  [11422300] = "Blushing, Kiro suddenly passed over a CD to you, then you tried to find...",
  [11422301] = "Gloves",
  [11422302] = "Headphones",
  [11422303] = "Comic Book",
  [11422311] = "Kiro looks slightly confused as you gave him what was in your hand, but he still took it anyway.",
  [11422312] = "Every time I hear this song, I will recall about us!",
  [11422313] = "Kiro looks slightly confused as you gave him what was in your hand, but he still took it anyway.",
  [11423000] = "A new location from a famous boba tea chain has opened its doors in Loveland City and has the customers in a frenzy on the very first opening day. How good does it taste? Our team is here to find out.",
  [11423001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11423002] = "Everyone has different tastes in boba tea. What is your favorite boba tea store? Send us a message and let us know!",
  [11423100] = "The line stretches out for miles. Looks like this is going to be a test of endurance if you want to try this boba tea...",
  [11423111] = "%s persevered using unbelievable stamina and endurance, and finally bought the boba tea after two hours of waiting in the queue.",
  [11423112] = "%s waited patiently, but people kept cutting in line. Hesitant to object, the line only grew longer.",
  [11423113] = "%s complained about being sore all over after mere minutes and wanted someone to take his place.",
  [11423114] = "%s stood in the completely wrong line for the fried chicken next door and only realized after waiting for a long time. He had to queue again.",
  [11423119] = "Nobody wanted to wait in line. In the end, everyone had to play Rock Paper Scissors to decide who was going.",
  [11423120] = "Would all the wait make the boba tea taste better?",
  [11423200] = "How does the boba tea taste? The show invited a famous food critic to be the judge.",
  [11423211] = "%s was a well-known food critic with a sharp tongue. His critique is often considered highly authoritative.",
  [11423212] = "%s took up a sponsorship from the store before, so the integrity of his critique became a subject of concern.",
  [11423213] = "%s is not a well-known food critic, so the audience did not find his critique credible.",
  [11423214] = "%s is notorious for previously leaving malicious fake reviews. The audience booed him off the stage.",
  [11423219] = "We didn't find a credible food critic. The staff's own opinion would have to suffice.",
  [11423220] = "It tastes... nothing out of the ordinary?",
  [11424000] = "Breaking news: the owner of the renowned bar, Nova, has decided to publicize his secret cocktail recipe. What has driven him to such a decision? Find out his story today on the show.",
  [11424001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11424002] = "The owner of Nova is as friendly as he is charismatic. Come to the Nova to experience this magnetic personality for yourself.",
  [11424100] = "The owner of the bar has a very charming personality. Someone who is equally as sociable should get along with him just fine.",
  [11424111] = "%s is very passionate and outgoing. He soon became friends with the owner.",
  [11424112] = "%s is very friendly but is not very knowledgeable nor very talkative when it comes to liquor. He cannot follow up when talking about it.",
  [11424113] = "%s is not very talkative and felt the owner's passion was slightly overwhelming.",
  [11424114] = "%s is not very sociable and didn't have much to talk about with the owner.",
  [11424119] = "The host and the owner didn't have a lot to say to each other. The interview ended in an awkward silence.",
  [11424120] = "A bar owner with this much passion is the life of the party wherever he goes.",
  [11424200] = "After the interview, the owner asked us to come up with a new slogan for the bar.",
  [11424211] = "%s came up with a simple, catchy, and memorable slogan.",
  [11424212] = "%s's slogan was too literary and did not fit the bar's overall feel.",
  [11424213] = "%s came up with a real cliché slogan that was completely uninspiring.",
  [11424214] = "%s thought long and hard but failed to produce anything.",
  [11424219] = "Everyone wracked their brains but couldn't come up with anything that satisfied the owner.",
  [11424220] = "It's hard to leave a memorable impression with a single sentence.",
  [11425000] = "Breaking news: the local hospital has been receiving numerous anonymous donations in recent days. Our reporters delved into the story and uncovered a touching story behind these donations.",
  [11425001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11425002] = "Even a small, ordinary kindness can light up ourselves and even the entire world.",
  [11425100] = "To uncover the truth, the show invited professionals to investigate.",
  [11425111] = "%s followed the clues and quickly uncovered the story behind everything.",
  [11425112] = "%s procrastinated, and the investigation was delayed for many days.",
  [11425113] = "%s investigated in the wrong direction and the results were unsatisfying.",
  [11425114] = "%s investigated for many days but to no fruition.",
  [11425119] = "For some strange reason, the truth continues to elude us.",
  [11425120] = "Who would've thought such an ordinary hospital would play home to such an extraordinary story...",
  [11425200] = "After the story went public, many people expressed their encouragement toward the fearless person struggling against illness. We're making these encouraging words and videos into a short film.",
  [11425211] = "%s is an expert video editor. The resulting video touched the heart of countless people.",
  [11425212] = "%s finished editing the whole video only to forget to blur out some private information.",
  [11425213] = "%s finished editing, but the timing of the words and pictures was completely off. The audience cannot finish reading each subtitle on the screen.",
  [11425214] = "%s finished editing, but the entire video was an incomprehensible mess with weird music choices.",
  [11425219] = "People have expressed their major dislike for the video, \"Thank you for your effort but do not try again\".",
  [11425220] = "Even a single encouragement can become the strength to fight on.",
  [11426000] = "According to credible sources, a new scam has been circulating about tricking people with fake videos. How can you identify and protect yourself from this new scam? Stay tuned and find out.",
  [11426001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11426002] = "New scams are popping up every day. We should all stay vigilant and be ever alert.",
  [11426100] = "The show invited psychology experts to explain the scam and how to protect yourself against it.",
  [11426111] = "%s was a well-known psychologist. He awed the audience with his knowledgeable presentation.",
  [11426112] = "%s's presentation was dull and uninspired, putting many of the audience to sleep.",
  [11426113] = "%s didn't know a thing about psychology, but came here anyways and badly read a script.",
  [11426114] = "%s didn't know a thing about psychology and stood silently on the stage the entire time.",
  [11426119] = "The expert had to cancel at the last minute due to a sensitive stomach. Looks like we'll have to read something from the book.",
  [11426120] = "Danger often comes from unexpected places!",
  [11426200] = "The show invited actors to play the scammer to simulate the scam. This part of the show put the actor's acting skills to the test.",
  [11426211] = "%s played out his role as the scammer perfectly.",
  [11426212] = "%s looked too much like a good guy to resemble anyone with evil intentions.",
  [11426213] = "%s couldn't act on the spot. A small deviation from the script made him forget his lines.",
  [11426214] = "%s got the stage freights and stuttered his lines in poor performance.",
  [11426219] = "The actor was the sponsor's relative who couldn't act even if his life depended on it.",
  [11426220] = "Playing a bad character well requires just as much talent.",
  [11426300] = "The upstairs neighbor is renovating their house. The noise has made Lucien hard to fall asleep. To remedy this, you prepared...",
  [11426301] = "Earplugs",
  [11426302] = "A robot vacuum",
  [11426303] = "A microphone",
  [11426311] = "With this, I can get a good night's sleep.",
  [11426312] = "Lucien shook his head and thanked your efforts.",
  [11426313] = "Lucien shook his head and thanked your efforts.",
  [11427000] = "The Bioscience Research Center arranged events in local schools to discuss scientific questions with the young students, intending to foster scientific interests in young minds.",
  [11427001] = "I wonder if the students will like and accept their special \"teacher\".",
  [11427002] = "The children showed great interest in the \"scientists\" who became their new teachers.",
  [11427100] = "Interests are often the best teacher. Someone with a good sense of humor will surely pique the students' interests.",
  [11427111] = "%s was extremely humorous and won the approving laughter of many students.",
  [11427112] = "%s was very humorous but often got carried off-topic.",
  [11427113] = "%s was somewhat stern and serious. The students responded by showing a lack of enthusiasm.",
  [11427114] = "%s's lecture was dull and put many of the students to sleep.",
  [11427119] = "Most of the students were uninterested in the wholly dull lecture.",
  [11427120] = "Who doesn't like a knowledgeable teacher with a good sense of humor?",
  [11427200] = "During a lab experiment, the podium suddenly caught on fire. In the pinch of the moment...",
  [11427211] = "%s darted forward and smothered the fire with his cloth.",
  [11427212] = "%s went for the fire extinguisher but forgot how to use it.",
  [11427213] = "%s ran to fetch water. By the time he came back, the fire was already put out.",
  [11427214] = "%s became frozen in fear and couldn't do anything.",
  [11427219] = "No one tried to put the fire out. Thankfully, the fire didn't spread, and no one was hurt.",
  [11427220] = "Safety always comes first. Do the experiments standardly.",
  [11428000] = "According to animal activists, a few newly born kittens were found abandoned under a bridge. Activists are looking for anyone willing to adopt the cat, and urge citizens to refrain from abandoning their pets.",
  [11428001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11428002] = "Owning a pet is a responsibility of a lifetime. If you choose to keep a pet, please do not abandon it.",
  [11428100] = "A newly born cat is very fragile. Someone needs to take care of it while a new owner is found.",
  [11428111] = "%s is very caring and reliable. With previous experiences of owning pets, the cats were well taken care of.",
  [11428112] = "%s is very caring but is somewhat of a compulsory perfectionist and falls into distress easily.",
  [11428113] = "%s is a little careless. It's probably not wise to leave the kittens with him.",
  [11428114] = "%s agreed to take the kittens home, but completely forgot the kittens when he left.",
  [11428119] = "No one wanted the kittens. Looks like I'll have to be the one to step up.",
  [11428120] = "A kitty is so adorable it just melts your heart.",
  [11428200] = "Activists are hoping to find a mascot to advocate animal protection. They want someone cute and adorable, just like the animals they're trying to protect.",
  [11428211] = "%s has a pair of adorable and lovely eyes.",
  [11428212] = "%s is very cute but is slightly afraid of animals.",
  [11428213] = "%s is allergic to cats and began sneezing uncontrollably.",
  [11428214] = "%s is very tall and has really broad shoulders. It's hard to associate him with the word \"cute\".",
  [11428219] = "We couldn't find someone who suited the role.",
  [11428220] = "It's said that everyone possessed the ability to communicate with animals when they were young.",
  [11429000] = "Have you ever run into trouble at work with another coworker? How did you manage to resolve it?",
  [11429001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11429002] = "Have you found the answer you were looking for after reading through the comments? Hopefully, you have found these tips useful for success in the workplace.",
  [11429100] = "We received many comments from a lot of enthusiastic users. Most of the comments were generic, so we need someone with a sharp eye to pick out a few ones that stood out.",
  [11429111] = "%s had a really sharp eye and picked out a lot of interesting content.",
  [11429112] = "%s had an overly-unique taste, and a lot of his choices were somewhat hard to understand.",
  [11429113] = "%s played it safe, and there weren't many pleasant surprises to be found.",
  [11429114] = "%s's choice included a bunch of content that was either indecipherable or completely outlandish.",
  [11429119] = "We didn't have time to go through them all. Looks like we'll just have to pick a few at random.",
  [11429120] = "Who could've thought such a simple topic would evoke so many responses? Looks like the workplace is a source of stress for everyone.",
  [11429200] = "The computer suddenly froze while organizing the topics. Looks like this is going to require expert help...",
  [11429211] = "%s was our computer expert. He quickly discovered and fixed the issue.",
  [11429212] = "%s was playing cards with the janitors in the logistics office. It took a long time before he was willing to come over.",
  [11429213] = "%s was a new hire and was unfamiliar with the company computer.",
