  [11429220] = "Sometimes restarting your computer just doesn't fix the problem.",
  [11430000] = "Jogging is a popular exercise choice. However, improper posture often leads to harm and injury. How do we avoid injury and maintain a correct posture? An expert is here to answer that question today.",
  [11430001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11430002] = "Exercising smartly is just as important on your way to a healthier lifestyle. Exercise in a scientific way will finally lead you to your health goal step by step.",
  [11430100] = "The show invited a retired athlete to teach the viewers about correct jogging postures.",
  [11430111] = "%s was an accomplished track and field athlete. He was both knowledgeable and authoritative on jogging.",
  [11430112] = "%s used to be a professional swimmer. He had little to no knowledge when it came to jogging.",
  [11430113] = "%s ran a few amateur marathons and came up with a few decent tips.",
  [11430114] = "%s rarely exercised. He didn't have any idea how to jog properly.",
  [11430119] = "We couldn't find an expert. Looks like we'll just have to make do with what's available on the Internet.",
  [11430120] = "Oh my, I can't believe I've been jogging wrong this entire time!",
  [11430200] = "The show played a few videos of everyday folks jogging. We need someone with a sharp eye to spot what is incorrect about their postures.",
  [11430211] = "%s is a very serious and careful person. He very quickly pointed out the issue within the video.",
  [11430212] = "%s is very observant but failed to find issues that were not as obvious.",
  [11430213] = "%s is an avid shoe collector. He only spotted the issue with the shoe that the jogger was wearing.",
  [11430214] = "%s watched a few videos and put himself to sleep.",
  [11430219] = "No one could point out what was wrong with the video, so the expert had to point it out for us.",
  [11430220] = "Now I will have a difficult time deciding which leg I lift first when I go jogging next time.",
  [11431000] = "Reports are coming in that parents are finding toys that could be mistaken for weapons in their children's backpacks. These reports beg the question, when will the under-regulated toy market see some much-needed regulations?",
  [11431001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11431002] = "Toys that are detrimental to the well-being of our children should not have a place on the store shelves.",
  [11431100] = "Despite strict regulations, toys resembling weapons still run rampant on the market. Our team has been sent in to uncover the story behind this shady industry.",
  [11431111] = "%s's undercover skill was top-notch. He quickly found the main supplier behind everything.",
  [11431112] = "%s was threatened halfway through the investigation and had to call it off early.",
  [11431113] = "%s followed false leads and went completely astray.",
  [11431114] = "%s had no idea where to begin.",
  [11431119] = "After a few days of investigation, nothing of value has been produced.",
  [11431120] = "Those who step over the law are bound to be punished by it.",
  [11431200] = "The show invited an expert to educate the public about the harm of weapon-like toys.",
  [11431211] = "%s is a renowned expert in the education industry. His words are both respected and authoritative.",
  [11431212] = "%s is well-known, but his friendly demeanor ill-suits a serious topic such as this.",
  [11431213] = "%s lacked any experience or fame. No one took his words seriously.",
  [11431214] = "%s was just part of a huge scandal. His appearance was not well-received.",
  [11431219] = "We couldn't find an expert to appear on the show. So, we couldn't achieve the effect we had in mind.",
  [11431220] = "The real weapon is the pursuit of justice within your heart and not the one in your hand.",
  [11431300] = "Gavin came back late into the wee hours with fatigue in his eyes after an entire day of going on dispatch. You gave him...",
  [11431301] = "A hand fan",
  [11431302] = "Body lotion",
  [11431303] = "Warm water",
  [11431311] = "Gavin shook his head and smiled. He grabbed what he needed himself.",
  [11431312] = "Gavin shook his head and smiled. He grabbed what he needed himself.",
  [11431313] = "You got this for me? Thanks.",
  [11432000] = "In recent news, the members of the Special Task Force presented flowers alongside many citizens at the Memorial Square.",
  [11432001] = "Many media were also on the scene to bear witness to this touching moment.",
  [11432002] = "Cherish the peace at hand, knowing that it came with a great cost.",
  [11432100] = "The Special Task Force invited a musician to play the famed Requiem to remember those who lost their lives.",
  [11432111] = "%s played the piece expertly and brought many to tears.",
  [11432112] = "%s wasn't on top of his game today, but finished playing regardless.",
  [11432113] = "%s wasn't very familiar with the piece and played a few notes wrong.",
  [11432114] = "%s was an amateur musician and completely botched the piece.",
  [11432119] = "We couldn't find a musician, so we had to play it off of a CD.",
  [11432120] = "May those who lost their lives find peace with this music.",
  [11432200] = "In the atmosphere of sorrow, someone tried to cause a commotion. In the pinch of the moment...",
  [11432211] = "%s quickly organized response and quelled the disturbance.",
  [11432212] = "%s ran into a few hitches but quickly brought the troublemakers into custody.",
  [11432213] = "%s couldn't deal with the disruption and had to pause the event and evacuate the crowd.",
  [11432214] = "%s couldn't bring the situation under control, and many citizens were injured.",
  [11432219] = "No one was able to mount a response in time, and the troublemakers got away unpunished.",
  [11432220] = "How dare someone try to ruin a solemn occasion such as this?",
  [11433000] = "There are so many books in the library. How are their serial numbers used to manage and organize them?",
  [11433001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11433002] = "I learned something new today! Felt like I became more knowledgeable!",
