  [11434000] = "The shooting of the popular spy movie \"Lurking\" finished this morning, which will come out in no time. But do you wonder if anything funny happened during the shoot?",
  [11434001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11434002] = "The wrap ceremony is officially over. Looking forward to \"Lurking\" being released!",
  [11434100] = "There must've been many special moments during the wrap ceremony. An experienced cameraman will be able to capture these moments.",
  [11434111] = "%s's photos are fun and heartwarming, which have been praised and forwarded crazily once they were released.",
  [11434112] = "%s's photos were beautiful but failed to capture the moments the audience was interested in and failed to draw any attention.",
  [11434113] = "%s is inexperienced in photography. The photos looked messy without any focus.",
  [11434114] = "%s is a complete photography newbie and took lots of blurry photos.",
  [11434119] = "I worked hard to take lots of photos, yet I lost my camera on the way home.",
  [11434120] = "Have you found the people you are interested in these photos?",
  [11434200] = "We arranged an interview with the cast and asked them about the funny things that happened during the shoot.",
  [11434211] = "%s is humorous and excellent at guiding the conversation, which helped to cheer the room up as they talked about the highlights.",
  [11434212] = "%s worked by the book. It's clear that the actors were a little reserved.",
  [11434213] = "%s kept interrupting the guests during the interview and got much criticism after it was released.",
  [11434214] = "%s got into a flight with the interviewees. The site descended into chaos.",
  [11434219] = "The interview got canceled, and the wrap ceremony ended early.",
  [11434220] = "Amusing interactions during the interview can increase the audience's interest in the film.",
  [11435000] = "There have been several cases of phone virus that controls the screen and steals passwords for illegal uses. We will continue to follow up on the specifics.",
  [11435001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11435002] = "Thank you for watching. Stay alert and away from scams.",
  [11435100] = "As the incident begins to fester, rumors about the phone virus circulate. Expert guidance is needed to remind people to discern what is true.",
  [11435111] = "%s has strong reasoning and logic and managed to debunk all the rumors with evidence.",
  [11435112] = "%s promoted a lot of tedious professional knowledge, not caring if the audience was interested or not.",
  [11435113] = "%s turns out to be another commercial writer who only knows how to draw people's attention and gave misleading guidance to the audience.",
  [11435114] = "%s is bad-tempered and engaged in a duel with an audience member with conflicting opinions. The show got suspended very quickly.",
  [11435119] = "The expert we hired was a charlatan who dropped out last minute, leaving us no guest to have on the show.",
  [11435120] = "Independent thinking is a critical skill.",
  [11435200] = "Our recent investigation drew the attention of criminal organizations. Several criminals attempted to mix in with the audience to cause chaos during the show.",
  [11435211] = "%s set up a strict security check at the entrance to check the audience's identity, leaving no room for the criminals to act.",
  [11435212] = "%s forcefully searched the audience and got many complaints.",
  [11435213] = "%s's loose security allowed some people to sneak in, which caused some trouble during the show.",
  [11435214] = "Many criminals sneaked into the shooting site and caused huge damage to the show.",
  [11435219] = "We are severely understaffed. All we can do is figure it out as we go.",
  [11435220] = "We will stand against evil despite the opposition.",
  [11436000] = "It is said that many young people have started to use their followed celebrity's social media as a tree hole, where they pour out their hearts in private messages. What reality does this trend reflect?",
  [11436001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [11436002] = "Many people long to be heard. Let's pay more attention to our inner voices and the people around us.",
  [11436100] = "The crew has conducted a series of comprehensive investigations regarding this trend.",
  [11436111] = "%s conducted a large-scale survey that produced comprehensive statistics and analysis of this trend.",
  [11436112] = "%s accidentally exposed interviewees' information during the investigation, which led to some trouble.",
  [11436113] = "%s's survey sample tends to be similar and not informative.",
  [11436114] = "%s encountered many hurdles during the investigation and eventually failed to carry it out.",
  [11436119] = "The investigation didn't get us anywhere. Let's just make up some stats to bluff it out.",
  [11436120] = "Will you ever confide in some strange \"tree hole\"?",
  [11436200] = "The crew invited a lively and lovely girl to share her experience.",
  [11436211] = "%s is such an excellent storyteller that her story immediately went viral once it was aired.",
  [11436212] = "%s's desperation to show off made his story unconvincing.",
  [11436213] = "%s was too nervous in front of the camera that he stammered the whole way through.",
  [11436214] = "%s was fine when he was reading the script, but then he panicked the whole time during the shoot.",
  [11436219] = "The person refused to be interviewed, so we could only change it to reading out the comments online.",
  [11436220] = "You might feel lonely at times but believe that you're not alone in this.",
  [11436300] = "Kiro accidentally cut himself while doing craft, so you found this in the cupboard...",
