  [11439220] = "Being a rational fan gives the celebrity the biggest support.",
  [11440000] = "It has become a new trend to book hospital appointments on the phone, but many citizens have found that well-known doctors will often be fully-booked as soon as there is availability. Our show will look into ways that may help with the medical supply shortage.",
  [11440001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
