  [12064113] = "%s sulks after getting a drop of juice on the expensive brand-new thread.",
  [12064114] = "%s is too good to touch such peasant grub.",
  [12064119] = "You can't even handle something as easy and cool as this? Well, step aside and let me show you!",
  [12064120] = "The heart warms by the fifth bowl.",
  [12064200] = "You need someone to discover the next great breakfast joint…",
  [12064211] = "%s combines keen research with legwork to uncover several hidden gems.",
  [12064212] = "%s recommends only hyped establishments lacking real substance.",
  [12064213] = "%s is ten pounds heavier when finally returning with a list.",
  [12064214] = "%s can't get up early in the morning to find any good breakfast place.",
  [12064219] = "Post information online for the establishments to contact the show directly.",
  [12064220] = "There's actually quite a lot of hidden gems in the city that no one knows about!",
  [12065000] = "I gained valuable experience from filming a competitive eating contest…",
  [12065001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [12065002] = "It's unbelievable how you can go from hungry to full just watching others eat.",
  [12065100] = "You need someone to eat alongside the competitors for sake of comparison…",
  [12065111] = "%s finishes regular portion like a normal person, illustrating the competitors' incredible capacity in contrast.",
  [12065112] = "%s gulps away relentlessly until throwing it all up.",
  [12065113] = "%s doesn't touch the food and tries to convince the competitors this is not healthy.",
  [12065114] = "%s unleashes potential and actually beats several of the competitors!",
  [12065119] = "You guys eat, we'll watch.",
  [12065120] = "Having a bottomless belly and hollow legs has to be the dream of many people.",
  [12065200] = "Who do you pick to run the promo campaign for the show?",
  [12065211] = "%s highlights the background and successes of every competitor.",
  [12065212] = "%s only shares the competitors' posts.",
  [12065213] = "%s wants to gather all the competitors and try to break an obscure world eating record.",
  [12065214] = "%s drags the competitors out to an unsanitary buffet and gets them sick.",
  [12065219] = "Just aim low and hope for the best.",
  [12065220] = "Note to self: Keep Horsome away from future food shows.",
  [12066000] = "It's a show featuring notable writers recommending books to read, a program that will benefit me greatly as well.",
  [12066001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [12066002] = "The man who does not read has no advantage over the man who cannot read.",
  [12066100] = "You seek a well-read guest to select and make reading recommendations.",
  [12066111] = "%s picks fascinating books with depth, and mesmerizes viewers with charming, humorous reviews.",
  [12066112] = "%s selects tomes with subjects too arcane and profound for the common masses.",
  [12066113] = "%s is just using the show to promote self.",
  [12066114] = "%s chooses banal, juvenile wastes of paper.",
  [12066119] = "No consultant hired, resulting in uneven quality in both books and recommendations.",
  [12066120] = "Maybe I should get around to reading some of the stacks cluttering my house…",
  [12066200] = "The show needs someone with a clear voice and good posture to read excerpts…",
  [12066211] = "%s motivates viewers to read with dramatic, polished recitals.",
  [12066212] = "%s doesn't have the best voice in the world…",
  [12066213] = "%s is too timid to read on air.",
  [12066214] = "%s gets too caught up in the book and forgets to read out loud.",
  [12066219] = "No reading of excerpts, which takes the show down a peg.",
  [12066220] = "We should do a bedtime story show with that great voice!",
  [12067000] = "It's my first time doing a major talent competition show and the butterflies in my tummy feel like the size of dragons.",
  [12067001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [12067002] = "Wow, there's no end to the variety of talent…",
  [12067100] = "You need someone to coordinate and oversee the show…",
  [12067111] = "%s makes arrangements according to the scope and restrictions of the show.",
  [12067112] = "%s is not a rational communicator and everyone bitches about not knowing what she wants.",
  [12067113] = "%s overlooks and ignores many a necessary detail.",
  [12067114] = "%s turns the show into a chaotic turd.",
  [12067119] = "No suitable candidate. The show is unable to proceed due to lack of management.",
  [12067120] = "Tells HR to consider a raise for the director.",
  [12067200] = "You need a tech to handle the stage lights…",
  [12067211] = "%s spotlights each participant perfectly to enhance their performance.",
  [12067212] = "%s has a muted style that falls short of the liveliness you're aiming for.",
  [12067213] = "%s mistimes the lighting and ruins the program.",
  [12067214] = "%s can't operate studio lights at all.",
  [12067219] = "The show uses one light throughout and bores the audience to tears.",
  [12067220] = "Behind every great performer is a great stage crew.",
  [12068000] = "Successful talk shows always built around a witty talker as the host. That's what I hope to get for my new talk show.",
  [12068001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [12068002] = "I feel like I'm walking on razor's edge and my show can be canceled at any moment...",
  [12068100] = "You need a quick, eloquent host who can deliver the funny on current events.",
  [12068111] = "%s has a sharp mind and sharper response to everything, and asks poignant follow-up questions. The show scores great ratings.",
  [12068112] = "%s asks the guests questions no one cares about.",
  [12068113] = "%s is not used to the fast pace and can't keep up with the guests, sometimes even being led around the nose by one.",
  [12068114] = "%s is not a amiable host and pisses off certain guests.",
  [12068119] = "No host. Maybe you can let the guests talk among themselves or have the audience interview them.",
  [12068120] = "Maybe the host can offer a pointer or two in case we have to go a round with the advertisers.",
  [12068200] = "You seek a capable editor who has an affinity for highlighting hot topics…",
  [12068211] = "%s has the skills to complement the host's style and timing, adding mirth to the humor and sarcasm.",
  [12068212] = "You got the wrong person, %s is a sound editor.",
  [12068213] = "%s is deliberate and methodic, not suitable for the break-neck pace of talk shows.",
  [12068214] = "%s has never used editing software before and is still stuck on XP operating system.",
  [12068219] = "A jumbled, incoherent mess of a show is what happens when you skim on editing.",
  [12068220] = "Even the most trivial stagehand should not be overlooked. Everyone is important.",
  [12069000] = "For a documentary on blueblood protocols, I contacted several traditional nobility butlers.",
  [12069001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [12069002] = "There were so many hoops to jump through that the shoot almost didn't happen.",
  [12069100] = "You need a seasoned, dignified butler to articulate the minutiae of noble life.",
  [12069111] = "%s is poised and even makes several excellent recommendations for the piece.",
  [12069112] = "%s is lacking as a butler.",
  [12069113] = "%s is leery about being on camera.",
  [12069114] = "%s is not a real butler and cons the show.",
  [12069119] = "Just do research and you'll have it covered.",
  [12069120] = "It doesn't sound like an easy life at all from the butler's description…",
  [12069200] = "You want to shoot a segment in a noble's house…",
  [12069211] = "%s welcomes you and the camera into their home.",
  [12069212] = "%s is a noble but never received any noble education or training.",
  [12069213] = "%s doesn't want his life shown to the rest of the world and snubs you.",
  [12069214] = "%s is very rich but not a noble.",
  [12069219] = "How are you going to demonstrate it without an expert or a noble?",
  [12069220] = "Actually, I feel nobility is a relic of the past.",
  [12070000] = "To advocate animal rights, I decide to shoot a film on humans and animals co-existing in harmony.",
  [12070001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [12070002] = "Protecting animals is not just a belief, but preserves the ecology of the world we live in. I hope the short feature will do it justice.",
  [12070100] = "You need a cameraman experienced with filming animals in adverse environments…",
  [12070111] = "%s is skillful at camouflaging the camera and gets vivid footages without ever disturbing the animals.",
  [12070112] = "%s shoots mostly unusable sequences.",
  [12070113] = "%s doesn't conceal the camera well enough, getting panda bites on the lens.",
  [12070114] = "%s doesn't take proper precautions and lets water get into the camera.",
  [12070119] = "You can't have a good movie without good camerawork.",
  [12070120] = "Pandas are so cute, I wish I could kiss one!",
  [12070200] = "To raise more awareness, you seek a star to sing the theme for postcredit…",
  [12070211] = "%s belts out a moving tune that leaves the audience in tears.",
  [12070212] = "%s sells records mostly on looks and is not a great singer.",
  [12070213] = "%s turns in a good song, but not compatible with the animal rights theme.",
  [12070214] = "%s keeps all prospective audience away with the song.",
  [12070219] = "No stars necessary as long as the song is good.",
  [12070220] = "Good music cost money too… All this spending is driving me to the poor house!",
  [12071000] = "You're sending reporters undercover at various manufacturers to investigate food safety and expose illegal or unsanitary productions.",
  [12071001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [12071002] = "This is my first time tackling the issue of food safety and it's a very important one, so I have to do a good job.",
  [12071100] = "Who do you choose to do undercover reporting?",
  [12071111] = "%s successfully gets the whole scandal on camera without the unscruplous manufacturer noticing.",
  [12071112] = "%s gets very fuzzy footages that cannot be aired.",
  [12071113] = "%s is discovered, takes a beating and removed from premise right off the bat.",
  [12071114] = "%s feels the assignment's too dangerous and declines.",
  [12071119] = "You do it yourself and, despite almost blowing the cover several times, manage to complete the job!",
  [12071120] = "Investigative reporting is both hard and dangerous!",
  [12071200] = "After airing, you need a bodyguard to protect the reporter from retribution…",
  [12071211] = "%s thrashes any thugs who try to exact vengeance until they quit.",
  [12071212] = "%s goes overboard and beat up some innocent bystanders too.",
  [12071213] = "%s can't fight and gets trashed.",
  [12071214] = "%s thinks the pay's too low and quits halfway through.",
  [12071219] = "Guess the whistleblower will have to carry a pepper spray.",
  [12071220] = "It's unfair for whistleblowers to be the targets of threats and derisions.",
  [12072000] = "It's a show that features stars trying to solve murder mysteries within a time limit.",
  [12072001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [12072002] = "You can't underestimate anyone's perception and intelligence.",
  [12072100] = "You need a logical person with knowledge of criminology to script the mysteries…",
  [12072111] = "%s scripts logical and exceptional whodunits.",
  [12072112] = "%s submits scripts heavy on romance, light on deduction.",
  [12072113] = "%s creates bland, illogical scenarios.",
  [12072114] = "%s rips off someone else's work that you can't legally use.",
  [12072119] = "It's no mystery why the show can't go on without a script.",
  [12072120] = "The scripts use real cases and real names… Hope we get them past Legal.",
  [12072200] = "You need someone to build the set for the show…",
  [12072211] = "%s builds a proper set with an ominous feel to it, even.",
  [12072212] = "%s paints the set like it's Romper Room.",
  [12072213] = "%s goes with an 18th century grand cathedral. Too bad that's not what the script calls for.",
  [12072214] = "%s gets hit on the skull by falling debris.",
  [12072219] = "You have to do your best building the set yourself.",
  [12072220] = "Pretty sure I won't need an interior designer when renovating my house anymore.",
  [12073000] = "This shows features a psychic solving guests' dilemmas and problems.",
  [12073001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [12073002] = "It's all up to you whether to belive it or not.",
  [12073100] = "You need a persuasive talker to convince a reclusive psychic to join the show…",
  [12073111] = "%s not only gets the psychic to join, but also a free reading for each member of the staff.",
  [12073112] = "%s gets a psychic who speaks too little throughout the show.",
  [12073113] = "%s gets kicked out by the psychic.",
  [12073114] = "%s doesn't return and instead becomes the psychic's assistant.",
  [12073119] = "You visit the psychic yourself to no avail.",
  [12073120] = "Get a psychic, I worry about credibility. If I don't, worry about show's future…",
  [12073200] = "You need another psychic to alleviate the workload…",
  [12073211] = "%s jumps in with both feet and wins many fans.",
  [12073212] = "%s says too little to have an impact on the show.",
  [12073213] = "%s spews only nonsense and gets fired.",
  [12073214] = "%s gets into a trance that last through the taping.",
  [12073219] = "Don't need psychic or soothsayer, switch to psychological tests instead.",
  [12073220] = "I'd like to ask what the psychic sees for my future romance...",
  [12074000] = "This show teaches the viewers to make the sweetest, yummiest desserts.",
  [12074001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [12074002] = "The taping's done, hope we get the word-of-mouth.",
  [12074100] = "You need an appealing and skilled dessert maker to host the show…",
  [12074111] = "%s has a down-home presence and makes tasty desserts.",
  [12074112] = "%s makes some odd dessert that doesn't seem appetizing.",
  [12074113] = "%s is too tense and ruins the dessert.",
  [12074114] = "%s epic fails and burns down the kitchen set.",
  [12074119] = "No professionals to host, so the mediocre desserts kill the ratings.",
  [12074120] = "Even the name of the program screams CALORIES.",
  [12074200] = "You need an editor to cut a promo for the show…",
  [12074211] = "%s captures the scenes that best convey the uniqueness of both the food and the show.",
  [12074212] = "%s adds complementary special effects in the promo but neglects to highlight the food.",
  [12074213] = "%s just haphazardously slaps a video together.",
  [12074214] = "%s spills water on the computer and ruins the footage.",
  [12074219] = "No promo clip, so you have to brainstorm your way out of this one.",
  [12074220] = "How can the publicity campaign be more tiring than producing the show itself?",
  [12075000] = "This show features the daily home life of a popular star.",
  [12075001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [12075002] = "It's more difficult to film than anyone imagined, since no one really wants to reveal every aspect of their private life.",
  [12075100] = "The show needs to feature a very well-known star to pull in ratings...",
  [12075111] = "%s draws a lot of fans and viewers to the program.",
  [12075112] = "%s works very well with you but is not quite well-known enough to get the ratings you're looking for.",
  [12075113] = "%s is extremely camera-shy and avoids it whenever possible.",
  [12075114] = "%s feels the pay is too low and brushes you off.",
  [12075119] = "Can't get anyone mega-popular, so you have to build a grassroot fanbase with the show.",
  [12075120] = "Sign autographs for me, you stud!",
  [12075200] = "You seek an excellent host who can light up the show…",
  [12075211] = "%s exhibits a lively style and pulls in unexpected demographics.",
  [12075212] = "%s is too serious for this kind of show.",
  [12075213] = "%s understands the target audience but is not an articulate speaker.",
  [12075214] = "%s is too busy gawking at the star to host the show.",
  [12075219] = "No host means bad transitions and segues. The project is shelved.",
  [12075220] = "Interesting hearing a host practicing tongue twisters for the first time!",
  [12076000] = "You invite a famous researcher to a show to discuss Chinese history.",
  [12076001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [12076002] = "There was a minor hiccup, but it was resolved quickly.",
  [12076100] = "The show need a well-learned, articulate historian…",
  [12076111] = "%s provides humorous and interesting facts authenticated by mainstream academia.",
  [12076112] = "%s tosses out one obscure, unproven theory after another.",
  [12076113] = "%s offers a dissertation more boring than a lecture.",
  [12076114] = "%s doesn't know history and offers complete nonsense.",
  [12076119] = "The program lays a goose egg. There goes any chance of a pay raise.",
  [12076120] = "It's not every day you get such a chance to learn something.",
  [12076200] = "You want a sound tech to provide apporpriate background tracks…",
  [12076211] = "%s does a great job of setting the mood and directing attention.",
  [12076212] = "%s uses only scary music to startle the audience throughout.",
  [12076213] = "%s turns up the volume and drowns out the panelist.",
  [12076214] = "%s gets too caught up in the speech and forgets to play any music.",
  [12076219] = "Don't need any technician if simple notes are all you're going to play.",
  [12076220] = "It's obvious how much music enhances the show in this instance.",
  [12077000] = "This show explores the pscyhology and effects behind cyber-bullying.",
  [12077001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [12077002] = "The program won't cover everything, but hope the effort that's there is satisfactory.",
  [12077100] = "You need someone to design a questionnaire to survey online behaviors...",
  [12077111] = "%s designs a survey that thoroughly determines different patterns in detail.",
  [12077112] = "%s sends out the wrong survey.",
  [12077113] = "%s turns in a questionnaire full of vague questions.",
  [12077114] = "%s has no idea how to create a survey.",
  [12077119] = "Don't need surveys, just poll a few web users.",
  [12077120] = "I hated it when people hand me a survey, but now it's my turn to hand them out.",
  [12077200] = "You need a web celeb who will be subjected to 20 anonymous users' live comments…",
  [12077211] = "%s comes on the program and reacts to the comments calmly.",
  [12077212] = "%s smashes the mic after reading negative posts.",
  [12077213] = "%s is not a web celeb and doesn't have any particular quality worthy of comments.",
  [12077214] = "%s regrets the decision to come on and forbids the show from airing the comments.",
  [12077219] = "Without the planned segment, the program gets a so-so rating.",
  [12077220] = "It's hard to control your emotions when someone can blast you behind an alias.",
  [12078000] = "This is a singing competition using only original songs, so you must invite singers who can also write good songs.",
  [12078001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [12078002] = "The high talent level of the participants makes elimination an especially difficult, heart-redning choice.",
  [12078100] = "You need a renowned prodigal muscian to be the judge…",
  [12078111] = "%s has a unique perspective on music and offers many excellent advice to the participants.",
  [12078112] = "%s takes bribes and compromises the show's fairness.",
  [12078113] = "%s seem to make decisions on a whim, causing the participants to revolt.",
  [12078114] = "%s doesn't know Beethoven from a bee hive.",
  [12078119] = "Maybe you can poll the audience for winners in a more casual format.",
  [12078120] = "Hmm, I do think having judges comes off as a bit snobby…",
  [12078200] = "You need a bandleader to lead the band for the participants' live performances…",
  [12078211] = "%s is a perfect bandleader who realizes the uniqueness in each song.",
  [12078212] = "%s can't lead ants through a picnic, missing every beat and rhythm.",
  [12078213] = "%s makes too many changes to the participants' songs and throws them off.",
  [12078214] = "%s doesn't know how to lead a band or improvise music.",
  [12078219] = "Participants have to sing their songs a capella. Awkward!",
  [12078220] = "Good background music can be an attractive gimmick too.",
  [12079000] = "This is a romance in which the leads met through \"The Snows of Kilimanjaro\", with the story revolving around the book.",
  [12079001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [12079002] = "Watching this makes me want to fall in love…",
  [12079100] = "You need a good-looking actor to play the male lead...",
  [12079111] = "%s is a genius actor and brings the role to life.",
  [12079112] = "%s is a hack who frustrates the director to no end.",
  [12079113] = "%s gets into a scandal two days into shooting, forcing you to get a new lead impromptu.",
  [12079114] = "%s can't act at all.",
  [12079119] = "You can't proceed with filming and the project is canceled.",
  [12079120] = "Wow, the lead is such a hunk now that I get to see him up close!",
  [12079200] = "You need a stylist for the cast…",
  [12079211] = "%s gives the cast distinctive styles fitting their characters.",
  [12079212] = "%s is the destroyer of all things holy and tasteful.",
  [12079213] = "%s takes too long and creates over-elaborate style.",
  [12079214] = "%s dresses the actors up like hobos.",
  [12079219] = "The wardrobe conflicts with characters to lessen the script.",
  [12079220] = "It's true, clothes do make a man.",
  [12080000] = "This program follows the migration of propoises to advocate protection of both endangered animals and the evironment.",
  [12080001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [12080002] = "Hope we can preserve the beauty of nature.",
  [12080100] = "You want an innocent cute kid to \"converse\" with a porpoise in the promo…",
  [12080111] = "%s's innocence in the scene with a \"smiling\" porpoise melts hearts everywhere.",
  [12080112] = "%s has a fierce countenance not suitable for the theme.",
  [12080113] = "%s's parents don't want their child in the promo.",
  [12080114] = "%s is a brat and quits halfway through.",
  [12080119] = "You don't need a child to show how friendly the porpoises are.",
  [12080120] = "It's not easy finding the perfect kid actor.",
  [12080200] = "You need someone to fix a camera drone that fell into the water now…",
  [12080211] = "%s repairs the drone and even adds waterproof measures.",
  [12080212] = "%s is an apprentice and new to the tech repair business.",
  [12080213] = "%s is prone to seasick, cannot come aboard the boat and must instruct you remotely.",
  [12080214] = "%s is away on another urgent business right now.",
  [12080219] = "The drone's out, so you'll be missing overhead shots.",
  [12080220] = "Crap, that's a couple thousand dollars down the drain!",
  [12081000] = "It's a show that puts people in dense jungles to test their limits. The premise sure sounds exciting.",
  [12081001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [12081002] = "I'm completely worn out. Let's take some time off and pick it back up later.",
  [12081100] = "You need someone who can navigate perils to lead the crew...",
  [12081111] = "%s guides the crew through the jungle safely.",
  [12081112] = "%s decides to provoke the monkeys and is soundly defeated.",
  [12081113] = "%s moves too fast and leaves the crew.",
  [12081114] = "%s tuckers out after ten minutes.",
  [12081119] = "Without a guide, the crew sprints through the jungle before any diaster can strike.",
  [12081120] = "We're going to need survival experts for the show to look cool.",
  [12081200] = "You need someone to feed the tired crew with a nice meal...",
  [12081211] = "%s cooks a great meal to fill everybody up.",
  [12081212] = "%s makes a soup with suspcious color…",
  [12081213] = "%s almost starts a bushfire.",
  [12081214] = "%s takes too much time trying to build a stone oven.",
  [12081219] = "No one cooks. Everyone loads up on dry rations.",
  [12081220] = "Compare to suspicious food, dry rations are a better choice.",
  [12082000] = "This is a documentary about psychological profilers. We went through a lot to get the rights, so I have to do it justice.",
  [12082001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [12082002] = "The theme exemplifies real life being stranger than fiction, and that helps to get the word out.",
  [12082100] = "You need a set replicated for the case, which took place last century.",
  [12082111] = "%s replicates the set perfectly.",
  [12082112] = "%s designs a flawed set that requires many takes.",
  [12082113] = "%s forgets to leave room for the camera and production crew on the set.",
  [12082114] = "%s just puts up a canvas with painted background.",
  [12082119] = "You forego set designer to save money. The result is unwatchable.",
  [12082120] = "Perfection requires attention to details.",
  [12082200] = "You need someone to run the promotion campaign…",
  [12082211] = "%s creates incredible buzz with a multimedia campaign.",
  [12082212] = "%s spends money and goes through the motions to little result.",
  [12082213] = "%s insinuates scandals involving the actors and torpedoes the film.",
  [12082214] = "%s spams every outlet and receives a tremendous backlash.",
  [12082219] = "The film can stand on its own without marketing if it is any good.",
  [12082220] = "Buried gems cannot sparkle.",
  [12083000] = "You finally find a geniune hypnotist to unshelf a project that's been in limbo for five long years!",
  [12083001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [12083002] = "This episode aims to cure viewers of their inability to fall asleep like it did for the director after years of insomnia!",
