  [12136200] = "A stylist is needed to design different looks for the Halloween ice cream cones.",
  [12136211] = "%s's design is an completely enlarged version of the Halloween ice cream cone. The big one and small one together look very cute!",
  [12136212] = "%s's design is green and integrates with the green screen. Photoshop can't save it at all...",
  [12136213] = "%s's design is too serious and not cute at all. The manufacturer is not satisfied with it.",
  [12136214] = "The costumes %s provided are borrowed from the crew next door. And they come to get these costumes before finishing shooting...",
  [12136219] = "The manufacturer has ready-made costumes. Let's just borrow them!",
  [12136220] = "Although there is no special design, the costumes made by the manufacturer are also very cute.",
  [12137000] = "This program sets dance competitions for male and female guests. They are divided in groups and can try various dances.",
  [12137001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind….",
  [12137002] = "Dance! Dance! Dance! Create a whole new world in dance!",
  [12137100] = "A stylist is needed to make fantastic dance costumes for everyone.",
  [12137111] = "%s makes a dance dress with a hidden secret. When the female contestant jumps up, the gorgeous lining flashes through the air like a dream!",
  [12137112] = "The dress %s made is too long and the female contestant trips several times.",
  [12137113] = "The dress %s made is too revealing to be shown on TV.",
  [12137114] = "%s mistakes the costumes for different contestants, and messes everything up.",
  [12137119] = "Guests wish to prepare the costumes for the competition themselves.",
  [12137120] = "Guests prefer to wear their own costumes so let's them prepare for themselves.",
  [12137200] = "An assistant is needed to arrange the order to appear on stage for contestants.",
  [12137211] = "%s is conscientious and responsible and can communicate smoothly with all the contestants and makes no mistakes.",
  [12137212] = "%s misremembers the order of the contestants and almost delays recording.",
  [12137213] = "%s can't handle the disputes among the stars and doesn't know who is the last one appearing on the stage.",
  [12137214] = "%s goes to the rest room of another program to look for guests.",
  [12137219] = "You take charge of communication and finally convince all the stars.",
  [12137220] = "I guess I've got a great aura!",
  [12138000] = "This program invites guests to re-experience the mysterious cases in the past and uncover the hidden truth.",
  [12138001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [12138002] = "It makes my heart thump wildly!",
  [12138100] = "For restoring the scenes, a prop expert is needed to make props for shooting.",
  [12138111] = "The props %s provided are very close to the original ones, and some people even write articles to praise the scenes after broadcasting.",
  [12138112] = "%s brings the wrong props, which are of no use to the recording.",
  [12138113] = "The props %s prepared are too bloody to be shown on TV.",
  [12138114] = "%s even faints at the sight of the fake blood bag.",
  [12138119] = "Fortunately, the program crew has prepared some props for the trailer and can be borrowed.",
  [12138120] = "But they can't restore the details...",
  [12138200] = "A host is needed to record the voice-over to create a good atmosphere.",
  [12138211] = "%s seems to whisper in the ears of the audience, dragging them into the atmosphere of the scene in an instant.",
  [12138212] = "%s keeps coughing while recording the voice-over, and the recording is interrupted several times.",
  [12138213] = "%s speaks with an accent, which makes the audience laugh and ruins the atmosphere.",
  [12138214] = "%s mispronounces countless words and gets complained about after broadcasting.",
  [12138219] = "The guests record the voice-over themselves.",
  [12138220] = "The audience will be able to immerse themselves better!",
  [12139000] = "Faced with the loss of traditional handicraft, we go to the south of the Yangtze River to see the classic embroidery.",
  [12139001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind….",
  [12139002] = "The traditional Chinese culture is so dazzling!",
  [12139100] = "A historian is needed to write voice-over for the documentary.",
  [12139111] = "%s talks about the history of embroidery in a funny and humorous way. People can learn a lot from it.",
  [12139112] = "%s doesn't know the history of embroidery at all, and the voice-over is full of mistakes.",
  [12139113] = "%s's commentary is so obscure that the ordinary audience can hardly understand it, and finally almost all the content is deleted.",
  [12139114] = "%s uses vulgar language and does not know the history of embroidery at all.",
  [12139119] = "Let's ask the embroidery expert in the documentary to provide the commentary.",
  [12139120] = "Why do you reject what is near at hand and seek what is far away?",
  [12139200] = "The documentary needs a series of posters to match. Who will design them?",
  [12139211] = "%s makes a series of posters in the form of embroidery, which are reposted by the audience crazily.",
  [12139212] = "The words on the posters that %s made are too small to be read at all.",
  [12139213] = "%s spends a whole night rendering one poster and ends up making only that one.",
  [12139214] = "The posters %s made are found out to be plagiarized. The film crew fires him immediately.",
  [12139219] = "Let's pick some beautiful embroidery pictures as the poster background.",
  [12139220] = "The embroidery works are so beautiful that they can be used without Photoshop!",
  [12140000] = "What if the babies wet their pants? Don't panic, Love Baby can help! Love Baby asks us to shoot an ad for their diapers.",
  [12140001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind….",
  [12140002] = "If you love your baby, buy her Love Baby diapers!",
  [12140100] = "A parenting blogger will have his son shoot the ad and promote the brand online.",
  [12140111] = "%s photographs a series of pictures of the blogger's son wearing diapers. People love the baby and repost those pictures one after another.",
  [12140112] = "Oh, no! %s dresses the blogger's son in the diaper of a rival brand!",
  [12140113] = "%s publicizes it in a low-key way. Even fans don't notice the brand of the diaper that the baby wears...",
  [12140114] = "%s takes the money but has done nothing and even puts the program crew in the blacklist.",
  [12140119] = "Invite the son of the manufacturer to be in the ad directly!",
  [12140120] = "He is a second-generation rich child, a future CEO!",
  [12140200] = "A childcare expert is invited to guide the baby to cooperate with the shooting.",
  [12140211] = "The baby makes lovely movements in the diaper under the patient instruction and careful guidance of %s. Great!",
  [12140212] = "The baby pays no attention to %s and is absorbed in playing with toys...",
  [12140213] = "%s persuades the baby for a long time, and the baby is finally willing to wear the diaper but looks unhappy.",
  [12140214] = "Instead of letting the baby cooperate, %s scolds the baby angrily.",
  [12140219] = "The parents come and solve the problem instantly!",
  [12140220] = "It seems that parents are more experienced!",
  [12141000] = "This is a documentary exploring the stories behind the \"white mask\". What are the doctors thinking? Let's find out together today.",
  [12141001] = "No more new ideas in my head. Just as my brain slowly rusted, a figure gradually appeared in my mind…",
  [12141002] = "Hold the hope of life!",
  [12141100] = "You need a doctor to provide you with the necessary background knowledge.",
  [12141111] = "%s is very experienced and gives the crew a great help!",
  [12141112] = "%s's words are too difficult to understand and get all people on the spot confused.",
  [12141113] = "%s is quick in actions but slow in talk.",
  [12141114] = "%s makes a basic medical knowledge mistake and gets refuted by another doctor at the site.",
  [12141119] = "You decide to directly consult the director of the cooperative hospital.",
  [12141120] = "The real expert is just next door!",
  [12141200] = "You need a professional interviewer to discuss with the doctors.",
  [12141211] = "%s's interview is humorous with solid foundational knowledge, impressing even the most introverted doctors.",
  [12141212] = "%s is busy talking, leaving no time for the doctors to chip in.",
  [12141213] = "%s has nothing to talk with the interviewees not long after the program begins. Everyone feels awkward...",
  [12141214] = "Knowing that there is no chance of appearing on the TV, %s immediately becomes listless and refuses to say anything.",
  [12141219] = "You decide to interview on your own. After all, you don't need to show up.",
  [12141220] = "After planning the program with the crew, I've gained a lot of professional knowledge. I'm perfect for this role!",
  [12142000] = "This documentary restores real cases to test people's vigilance and true reaction when facing dangers.",
  [12142001] = "No more new ideas in my head. Just as my brain slowly rusted, a figure gradually appeared in my mind…",
  [12142002] = "The sunniest places often hide the deepest darkness.",
  [12142100] = "You need a detective to design the dangerous plots for people.",
  [12142111] = "%s's plots are based on rich experiences, which is true to life and has many unexpected twists.",
  [12142112] = "The plots designed by %s are so common that even old ladies know how to deal with these dangers.",
  [12142113] = "%s's plots are of a powerful and unconstrained style, making the audience confused.",
  [12142114] = "%s arbitrarily added too many romantic plots, turning the criminal investigation documentary into a romantic drama.",
  [12142119] = "Just ask the program team to write the plots on their own on the basis of the real cases.",
  [12142120] = "Never thought a detective would love watching an idol drama...",
  [12142200] = "You need an art designer to make a set of posters. Who will you pick?",
  [12142211] = "%s's posters are of good quality, people can't help thinking about the story behind after seeing them.",
  [12142212] = "%s's posters are too childish to fit the atmosphere.",
  [12142213] = "%s's posters are too gloomy for publicity...",
  [12142214] = "%s's posters are actually pirated, and the crew is sued for a lot of money.",
  [12142219] = "You decide to use the screenshots of the highlighted moments in the documentary as posters.",
  [12142220] = "Documentaries should be true to daily life.",
  [12143000] = "This is a documentary about the last generation of 'Bang-Bang Army' in Chongqing, the freelance Chinese laborers who endure grueling work with little pay.  ",
  [12143001] = "There are too many disguises in the world... I was tired of staying perfect. When I was dispirited, I suddenly remembered what he said...",
  [12143002] = "Shoulder the burden of life and take on the future!",
  [12143100] = "Chongqing is a famously hilly city. Choose an energetic photographer to follow the filming.",
  [12143111] = "%s climbs 300 steps without panting and perfectly keeps up with the footsteps of the laborers.",
  [12143112] = "%s is exhausted after shooting for a little while.",
  [12143113] = "%s can barely keep up, but the heavy breathing is all recorded in the documentary.",
  [12143114] = "%s quits after seeing the steep mountains.",
  [12143119] = "You decide to hire a bang-bang army on the street as the cameraman.",
  [12143120] = "Can the laborers quickly learn how to use the camera?",
  [12143200] = "The bang-bang army speaks the local dialect, so you need a linguist to facilitate communication.",
  [12143211] = "%s perfectly and effortlessly switches between different languages, bringing us a lot of fun.",
  [12143212] = "%s is hot-tempered and begin to quarrel with the laborers  soon.",
  [12143213] = "%s speaks a similar but different dialect. The process goes not very smoothly.",
  [12143214] = "%s doesn't say a word, creating an awkward situation.",
  [12143219] = "You have to communicate with them with your broken Chinese.",
  [12143220] = "Nothing to fear if you master more than one language!",
  [12144000] = "With the development of the Internet, more and more teens are addicted to the Internet.",
  [12144001] = "There are too many disguises in the world... I was tired of staying perfect. When I was dispirited, I suddenly remembered what he said...",
  [12144002] = "Being virtual and reality are two sides of the same coin.",
  [12144100] = "You need an online celebrity to promote the documentary. Who will you choose?",
  [12144111] = "%s wrote some marketing articles in a funny way by combining personal experience, soon making the documentary popular.",
  [12144112] = "%s's articles are too humorless that they render people reluctant to watch them.",
  [12144113] = "%s's boastful hype disgusts the audience.",
  [12144114] = "%s sneers at teen Internet addiction in the slogan, causing a backlash from the audience.",
  [12144119] = "You decide to write the slogan on your own.",
  [12144120] = "Online celebrities are still not as good as marketing professionals.",
  [12144200] = "You need a psychologist to talk with the teens. Who will you choose?",
  [12144211] = "%s is patient and knows how to get close to the teens, winning their trust soon.",
  [12144212] = "Crossing the legs and holding a lit cigarette, %s leaves the teens a bad impression.",
  [12144213] = "%s has done several psychological interviews for many days and still can't distinguish the teens.",
  [12144214] = "%s does the job out of personal preference, causing a conflict among the teens.",
  [12144219] = "You ask an agony aunt to communicate with the teens, but she is ignored by the teens.",
  [12144220] = "Come have a heart-to-heart talk with your very own agony aunt!",
  [12145000] = "This is a reality show about stars taking on a survival challenge and joining hands to survive on an uninhabited island.",
  [12145001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [12145002] = "If only we survive in this world, I hope we could make it through together!",
  [12145100] = "You need a doctor to watch for possible injuries in the wilderness.",
  [12145111] = "%s cannot only deal with emergency injuries, but also gets well prepared for other risks such as mosquitoes and beasts.",
  [12145112] = "%s doesn't carry all the basic and necessary medicines!",
  [12145113] = "%s is a surgeon who only knows to perform operations.",
  [12145114] = "%s shies away from work and is nowhere to be seen when the guests get hurt.",
  [12145119] = "The budget is tight, let the team doctor do this job...",
  [12145120] = "It's too thrifty to do this...",
  [12145200] = "You need a drone operator to shoot the life of the guests on the island. Who will you choose?",
  [12145211] = "%s is proficient in controlling the drone and the shooting is extremely fascinating.",
  [12145212] = "%s isn't skilled at controlling the drone, making the shots unstable and constantly swaying.",
  [12145213] = "%s focuses on shooting the sceneries and forgets to shoot the guests.",
  [12145214] = "%s made a mistake and broke the drone, embarrassing the entire production team.",
  [12145219] = "Let that guy who has experience in operating aircraft model to do the job.",
  [12145220] = "Can he really take on the job?",
  [12146000] = "This is a program about guests seizing every minute and second to save the world when the doomsday is coming.",
  [12146001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [12146002] = "Your actions will save the world!",
  [12146100] = "You need an expert to design more interesting tasks. Who will you choose?",
  [12146111] = "The tasks designed by %s are both thrilling and distinctive, letting the guests fight until the last second.",
  [12146112] = "The tasks designed by %s are so easy that the guests complete them without effort, making people on the spot stupefied.",
  [12146113] = "The tasks designed by %s are too long to be completed on time...",
  [12146114] = "The tasks designed by %s are so dangerous that some guests get injured as a result.",
  [12146119] = "Fortunately, the guests are experienced enough to successfully complete the tasks on time.",
  [12146120] = "Thanks to the guests, otherwise the program can't go on.",
  [12146200] = "You need an agent to recommend the right guest for you. Who will you choose?",
  [12146211] = "%s's candidate is the right person in terms of both ability and sense of variety.",
  [12146212] = "%s's candidate is high in IQ but poor in physical strength, and can't persist in the middle of the journey.",
  [12146213] = "%s's candidate doesn't fit variety shows, making the program boring.",
  [12146214] = "%s doesn't want to be the man behind the scene. It makes people feel helpless.",
  [12146219] = "You decide to let the director contact the guests he is familiar with.",
  [12146220] = "It's difficult to find a suitable guest nowadays...",
  [12147000] = "This is a doomsday survival program. When the last day comes, everyone has to find a way to survive.",
  [12147001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [12147002] = "There is just one right way!",
  [12147100] = "You need an experienced designer to design the scenes. Who will you choose?",
  [12147111] = "The scenes designed by %s are extremely diverse, each of which is filled with interesting challenges.",
  [12147112] = "The scenes designed by %s are so complicated that it almost makes the program go bankrupt.",
  [12147113] = "The scenes designed by %s are so unremarkable that people get no interest.",
  [12147114] = "%s hasn't completed the design on time, forcing the program to be suspended.",
  [12147119] = "You decide to let the program crew design the scenes themselves, however, it delays the progress.",
  [12147120] = "There is strength in numbers!",
  [12147200] = "You need an expert to draw the road map. Who will you choose?",
  [12147211] = "%s's road map shows different routes in 3D, which is interesting and challenging.",
  [12147212] = "%s's road map is full of mistakes and is roasted by the audience.",
  [12147213] = "%s's road map is too regular to interest the audience.",
  [12147214] = "%s's road map is basically a simple line-drawing, making people disappointed.",
  [12147219] = "You decide to draw the road map on your own. After all, you're talented at drawing since childhood.",
  [12147220] = "I'm a painting genius!",
  [12148000] = "This is a fictional variety show. As the doomsday comes, guests must eliminate members from other groups in order to survive.",
  [12148001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [12148002] = "There are no permanent friends or permanent enemies, only permanent interests!",
  [12148100] = "You want to shoot a trailer to attract the audience. Who will you choose?",
  [12148111] = "%s's trailer is good enough to be played in the movie festival!",
  [12148112] = "%s's trailer spoiled the movie and there's no suspense left.",
  [12148113] = "%s made the trailer into a short science popularization movie, which doesn't match the tension of the doomsday.",
  [12148114] = "%s's trailer is so long that all TV stations are reluctant to show it.",
  [12148119] = "The director of the program tells you that he can edit the trailer himself.",
  [12148120] = "Not everyone can be an editor.",
  [12148200] = "You need a psychologist to interpret the guest's behavior. Who will you choose?",
  [12148211] = "%s's analysis is crafty and accurate, making the audience enlightened at once.",
  [12148212] = "%s keeps asking strange things and turns out to be a fortune teller instead of a psychologist.",
  [12148213] = "%s's analysis is always off-topic and judging people by their appearance.",
  [12148214] = "%s crazily disses all players, as if only he can make the right choice.",
  [12148219] = "It's better to let the guests talk about their feelings instead of looking for someone to analyze them blindly.",
  [12148220] = "I have nothing to say about the so-called experts...",
  [12149000] = "It's a fictional variety show about people finding clues to get out of a dark chamber after the doomsday.",
  [12149001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [12149002] = "The most frightening thing is not the darkness but the unknown.",
  [12149100] = "You need a cameraman experienced in night shooting. Who will you choose?",
  [12149111] = "%s is very clear about how to arrange cameras in the dark to achieve the best effect, and the completed film is brilliant.",
  [12149112] = "%s arranged the cameras so far away that audience could not even see the faces of the guests.",
  [12149113] = "%s arranged the cameras so close that all images are blurred.",
  [12149114] = "%s forgot to turn the cameras into night vision mode, making the completed film in pitch dark.",
  [12149119] = "The program spent a huge sum on their own night vision cameras. Anyway, they will use them in the future!",
  [12149120] = "The money has to be spent...",
  [12149200] = "You need a composer to write music for the program. Who will you choose?",
  [12149211] = "The dark atmosphere pairing with %s's sometimes depressing and sometimes exciting music makes people completely addicted.",
  [12149212] = "%s wrote a children's song for the program. How embarrassing!",
  [12149213] = "%s's music is so emotional and entangled that people think it's a love story instead of a doomsday variety show.",
  [12149214] = "%s's music is so noisy that the guests can't hear each other.",
  [12149219] = "You decide to use a suspense film's soundtrack directly.",
  [12149220] = "Good music is half done!",
  [12150000] = "The program restores the monsters we imagined in our childhood to give the guests a \"big surprise\".",
  [12150001] = "No more new ideas in my head. Just as my brain slowly rusted, a figure gradually appeared in my mind…",
  [12150002] = "The monsters under the bed are let out!",
  [12150100] = "You need an online celebrity to help you with the marketing.",
  [12150111] = "%s's stories are both frightening and intriguing, making them indulged in this program.",
  [12150112] = "%s's stories are so bloody that they get reported by someone...",
  [12150113] = "%s's stories are too outdated...",
  [12150114] = "%s is indulged in posting selfies and doesn't care if the stories meet the requirements.",
  [12150119] = "Since it's about childhood imagination, everybody can contribute their own childhood fantasies.",
  [12150120] = "We all have our own stories.",
  [12150200] = "You need a lighting operator to create an occult atmosphere. Who will you choose?",
  [12150211] = "%s's lighting is like a fantasy, making it hard to distinguish if it's the reality or a childhood dream.",
  [12150212] = "%s's lighting is so bright that people can see the guests' pores clearly and fails to create an occult atmosphere.",
  [12150213] = "%s's lighting is too dim to see anything clearly...",
  [12150214] = "%s's lighting keeps flickering, turning the scene a ballroom in the 1990s.",
  [12150219] = "Just use filament lamps, the most common light source in childhood. It's more realistic.",
  [12150220] = "I get to know that lighting is also important.",
  [12151000] = "It's a supernatural adventure show about guests spending 24 hours in ruins that have been abandoned for years.",
  [12151001] = "No more new ideas in my head. Just as my brain slowly rusted, a figure gradually appeared in my mind…",
  [12151002] = "You're...the...only...one here!",
  [12151100] = "You need a local person to look for ruins with paranormal phenomena. Who will you choose?",
  [12151111] = "%s found out the ruins that have been abandoned for more than 50 years and all of them meet the shooting standards.",
  [12151112] = "%s found a dilapidated building. For safety reasons, the guests did not enter it eventually.",
  [12151113] = "The ruin that %s recommended is next to a large pig farm, and the grunting of the pigs ruined the atmosphere of terror.",
  [12151114] = "The ruin that %s recommended turns out to be a commercial haunted house.",
  [12151119] = "You decide to search for occult ruins online on your own.",
  [12151120] = "Folk legends sources from the people.",
  [12151200] = "You need a host to act as a voiceover announcer to the guests. Who will you choose?",
  [12151211] = "%s's hosting is like whispering in ears, giving people a supernatural experience.",
  [12151212] = "%s is so focused on the guests that all the audience get confused.",
  [12151213] = "%s's accent is so heavy that the audience can't feel any sense of terror at all...",
  [12151214] = "%s ignores the guests and starts to boast himself.",
  [12151219] = "How awkward...",
  [12151220] = "The voiceover is too much...",
  [12152000] = "This is a program that invites guests to talk about their supernatural experience.",
  [12152001] = "No more new ideas in my head. Just as my brain slowly rusted, a figure gradually appeared in my mind…",
  [12152002] = "Mysterious events may happen in every moment of your daily life.",
  [12152100] = "You need an appropriate host to interview the guests. Who will you choose?",
  [12152111] = "%s has an in-depth interview with the guests, digging into details that the guests themselves are unaware of.",
  [12152112] = "%s keeps talking about personal supernatural experience and doesn't listen to the guests.",
  [12152113] = "%s keeps yawning during the interview due to lack of sleep.",
  [12152114] = "%s is a complete atheist and constantly refutes the guests while shooting.",
  [12152119] = "You decide to let the guests talk about their experience with each other.",
  [12152120] = "The guests have a good chat. It seems that there is no need for a host at all.",
  [12152200] = "You need an expert to interpret the supernatural experience. Who will you choose?",
  [12152211] = "%s appropriately interprets every guest's story in details and wins their trust.",
  [12152212] = "%s tells all guests that they will have a bad luck, making all of them unhappy.",
  [12152213] = "%s mixes up the stories of guests and almost makes a big joke...",
  [12152214] = "%s is a stutter and is too nervous to talk on TV.",
  [12152219] = "Just let the audience interpret the stories on their own.",
  [12152220] = "Not everyone can do this job.",
  [12153000] = "This program is devoted to collecting all kinds of ghost stories and legends all over the world.",
  [12153001] = "No more new ideas in my head. Just as my brain slowly rusted, a figure gradually appeared in my mind…",
  [12153002] = "We see, we believe, we record.",
  [12153100] = "Choose a guest to talk about ghost stories from his own unique perspective.",
  [12153111] = "%s's rich experience, courage and unique personal charisma deeply move the audience.",
  [12153112] = "%s seems to be a common person and doesn't show any unique perspective.",
  [12153113] = "%s is immersed in his own world and refuses to communicate with mortals.",
  [12153114] = "%s seems to have been hypnotized and keeps muttering a few words repeatedly. People doubt if he is mentally sick.",
  [12153119] = "Let's invite someone normal.",
  [12153120] = "Though valuable, uniqueness also brings troubles...",
  [12153200] = "You need a diviner to predict the ending of the stories and legends. Who will you choose?",
  [12153211] = "%s's predictions are interesting and bold, and some of them have been proven to be true later.",
  [12153212] = "%s's divination is just the repetition of known information.",
  [12153213] = "%s's divination is too blurred to satisfy the audience.",
  [12153214] = "%s's divination is fabricated that even the crew members are speechless.",
  [12153219] = "Just leave the stories with open endings.",
  [12153220] = "Better to keep the ending unknown...",
