  [13218220] = "Why would Lucien come to me for that... Maybe he just wanted to talk to me?",
  [13219000] = "We launch the promotion on social media, and everybody is on pins and needles waiting for the response…",
  [13219001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [13219002] = "The images got people talking online. Here's to awareness and more help for the kids.",
  [13219100] = "You want to talk to sponsors about buying headlines on social media…",
  [13219111] = "%s thinks it's an honor and a pleasure to do so.",
  [13219112] = "%s isn't into charities and refuses.",
  [13219113] = "%s thinks you're a busybody and becomes biased toward you.",
  [13219114] = "%s takes the opportunity to smear your rep.",
  [13219119] = "You reconsider going to the sponsors and squeeze funding out of your budget.",
  [13219120] = "Hope this will help the kids.",
  [13219200] = "While watching you work in the office, Lucien falls asleep on your shoulder…",
  [13219211] = "You don't want to wake him up so you sit still for two hours and can't feel your left shoulder.",
  [13219214] = "You nudge Lucien awake and tell him to head home if he's tired.",
  [13219219] = "You forget Lucien is on your shoulder so you get up as usual and tweaks his neck.",
  [13219220] = "This is my first time seeing him letting his guard down. He has trust in me…",
  [13220000] = "The program is well-received. Lucien and I go back to the school with gifts sent in by viewers.",
  [13220001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [13220002] = "The images got people talking online. Here's to awareness and more help for the kids.",
  [13220100] = "You want to bring someone in costume along for the Halloween visit...",
  [13220111] = "%s has been a soothsayer since childhood and makes the children happy with her arrival.",
  [13220112] = "%s is so fake as in a witch costume that no kid likes her.",
  [13220113] = "%s dons a makeup scary enough to put many kids in tears.",
  [13220114] = "%s doesn't like crowded place and declines to go.",
  [13220119] = "You scrap the idea in favor of witch stickers, but the kids still like it.",
  [13220120] = "The children are simply adorable!",
  [13220200] = "Lucien waltzes over in a vampire costume, bows and asks you to dance...",
  [13220211] = "You give him your hand with a smile, \"Certainly, my vampire prince!\"",
  [13220214] = "You wave your hands and tell him you don't dance.",
  [13220219] = "Before you can say anything, a little girl runs up to him and starts dancing with him.",
  [13220220] = "I can't dance, but I don't mind letting Lucien see what a klutz I am…",
  [13221000] = "I'm making a psychological thriller with Lucien on board as consultant. It's already been announced online.",
  [13221001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [13221002] = "The publicity stills look very good. This is my first thriller so cross my fingers!",
  [13221100] = "You need someone to write a good screenplay...",
  [13221111] = "%s weaves an exciting plot that holds a lot of promise.",
  [13221112] = "%s writes a boring script that you can hardly read through.",
  [13221113] = "%s has too much violence and gore in the script for your taste.",
  [13221114] = "%s turns in a story heavy with racial prejudice that you reject immedately.",
  [13221119] = "No suitable candidate so you go with an unknown. It's an average work.",
  [13221120] = "The screenplay is the soul of a movie!",
  [13221200] = "You're discussing the script with Lucien when you get close and lock eyes…",
  [13221211] = "Lucien cracks a huge smile and tell you that you have beautiful eyes…",
  [13221214] = "You avert your eyes. Lucien smiles and doesn't seem surprised.",
  [13221219] = "You're too close and knock noggins with Lucien.",
  [13221220] = "First time so close to him… Be still my heart!",
  [13222000] = "We got a lot of work today, including script meeting and cast photos!",
  [13222001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [13222002] = "OK, the groundwork's been laid, now we can start filming!",
  [13222100] = "You need someone to play the lead who's obsessed with plastic surgeries…",
  [13222111] = "%s has the defined, good-looking face perfect for the role.",
  [13222112] = "%s has a very natural look not suitable for the role.",
  [13222113] = "%s declines because the role might hurt own image.",
  [13222114] = "%s is asking a price you can't afford.",
  [13222119] = "You're forced to put makeup on an extra as stand-in. It's just not the same…",
  [13222120] = "I'm actually open-minded about plastic surgery. To each her own, I say.",
  [13222200] = "You see Lucien is oblivious reading a book and want to make him jump…",
  [13222211] = "You tap him on the back and startles him. He turns and smiles at you.",
  [13222214] = "He shoots up from the seat and scans the surrounding, but remains guarded even after finding out it was you.",
  [13222219] = "You pause, think you're not close to him to pull such a prank yet and sneak away.",
  [13222220] = "It's not often I see Lucien distraught, and it's actually cute!",
  [13223000] = "The filming starts today and it should be good with all the preparations in place.",
  [13223001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [13223002] = "Everybody is getting more focused as the filming proceeds.",
  [13223100] = "You need a foreign actor for a role in the movie...",
  [13223111] = "%s has an opening in schedule and is glad to help.",
  [13223112] = "%s has a full schedule and can't make it.",
  [13223113] = "%s has dyed hair and isn't actually a foreigner.",
  [13223114] = "%s thinks the movie's budget isn't big enough and turns you down.",
  [13223119] = "No one suitable so you change the role.",
  [13223120] = "I can't wait to see the final release!",
  [13223200] = "A petal falls on your head as you and Lucien talk under a tree…",
  [13223211] = "Lucien moves in and gently takes the petal off your head.",
  [13223214] = "He points at your head. You reach and feel a petal.",
  [13223219] = "Someone calls for you. You turn around and the petal falls off.",
  [13223220] = "When Lucien moved close to me, I thought he was gonna… What did I think that?",
  [13224000] = "We're getting close to a wrap, must remember to thank Lucien for his help.",
  [13224001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [13224002] = "What a great movie! I'm at a loss for words!",
  [13224100] = "You need someone to compose the theme for the movie…",
  [13224111] = "%s creates a moving score that's sure to be a hit!",
  [13224112] = "%s composes a strange patchwork of notes.",
  [13224113] = "%s makes a theme too pedestrian to stand out.",
  [13224114] = "%s scores a theme completely incompatible with the movie.",
  [13224119] = "You use a newbie. The theme is only so-so.",
  [13224120] = "I don't know much about music, so I think pretty highly of composers…",
  [13224200] = "You notice Lucien's shirt collar is up during his cameo for the movie...",
  [13224211] = "You go over and fix his collar for him. He looks at you and you can feel his warm breaths…",
  [13224214] = "You shake your head and signal the stylist to fix his collar.",
  [13224219] = "You think it may be the latest fashion trend and say nothing.",
  [13224220] = "I want to be coddled in Lucien's warm embrace...",
  [13225000] = "I'm attending the movie's premiere with Lucien. I hope it does blockbuster box office!",
  [13225001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [13225002] = "The movie is successful thanks to Lucien. I'm so happy and grateful!",
  [13225100] = "You need someone to design a dress for walking the red carpet...",
  [13225111] = "%s picks out a long elegant dress for you that stuns the crowd.",
  [13225112] = "%s chooses a dress that clashes with the red carpet.",
  [13225113] = "%s selects an ugly drab-green dress. You look like a green chili.",
  [13225114] = "%s gives you a revealing dress showing too much skin. You're not wearing that.",
  [13225119] = "You don't think you're an actual entertainer so you decline the invite.",
  [13225120] = "It's so exciting and nervous at the same time walking the red carpet!",
  [13225200] = "You're getting congratulatory kisses all around when Lucien walks to you...",
  [13225211] = "He takes your hand, kisses it and whispers, \"You look beautiful tonight, miss.\"",
  [13225214] = "He waves at you. You relax. It's just a friendly peck.",
  [13225219] = "He walks past you to talk to a person behind you.",
  [13225220] = "I can't help but always look for Lucien.",
  [13226000] = "I'm making a documentary about the brain with Lucien on the production crew.",
  [13226001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [13226002] = "Preproduction is ready and trailer has been released.",
  [13226100] = "You need someone to borrow models of brains and medical devices from a hospital…",
  [13226111] = "%s gets the hospital to lend you everything you needed.",
  [13226112] = "%s is an awful talker and can't get anything.",
  [13226113] = "%s annoys the hospital administrators.",
  [13226114] = "%s feels it's too much trouble and gets pig brains from the slaughterhouse.",
  [13226119] = "You negotiate with the hospital yourself and get them to reluctantly lend you their precious machines.",
  [13226120] = "You can get most of anything with sincerity and a good attitude.",
  [13226200] = "You need superior camerawork to explore the inside of a brain...",
  [13226211] = "%s is both patient and skilled to finish the task.",
  [13226212] = "%s doesn't have steady hands and shoots shaky footage.",
  [13226213] = "%s quits a minute into it.",
  [13226214] = "%s doesn't take it seriously and shoots unwatchable footage.",
  [13226219] = "You use an intern to crappy result.",
  [13226220] = "This is a tough challenge, hopefully nothing goes wrong.",
  [13227000] = "After brainstorming, we decide to anthropomorphically show the different parts and functions of a brain.",
  [13227001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [13227002] = "The filming of the documentary officially kicks off. Here's to a smooth sailing!",
  [13227100] = "Someone has to comfort a brain cancer patient volunteering to be in the film…",
  [13227111] = "%s embraces the volunteer and calms her down with soothing whispers.",
  [13227112] = "%s makes the meltdown worse.",
  [13227113] = "%s says the wrong thing to make the volunteer quit the documentary.",
  [13227114] = "%s thinks the volunteer just needs to cry it out alone.",
  [13227119] = "You try to comfort the volunteer yourself but can't quite find the right words and end up crying with her.",
  [13227120] = "Why? She's still young… I feel really bad for her!",
  [13227200] = "You smell formaldehyde and get very queasy and lightheaded...",
  [13227211] = "Lucien senses something's wrong and holds you up while asking you in whispers...",
  [13227214] = "Lucien gets a chair and motions you to sit down without interrupting the shoot.",
  [13227219] = "You grit your teeth and tough it out so you won't delay filming.",
  [13227220] = "No matter what, the production can't stop because of me!",
  [13228000] = "Lucien offered many interesting suggestions to the documentary. No idea he was so hip to current pop culture!",
  [13228001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [13228002] = "Hope we get over the rough patches of the filming soon…",
  [13228100] = "You find out the volunteer has a secret crush and decide to surprise her…",
  [13228111] = "%s arrives on set quickly.",
  [13228112] = "You can't reach that person so you let %s come chat with the volunteer, who's a bit disappointed.",
  [13228113] = "You can't reach that person so you let %s come chat with the volunteer, who actually dislikes her.",
  [13228114] = "You can't reach that person so you let %s come chat with the volunteer, whose conditions then get worse...",
  [13228119] = "You can't get in touch with Kim and are sorry to disappoint the volunteer.",
  [13228120] = "Hope I can make this small wish of hers come true.",
  [13228200] = "While in the hallway of a hospital, you ask Lucien if he's seen death before…",
  [13228211] = "He holds your hand and says, \"Yes, but I started fearing it only after I met you. And because of you, I want to live.\"",
  [13228214] = "He nods and smiles, \"Yes, and often.\"",
  [13228219] = "You don't get an answer, maybe because he didn't hear you, or he didn't want to reply.",
  [13228220] = "Death is a fact of life but one that's difficult to accept.",
  [13229000] = "The filming's over. Animations will be added in post-prodcution. Hope they will come across well.",
  [13229001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [13229002] = "What may be the most touching production for me personally has finished shooting. I realize the greatest challenge in life is staying alive...",
  [13229100] = "You need super high-tech equipment to complete the film…",
  [13229111] = "%s lends you the equipment right away.",
  [13229112] = "%s doesn't want to chance you breaking it and turns you away.",
  [13229113] = "%s isn't on good terms with you and refuses.",
  [13229114] = "%s just sold it to make ends meet.",
  [13229119] = "You can't get the equipment so you have to skip over some content.",
  [13229120] = "Some equipment are just too darn expensive! Plus, I don't know how to use them…",
  [13229200] = "The volunteer at last passes away. Lucien wonders why are you crying…",
  [13229211] = "You are intimate enough with him to smile and share that it reminds you of your father when he passed...",
  [13229214] = "You don't feel close enough to Lucien yet, so you wipe away the tears and tell him it's nothing.",
  [13229219] = "You wipe off your tears, push him aside and walk off.",
  [13229220] = "Oh how I miss my father, my mind's mess when I think about him…",
  [13230000] = "After the film's release, Lucien and I are interviewed by the media.",
  [13230001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [13230002] = "Interview's over, but as I look at Lucien, I wish it could have gone longer…",
  [13230100] = "You need someone to make you up for the interview...",
  [13230111] = "%s applies a light makeup that suits you perfectly. You look like a star in the interview.",
  [13230112] = "%s gives you a sultry makeup that makes you seem like you worked in a dubious profession.",
  [13230113] = "%s uses inferior cosmetics that run during the interview.",
