  [13307120] = "It's hard to find someone who can set tempo, and harder for setting good tempo.",
  [13307200] = "You ask Kiro privately if he remembered what happened in the previous taping…",
  [13307211] = "Kiro recalls the good time with you from that taping and laughs, \"Where's the food you promised me?\"",
  [13307214] = "Kiro struggles to recall and ask you to clarify.",
  [13307219] = "You speak too softly for Kiro to notice.",
  [13307220] = "I ate way too much with Kiro last time and I'm happy about it!",
  [13308000] = "So excited that we're shooting! My first time working with Kiro on a TV drama too!",
  [13308001] = "Facing great pressures in life, I could no longer cope properly. Just when I was dispirited, I suddenly remembered what he said...",
  [13308002] = "The first few episodes are done, and Kiro's acting is getting better and better!",
  [13308100] = "You want to find an acting coach for Kiro, who feels he need to improve...",
  [13308111] = "%s is a great teacher. Kiro's acting improves by leaps and bounds.",
  [13308112] = "%s is an awful actor, much less teach Kiro.",
  [13308113] = "%s spends far more time bragging about own acting chops than teaching.",
  [13308114] = "%s is in awe of Kiro and unable to speak around him.",
  [13308119] = "You talk to Kiro's agent about it and he will handle it.",
  [13308120] = "I'm impressed by how much effort Kiro puts into acting.",
  [13308200] = "You need someone to cleanse Kiro's wound after an accident on set…",
  [13308211] = "%s cleans the wound gently without hurting Kiro.",
  [13308212] = "%s gets too rough and has Kiro hopping in pain.",
  [13308213] = "%s grabs something else other than antiseptic, slowing down Kiro's recovery.",
  [13308214] = "%s just goes through the motions and the wound shows sign of infection.",
  [13308219] = "Everybody's occupied so you do it yourself, which oddly makes Kiro happy…",
  [13308220] = "Where are Kiro's assistants? Where did they go?",
  [13309000] = "The filming will end soon. It's a long arduous journey making a television drama.",
  [13309001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [13309002] = "We're finally done after all the problems and obstacles. Thanks for everything!",
  [13309100] = "You need a martial artist to train Kiro for the fight scenes…",
  [13309111] = "%s is a patient and diligent instructor, enabling Kiro to perform well.",
  [13309112] = "%s is tempermental and often gets into arguments with Kiro.",
  [13309113] = "%s is taking it too seriously and taking up too much of Kiro's time.",
  [13309114] = "%s would rather do as little as possible and just hang out with Kiro.",
  [13309119] = "After Kiro's agent mentions the possibility for injury, you decide to use a stunt double.",
  [13309120] = "Kiro is a very dedicated actor and that makes me see him in a different light.",
  [13309200] = "Kiro gets hurt again and you're conflicted about rushing over to help him…",
  [13309211] = "Kiro won't let anybody else touch him but Miss Chips, i.e., you.",
  [13309214] = "Kiro doesn't even look at you, grabs his agent's hand and pulls himself back up.",
  [13309219] = "Kiro casually gets back up and dusts himself off.",
  [13309220] = "Kiro can't get hurt, because he's my… uh, the leading man… for the series.",
  [13310000] = "Only dubbing is left, and Kiro wants to dub the voice for his role himself. How dedicated!",
  [13310001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [13310002] = "Dubbing's done! You know, I'd watch it on TV if I was at home…",
  [13310100] = "You need a sound engineer for the drama series…",
  [13310111] = "%s provides moving tracks for the show.",
  [13310112] = "%s makes odd choices that hurts the mood.",
  [13310113] = "%s has a miscue that damages the sound files.",
  [13310114] = "%s plays the same track twenty times in a row.",
  [13310119] = "You resort to using several students from a music academy to so-so result.",
  [13310120] = "Music is practially the soul of a drama.",
  [13310200] = "You want to have a talk with Kiro about goofing off on the set lately…",
  [13310211] = "He turns into a model actor and gets seriously about work.",
  [13310214] = "He knits his brows, turns and walks away.",
  [13310219] = "You don't have the guts to confront him and calls his agent instead. Kiro thinks you're a little snitch after finding out.",
  [13310220] = "I wanna be with Kiro more and more, but is it just because he's fun to be with?",
  [13311000] = "We're making a contemporary comedy called \"Nine Bad Men Out of Ten,\" starring Kiro. Today is publicity photo op.",
  [13311001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [13311002] = "Nice publicity pictures will get viewers excited and make new fans!",
  [13311100] = "You need someone to do Kiro's makeup for the shoot…",
  [13311111] = "%s is a pro and makes Kiro even more an Adonis than usual.",
  [13311112] = "%s is only average and fails to maximize Kiro's looks.",
  [13311113] = "%s works for the circus and does makeups for clowns.",
  [13311114] = "%s is clumsy and almost pokes Kiro in the eye.",
  [13311119] = "Kiro has his own makeup artist, so no worries.",
  [13311120] = "Actually, Kiro looks the best without any makeup on.",
  [13311200] = "You need someone to fix the light that went out during the publicity shoot…",
  [13311211] = "%s changes the bulb right away.",
  [13311212] = "%s can't figure out what is wrong.",
  [13311213] = "%s breaks all the lights.",
  [13311214] = "%s thinks it's too dangerous and refuses.",
  [13311219] = "No one to fix it, so you go with an emergency backup light.",
  [13311220] = "People look so dark in a photo without proper lighting!",
  [13312000] = "The company invested a lot into the film so we have to launch a great campaign to push it.",
  [13312001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [13312002] = "The feedbacks are great! All that money going into promoting it wasn't wasted, after all!",
  [13312100] = "You need someone to talk to the cinemas about running the trailer…",
  [13312111] = "%s has done negotiations large and small and handles this one with ease.",
  [13312112] = "%s is a novice and almost blows the deal.",
  [13312113] = "%s is volatile and threatens to trash the place on a perceived slight.",
  [13312114] = "%s is anti-social.",
  [13312119] = "You do the negotiation yourself and barely hammer it through.",
  [13312120] = "Note to self: brush up on negotiation skills.",
  [13312200] = "You need someone to check out reactions to the preview in the theaters...",
  [13312211] = "%s checks everywhere and assures you it got positive reactions.",
  [13312212] = "%s blows it off after checking out a couple cinemas.",
  [13312213] = "%s is too busy buying popcorn and misses the trailers entirely.",
  [13312214] = "%s is too lazy to actually do it and just makes up stories.",
  [13312219] = "You decide to do it yourself and almost run yourself into the ground.",
  [13312220] = "How many theaters was that? At least it's getting a good repsonse!",
  [13313000] = "Given the crew's excitement, I'm sure we can finish filming without major problems.",
  [13313001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [13313002] = "The movie has premiered! Please, make it rain at the box office!",
  [13313100] = "You need someone to stand in for Kiro's bed-ridden agent…",
  [13313111] = "%s has 30 years of management experience and takes care of Kiro's schedule perfectly.",
  [13313112] = "%s is a hack who knows nothing.",
  [13313113] = "%s makes Kiro do all the arrangements himself.",
  [13313114] = "%s tries to bully Kiro around all the time.",
  [13313119] = "You try to let Kiro manage himself for the time being and that causes all sorts of problems.",
  [13313120] = "Sigh, Kiro needs someone to look after him.",
  [13313200] = "A sea of fans mobs Kiro and almost bowls you over in the process...",
  [13313211] = "Kiro reaches out and grabs you before you fall.",
  [13313214] = "Kiro sees you fall but is too swarmed to help.",
  [13313219] = "Kiro is too busy chowing down snacks from fans to notice you.",
  [13313220] = "Kiro treats his fans so well, whereas other stars would throw a fit by now.",
  [13314000] = "Director Young is incredibly demanding and one simple scene can take up a whole day to shoot!",
  [13314001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [13314002] = "It's a wrap! One blockbuster coming up!",
  [13314100] = "You want a talk show host to perfect Kiro's expression and timing...",
  [13314111] = "%s has very animated expression and is a big help to Kiro.",
  [13314112] = "%s is a deadpan comedian, facial expression is not a strong suit.",
  [13314113] = "%s is more interested in chatting with Kiro.",
  [13314114] = "%s is a hack who can't do anything.",
  [13314119] = "You download a lot of comedies for Kiro to study but he's still only so-so.",
  [13314120] = "Kiro is a talented performer. He'll be good in due time.",
  [13314200] = "You need a kid for a fun role in the film…",
  [13314211] = "%s is a natural and aces every scenes.",
  [13314212] = "%s is some bigwig's kid who didn't get here on acting ability.",
  [13314213] = "%s is a wild child who nearly tears the set apart.",
  [13314214] = "%s butts heads with Kiro all the time and can't stand each other.",
  [13314219] = "No suitable candidate so you use a crew member's kid, who turns out to be a pitiful.",
  [13314220] = "Even just a cute look won't work for kids anymore, they gotta know how to act!",
  [13315000] = "You and Kiro attend the movie's premiere. Judging from the constant laughter, it seems the audience really enjoy it!",
  [13315001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [13315002] = "The movie's over, and I love it even if I do say so myself!",
  [13315100] = "You seek a model to show you how to walk the red carpet at the premiere…",
  [13315111] = "%s is a supermodel, correcting your postures and showing you all the tricks.",
  [13315112] = "%s isn't much of an expert and is still figuring some stuff out herself.",
  [13315113] = "%s is too busy to give you pointers.",
  [13315114] = "You're getting a flatfoot under the tutelage of %s.",
  [13315119] = "You know you aren't the star so decide to forego walking the carpet.",
  [13315120] = "Oh my, first time on red carpet! So much butterflies!",
  [13315200] = "Sitting next to Kiro, your hand touches Kiro's while reaching for popcorn…",
  [13315211] = "Kiro pauses, then holds your hand in the darkness. You blush, but never try to pull it away.",
  [13315214] = "Kiro pauses and pulls his hand back.",
  [13315219] = "You actually whiffed. You turn and see Kiro digging into the tub of popcorn.",
  [13315220] = "Time always flies when I'm with Kiro!",
  [13316000] = "The new fantasy romance show stars Kiro and Chik, who seems to have it out for me ever since she come on set.",
  [13316001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [13316002] = "The poster is ready. It should be gold with two hot, beautiful people on it!",
  [13316100] = "You need someone to pick out a princess dress for Chik on the poster…",
  [13316111] = "%s is experienced and picks out a very nice dress.",
  [13316112] = "%s settles on a dress not suitable for Chik's figure.",
  [13316113] = "%s selects a dress with clashing colors.",
  [13316114] = "%s chooses a low-quality dress that quickly rips.",
  [13316119] = "You let Chik pick for herself and find she has average taste.",
  [13316120] = "It's every girl's dream to be a princess at least once, right?",
  [13316200] = "You need someone to refine Kiro and Chik to lend them a greater air of nobility…",
  [13316211] = "%s is a genuine prince and shows them how to be regal.",
  [13316212] = "%s is just rich, not a noble.",
  [13316213] = "%s is pretentious and over-flowery.",
  [13316214] = "%s not only fails to help Kiro and Chik, but gives them bad advice.",
  [13316219] = "You feel they should be themselves and scrapped the idea.",
  [13316220] = "Kiro is Prince Charming from head to toe in this outfit!",
  [13317000] = "Today is the photo shoot for the poster. Kiro and Chik are very professional, and the session is done quickly.",
  [13317001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [13317002] = "This is scripted, but any romantic encounter in real life feels just as good as this.",
  [13317100] = "You want someone to train the cameraman to take candid shots for the show…",
  [13317111] = "%s is virtually a ninja who teaches the cameraman to vanish.",
  [13317112] = "You got the wrong person, %s is not an expert in this.",
  [13317113] = "%s is too keen on concealment that the cameraman lost Kiro and Chik.",
  [13317114] = "%s is too keen on concealment and makes the footage come off like they're shot by a paparazzi…",
  [13317119] = "You don't feel the need to be that gimmicky.",
  [13317120] = "Am I too demanding on the cameramen? I feel like a tyrant ordering them around.",
  [13317200] = "You replay Kiro and Chik holding hands in your mind with a tinge of jealousy…",
  [13317211] = "During a break, Kiro ignores Chik and ask you what is wrong.",
  [13317214] = "Kiro is too busy discussing scenes with Chik between taping to notice you.",
  [13317219] = "A bee buzzes by and takes away Kiro's focus.",
  [13317220] = "Chik and Kiro make a perfect couple, but why am I feeling left out inside?",
  [13318000] = "We're spending a whole day filming how the two first met. Lights, camera, action!",
  [13318001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [13318002] = "What a perfect image! Guess that's what happens when you put a perfect pair together…",
  [13318100] = "You need someone to point you to a high-end restaurant…",
  [13318111] = "%s loves high-end food and makes several recommendations.",
  [13318112] = "%s recommends dilapidated places not suitable for filming.",
  [13318113] = "%s inserts self into the trip upon learning you're filming a show.",
  [13318114] = "%s is not familiar with the area. You should try someone else.",
  [13318119] = "You google online and find an establishment that's more hype than substance.",
  [13318120] = "Since the roles are prince and princess, the setting has to be grand and regal.",
  [13318200] = "Kiro grabs a cake upon entering and even feeds me a piece…",
  [13318211] = "You smile and eat it despite everyone watching.",
  [13318214] = "You frown, then tell Kiro to stop the horseplay and concentrate on work.",
  [13318219] = "Kiro isn't careful and smear the piece all over you.",
  [13318220] = "Oh, how sweet, he shared the cake with me!",
  [13319000] = "Time to shoot the couple watching fireworks at night. How romantic!",
  [13319001] = "Just when I was about to give up from the setbacks, he popped into my mind…",
  [13319002] = "The taping went well, and everyone had fun watching the fireworks.",
  [13319100] = "You need someone to light the fireworks…",
  [13319111] = "%s played with firecrackers all the time as a child and has no problem setting off the fireworks.",
  [13319112] = "%s is too cowardly to even touch it.",
  [13319113] = "%s recklessly light the fireworks but stays in place and almost gets injured.",
  [13319114] = "%s hides behind you and can't be dragged away.",
  [13319119] = "You decide to do it yourself and almost shriek out loud.",
  [13319120] = "If you can light fireworks, you're braver than I am.",
  [13319200] = "The gorgeous fireworks and cuddling lovers make you recall good times with Kiro…",
  [13319211] = "You recall meeting Kiro, how he helped and protected you, his smiles, and that warms your heart…",
  [13319214] = "You recall how Kiro teased and pranked you, how he's holding hands with Chik, and you almost chuck a rock at him.",
  [13319219] = "Someone comes to you to discuss a filming issue before you can get sentimental.",
  [13319220] = "Hope Kiro will always be like this…",
  [13320000] = "Kiro shows up to the office and sit next to me to watch the program on air. Don't know why but that makes me nervous.",
  [13320001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [13320002] = "The romance fantasy program is done! Now let's hope the gossip dies down.",
  [13320100] = "You would like starts to push the show for you and get more exposure…",
  [13320111] = "%s is an international star whose endorsement sends the ratings through the roof.",
  [13320112] = "%s is an average entertainer and doesn't have much pull.",
  [13320113] = "%s sends thirty fans your way.",
  [13320114] = "%s doesn't play the favor game and won't help you.",
  [13320119] = "You think the program is good enough to stand on its own without the additional push.",
  [13320120] = "Can you imagine how big the show will be with a decent push behind it?",
  [13320200] = "Kiro suddenly leans over to you and whispers in your ear…",
  [13320211] = "You hear Kiro's voice, \"I'd very much like to work on the show with Miss Chips...\"",
  [13320214] = "Kiro's voice is a bit startled, \"Hey, there's something on your face.\"",
  [13320219] = "You nudge Kiro away before he can speak.",
  [13320220] = "Kiro leans on you like a big puppy. You really want to rub his hair…",
  [13321000] = "I'm shooting a music video for Kiro's newest album. I better be perfect on this one.",
  [13321001] = "I don't know if my decision will lead me to a bright future or a dark abyss. Just as I was hesitant, I heard a gentle voice in my mind...",
  [13321002] = "The poster is ready and should look fantastic!",
  [13321100] = "You need someone to design a punk-style album cover for Kiro…",
  [13321111] = "%s is a veteran punk rocker and whips it up in very little time.",
  [13321112] = "%s is into folk music so unable to help.",
  [13321113] = "%s charges way more than you can afford.",
  [13321114] = "%s has beef with Kiro and not willing to help.",
  [13321119] = "You stay up all night researching but can only come up with a barely passable design.",
  [13321120] = "Kiro will look extra cool going punk!",
  [13321200] = "Kiro want you to go with him to divine the success ahead…",
  [13321211] = "%s makes an accurate divination, predicting success for the album and warning Kiro on several things to look out for.",
  [13321212] = "%s predicts a chart topper, but later is exposed as a charlatan.",
  [13321213] = "%s unnerves Kiro by telling him the album's going to be a bust.",
  [13321214] = "%s annoys Kiro for an unhappy parting.",
  [13321219] = "You tells Kiro not to be superstitious. He nods, but obviously still feels uncertain inside.",
  [13321220] = "Believe it or don’t? I'm torn about it myself.",
  [13322000] = "First things first, nail the concept for the new album, then give Kiro a fitting image and style.",
  [13322001] = "I was totally out of creative ideas, feeling exhausted and slow. Just when my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly popped into my mind…",
  [13322002] = "The image and style are set. We're off to the races!",
  [13322100] = "You want someone to conceive an attractive yet down-to-earth style for Kiro…",
  [13322111] = "%s conceives a hairstyle both unique and proper for Kiro.",
  [13322112] = "%s designs a very odd hairstyle.",
  [13322113] = "%s makes Kiro a Alternateen.",
  [13322114] = "%s is lazy and does nothing beyond blowdrying Kiro's hair.",
  [13322119] = "You offers Kiro many choices you found online and he decides to keep his current hairstyle.",
  [13322120] = "It probably won't matter what hairstyle it is with how hot Kiro looks.",
  [13322200] = "Kiro smiles and wants you to get the same hairstyle as him...",
  [13322211] = "You hem and haw but relent to dying a bang to make Kiro happy.",
  [13322214] = "You decline, citing you're too busy for that.",
  [13322219] = "You tell Kiro his new style is ugly. He doesn't seem happy.",
  [13322220] = "I'm a girl, and hair is super-important to a girl, after all.",
  [13323000] = "I'm going with Kiro to northern Europe to shoot the music video. Kiro really likes snow!",
  [13323001] = "After many hardships, my feet could not move and my eyes were not clear. Just when I was about to give up, he popped into my mind...",
  [13323002] = "The first half is done. Never thought everyone would still be this excited!",
