  [18064000] = "Hard to find a good hairdresser? Dissatisfied with your own hairdresser? 'Top Hairdresser' is now giving you the opportunity to get transformed by the best hairdressers in town!",
  [18064001] = "No more new ideas in my head. As my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly appeared in my mind...",
  [18064002] = "These hairstyles are created by great skills!",
  [18064100] = "You need a scripter to design tortuous advancing process for the show.",
  [18064111] = "The competition system designed by %s was perfect, and the hairdresser competition was as tense as a survival competition.",
  [18064112] = "%s designed the competition so melodramatic that the audience thought they were watching drama instead.",
  [18064113] = "%s's arrangement was too lax, and even the competitors didn't care about victory or defeat.",
  [18064114] = "%s set unfair rules to allow %s's own hairdresser to advance in the competition, causing a big protest!",
  [18064119] = "In the end, we decided to follow the rules of the previous singing competition. There may be not much difference...",
  [18064120] = "How can they be similar...",
  [18064200] = "An agent is needed to find hair models among ordinary people to show the hairdressers' skill.",
  [18064211] = "The hairstyles and looks of the models selected by %s are very representative. Many audience thought the show would help them a lot!",
  [18064212] = "%s didn't understand what ordinary people meant. The professional models were so beautiful that they would look good wearing any hair style.",
  [18064213] = "The models %s found... looked so bizarre that the audience couldn't shift their eyes from the faces of the models to their hairstyles.",
  [18064214] = "%s went on stage as a model on the day of competition instead of finding a candidate, and got rejected by the hairdresser!",
  [18064219] = "The girls in the production team went on stage at the last moment, and the result was unexpectedly great!",
  [18064220] = "They are naturally beautiful!",
  [18065000] = "For those car lovers, the most satisfying thing is all kinds of car tests. To show the limits of speed and the passion of collisions, we decided to produce a racing show.",
  [18065001] = "No more new ideas in my head. As my brain slowly rusted, a figure suddenly appeared in my mind...",
  [18065002] = "Wonder is just around the corner.",
  [18065100] = "You need a PR expert to find suitable car sponsors. Which one would you choose?",
  [18065111] = "%s was eloquent and persuaded many car manufacturers to participate in the show, and the cars they provided added luster to the show.",
  [18065112] = "%s knows little about cars, and the manufacturers begin to doubt the professional standard of the show.",
  [18065113] = "%s was a bit introvert and didn't like talking. The manufacturers had to make conversation themselves.",
  [18065114] = "%s put on airs, which made the car manufacturers angry and they left on the spot.",
  [18065119] = "Let the director do it himself. After all, he knows the show best.",
  [18065120] = "It's to save money!",
  [18065200] = "A cameraman is needed to capture the exciting moments of the car racing.",
  [18065211] = "%s's high-speed photography was of cinematic level, which made the show a lot more exciting.",
  [18065212] = "%s's shots were quite fine, but almost lost all the recording tapes.",
  [18065213] = "%s's shots was shaky. Although it showed a sense of speed, it made the audience dizzy.",
  [18065214] = "%s focused on shooting the little flowers next to the track, and said this would help the show return to nature, which pissed everyone off.",
  [18065219] = "The cameraman of the production team is experienced, and can fully meet the shooting requirements.",
  [18065220] = "Cameramen who are not from the production team might not be able to do a better job.",
  [18066000] = "What would you do if you saw a ghost on the last bus of the night? It's the first time we're making a Prank Show.  Who knows it will go? Everyone's feeling a bit nervous.",
  [18066001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [18066002] = "It's a wrap. For some reason the crew look half-amused. Their expressions are hard to read.",
  [18066100] = "Professional actor required to play the part of a ghost on public transport.",
  [18066111] = "%s really knows how to create a scene. She played the ghost to perfection, scaring the wits out of those pedestrians.",
  [18066112] = "%s really over did it, and gave that poor pedestrian a heart attack.",
  [18066113] = "%s really showed her inexperience. She played it like mad woman, not a ghost.",
  [18066114] = "%s had everyone in stitches. All that hard work for nothing.",
  [18066119] = "If there's no one good, just shove a mannequin in the seat. That will scare them.",
  [18066120] = "I wonder why ghosts always like to wear white.",
  [18066200] = "The pranked pedestrians appear pretty shaken up. Find someone nice to explain.",
  [18066211] = "%s's so cute. No one could ever get angry at her.",
  [18066212] = "%s is too shy. No one could hear anything.",
  [18066213] = "%s's too scary looking. He's worse than the ghost.",
  [18066214] = "%s rushes forward shouting \"HAHAHAHAHA!!! YOU'VE BEEN PUNKED!!!\"",
  [18066219] = "Sometimes silence is the best medicine. Let time heal their frayed nerves.",
  [18066220] = "Freaky. That's the last time I catch a bus by myself at night.",
  [18067000] = "This documentary follows the \"Sunset Mountaineers\", a team of nine 70-somethings, as they attempt to climb different summits around the world. It will be an unforgettable experience, for participants and viewers alike.",
  [18067001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18067002] = "By the time they broadcast the documentary, the nine will have started on a new journey...",
  [18067100] = "Filming mountaineers as they struggle over the rugged terrain requires a lot of endurance.",
  [18067111] = "%s grew up in the mountains and has powerful and sturdy legs, like a mountain goat. There's no better choice for this expedition.",
  [18067112] = "%s won't complain, but documentaries aren't really her thing. Probably not a good choice.",
  [18067113] = "%s is very lively, but she's a bit frail. She'll probably be airlifted out on day 3 with stomachache.",
  [18067114] = "%s likes to complain, can't handle being away from home comforts, and will slow everyone down.",
  [18067119] = "None of them are any good. You'd better it yourself. If it doesn't work out, too bad.",
  [18067120] = "It's a hard road. Going up is hard, and coming down is even harder!",
  [18067200] = "One of your teammates is arguing with one of the old people, who is now refusing to move. You will turn to --",
  [18067211] = "%s is a bit strange, but he gets on very well with the old codger. The two spend a long time comparing ailments, until the old man is ready to move again.",
  [18067212] = "%s gets on well with the old man, but forgets about finishing the documentary. They are edited out of the final cut.",
  [18067213] = "%s seems very nice, but the old man becomes enraged as soon as he sees him. Communication is impossible.",
  [18067214] = "% takes one look at the furious old man and walks away, visibly shaken.",
  [18067219] = "Best not prod an angry bear. Let him calm down by himself.",
  [18067220] = "Happy old people are just like children.",
  [18068000] = "Everyone likes to talk about past lives. Recently a kid appeared in the media, claiming to have memories of a previous life. We're sending a reporter around there to investigate.",
  [18068001] = "I don't know whether my decision will bring me light or push me towards the abyss. But as I hesitate, a warm voice speaks to me, inside my mind...",
  [18068002] = "There's so much fake news floating around lately. I bet our program gets a spray too...",
  [18068100] = "Arriving in town, the locals seem cagey, especially on the topic of the kid. Try to find someone chatty to look into it.",
  [18068111] = "%s has a way with words and puts people at their ease. One or two questions and you have the information you seek.",
  [18068112] = "%s gets talking to some people, but loses her train of thought, and she forgets what she wanted to ask them.",
  [18068113] = "%s isn't very talkative. Usually he just says exactly what's on his mind. As a result, no one tells him anything.",
  [18068114] = "Red-faced, %s runs over and stares at them for a while, not saying a word.",
  [18068119] = "What would those guys know anyway? Better just go and talk to the source.",
  [18068120] = "Everyone is being super-cagey. What the hell is going on?",
  [18068200] = "The boy's account of a past life has holes in it so big you could drive a truck through them. He keeps looking to his mother for guidance. Just as the journalist is about to express reservations, she collapses in tears on the floor. Can anyone help?",
  [18068211] = "%s is unmoved and watches her in silence. When the mother realizes no one is paying her any attention, she stops crying. Talk about awkward!",
  [18068212] = "Afraid the situation will get out of hand, %s calls the cops. The interview will have to wait for another time.",
  [18068213] = "%s tries to reason with her, but gradually loses patience as the wailing continues.",
  [18068214] = "%s sits down next to her and starts wailing too.",
  [18068219] = "The interview is over. Better make a quick exit and avoid further trouble.",
  [18068220] = "Remain calm in the face of strangeness. Strangeness alone cannot harm you.",
  [18069000] = "A Player Companion Platform has asked us to do a promotion for them. Imagine playing a game with a pretty girl or cute boy... It sounds wonderful!",
  [18069001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [18069002] = "Everything went well. As long as Player A is happy, that's the main thing.",
  [18069100] = "Successful promotions have to cut through the noise. We need to find an experienced writer.",
  [18069111] = "%s's writing gets rave reviews. It really grabs people's attention.",
  [18069112] = "%s tries to describe all the platform's advantages, but the message is longwinded and kind of confusing.",
  [18069113] = "%s's text is all over the place. It's completely unusable.",
  [18069114] = "%s has a serious case of writer's block. Three days and not a word.",
  [18069119] = "No one volunteers. You'll just have to sit down and bang one out yourself.",
  [18069120] = "Brown-nosing is a real talent. No just anyone can do it.",
  [18069200] = "Now we need to find an influencer to use the platform. Someone with enough fans to make it worthwhile.",
  [18069211] = "%s is really popular with gamers. One game with a girl from the platform and everyone knows about it!",
  [18069212] = "%s is overly confident and doesn't interact with the girl from the platform. The game is boring to watch.",
  [18069213] = "$s put so much effort into it. So how come no one watched? A big flop.",
  [18069214] = "%s tries flirting with the girl but ends up making some pretty off-color remarks. The feed is cut.",
  [18069219] = "Influencers cost way too much. Just edit the videos they've already got and use them.",
  [18069220] = "That girl can play games AND sing. I think I'm in love!",
  [18070000] = "Ten well-known youtubers head into the wilderness to play at survival. Which one will get the most views and become the undisputed King of Youtube? Only time will tell!",
  [18070001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18070002] = "The show is done. Lots of youtubers are looking tired and skinny. It's not easy being the King of Youtube.",
  [18070100] = "Ten youtubers are live broadcasting from the wild. Putting all that great footage together is going to be a real challenge for the editor.",
  [18070111] = "%s did a wonderful job arranging the footage, with lots of highlights and a clear storyline.",
  [18070112] = "%s only put in the bits he liked. The youtubers are unhappy with the cut, and their fans are up in arms.",
  [18070113] = "%s' edit is really confusing. There's no hero or villain or storyline for viewers to follow.",
  [18070114] = "%s' cut is a complete disaster. All the good bits were cut out and all the bad bits included. Totally dank.",
  [18070119] = "None of the regular editors are available. You'll have to give it to the work experience kid.",
  [18070120] = "Season 1 was a mess. We're really going to have our work cut for us in Season 2.",
  [18070200] = "One of the Youtubers they call the \"Cave Chef\" ate some poison mushrooms to get some extra views. The hospital is many miles away. Better find a medic to take care of him!",
  [18070211] = "%s knows all about food poisoning. The patient is fully recovered within moments.",
  [18070212] = "Unfortunately, %s is an orthopaedic surgeon and only good with broken bones.",
  [18070213] = "%s studied acupuncture for two days at the Wild Duck Beauty College. Thankfully someone steps in to stop her.",
  [18070214] = "%s takes one look at the mushroom and eats it. Now there are two patients.",
  [18070219] = "The situation is very serious. Better organize a vehicle to get them to a hospital.",
  [18070220] = "Mind what you say and mind what you eat in the forest.",
  [18071000] = "虽然我觉得把《千里江山图》的名字放出去就是最好的宣传了，但一部出色的宣传片还是必不可少的！",
  [18071001] = "我不知道我的决定究竟是会给我带来光明，还是引我走向深渊。就在我犹豫不决的时候，突然有温和的声音在我脑海中响起……",
  [18071002] = "好的开头是成功的一半，我觉得我可以！",
  [18071100] = "出色的剪辑对一部宣传片来说必不可少，你决定邀请哪一位专家？",
  [18071111] = "%s剪辑出的宣传片非常富有艺术感染力，让人连连惊叹。",
  [18071112] = "%s胡乱将镜头拼凑在一起，最终成品惨不忍睹。",
  [18071113] = "%s试图剪辑成动作大片的预告片，结果不伦不类。",
  [18071114] = "%s并不会剪辑，结果沦为了打杂小弟。",
  [18071119] = "找不到合适的专家，你只能硬着头皮自己上了。",
  [18071120] = "术业有专攻，至少我不是这块料。",
  [18071200] = "眼看宣传片都要剪辑完了，你还没有找到合适的配乐，你决定请一位专家来帮忙。",
  [18071211] = "%s制作了一首古典又恢弘的音乐，完美地适配了画面。",
  [18071212] = "%s精心打造了一首曲子，结果听过的人都被难听哭了。",
  [18071213] = "%s制作出一首激昂的摇滚乐，但并不适合这部纪录片。",
  [18071214] = "%s将自己关在房间里三天三夜，最后什么都没制作出来。",
  [18071219] = "时间紧急，你决定直接从曲库中挑选一首曲子。",
  [18071220] = "怎么样让背景音乐既存在又不出戏，也是一个难题。",
  [18072000] = "有不少观众在关注纪录片的拍摄进程，我决定将拍摄花絮制作成锦集放在公司官网上，作为纪录片的宣传之一。",
  [18072001] = "我的脑海中已经不再有新的创意出现。就在我的大脑慢慢生锈的时候，突然有身影在我心中缓缓出现……",
  [18072002] = "宣传的效果不错，这真是个极佳的决定！",
  [18072100] = "拍摄进行到一半摄影师因为中暑倒下了，你得在最短的时间内找到合适的摄影师接替他。",
  [18072111] = "%s完美地接过的工作，拍摄得以继续进行。",
  [18072112] = "%s根本不会用摄影机，并且试图说图说服你用DV拍摄。",
  [18072113] = "%s每天都在纠结镜头画面不够刺激的问题，拍摄进度缓慢。",
  [18072114] = "%s嫌弃天气太热，拒绝了你的邀请。",
  [18072119] = "只是临时拍摄一下，你干脆自己上了。",
  [18072120] = "八九月的北京实在是太热了！！",
  [18072200] = "演员进组了却发现准备的服装一点都不合身，你决定找哪位专家来解决这个问题？",
  [18072211] = "%s妙手一动，光用别针和胶带就让整套衣服像量身定制的一般。",
  [18072212] = "%s提出了让演员增加体重的主意，被经纪人果断否决了。",
  [18072213] = "%s拿起剪刀就是咔嚓几下，好好的公服变成“乞丐服”了。",
  [18072214] = "%s花了一个小时也没有将线穿进针孔里，怒掀桌离开。",
  [18072219] = "马上就要开始拍摄了，你只能放弃拯救这件衣服。",
  [18072220] = "人靠衣装，果然说的很有道理。",
  [18073000] = "北宋王希孟的一卷《千里江山图》惊艳了时光，让人们念念不忘。这次，就让我们一起走进千里江山的故事。",
  [18073001] = "我不知道我的决定究竟是会给我带来光明，还是引我走向深渊。就在我犹豫不决的时候，突然有温和的声音在我脑海中响起……",
  [18073002] = "浩渺壮阔的山水跃然纸上，莫名让人有种感动。",
  [18073100] = "在纪录片制作完成后，你需要请一位对历史有研究的专家进行最后的审核。",
  [18073111] = "%s对于历史研究颇深，为你指出了不少细节问题。",
  [18073112] = "%s对于北宋的历史一知半解，还没有李泽言靠谱。",
  [18073113] = "%s一直细究一些学术界都没有定论的地方，让你很是头大。",
  [18073114] = "%s一问三不知，你找错人了。",
  [18073119] = "这部纪录片就留给观众和时间来检验吧！",
  [18073120] = "当年考试的时候都没有这么紧张。",
  [18073200] = "优秀的解说能够赋予纪录片灵魂，你觉得谁比较合适？",
  [18073211] = "%s的解说恰到好处，为这部纪录片增色不少。",
  [18073212] = "%s的声音干巴巴的毫无感情，听起来十分催眠。",
  [18073213] = "%s将好好的解说词说成了rap，让人非常出戏。",
  [18073214] = "%s没有做解说的经验，结结巴巴还读错了几个字。",
  [18073219] = "你觉得用画面和文字就能打动观众了，不用解说也可以。",
  [18073220] = "差点不小心睡着了……",
  [18074000] = "一部宣传片当然必不可少，但我觉得这次并不需要太多技巧，因为它的主角——是故宫与金瓯永固杯。",
  [18074001] = "我的脑海中已经不再有新的创意出现。就在我的大脑慢慢生锈的时候，突然有身影在我心中缓缓出现……",
  [18074002] = "有些东西不需要噱头，因为它本身就引人注目。",
  [18074100] = "如何写出吸引人的文案也是一个重要论题，你觉得请一位专家来帮忙。",
  [18074111] = "%s文思如泉涌，写出的每个方案都非常出色。",
  [18074112] = "%s直接拿隔壁旅游节目的台词来套用，结果不伦不类。",
  [18074113] = "%s写出来的东西总有一种广告体的感觉挥之不去。",
  [18074114] = "%s对此毫无兴趣，直接消失不见了。",
  [18074119] = "你想到快要头秃，总算是将文案写好了。",
  [18074120] = "没想到文案也是个掉头发的工作。",
  [18074200] = "宣传片完成了，接下来你需要一位经验丰富的专家来帮助你进行宣传。",
  [18074211] = "%s另辟蹊径，让这部宣传片脱颖而出受到了众多关注。",
  [18074212] = "%s想了十二个宣传方式，但一个都没有成功。",
  [18074213] = "%s试图通过炒作的方式来宣传，引起了不少人的反感。",
  [18074214] = "%s觉得宣传没有意义，全程都在摸鱼。",
  [18074219] = "酒香不怕巷子深，你直接在官网上放出了宣传片。",
  [18074220] = "头条？热门？总之都先努力一把！",
  [18075000] = "有不少观众在关注纪录片的拍摄进程，我决定将拍摄花絮制作成锦集放在公司官网上，作为纪录片的宣传之一。",
  [18075001] = "这个世界有太多伪装。我疲累于保持完美的状态，就在我心灰意冷的时候，突然想起了他的话……",
  [18075002] = "宣传的效果超出预期，这真是个极佳的决定！",
  [18075100] = "一名工作人员架设摄影机时不小心被砸伤，你急急忙忙地去找人来进行紧急处理。",
  [18075111] = "%s经验丰富，动作娴熟地为受伤的人处理好了伤口。",
  [18075112] = "%s手忙脚乱地包裹伤口，成功让受伤的人痛晕了过去。",
  [18075113] = "%s空有丰富的医疗知识，但都是纸上谈兵，并没有什么作用。",
  [18075114] = "%s觉得受伤的人摔了摄影机很不应该，把他说哭了。",
  [18075119] = "停工把人送到医院检查后，发现并没有什么问题。",
  [18075120] = "关键时刻还是专业人士比较靠谱！",
  [18075200] = "在宫里拍摄时涉及到方方面面，你需要请一位性格友善的人来负责沟通问题。",
  [18075211] = "%s性格和善可亲，很快得到了众人的喜爱，沟通很顺利。",
  [18075212] = "%s因为一件小事和人吵了起来，情况反而更糟糕了。",
  [18075213] = "%s的友善都用在了故宫的猫上，最后并没有起很大作用。",
  [18075214] = "%s全程高冷，一句话都没说。",
  [18075219] = "没有人当做调节剂，拍摄现场摩擦不断。",
  [18075220] = "其实我也是个很友善的人。",
  [18076000] = "一只金瓯永固杯，蕴意着江山社稷永固。虽然王朝已经不在，但它依旧为我们讲述着过去的历史。",
  [18076001] = "我不知道我的决定究竟是会给我带来光明，还是引我走向深渊。就在我犹豫不决的时候，突然有温和的声音在我脑海中响起……",
  [18076002] = "拍摄完这部纪录片，我觉得自己又学到了很多东西！",
  [18076100] = "用镜头来讲述文物的故事，你需要挑选最合适的摄影师来进行拍摄。",
  [18076111] = "%s的镜头语言浪漫而富有古韵，完美地拍摄出了你想要的效果。",
  [18076112] = "%s拍摄出来的画面剧烈晃动，基本不能用。",
  [18076113] = "%s在拍摄时刻意炫技，结果很多镜头都完全不合适。",
  [18076114] = "%s在第一天就摔坏了摄像机，被导演赶了出去。",
  [18076119] = "没有找到合适的摄影师，拍摄进度全面停滞了下来。",
  [18076120] = "我相信，镜头是会说话的。",
  [18076200] = "细节决定成败，你决定请一位严格的专家来把控纪录片的质量。",
  [18076211] = "%s对每个细节都精益求精，最后出来的成品令人惊叹。",
  [18076212] = "%s粗心大意，甚至没有审核出字幕里的错字。",
  [18076213] = "%s像教导主任一样对每个人都很严苛，制作进度反而变慢了。",
  [18076214] = "%s像个小孩一样，反而给你们惹了不少麻烦。",
  [18076219] = "缺少了这个精细打磨的环节，最后的成品不尽如人意。",
  [18076220] = "在每个地方纠结一遍最终会导致两个结果：成功或成仁。",
  [18077000] = "古琴是一门高雅的艺术，谁心里没有慕古情怀呢，如果以这个为出发点制作宣传片，我觉得一定能成功！",
  [18077001] = "我的脑海中已经不再有新的创意出现。就在我的大脑慢慢生锈的时候，突然有身影在我心中缓缓出现……",
  [18077002] = "一切都在我的意料之中，接下来就等待纪录片播出了！",
  [18077100] = "想要获得绝大部分的人认同需要先征服一小波的爱好者，你打算邀请一位专家作为顾问。",
  [18077111] = "%s对于“大圣遗音”琴颇有研究，宣传片放出后受到广泛好评。",
  [18077112] = "%s对古琴一知半解，最后犯了许多低级错误。",
  [18077113] = "%s在这方面极其专业，但很多观众表示看不懂。",
  [18077114] = "%s想用非主流文化引起共鸣，结果太糟糕了。",
  [18077119] = "没有专门的顾问，虽然中间出现很多小问题，但最后还是完成了。",
  [18077120] = "现在我也能算小半个专家了……",
  [18077200] = "宣传一部讲述古琴的纪录片，配乐当然是重中之重，你决定选谁？",
  [18077211] = "%s创作的配乐淳和宏远，与娓娓道来的解说相得益彰。",
  [18077212] = "%s做出来的配乐简直是一通乱弹，还不如不用。",
  [18077213] = "%s擅长的摇滚乐一点都不适合这部宣传片。",
  [18077214] = "%s沉迷于拉工作人员开黑，反而拖慢了整体进度。",
  [18077219] = "没有合适的配乐，宣传片黯然失色，没有引起什么关注。",
  [18077220] = "一部宣传片没有配乐，就像方便面没有调料包。",
  [18078000] = "有不少观众在关注纪录片的拍摄进程，我决定将拍摄花絮制作成锦集放在公司官网上，作为纪录片的宣传之一。",
  [18078001] = "这个世界有太多伪装。我疲累于保持完美的状态，就在我心灰意冷的时候，突然想起了他的话……",
  [18078002] = "宣传的效果不错，这真是个极佳的决定！",
  [18078100] = "为了防止周棋洛的出现在拍摄现场引起骚乱，你需要一位经验丰富的安保人员。",
  [18078111] = "%s曾经给许多艺人做过保镖，做起安保工作来驾轻就熟。",
  [18078112] = "%s完全是个新手，最后众多粉丝围观导致拍摄暂停。",
  [18078113] = "%s高大威猛看起来像个危险分子，居然吓哭了几个小姑娘。",
  [18078114] = "%s居然是伪装成安保的狗仔，冲上去对着周棋洛就是一阵拍。",
  [18078119] = "没有安保人员，周棋洛的出现引起了骚动，拍摄差点进行不下去。",
  [18078120] = "我觉得这些粉丝比狗仔还厉害……",
  [18078200] = "你突然发现从镜头中看，灯光有很多问题，你打算找谁来解决？",
  [18078211] = "%s打的灯光与镜头完美融合，堪称是“光的魔术师”。",
  [18078212] = "%s现场向你询问怎样调灯光，你们两人面面相觑。",
  [18078213] = "%s差点用强光去照射文物，把你吓得呼吸都快停住了。",
  [18078214] = "%s不知从哪找来了炫彩的灯光，整个拍摄现场变成了舞厅。",
  [18078219] = "没有专家拍摄也只能继续，但后期制作的时间翻了一倍。",
  [18078220] = "这种时候也只能辛苦万能的后期了。",
  [18079000] = "“巨壑迎秋，寒江印月。万籁悠悠，孤桐飒裂”——从“大圣遗音”琴的琴声中，我们也许能听见来自李唐的传说。",
  [18079001] = "这个世界有太多伪装。我疲累于保持完美的状态，就在我心灰意冷的时候，突然想起了他的话……",
  [18079002] = "其忧深思远，则舜与文王、孔子之遗音也……",
  [18079100] = "古琴的历史悠久，你需要一位研究古琴的专家来指导拍摄。",
  [18079111] = "%s对“大圣遗音”琴颇有研究，纪录片放出后受到广泛好评。",
  [18079112] = "%s对古琴一知半解，最后犯了许多低级错误。",
  [18079113] = "%s在这方面极其专业，但很多观众表示看不懂。",
  [18079114] = "%s热爱非主流文化，对古琴文化还没有你了解。",
  [18079119] = "没有专门的顾问，拍摄出现许多波折，但最后还是完成了。",
  [18079120] = "现在我也能算小半个专家了……",
  [18079200] = "弹奏古琴时的姿势仪态十分重要，你需要请一位专家来对演员进行突击训练。",
  [18079211] = "%s的仪态优雅如画，不仅打动了演员最终还打动了观众。",
  [18079212] = "%s教给了演员错误的弹琴姿势，纪录片播出后备受诟病。",
  [18079213] = "%s的训练太过严苛，演员始终无法毕业，拍摄一拖再拖。",
  [18079214] = "%s对古琴一窍不通，找他也没什么用。",
  [18079219] = "没有进行仪态训练，演员弹琴的动作十分僵硬。",
  [18079220] = "古人真是太不容易了！",
  [18080000] = "为了给金嵌珍珠天球仪的纪录片做前期宣传，我决定制作一部以“星空”为主题的宣传片，一定会引起共鸣的！",
  [18080001] = "我的脑海中已经不再有新的创意出现。就在我的大脑慢慢生锈的时候，突然有身影在我心中缓缓出现……",
  [18080002] = "在我们的精心制作下，宣传片质量极高，有些迫不及待地想放出了呢！",
  [18080100] = "制作一部受关注的宣传片从调查开始，你打算选择哪一位专家呢？",
  [18080111] = "%s通过多种途径进行调查，得到了非常详尽的结论。",
  [18080112] = "%s不知道该怎样调查，忙活了几天什么结论也没有得到。",
  [18080113] = "%s多方调查得出了一份网民欧非报告，但根本不是你需要的。",
  [18080114] = "%s还有其他工作，拒绝了你的邀请。",
  [18080119] = "没有经过前期调查，制作出来的宣传片反响平平。",
  [18080120] = "我从来不打没有准备的仗，但现实阻拦了我……",
  [18080200] = "优秀的宣传需要让人印象深刻的文案，你打算请一位专家来完成这项工作。",
  [18080211] = "%s为宣传片写出的文案不落俗套，以最简单的文字打动了观众。",
  [18080212] = "%s不知从哪儿吸取的灵感，整部宣传片充满了广告的意味。",
  [18080213] = "%s想用夸张的话语来吸引眼球，结果反而落了下乘。",
  [18080214] = "%s是个理科生，一直对语文极其苦手。",
  [18080219] = "没有邀请专家，普普通通的文案让人看过就忘了。",
  [18080220] = "古人言一字千金，现在的我完全认同……",
  [18081000] = "有不少观众在关注纪录片的拍摄进程，我决定将拍摄花絮制作成锦集放在公司官网上，作为纪录片的宣传之一。",
  [18081001] = "这个世界有太多伪装。我疲累于保持完美的状态，就在我心灰意冷的时候，突然想起了他的话……",
  [18081002] = "宣传的效果不错，这真是个极佳的决定！",
  [18081100] = "前往宫里拍摄需要众多设备和人员，你需要一位经验丰富的后勤来作为保障。",
  [18081111] = "%s有过多次跟组拍摄的经验，将一切处理得井井有条。",
  [18081112] = "%s毫无后勤的经验，经常丢三落四，大大拖延了拍摄进度。",
  [18081113] = "%s经验不足没有做好前期准备，所幸没有出现太大问题。",
  [18081114] = "%s是个摄影爱好者，沉迷于拍摄故宫不可自拔、",
  [18081119] = "拍摄在即，没有后勤你只能自己勉强接过重任了。",
  [18081120] = "这次真的累死我了……",
  [18081200] = "你打算让宫里的猫入境，但需要先请人来协助拍摄。",
  [18081211] = "%s自己养了十五只猫，很快就和故宫的猫保安们打好关系了。",
  [18081212] = "%s怕猫，怂怂地躲在摄影师后面不敢上前。",
  [18081213] = "小猫们完全不听%s的引导，拍摄过程很不顺利。",
  [18081214] = "%s一出现，不知道为什么猫们都跑掉了。",
  [18081219] = "听说故宫的猫根本不怕人，你觉得自己上也可以。",
  [18081220] = "在故宫撸猫，幸福程度简直翻倍！",
  [18082000] = "当所有人看到这件金嵌珍珠天球仪时，都会想到天空、想到星辰。从远古起，人们对于未知的探索就从未停止——我希望这部纪录片也能传达这份信念。",
  [18082001] = "我不知道我的决定究竟是会给我带来光明，还是引我走向深渊。就在我犹豫不决的时候，突然有温和的声音在我脑海中响起……",
  [18082002] = "拍摄结束后，我们一起去看星星吧？",
  [18082100] = "为了最大程度地展示金嵌珍珠天球仪的精致华美，你需要一位资深的摄影师。",
  [18082111] = "%s对镜头的把控登峰造极，天球仪的每个细节都拍摄得美轮美奂。",
  [18082112] = "%s手抖将天球仪的画面全都拍糊了，只能重拍一遍。",
  [18082113] = "%s刻意炫技，结果后期剪辑的时候作废了不少镜头。",
  [18082114] = "%s拿着摄影机研究了半天，也没搞懂怎么开机。",
  [18082119] = "没有摄影师，拍摄只能暂停了。",
  [18082120] = "用镜头讲述故事也不是件容易的事。",
  [18082200] = "所有镜头拍摄完成进入下一阶段后，剪辑至关重要，你打算选谁来负责？",
  [18082211] = "%s十分擅长纪录片的剪辑，恰到好处的节奏正适合这部讲述文物的片子。",
  [18082212] = "%s没有过相关经验，剪出的成品还有足足五个小时。",
  [18082213] = "%s剪出来的片子节奏很快，让人看得莫名其妙。",
  [18082214] = "%s不小心把硬盘格式化了，你请人恢复花了不少时间。",
  [18082219] = "你自己上阵剪辑，最后成品无功无过。",
  [18082220] = "想成为一个好的制作人，有时候什么都要会一点。",
  [18083000] = "The subway exit leads to that old abandoned Amusement Park? What... is going on?",
  [18083001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18083002] = "I wonder, will Kiro and I ever return to that happy time?",
  [18083100] = "Since you're back, you might as well look for clues you overlooked last time!",
  [18083101] = "Ask a nearby vendor.",
  [18083102] = "Ask the girl selling balloons.",
  [18083103] = "Go to the Music Fountain.",
  [18083111] = "You walk away empty handed, feeling ripped off.",
  [18083112] = "The girl tells you there's a parade happening in the next square.",
  [18083113] = "Suddenly you are hit by a powerful spout of water.",
  [18083120] = "The parade might hold some clues...",
  [18083200] = "The Amusement Park parade has started. You...",
  [18083201] = "Try to find the best vantage point.",
  [18083202] = "Yell out to your favorite character.",
  [18083203] = "Sneak up onto the parade float.",
  [18083211] = "You are squeezed out of the crowd.",
  [18083212] = "You're so excited by the ride, you completely forget why you are there.",
  [18083213] = "Up high, you can see in every direction.",
  [18083220] = "Now I don't have to go running around everywhere! Hooray!",
  [18083300] = "You see Kiro standing on the steps, waiting for \"you\". Seeing him, you...",
  [18083301] = "Have a boy deliver a candy to Kiro",
  [18083302] = "Wave at him and call out his name.",
  [18083303] = "Jump down the float to go find Kiro.",
  [18083311] = "Kiro takes the candy and ruffles the boy's hair.",
  [18083312] = "Your cover is blown. Park staff chase you off the float.",
  [18083313] = "Security grabs you from either side.",
  [18083320] = "If only I could be that kid, and give him the candy myself...",
  [18084000] = "The subway takes you to Ultima Bioresearch. It looks abandoned. The desolate structure looms in the twilight, its pitch black windows staring balefully at the unwelcome guest...",
  [18084001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18084002] = "Lucien... No, Ares. What is it that you want from me?",
  [18084100] = "Standing inside the empty building, you find it retains much of its old traits.",
  [18084101] = "Take a picture for future analysis.",
  [18084102] = "Proceed according to your memories.",
  [18084103] = "You look into each room in turn.",
  [18084111] = "You forget to turn off the shutter sound effect. Security hears you and chases you out.",
  [18084112] = "You find yourself in a vast, empty hall.",
  [18084113] = "The enormous institute is like a labyrinth and you lose your way.",
  [18084120] = "My memory's not that bad, after all...",
  [18084200] = "You come to a familiar chamber. You...",
  [18084201] = "Inspect the items on the floor.",
  [18084202] = "Try to turn on the lights.",
  [18084203] = "Close the door.",
  [18084211] = "You step around the shards of glass on the floor.",
  [18084212] = "The passage is eroded and hard to navigate.",
  [18084213] = "The lock is rusted shut. The door will not open.",
  [18084220] = "I won't make the same mistake again!",
  [18084300] = "You hear footsteps outside the building. Look for a place to hide!",
  [18084301] = "See if there are other exits.",
  [18084302] = "Escape out of a window.",
  [18084303] = "Whistle like a bird.",
  [18084311] = "You find an easy escape route and flee the scene.",
  [18084312] = "You misjudge the size of the window and get stuck.",
  [18084313] = "You manage to gain their attention.",
  [18084320] = "Bit of a scare. No real harm done...",
  [18085000] = "You're sitting in a snack bar near the river. The Loveland Bridge looks strong and solid in the cold light of evening. The river is tranquil. You're the only one who knows the ...",
  [18085001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18085002] = "The bridge... comes down, in the end...",
  [18085100] = "You see the black umbrella by the table. You know Shaw probably just left, so you...",
  [18085101] = "Run after him and hand it to him.",
  [18085102] = "Take the umbrella.",
  [18085103] = "Leave the umbrella where it is.",
  [18085111] = "He has already disappeared into the falling snow.",
  [18085112] = "The umbrella shields you from the freezing wind and you make easy progress down the street.",
  [18085113] = "The howling wind outside nearly knocks you off your feet.",
  [18085120] = "You can give it to him next time...",
  [18085200] = "Walking towards the bridge, you hear a familiar and ethereal piano piece. You...",
  [18085201] = "Hum along with the melody.",
  [18085202] = "Walk towards the sound.",
  [18085203] = "Make it a piano duel.",
  [18085211] = "The melody is too complex and you cannot keep up.",
  [18085212] = "The music becomes louder and louder. It feels like it is guiding you towards it.",
  [18085213] = "There's no Piano Shop nearby.",
  [18085220] = "The piano is calling to me...",
  [18085300] = "The bridge is about to explode. You've got to get the people off it!",
  [18085301] = "Grab the kid next to you and run.",
  [18085302] = "Yell at them to leave the bridge.",
  [18085303] = "Raise the alarm.",
  [18085311] = "There is an explosion behind you. The kid is safe from harm.",
  [18085312] = "They turn to look at you. Nobody moves.",
  [18085313] = "The police do not believe you.",
  [18085320] = "This isn't over...",
  [18086000] = "The dark gray exoskeleton, the soaring superstructure. Welcome to the—Central Quarantine Zone.",
  [18086001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18086002] = "Revisiting the scar in the recesses of your memory, it still feels painful and raw...",
  [18086100] = "You accompany Victor to the Zone. Instead of entering the main hall, you...",
  [18086101] = "Urge Victor to take care.",
  [18086102] = "Take his hand.",
  [18086103] = "Turn tail and run.",
  [18086111] = "Victor frowns and tells you to take care as well.",
  [18086112] = "Victor seems surprised, but then squeezes your hand tightly.",
  [18086113] = "Victor grabs you and drags you back.",
  [18086120] = "This time I'll be braver.",
  [18086200] = "This time, when you see them all walking like dead people, you...",
  [18086201] = "Tell them not to go in.",
  [18086202] = "Block their path.",
  [18086203] = "Look at Victor.",
  [18086211] = "They show no sign of hearing you.",
  [18086212] = "You almost fall down. Luckily Victor catches you before you hit the floor.",
  [18086213] = "Victor senses the danger and grips your hand more tightly.",
  [18086220] = "The warmth of his hand calms me.",
  [18086300] = "Before you enter at that fateful hall, you stop Victor and look directly at him.",
  [18086301] = "\"Come what may, I have no regrets.\"",
  [18086302] = "\"Let's go get bulletproof vests.\"",
  [18086303] = "\"How about another meal at Souvenir?\"",
  [18086311] = "After a moment, Victor's expression softens.",
  [18086312] = "Victor looks at you, his expression unreadable.",
  [18086313] = "Victor sighs and doesn't respond.",
  [18086320] = "Running away is no way to solve your problems.",
  [18087000] = "You sit on the number 330. The ride to the hospital is bumpy, as the driver accelerates and slams on the brakes repeatedly...",
  [18087001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18087002] = "Back then I didn't think our meeting was out of the ordinary. I never imagined it would be the cause of such great ructions.",
  [18087100] = "The driver's technique is really getting on your nerves. You decide to...",
  [18087101] = "Shove the driver aside.",
  [18087102] = "Open a window.",
  [18087103] = "Say you want to get off.",
  [18087111] = "He chases you off the bus.",
  [18087112] = "Cool air wafts over you, calming your nerves.",
  [18087113] = "You speak softly and he doesn't hear you.",
  [18087120] = "Ugh...",
  [18087200] = "To your surprise, the bus breaks down mid-journey. You decide to...",
  [18087201] = "Get off quickly.",
  [18087202] = "Get out and push.",
  [18087203] = "Wait patiently for maintenance.",
  [18087211] = "You find there are no other bus stops nearby.",
  [18087212] = "You unleash all your power. The bus doesn't budge an inch.",
  [18087213] = "The mechanic quickly identifies the problem and the bus continues on its way.",
  [18087220] = "Wave to the hardworking mechanic!",
  [18087300] = "A blue-haired boy with headphones gets onto the bus. He walks towards you...",
  [18087301] = "Put on your headphones.",
  [18087302] = "Change seats.",
  [18087303] = "Say hi.",
  [18087311] = "Interest flickers in his eyes.",
  [18087312] = "The bus starts to move. You fall down on the floor.",
  [18087313] = "He is wearing headphones and does not hear you.",
  [18087320] = "Headphones are cool, huh?! I've got some too—",
  [18088000] = "On an unfamiliar street, only the TV Tower in front of you. Will you make the same decision this time round?",
  [18088001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18088002] = "The lucky fountain pen is still gripped tightly in my hand.",
  [18088100] = "Two people argue about an elevator accident. They want your opinion. You...",
  [18088101] = "Excuse yourself and walk away.",
  [18088102] = "Flip a coin.",
  [18088103] = "Claim you didn't hear anything.",
  [18088111] = "The two parties drag you back.",
  [18088112] = "The coin lodges in a crack and there is no way to determine who is the winner.",
  [18088113] = "They expound their different theories at great length.",
  [18088120] = "A security guard steps blocks your way. The area has been roped off. You...",
  [18088200] = "Not everything is black or white. Not everything has a yes or no answer.",
  [18088201] = "Try to shake off the guard.",
  [18088202] = "Inform him you have superpowers.",
  [18088203] = "Claim to be a reporter.",
  [18088211] = "You are too weak.",
  [18088212] = "The guard looks stunned and dials 120.",
  [18088213] = "You pull out your Reporter ID and he lets you pass.",
  [18088220] = "I love my job!",
  [18088300] = "You are near where Lucien is chatting to BS members. You can hear his voice...",
  [18088301] = "Rush over and interrupt him.",
  [18088302] = "Turn on the recorder.",
  [18088303] = "Hide behind the tree and eavesdrop.",
  [18088311] = "You are too eager and trip over on a rock.",
  [18088312] = "Your mobile battery is too low...",
  [18088313] = "What you hear is truly horrifying.",
  [18088320] = "But is it the truth or a lie...?",
  [18089000] = "The strange fire, Josie going out of her mind... This time I'll buy Gavin more time!",
  [18089001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18089002] = "In Room 404 I sense the malice of Evols, like in a nightmare.",
  [18089100] = "The door to Room 404 is left ajar. This time you won't be surprised. You...",
  [18089101] = "Call the cops.",
  [18089102] = "Grab a fire extinguisher and go in.",
  [18089103] = "Wedge the door open with a chair.",
  [18089111] = "The signal is very poor.",
  [18089112] = "As you step over the threshold, the extinguisher in your hands vanishes.",
  [18089113] = "The door slams shut and the chair goes flying.",
  [18089120] = "The adversary is not to be underestimated...",
  [18089200] = "Josie is really aggressive. You decide to say something to stop her ranting...",
  [18089201] = "\"What color is your lipstick?\"",
  [18089202] = "\"You looked thinner in photos.\"",
  [18089203] = "\"...\"",
  [18089211] = "Josie pauses, the starts to explain where she got her lippy.",
  [18089212] = "Josie is enraged and starts recounting her struggle with weight in detail.",
  [18089213] = "Seeing your lack of reaction, Josie loses interest.",
  [18089220] = "Sometimes a cold shoulder is more effective than a sharp tongue.",
  [18089300] = "Josie's Evol goes critical. Avoid the blast!",
  [18089301] = "Run to the washroom.",
  [18089302] = "Throw your arms around her.",
  [18089303] = "Jump from side to side.",
  [18089311] = "The door is locked.",
  [18089312] = "Forcefully you throw your arms around Josie. Sure enough, the fire does not burn you.",
  [18089313] = "You soon discover the fancy anime move is not so useful in real life.",
  [18089320] = "No problem. I'm quick on my feet...",
  [18090000] = "A four-storey monolith, the most exacting levels, a world of hidden dangers...",
  [18090001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18090002] = "Dark clouds fill the sky on the day I remember.",
  [18090100] = "Opening your eyes, you are in the HBS secret room. You hear incoming footsteps.",
  [18090101] = "Hide and try to scare him.",
  [18090102] = "Make no sound.",
  [18090103] = "Yell out, to get his attention.",
  [18090111] = "You wait patiently, but the footsteps go off in another direction.",
  [18090112] = "He does not notice and brushes past you.",
  [18090113] = "You get his attention, but after a short pause, he heads off quickly in the other direction.",
  [18090120] = "There's a constant sense of foreboding...",
  [18090200] = "In the room corner you find illegible words carved into the wall...",
  [18090201] = "Grope at them with your fingertips.",
  [18090202] = "Use the mobile's torch function.",
  [18090203] = "Use a stone to scrape a line below.",
  [18090211] = "It's too long to make any sense of.",
  [18090212] = "It says something about Black Swan.",
  [18090213] = "Thinking better of it, you put the rock down.",
  [18090220] = "That Black Swan sure gets around...",
  [18090300] = "You hear Victor's voice off in the distance. You've got to get his attention...",
  [18090301] = "Kick at the door with all you have.",
  [18090302] = "You yell out Victor's name.",
  [18090303] = "Calculate the variables yourself.",
  [18090311] = "The sound of the door crashing in gains Victor's attention.",
  [18090312] = "Victor doesn't hear you and walks away. ",
  [18090313] = "You clearly overestimated your ability at math.",
  [18090320] = "Your foot might feel a bit numb... but at least you achieved your objective.",
  [18091000] = "The Hacker Summit is about to begin. Everyone is eager to meet Key and I am no exception...",
  [18091001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18091002] = "Key is about to make an appearance! I can barely wait!",
  [18091100] = "Before exchanging codes with Punkilles, you need to dress up. You decide to...",
  [18091101] = "Be a \"spike-haired punk\" like him.",
  [18091102] = "Wear an irresistible JK uniform.",
  [18091103] = "Try out hip hop street style.",
  [18091111] = "Punkilles thinks you're making fun of him and angrily shoos you away.",
  [18091112] = "Punkilles keeps a straight face and hands you a hundred dollar bill. You should try again.",
  [18091113] = "Punkilles thinks you look dumb, but flashes you the code anyway.",
  [18091120] = "Maybe I really DON'T know what's cool...",
  [18091200] = "Inside the Hacker Summit, people are giving you funny looks. You decide to...",
  [18091201] = "Find a quiet corner.",
  [18091202] = "Try and talk to someone nearby.",
  [18091203] = "Start freestylin'.",
  [18091211] = "They silently follow you.",
  [18091212] = "Their conversation makes about as much sense as Ancient Greek to you.",
  [18091213] = "They look away without saying a word.",
  [18091220] = "It's not so easy, being a TV spy...",
  [18091300] = "Someone who knows \"BigDaddy123\" asks why you ignored his messages. You say...",
  [18091301] = "\"I don't often check my messages! \"",
  [18091302] = "\"My English not good!\"",
  [18091303] = "\"Sorry. I forgot.\"",
  [18091311] = "He says he just saw you give a talk at the Hacking Workshop and knows you're lying.",
  [18091312] = "You start speaking a made-up language. He looks confused and walks off.",
  [18091313] = "He says he doesn't really know \"BigDaddy123\" and wants to know who you really are.",
  [18091320] = "I'm totally a natural at this cloak and dagger stuff...",
  [18092000] = "Movie night. A dark cloud gathers over the peaceful Orphanage...",
  [18092001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18092002] = "The storm must have gathered when I wasn't watching.",
  [18092100] = "The orphans are watching a show but they're making noises, so you decide to...",
  [18092101] = "Shout loudly.",
  [18092102] = "Bribe them with snacks.",
  [18092103] = "Tell them be quiet to get a reward.",
  [18092111] = "You scare the children and they start to cry.",
  [18092112] = "Their eyes light up, and they start watching quietly.",
  [18092113] = "They say they're big kids now, not 3 year olds.",
  [18092120] = "Snacks are a \"magic weapon\" when dealing with kids.",
  [18092200] = "After the show, the kids go back to their rooms, but one is missing. You...",
  [18092201] = "Look in the dorm.",
  [18092202] = "Look in the grounds.",
  [18092203] = "Check the classroom.",
  [18092211] = "Turns out the kid is already in bed, sound asleep.",
  [18092212] = "No sign of the kid. It's freezing outside.",
  [18092213] = "The classroom is completely empty.",
  [18092220] = "Kids sleep so soundly. They fall asleep, as soon as their heads hit the pillow—",
  [18092300] = "Outside, the wind flings a bedsheet on a tree. The teachers turn to you and Lucien...",
  [18092301] = "Get Lucien to help you take it down.",
  [18092302] = "Wait for the wind to die down.",
  [18092303] = "Volunteer to go and get it.",
  [18092311] = "Lucien nods, but he doesn't look too pleased about it.",
  [18092312] = "The wind intensifies and the sheet is swept away.",
  [18092313] = "You're blown into the tree too.",
  [18092320] = "Are scenes from the past being played out again...?",
  [18093000] = "The Station Director has a mission for you. He wants you to contact someone at the Police Headquarters...",
  [18093001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18093002] = "No doubt Gavin will be throwing his weight around at the Police Station...",
  [18093100] = "At the station, the guard says no appointment no entry and turns you away...",
  [18093101] = "Tell him you're looking for someone.",
  [18093102] = "Call Gavin right away.",
  [18093103] = "Show him your Journalist ID.",
  [18093111] = "He asks you to make an appointment and come back in a few days' time.",
  [18093112] = "You wait for ages but no one picks up.",
  [18093113] = "He says \"No photos allowed\" and ushers you into the station.",
  [18093120] = "Sometimes it's good to be a journalist...",
  [18093200] = "You're finally inside, but you've got no idea where Gavin works. You...",
  [18093201] = "Look for Major Crime Squad.",
  [18093202] = "Follow your nose.",
  [18093203] = "Ask the guard.",
  [18093211] = "You identify yourself as a journalist, but the police officers continue to eye you warily.",
  [18093212] = "You find Gavin's office, but there's no sign of him.",
  [18093213] = "The guard says \"How should I know?\"",
  [18093220] = "Where could Gavin have got to?",
  [18093300] = "A middle-aged officer approaches you and says he knows Gavin well. You ask him...",
  [18093301] = "How much does Gavin earn?",
  [18093302] = "Does Gavin have a girlfriend?",
  [18093303] = "Is Gavin still getting into fights?",
  [18093311] = "The Sergeant says a policeman's salary is his own business.",
  [18093312] = "The Sergeant admits lots of Gavin's female colleagues like him, but says none of them have got close.",
  [18093313] = "The Sergeant says Gavin doesn't lose anyway.",
  [18093320] = "I never realized Gavin was so popular in the station...",
  [18094000] = "Uncle John calls just as I get off the subway. He's thought of a way forward for my next program...",
  [18094001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18094002] = "I should find out more about Lucien before our next meeting.",
  [18094100] = "In the middle of Loveland University O-week, students ask you to join their club...",
  [18094101] = "Tell them you here to see Lucien.",
  [18094102] = "Inform them you're not a student.",
  [18094103] = "Ask them about their club.",
  [18094111] = "They assume you're one of Lucien's students and seem very envious.",
  [18094112] = "Hearing you're a postgrad, they want to gossip.",
  [18094113] = "They fall over themselves to explain and you're swept away by their enthusiasm.",
  [18094120] = "Looks like Lucien is very popular with the students!",
  [18094200] = "The campus is very big and you are lost. You'll be late if you don't hurry up. You...",
  [18094201] = "Open the map app on your phone.",
  [18094202] = "Get on the campus bus.",
  [18094203] = "Ask a student.",
  [18094211] = "The university roads are being repaired and the map is of little use.",
  [18094212] = "It takes you to another campus.",
  [18094213] = "The kindhearted student takes you to Lucien's building.",
  [18094220] = "I knew it! The students here are lovely!",
  [18094300] = "To prepare for the meeting, you ask a student in the corridor about Lucien...",
  [18094301] = "Are Prof. Lucien's classes popular?",
  [18094302] = "How old is Prof. Lucien?",
  [18094303] = "How does Prof. Lucien's hair look?",
  [18094311] = "He nods and says there are students sitting in the aisles.",
  [18094312] = "He says he's not sure, but he think the professor looks very young.",
  [18094313] = "He grimaces and says he wishes he had as much hair as Lucien does.",
  [18094320] = "He sounds like a total dreamboat...",
  [18095000] = "Next door to B.S. there's a well-stocked supermarket. It's a great place to get snacks at break time.",
  [18095001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18095002] = "Big celebrities are so cute when they think they're not being watched!",
  [18095100] = "In the supermarket, a tower of cans is about to topple. A kid will get hit!",
  [18095101] = "Tell him to run.",
  [18095102] = "Use your body to shield him.",
  [18095103] = "Pull him away from the splash zone.",
  [18095111] = "The kid hears you, but doesn't move.",
  [18095112] = "You take the brunt of the impact and fall on the kid as well.",
  [18095113] = "The kid gets out of the way.",
  [18095120] = "Bit of a scare. No real harm done...",
  [18095200] = "Your basket is still empty. What are you going to get?",
  [18095201] = "Spongy cream puffs",
  [18095202] = "Spicy sticks",
  [18095203] = "Bag of chips",
  [18095211] = "Recalling the heat level, you respectfully return it to the shelf.",
  [18095212] = "You realize with a start there's already a box at home.",
  [18095213] = "A blonde haired boy next to you reaches for the same bag of chips.",
  [18095220] = "It's you, Kiro!",
  [18095300] = "Kiro is in the chips section! A customer turns towards you. He can't see Kiro's face—",
  [18095301] = "Look at Kiro.",
  [18095302] = "Tackle Kiro to the ground.",
  [18095303] = "Grab Kiro and run outside.",
  [18095311] = "Kiro places his index finger on his lips, then takes your hand and crouches down.",
  [18095312] = "You must be heavier than you think and you hear Kiro groan.",
  [18095313] = "You forget to pay and the shopkeeper cuts you off.",
  [18095320] = "That was the moment you became \"partners in crime\"...",
  [18096000] = "A cold, impersonal air permeates glimmering halls of Loveland Financial Group, dooming you to meet...",
  [18096001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18096002] = "I should probably do a bit of background research. It might help in my negotiations with their CEO!",
  [18096100] = "Before you arrive at LFG, you do a google search on their CEO...",
  [18096101] = "How many properties does he own?",
  [18096102] = "What do people say about him?",
  [18096103] = "What does he look like?",
  [18096111] = "There's not much information, but it does say he has some investment properties.",
  [18096112] = "\"Business tycoon\", \"Capitalist scum\", \"Hottie patottie!\"...",
  [18096113] = "No search results. It seems the CEO is camera shy.",
  [18096120] = "Hm... Looks like complicated guy.",
  [18096200] = "The receptionist in the LFG lobby asks you to sign in. You pick up the pen and...",
  [18096201] = "Write down your nickname.",
  [18096202] = "Draw a little love heart.",
  [18096203] = "Add your number after your name.",
  [18096211] = "The receptionist insists your write your full name.",
  [18096212] = "The receptionist makes an unequivocal \"Please leave now\" gesture.",
  [18096213] = "You tell her the negotiation will be a success and Victor can call you to after.",
  [18096220] = "I've got this negotiation in the bag!",
  [18096300] = "Goldman approaches and insists you sign a Withdrawal Agreement. You clench your fists...",
  [18096301] = "Tell him you will not sign it.",
  [18096302] = "Throw the Agreement in his face.",
  [18096303] = "Ask to speak to the CEO.",
  [18096311] = "Goldman says unenthusiastically \"Sign or you'll regret it.\"",
  [18096312] = "Enraged, Goldman calls security and has you thrown out of the building.",
  [18096313] = "Goldman gets impatient and says the CEO is busy and has no time to indulge you.",
  [18096320] = "Won't I get to speak to him then?",
  [18097000] = "Steam and mouthwatering aromas waft out of the new Souvenir on Leaf Street.",
  [18097001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18097002] = "I can't wait to try the food at the Souvenir!",
  [18097100] = "As you approach the Souvenir, the tout at the place next door invites you inside...",
  [18097101] = "You politely refuse.",
  [18097102] = "You ask him about the Souvenir.",
  [18097103] = "Tell him you ate already.",
  [18097111] = "He tells you all about the menu inside his own restaurant.",
  [18097112] = "He grimly tells you it just opened, but he doesn't think it will be very successful.",
  [18097113] = "Just at that moment your stomach growls.",
  [18097120] = "That's a bit harsh, bad-mouthing the competition on their first day of business.",
  [18097200] = "Inside Souvenir everything looks very clean and new. What do you want to look at first?",
  [18097201] = "The kitchen.",
  [18097202] = "The decorations.",
  [18097203] = "The owner.",
  [18097211] = "There is a sign on the kitchen door which reads \"Staff Only\".",
  [18097212] = "The interior is simply decorated, with a few plants by the window.",
  [18097213] = "The waitress says the owner is not on the premises.",
  [18097220] = "Souvenir gets a lot more decorations in the future!",
  [18097300] = "You find a Guestbook sitting on a shelf. Leave Victor a message!",
  [18097301] = "Ignore the reviews. It's great!",
  [18097302] = "Guess who?",
  [18097303] = "More people will come if you are known!",
  [18097311] = "You pause for a second, then add a heart at the end.",
  [18097312] = "Victor doesn't know you yet, so you scribble out your message.",
  [18097313] = "You realize Victor doesn't care about how many customers there are.",
  [18097320] = "I hope he sees it!",
  [18098000] = "The bustling airport sees many partings and reunions and majestic entrances like his...",
  [18098001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18098002] = "I never thought I'd get to be a student and meet Lucien off the plane...",
  [18098100] = "Today is the day Lucien arrived in the city. You need to find out Lucien's flight...",
  [18098101] = "Go and ask at the Information Desk.",
  [18098102] = "Call Lucien.",
  [18098103] = "Go to the Arrival Hall.",
  [18098111] = "There's a long line of people already waiting in front of the Information Desk.",
  [18098112] = "Lucien doesn't use this number yet. You get a silent tone.",
  [18098113] = "Off in the distance you see someone holding up a \"Prof. Lucien\" sign.",
  [18098120] = "Lucien will be here any moment now!",
  [18098200] = "The students here think you are one of them and start gossiping about him. You tell them...",
  [18098201] = "I hear Prof. Lucien is single.",
  [18098202] = "I hear Prof. Lucien is very young.",
  [18098203] = "I hear Prof. Lucien is handsome.",
  [18098211] = "They say it's not unusual, for a researcher.",
  [18098212] = "They say they know. His CV is something to behold.",
  [18098213] = "They look at you dubiously.",
  [18098220] = "It seems they have very fixed ideas about what researchers are like...",
  [18098300] = "The Arrivals Hall is very crowded. Lucien doesn't see you and starts walking off...",
  [18098301] = "Yell out his name.",
  [18098302] = "Run towards him.",
  [18098303] = "Push through the crowd.",
  [18098311] = "The Airport is too noisy and he doesn't hear you.",
  [18098312] = "There's too many people and you become lost in the crowd.",
  [18098313] = "His gaze comes to rest on you. He looks mildly surprised.",
  [18098320] = "There you are, finally...",
  [18099000] = "Under the resplendent sun, many earnest young men and women stand in lines, making vows with their right arms up high.",
  [18099001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18099002] = "Inside hundreds of idealistic young people are committing themselves to the highest ideals.",
  [18099100] = "The guard stands in your way. He wants to see your ID before he lets you in. You...",
  [18099101] = "Tell him you forgot it.",
  [18099102] = "Tell him you're a family member.",
  [18099103] = "Call out to a passing police officer.",
  [18099111] = "The guard tells you to go and get it.",
  [18099112] = "The guard believes you and says \"I'll make a special exception\".",
  [18099113] = "When the officer hears you're looking for Gavin, he thinks better of it and leaves.",
  [18099120] = "Where DID I learn so much about Gavin...?",
  [18099200] = "\"I can't believe Gavin is already so big...\" Someone nearby seems to know Gavin. Ask her...",
  [18099201] = "What she thinks of him.",
  [18099202] = "Which department he will belong.",
  [18099203] = "How she knows him.",
  [18099211] = "A quiet boy with a bit of a temper. Conscientious though.",
  [18099212] = "She shakes her head.",
  [18099213] = "She says her son got into a fight with Gavin when they were little and she's still angry about it.",
  [18099220] = "He's always been conscientious, in everything he does.",
  [18099300] = "Gavin notices you. He looks astonished, then frowns deeply. \"Who are you?\" he asks.",
  [18099301] = "Claim to be his cousin.",
  [18099302] = "Identify yourself directly.",
  [18099303] = "\"Food delivery.\"",
  [18099311] = "Gavin looks a bit uncertain, but decides to believe you.",
  [18099312] = "Gavin's frown deepens, compelling you to tell the truth.",
  [18099313] = "Gavin calls the guard over and you are escorted out.",
  [18099320] = "Now that's the Gavin I know.",
  [18100000] = "The waving fluorescent wands, the cheering crowds, all that fervor directed at one person on the stage.",
  [18100001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18100002] = "Nothing can hold Kiro back, especially when he's on stage.",
  [18100100] = "The subway delivers you to Kiro's first concert. You don't have any merch for calls. You...",
  [18100101] = "Buy a fluorescent wand nearby.",
  [18100102] = "Ask one of the groupies nearby.",
  [18100103] = "Use your mobile flashlight instead.",
  [18100111] = "All the exclusive fluorescent wands have been sold out.",
  [18100112] = "She takes pity on you and gives you a spare one.",
  [18100113] = "The bright flashlight looks out of place among all the golden fluorescent wands.",
  [18100120] = "Kiro's fans really are lovely people.",
  [18100200] = "A fan in front of you is dancing around, blocking everyone's view behind. You...",
  [18100201] = "Ask her to sit down.",
  [18100202] = "Tap her on the shoulder.",
  [18100203] = "Call security.",
  [18100211] = "The concert is too loud and she doesn't hear you.",
  [18100212] = "She seems not to hear you. Maybe she’s just ignoring you",
  [18100213] = "Security gives her a lecture and she realizes her mistake.",
  [18100220] = "Anyway, people need to respect the rules!",
  [18100300] = "Kiro is walking towards you smiling. The fans go wild, eager for fan service...",
  [18100301] = "Start copying his dance moves.",
  [18100302] = "Call out his name.",
  [18100303] = "Smile and wave at him.",
  [18100311] = "You really overdo it, annoying the people around you.",
  [18100312] = "You voice is drowned out by the screaming.",
  [18100313] = "He winks and waves at you.",
  [18100320] = "Did he just wave at me...?",
  [18101000] = "Returning to the Miracle Finder movie set, seeing the crew members running around everywhere fills you with nostalgia...",
  [18101001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18101002] = "I love hanging around movie sets!",
  [18101100] = "The crew is busy. No one notices the lighting rig that's about to fall...",
  [18101101] = "Ignore it.",
  [18101102] = "Step out of the way.",
  [18101103] = "Warn everyone.",
  [18101111] = "The light hits you.",
  [18101112] = "The light hits a crew member.",
  [18101113] = "They get out of the way.",
  [18101120] = "Somebody really needs to check that equipment!",
  [18101200] = "The crisis averted, Anna spots you. She asks you what you're doing here...",
  [18101201] = "I was just passing.",
  [18101202] = "I'm looking for my father.",
  [18101203] = "It's a free day.",
  [18101211] = "Anna thinks you should get to class.",
  [18101212] = "Anna says he just left the movie set. He will be back presently.",
  [18101213] = "Anna suddenly realizes it's the weekend. She totally lost track of the time.",
  [18101220] = "Anna has been working too hard...",
  [18101300] = "Since you're at the set, you might as well eat. There are three lunch boxes. You pick...",
  [18101301] = "Fast food.",
  [18101302] = "Noodles.",
  [18101303] = "Home cooking.",
  [18101311] = "The flavor is exactly the same.",
  [18101312] = "You find a hair.",
  [18101313] = "It really does taste like home—",
  [18101320] = "I promise I'll make something of myself, Daddy.",
  [18102000] = "It didn't take long for B.S. to become a focal point for the local entertainment industry in Loveland City.",
  [18102001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18102002] = "Hard to believe this company casts such a long shadow?",
  [18102100] = "In the lobby of the B.S. building, you overhear two people discussing Miracle Finder. You...",
  [18102101] = "Move closer to hear better.",
  [18102102] = "Join in their conversation.",
  [18102103] = "Hide behind a plant pot.",
  [18102111] = "They are planning to arrange a spot for one of their celebrities on Miracle Finder.",
  [18102112] = "They look at you for a moment, then call security.",
  [18102113] = "Your strange behavior attracts their attention.",
  [18102120] = "Haha, Miracle Finder is all the rage—",
  [18102200] = "Call it instinct, but you get the sense someone is looking right at you. You...",
  [18102201] = "Call out to him.",
  [18102202] = "Speed up and try to lose him.",
  [18102203] = "Suddenly change directions.",
  [18102211] = "You turn around and find no one there.",
  [18102212] = "Your weird behavior attracts the attention of others in the area.",
  [18102213] = "You lose him.",
  [18102220] = "Will the weirdness never end?",
  [18102300] = "You see Savin! He looks like he is waiting for someone. Maybe I should say hello?",
  [18102301] = "Hesitate.",
  [18102302] = "Don't go over.",
  [18102303] = "Go over.",
  [18102311] = "As you hesitate, you see Kiro walk over.",
  [18102312] = "Just as you turn to leave, you bump into an employee.",
  [18102313] = "Savin mistakes you for a journalist and calls security.",
  [18102320] = "If we could sign a big star like Kiro one day...",
  [18103000] = "At the Loveland University commencement ceremony, a First Year representative gets up on stage to speak...",
  [18103001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18103002] = "It reminds me of my own commencement ceremony!",
  [18103100] = "At the commencement ceremony, a student turns and asks what you're majoring in...",
  [18103101] = "\"Mind your own bees wax!\"",
  [18103102] = "\"I'm a professor actually.\"",
  [18103103] = "\"Sinhalese Language.\"",
  [18103111] = "He looks offended. \"What's YOUR problem?\" he says.",
  [18103112] = "He looks skeptical. \"As if\" he says.",
  [18103113] = "He looks confused. He's clearly never heard of that major.",
  [18103120] = "There's something to be said for doing obscure topics.",
  [18103200] = "The next speaker has got his shirt on back to front. Maybe you should inform him...",
  [18103201] = "Pretend not to notice it.",
  [18103202] = "Sidle up to him and whisper to him.",
  [18103203] = "Tell him using body language.",
  [18103211] = "The whole auditorium laughs at him, and he runs out crying.",
  [18103212] = "He thanks you, and tells you you have a leaf stuck in your hair.",
  [18103213] = "A tutor berates you.",
  [18103220] = "To help others is to help yourself.",
  [18103300] = "Victor gets up to speak. The student supposed to present the flowers to him is ill.",
  [18103301] = "Watch quietly.",
  [18103302] = "Ask another student to replace him.",
  [18103303] = "Stand in for him.",
  [18103311] = "The MC mistakes you for the student in charge of the flowers and reprimands you.",
  [18103312] = "The student looks up at Victor on the stage and shakes his head, terrified.",
  [18103313] = "Victor accepts the flowers and says boredly, \"Thanks\".",
  [18103320] = "Strong aura...",
  [18104000] = "In the leafy college grounds you see him, Lucien before he was a Professor...",
  [18104001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18104002] = "So this is where he went to school...",
  [18104100] = "An orderly stops you and asks to see some ID. You tell him...",
  [18104101] = "\"Sorry, my English not good.\"",
  [18104102] = "\"You know everyone by sight?!”",
  [18104103] = "\"My brother is a student.\"",
  [18104111] = "To your surprise the orderly is Chinese background and switches into Chinese.",
  [18104112] = "The orderly accepts your point and lets you through.",
  [18104113] = "The orderly says family members also have to show ID.",
  [18104120] = "That orderly's got a nerve...",
  [18104200] = "Looks like the college is preparing for an event. Where do you look for Lucien?",
  [18104201] = "Sports field.",
  [18104202] = "Library.",
  [18104203] = "Classroom.",
  [18104211] = "A crowd has gathered around the field. You try to catch sight of Lucien.",
  [18104212] = "You need to swipe a card to enter the library. You have no choice but to leave.",
  [18104213] = "The classroom is completely empty.",
  [18104220] = "Where could Lucien be...?",
  [18104300] = "Someone behind you says \"Miss?\" You turn around and see a youthful Lucien...",
  [18104301] = "\"Oh, hi—\"",
  [18104302] = "\"You... Wow, you're super cute!\"",
  [18104303] = "\"Lucien! I've been looking for you!\"",
  [18104311] = "Lucien looks you up and down, skeptically.",
  [18104312] = "Lucien walks out without saying a word. A minute or two later security arrives and escorts you out.",
  [18104313] = "Lucien frowns. He thinks you are a stalker.",
  [18104320] = "He's changed...",
  [18105000] = "The subway cars roar through the night, carrying you on your way to see Gavin.",
  [18105001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18105002] = "A wild nighttime rendezvous.",
  [18105100] = "The subway spits you out somewhere unknown. It is dark and deserted. You...",
  [18105101] = "Find somewhere with a bit of light.",
  [18105102] = "Open the map on your phone.",
  [18105103] = "Yell out \"ANYONE THERE?!\"",
  [18105111] = "There isn't a light anywhere.",
  [18105112] = "The map indicates you are on the outskirts of Loveland City.",
  [18105113] = "A second later the echo comes back to you.",
  [18105120] = "What am I doing here?!",
  [18105200] = "You push on down the road. Suddenly you hear the sound of a motorbike...",
  [18105201] = "Hide.",
  [18105202] = "Call the police.",
  [18105203] = "Get off the road.",
  [18105211] = "There's nothing to hide behind.",
  [18105212] = "There's no signal.",
  [18105213] = "He sees you and comes to a stop in front of you.",
  [18105220] = "No pepper spray... Hope he's a good guy.",
  [18105300] = "It's Gavin! He doesn't recognize you in the dark. He asks what you're doing out here...",
  [18105301] = "I took the subway.",
  [18105302] = "I'm out for a walk.",
  [18105303] = "I'm lost.",
  [18105311] = "Gavin looks confused. \"There's no subway station around here.\"",
  [18105312] = "Gavin frowns. \"You like to walk on highways?\"",
  [18105313] = "Gavin sighs. \"It's not safe here at night. Let me take you back.\"",
  [18105320] = "Gavin, reliable as ever!",
  [18106000] = "A kid's dream takes flight in the noisy Subway Music Studio...",
  [18106001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18106002] = "The lively music is infectious and you start moving with the beat...",
  [18106100] = "Many bands rehearse here. The rooms are for different music. You decide to look in the...",
  [18106101] = "Rock Studio.",
  [18106102] = "Classic Studio.",
  [18106103] = "Pop Music Studio.",
  [18106111] = "You see loads of \"Punkilles\".",
  [18106112] = "No one's rehearsing classical music today. ",
  [18106113] = "Kiro is practicing a bunch of cool-looking foreign kids.",
  [18106120] = "Yes! I found him!",
  [18106200] = "You never knew Kiro came here as a kid. The band says you can pick a song...",
  [18106201] = "\"Piggy Disco\".",
  [18106202] = "Any Chinese song will do.",
  [18106203] = "Sing him a song.",
  [18106211] = "Kiro smiles and says he hasn't heard that one.",
  [18106212] = "Kiro scratches his head and says he doesn't remember and Chinese songs.",
  [18106213] = "You sing \"Starlight Confession\". Kiro laughs and starts to accompany you.",
  [18106220] = "Let me sing you a song—our song...",
  [18106300] = "Afterwards Kiro walks over and asks you what you think of his new song...",
  [18106301] = "\"Great! Just I didn't catch the lyrics...\"",
  [18106302] = "\"Faultless!\"",
  [18106303] = "\"It could use some freestyle...\"",
  [18106311] = "Kiro gives a snort of laughter.",
  [18106312] = "Kiro says that's nice, but he'd still like to know your opinion.",
  [18106313] = "Kiro looks disappointed and says he'll include some rap elements in his next song.",
  [18106320] = "Kiro promises he'll do a Chinese version next time too!",
  [18107000] = "Going back in time, the most obvious thing to do is... buy a lottery ticket!",
  [18107001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18107002] = "Lottery scratchcards are fun too!",
  [18107100] = "The Lotto Center is packed. Someone grabs your elbow and says you can make a fortune...",
  [18107101] = "Call the police.",
  [18107102] = "Follow him.",
  [18107103] = "Scream \"FREE LUNCH DOEN'T EXIST!!!\"",
  [18107111] = "He runs away in fright.",
  [18107112] = "He rips you off.",
  [18107113] = "The people buying Lotto tickets stare at you coldly.",
  [18107120] = "Better tell the police about the scammer—",
  [18107200] = "You ask a ticket, but you realize you forgot the winning number. Instead you enter...",
  [18107201] = "Today's date.",
  [18107202] = "Your birthday.",
  [18107203] = "Your lucky number.",
  [18107211] = "When the number is announced, it's not yours.",
  [18107212] = "You have the winning number... for last week.",
  [18107213] = "Your confidence impresses your neighbor who writes down the same number.",
  [18107220] = "I've got a good feeling about this one!",
  [18107300] = "A strange woman says she's from the future and knows today's number. Do you listen to her?",
  [18107301] = "Tell her you're from the future too.",
  [18107302] = "Go over.",
  [18107303] = "Don't go over.",
  [18107311] = "She looks at you sympathetically and says \"I thought I was crazy!\"",
  [18107312] = "She says it will cost you extra if you want to know.",
  [18107313] = "She tries someone else.",
  [18107320] = "I'll trust my own luck thanks!",
  [18108000] = "The New Light Mall of a few years back, before it was renovated, still exhibits vestiges of yesteryear...",
  [18108001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18108002] = "New Light Mall is like a small village that has grown into a mighty city.",
  [18108100] = "The old fast food joint in the food court is still open. You go in and order...",
  [18108101] = "A French banquet.",
  [18108102] = "Your old favorite.",
  [18108103] = "Their best-selling meal.",
  [18108111] = "The manager says \"We only sell fast food!\"",
  [18108112] = "It tastes just like you remember it.",
  [18108113] = "The manager says they are sold out.",
  [18108120] = "Mmmm, good as ever.",
  [18108200] = "Uh-oh. You don't have any cash. Everyone uses cards now! The manager is getting angry...",
  [18108201] = "Call a friend for help.",
  [18108202] = "Tell him you'll become a producer.",
  [18108203] = "Apologize sincerely.",
  [18108211] = "You pull out the latest model phone, causing a great stir.",
  [18108212] = "He laughs and says \"Next you'll be telling me you're the Monkey King!\"",
  [18108213] = "You tell him you'll stay back and wash the dishes. He is very magnanimous and forgives you.",
  [18108220] = "Sincerity is the key to people's hearts.",
  [18108300] = "In the mall, you see your classmates. They are chatting as they walk towards you...",
  [18108301] = "Watch them without saying anything.",
  [18108302] = "Wave to them and say hi.",
  [18108303] = "Ask them if you can get a selfie.",
  [18108311] = "You engrave their smiles in your heart forever.",
  [18108312] = "They look worried and give you a wide berth.",
  [18108313] = "They think you're weird and say no.",
  [18108320] = "It's been ages. How have guys you been doing...?",
  [18109000] = "Central Park bustling with children of all ages playing happily...",
  [18109001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18109002] = "I always used to come to Central Park with my friends to play!",
  [18109100] = "One boy is alone, not playing with the other children. Seeing this, you...",
  [18109101] = "Tell the other children off.",
  [18109102] = "Go over and talk to him.",
  [18109103] = "Ask him if he wants to play with you.",
  [18109111] = "They say they don't know him.",
  [18109112] = "He says he's waiting for his mum.",
  [18109113] = "He says no.",
  [18109120] = "Oh, my mistake.",
  [18109200] = "Out of nowhere a dog dashes towards the children. The owner has let get go of its leash—",
  [18109201] = "Intercept it.",
  [18109202] = "Bark at the dog.",
  [18109203] = "Tell the children to run.",
  [18109211] = "You deftly grab its leash.",
  [18109212] = "Your bark sounds terrible and it ignores you.",
  [18109213] = "Some of the children stand there, rooted to the spot.",
  [18109220] = "That was close...",
  [18109300] = "The crisis is averted. You hear a \"Thanks\" from behind. Turning around is a young Victor!",
  [18109301] = "Ask him if he has a Thank You gift.",
  [18109302] = "Tell him he should learn from you.",
  [18109303] = "Pat him on the head.",
  [18109311] = "Victor pauses for a moment, then gives you his card.",
  [18109312] = "He gives you a puzzled look and says nothing.",
  [18109313] = "He reaches out his hand and stops you.",
  [18109320] = "Typical Victor...",
  [18110000] = "Under a leaden sky a lone figure stands beneath the flickering traffic light.",
  [18110001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18110002] = "His restless heart meanders the space at the crossroads.",
  [18110100] = "Fine drizzle starts falling on your head. You'd better get out of the rain!",
  [18110101] = "Make for the Bus Stop.",
  [18110102] = "Stay put.",
  [18110103] = "Run into a shop.",
  [18110111] = "The Bus Stop is too far away.",
  [18110112] = "The fine drizzle falls on your face, so softly you can barely feel it.",
  [18110113] = "The road is slippery and you fall over.",
  [18110120] = "Sometimes it's nice to get back to nature.",
  [18110200] = "A granny is pulling a trolley. A wheels comes off, threatening to spill her shopping.",
  [18110201] = "Warn her.",
  [18110202] = "Steady the trolley.",
  [18110203] = "Help her pick up after the fall.",
  [18110211] = "She's too slow and all her stuff lands on the floor.",
  [18110212] = "She smiles and thanks you.",
  [18110213] = "The load was mostly papers and cannot be retrieved.",
  [18110220] = "Old people need to be careful when walking in the rain...",
  [18110300] = "You notice a boy standing at the crossroads ahead. Isn't that... Lucien?",
  [18110301] = "See what he does.",
  [18110302] = "Call out to him.",
  [18110303] = "Grab his hand.",
  [18110311] = "He's just standing there, looking blankly up at the traffic lights.",
  [18110312] = "He doesn't appear to hear you.",
  [18110313] = "He throws off you hand.",
  [18110320] = "Does he want to cross the road...?",
  [18111000] = "A bowl of noodles garnished with a soft boiled egg, takes me back in time...",
  [18111001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18111002] = "Running a Noodle Bar can't be easy.",
  [18111100] = "A stray cat is eyeing the food the manager has laid out to dry on the sidewalk. You...",
  [18111101] = "Shoo the cat away.",
  [18111102] = "Go and grab the food.",
  [18111103] = "Buy some cat biscuits to give it.",
  [18111111] = "The cat swipes at you angrily.",
  [18111112] = "The manager mistakes you for a thief and chases you off.",
  [18111113] = "The cat tucks in happily.",
  [18111120] = "You're pleased, but that also happened to be your last coin...",
  [18111200] = "The manager offers you noodles for your trouble. You wonder which flavor to choose...",
  [18111201] = "Ask the manager to recommend one.",
  [18111202] = "Tom yum soup.",
  [18111203] = "Your favorite from high school.",
  [18111211] = "The manager gets you a bowl of Chili Beef Noodles",
  [18111212] = "The manager says they don't have that dish.",
  [18111213] = "The familiar smell assails your nostrils and you dive right in.",
  [18111220] = "It takes you right back to your high school days—",
  [18111300] = "To your surprise the today's last customer is Gavin, only... he looks a lot smaller...",
  [18111301] = "Smile at him.",
  [18111302] = "Take a sneaky photo.",
  [18111303] = "Pinch his cheek.",
  [18111311] = "He gives you an odd look, but says nothing.",
  [18111312] = "You forget the flash is on. Gavin demands you delete the photo or he will call the cops.",
  [18111313] = "As soon as you get close he runs out the door.",
  [18111320] = "I'd know that look anywhere—",
  [18112000] = "In the glamorous Celebrity Salon there's a beautiful blonde haired boy. He looks as pretty as a picture.",
  [18112001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18112002] = "I don't really fit in here, with all the rich and famous people.",
  [18112100] = "A wealthy lady strikes up a conversation with you and asks what art you practice...",
  [18112101] = "Jewellery.",
  [18112102] = "Television.",
  [18112103] = "Cosmetics.",
  [18112111] = "She asks your opinion about a piece of jewellery she just bought.",
  [18112112] = "She looks at you apologetically and says she doesn't watch a lot of TV.",
  [18112113] = "Other women start to pay attention to your conversation.",
  [18112120] = "Maybe tell her a bit more about Miracle Finder...",
  [18112200] = "Kiro is surrounded by admirers but looks distressed and about to cry...",
  [18112201] = "Sing him a song.",
  [18112202] = "Pull a funny face.",
  [18112203] = "Give him a snack.",
  [18112211] = "He doesn't look any happier, and says \"You're off-key.\"",
  [18112212] = "Kiro starts crying.",
  [18112213] = "Kiro hesitates for a moment, then starts eating. He seems a bit happier.",
  [18112220] = "So Kiro always liked snacks...",
  [18112300] = "You try to lead Kiro outside, but are cut off by a maid. She asks your identity...",
  [18112301] = "\"I am a friend of Madame Seidel's.\"",
  [18112302] = "\"I know this boy.\"",
  [18112303] = "Look at Kiro.",
  [18112311] = "They check the invitation list, but cannot find your name.",
  [18112312] = "They don't believe you and move him away from you.",
  [18112313] = "Kiro squeezes your hand, and tells the maid you're his friend.",
  [18112320] = "His hand is still trembling a little...",
  [18113000] = "For as long as you can remember Verdant Plaza has been a major destination in Loveland City, but today its flower beds and paving stones look especially bright in the sunshine...",
  [18113001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18113002] = "This is the golden age when father created Miracle Finder. I'll continue his legacy, I swear it!",
  [18113100] = "There's a newsstand nearby. It's full of popular magazines. What do you want to read?",
  [18113101] = "Miracle Finder Special Edition",
  [18113102] = "E Weekly",
  [18113103] = "Teen Scholar Weekly",
  [18113111] = "It's too popular. There are none left.",
  [18113112] = "E Weekly just rehashes the stories in Miracle Finder.",
  [18113113] = "Too many years have passed and you can't understand what it's talking about. ",
  [18113120] = "Miracle Finder really was ahead of its time.",
  [18113200] = "Two customers fight over the last copy of Miracle Finder Special Edition. You...",
  [18113201] = "\"What's special about Miracle Finder?\"",
  [18113202] = "Ask the shopkeeper how much.",
  [18113203] = "Ask them why they are fighting.",
  [18113211] = "They look at you like you are stupid.",
  [18113212] = "You buy it and walk away.",
  [18113213] = "They say the issue includes a detailed report on the \"Case of the Missing Waterfall\".",
  [18113220] = "The Case of the Missing Waterfall. Father was very involved in that story...",
  [18113300] = "Miracle Finder starts playing on the TV. The shopkeeper reaches to change the channel...",
  [18113301] = "Tell him this episode is a good one.",
  [18113302] = "Ask him to change the channel.",
  [18113303] = "Stop him.",
  [18113311] = "He watches for 5 minutes without changing the channel.",
  [18113312] = "He starts watching a Courtroom Drama and falls right to sleep.",
  [18113313] = "He says he's the boss of the TV and ruthlessly changes the channel.",
  [18113320] = "Miracle Finder won't disappoint you—",
  [18114000] = "You've returned to the Twin Leaves Orphanage just after the incident. Confusion reigns; reporters, police and onlookers are everywhere...",
  [18114001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of him...",
  [18114002] = "The last place you come to is the starting point for all that follows.",
  [18114100] = "A reporter stops you and asks your view of the events at the Twin Leaves Orphanage...",
  [18114101] = "\"What happened?\"",
  [18114102] = "\"There must be a conspiracy behind it...\"",
  [18114103] = "\"The poor children.\"",
  [18114111] = "The reporter thinks he's asked the wrong person.",
  [18114112] = "The reporter likes your response and decides to include it in his report.",
  [18114113] = "The reporter nods in agreement.",
  [18114120] = "One day the truth will come out.",
  [18114200] = "Up ahead you see a figure with a B.S. logo dart out of the crowd. You decide to...",
  [18114201] = "Call the police.",
  [18114202] = "Call out to him.",
  [18114203] = "Chase him.",
  [18114211] = "By the time the police arrive, there is no sign of him.",
  [18114212] = "He ignores you.",
  [18114213] = "You find a note on the road. \"Program reactivated. Evacuate immediately.\"",
  [18114220] = "B.S. is like a bad penny...",
  [18114300] = "You find a doll in the corner of the Orphanage. It looks like the one you lost. You...",
  [18114301] = "Put it back.",
  [18114302] = "Give it to one of the children.",
  [18114303] = "Decide to take it.",
  [18114311] = "Someone throw it in the trash.",
  [18114312] = "The little girls says happily: \"Thank you!!!\"",
  [18114313] = "When you get back to the subway car, the doll disappears.",
  [18114320] = "If only I could keep it for a little while...",
  [18120000] = "I'm going to the Rose Festival with Victor! But first, I need to buy something for the trip!",
  [18120001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [18120002] = "With enough preparation, this trip is guaranteed to be a success!",
  [18120100] = "A single trip will take over a dozen hours. You're standing before the food shelf, looking to buy something for the road...",
  [18120101] = "Buy candies",
  [18120102] = "Buy bread",
  [18120103] = "Buy fruits",
  [18120111] = "Victor stops you from reaching for the shelf for the fifth time: \"Too many sweets are bad for your teeth.\"",
  [18120112] = "While accusing you of being childish, Victor gets you the freshest bread from the shelf.",
  [18120113] = "You put the apple in your hand back on the shelf because it occurs to you that you might not be able to get it through the customs.",
  [18120120] = "Red Bean Buns, Matcha Buns, Cranberry Buns, Coconut Buns♪",
  [18120200] = "You suddenly realize you and Victor got separated in the crowd...",
  [18120201] = "Wait where you are",
  [18120202] = "Call him",
  [18120203] = "Use the service center radio",
  [18120211] = "After waiting for ten minutes, your legs become sore.",
  [18120212] = "\"I'm right behind you, idiot.\" Victor approaches you with your favorite snack.",
  [18120213] = "A loudspeaker blares: \"Little Victor, Little Victor, your $u is waiting for you at the service center.\"",
  [18120220] = "In modern society, this is the most convenient way to do it!",
  [18121000] = "Before I depart, I'll treat myself to a meal at Souvenir!",
  [18121001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [18121002] = "This is a place where so many memories were made. Hope it can carry on forever.",
  [18121100] = "You decide to do a cleaning of Souvenir. But where to start...",
  [18121101] = "Glass window",
  [18121102] = "Kitchen",
  [18121103] = "Front porch",
  [18121111] = "Since eyes are the window to the soul, does it mean the window is Souvenir's eyes?",
  [18121112] = "The kitchen is the heart of Souvenir. Keeping it clean is crucial to keeping the food delicious!",
  [18121113] = "Once you finish cleaning the inside of the house, you realize the door got dirty again... Next time clean the inside first.",
  [18121120] = "I might be a bad cook, but I'm certainly a good cleaner!",
  [18121200] = "You have finished cleaning the place and are about to start preparing dinner. Just then, a mother and daughter push open the door...",
  [18121201] = "Ask Victor to attend to them while you prepare dinner.",
  [18121202] = "Get them seated and bring them a menu.",
  [18121203] = "Tell them you're closed and that they can come next time.",
  [18121211] = "Victor raises his eyebrows and smiles at you: \"Are you planning on being the chef of Souvenir?\"",
  [18121212] = "You receive hefty praise for the delicious food because you're mistaken as the owner of the restaurant.",
  [18121213] = "The little girl breaks into a wail. You have to share your pudding with her.",
  [18121220] = "Despite the little incident, this is a romantic night.",
  [18122000] = "Let go of your concerns and get ready for a romantic trip.",
  [18122001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of his words...",
  [18122002] = "Thus begins our romantic trip...",
  [18122100] = "On your way home, you see a boy standing alone at the entrance of the neighborhood...",
  [18122101] = "Alert the neighborhood guard.",
  [18122102] = "Cheer him up with a piece of candy.",
  [18122103] = "Walk up to him, squat down and ask if he's lost.",
  [18122111] = "The guard is occupied with something else. You lead the boy into the guard's room.",
  [18122112] = "The boy eats the candy and clutches the brim of your dress. He won't let you go.",
  [18122113] = "The boy pouts and cries as he tells you how he and his mother got separated.",
  [18122120] = "Return him to his home first.",
  [18122200] = "You are too excited to sleep. Victor, who's on the other end of the phone, asks what it will take to get you to sleep...",
  [18122201] = "Count puddings!",
  [18122202] = "Recite dish names?",
  [18122203] = "Have a chat.",
  [18122211] = "\"You're like a five-year-old about to go on a spring outing.\" As he's saying that, he begins the counting.",
  [18122212] = "Oh no, it makes you hungry...",
  [18122213] = "Soothed by his voice, you drift off to sleep.",
  [18122220] = "Start the journey with a sweet dream.",
  [18123000] = "Lucien is said to be working on a new research project. Pay him a visit!",
  [18123001] = "I don't know whether my decision will bring me light or push me towards the abyss. But as I hesitate, a warm voice speaks to me inside my mind...",
  [18123002] = "Scientific researchers are a busy bunch...",
  [18123100] = "Lucien is not at his lab. Where to go look for him?",
  [18123101] = "Maybe he's at the office.",
  [18123102] = "Go check the conference room!",
  [18123103] = "Is he taking a stroll in the courtyard?",
  [18123111] = "Not a soul in his office, only files...",
  [18123112] = "His gentle yet firm voice reaches your ears before you get to the door.",
  [18123113] = "There's no one in the courtyard. The other researchers are probably too busy to come out here to sunbathe.",
  [18123120] = "I'm going to make him the subject of my next documentary, which will be titled \"A Researcher's Typical Day\".",
  [18123200] = "Lucien is at a meeting. You look around outside the meeting room and decide to...",
  [18123201] = "Peek in through the window.",
  [18123202] = "Sneak inside.",
  [18123203] = "Take a walk somewhere else until the meeting is over.",
  [18123211] = "Noticing your gaze, he smiles at you and points at the watch on his wrist to signal you to wait.",
  [18123212] = "Seeing that everyone at the meeting is voicing their opinion, you decide not to disturb them by going in.",
  [18123213] = "You go for a walk in the courtyard. As you are counting the time, Lucien walks up to you and takes your hand. ",
  [18123220] = "Lucien has a different kind of charm when he's working.",
  [18124000] = "He's brought home a lot of files that need sorting. Go give him a hand...",
  [18124001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [18124002] = "Sorting files is a finicky job.",
  [18124100] = "Lucien is busy sorting files. What can you do for him?",
  [18124101] = "Join him",
  [18124102] = "Make him a cup of tea",
  [18124103] = "Give him a back massage",
  [18124111] = "You want to help, but you don't know how to sort those academic papers. Best to leave professional work to the professionals.",
  [18124112] = "He cared for you when you were tired. Now is your chance to repay the favor. ",
  [18124113] = "Lucien grabs your hand: \"I can't help being distracted by you.\"",
  [18124120] = "Sorting files becomes less tedious when there are tea and fruits.",
  [18124200] = "Lucien's teacup is gone. Where will you start looking for it?",
  [18124201] = "Fridge",
  [18124202] = "Bedroom",
  [18124203] = "Study",
  [18124211] = "There's nothing other than assorted food in the fridge... which makes sense. Lucien wouldn't be careless enough to leave his cup in it...",
  [18124212] = "The only thing on the nightstand is several thick academic books. It's not here...",
  [18124213] = "Oh, it's here. He must have been too absorbed in the books and forgot to take it with him.",
  [18124220] = "I hope the scent of the tea can help him relax!",
  [18125000] = "You and Lucien are on your way home from the cafe...",
  [18125001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of his words...",
  [18125002] = "You feel safe with him living next door.",
  [18125100] = "You decide to cook a hearty meal. Which non-veg dish are you going to make?",
  [18125101] = "Buddha's Temptation",
  [18125102] = "Braised Pork Chops",
  [18125103] = "Stir-Fried Tomato and Scrambled Eggs",
  [18125111] = "You feel up to a challenge but give up as soon as you see the recipe.",
  [18125112] = "Not too difficult to make and tastes nice. This should be the best choice.",
  [18125113] = "Maybe a little too plain as a main course for dinner...",
  [18125120] = "My cooking has improved for sure!",
  [18125200] = "You see a pastry vendor at the entrance of the neighborhood. You want to buy something to go with tea. What will it be?",
  [18125201] = "Nut Cake",
  [18125202] = "Sponge Cake",
  [18125203] = "Green Bean Cake",
  [18125211] = "A hearty nut cake loaded with nuts. Something tells you it will fatten you up. You should think twice...",
  [18125212] = "Not the best choice to go with tea.",
  [18125213] = "Goes well with both tea and fruits. Good choice!",
  [18125220] = "Find the right moment to share this token of love with him.",
  [18126000] = "This year's Night of Loveland is just around the corner. Go write a special report on Kiro!",
  [18126001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [18126002] = "He's always been the little sun in people's hearts.",
  [18126100] = "There's too much info about Kiro's events this year. Where to start gathering it?",
  [18126101] = "Acting",
  [18126102] = "Singing",
  [18126103] = "Publicity events",
  [18126111] = "You have spent the whole day binge-watching his TV dramas. When you move your gaze away from the screen, you realize it's already dark.",
  [18126112] = "Soon you've collected enough materials. It appears you'll be able to publish a high-quality report ahead of the festival!",
  [18126113] = "You've collected a whole bunch of pictures of Kiro in different styles, but his musical achievements have been left out.",
  [18126120] = "Kiro has done so many things this year and has done them well!",
  [18126200] = "You come across a made-up scandal about Kiro on the internet. Outraged, you decide to...",
  [18126201] = "Reply to each comment, trying to get the truth out there",
  [18126202] = "Send a message about the truth to Kiro's fans",
  [18126203] = "Create a website and use it to publish the truth",
  [18126211] = "There are too many comments. It has taken you forever to reply to them all...",
  [18126212] = "As soon as the message is sent, the scandal evaporates.",
  [18126213] = "After spending a long time learning how to run a website, your head feels dizzy.",
  [18126220] = "Rumor is easy to create but hard to break...",
  [18127000] = "Before I go to the festival, I need to accompany Kiro as he gets a style makeover!",
  [18127001] = "I don't know whether my decision will bring me light or push me towards the abyss. But as I hesitate, a warm voice speaks to me inside my mind...",
  [18127002] = "Kiro looks great in every style!",
  [18127100] = "The stylist asks Kiro which style he wants to go for. Kiro glances at you with a smile...",
  [18127101] = "Cute",
  [18127102] = "Formal",
  [18127103] = "Casual",
  [18127111] = "\"Though attendees of the festival are supposed to be formally dressed, I'll break the norm this time for Miss Chips!\" Kiro makes a face at you.",
  [18127112] = "\"My Miss Chips always has the best idea!\" Kiro says in all seriousness, his eyes glued to you.",
  [18127113] = "\"It's such an important event. Don't you want to see me in a different style, Miss Chips?\" Kiro turns to look at you and blinks.",
  [18127120] = "Whatever he wears, he's the brightest star in the crowd!",
  [18127200] = "The tuxedo brooch is gone! Anxious, you decide to...",
  [18127201] = "Give him your brooch",
  [18127202] = "Fold the matching handkerchief into a flower shape and put it on",
  [18127203] = "Let it be and pretend the tuxedo doesn't have a brooch in the first place...",
  [18127211] = "Though it doesn't draw much attention, you find it out of place...",
  [18127212] = "This little improvisation has deceived people's eyes and even turned into a fashion trend.",
  [18127213] = "The little imperfection doesn't prevent him from appearing poised and confident.",
  [18127220] = "His confident smile has turned this little imperfection into something perfect.",
  [18128000] = "Prepare him a gift to congratulate him on winning the award again!",
  [18128001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [18128002] = "Hope he likes the gift...",
  [18128100] = "If you're going to give him massage oil as a gift, consult an expert first on what kind of smell suits him...",
  [18128101] = "The sweet scent of cream",
  [18128102] = "The rich fragrance of fruits",
  [18128103] = "The faint fragrance of flowers",
  [18128111] = "The scent makes you hungry...",
  [18128112] = "The smell is a little too much on the cute side...",
  [18128113] = "The faint scent of flowers tinged with sweetness speaks to romance.",
  [18128120] = "Picking a smell is not an easy task...",
  [18128200] = "Oh no, the ribbon for wrapping the gift has become a tangled mess...",
  [18128201] = "Cut it into pieces",
  [18128202] = "Use brute force",
  [18128203] = "Calmly untangle the mess",
  [18128211] = "You have no choice but to buy a new roll of ribbon...",
  [18128212] = "The ribbon becomes more tangled... Now it's a full-blown crisis...",
  [18128213] = "The mess is easier to untangle than you imagined. Pretty soon you finish rewrapping the gift.",
  [18128220] = "The best gift for the best Kiro.",
  [18129000] = "You finally have some time off. Now go to New Light Mall with Gavin and help him shop for some new clothes!",
  [18129001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of his words...",
  [18129002] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [18129100] = "As you're waiting for Gavin, a man mistakes you for his blind date...",
  [18129101] = "Take off running",
  [18129102] = "Try to explain",
  [18129103] = "Don't know how to explain. Just ignore him...",
  [18129111] = "\"Marry, why are you running away?!!\" The man cries at the top of his voice.",
  [18129112] = "The man is not fully convinced by your explanation. Just then, Gavin comes and takes your hand: \"She's my girlfriend. You got the wrong person.\"",
  [18129113] = "As the man is rambling on, you see Gavin in the distance and runs toward him.",
  [18129120] = "I wish him good luck with his date...",
  [18129200] = "With the misunderstanding cleared up, you enter the mall. Where do you wish to start your shopping tour?",
  [18129201] = "Jewelry section",
  [18129202] = "Toy section",
  [18129203] = "Clothing section",
  [18129211] = "You slow your step as you browse the dazzling array of merchandise, hoping to take it slow... No, this is not right. You have a mission today!",
  [18129212] = "Before you know it, hours have gone by. Although Gavin doesn't mind, you feel a little guilty...",
  [18129213] = "Head straight to the target area and worry about everything else later.",
  [18129220] = "Here comes the real battle!",
  [18130000] = "I'm full of energy when I go shopping!",
  [18130001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [18130002] = "The tailor makes the man... No, Gavin looks handsome even in rags!",
  [18130100] = "You're here to shop for clothes for Gavin. What kind of style to go for?",
  [18130101] = "Dashing suits",
  [18130102] = "Fine casual wear",
  [18130103] = "Fashionable swimwear",
  [18130111] = "It makes him look more handsome than he already is! But maybe something comfier would be better!",
  [18130112] = "This is the best style for him. Handsome and comfy.",
  [18130113] = "A good outfit to wear to the beach. But it's still spring, so it's a little too early to buy it.",
  [18130120] = "I want them all!",
  [18130200] = "A barbershop worker walks over and invites you and Gavin to experience their bleaching service for free...",
  [18130201] = "Politely reject",
  [18130202] = "Say you frequent another barbershop",
  [18130203] = "Flash your name card, passing it off as a membership card of the barber shop",
  [18130211] = "The worker keeps pestering you. Gavin warns him off with a glare.",
  [18130212] = "The worker is undeterred. Gavin ignores him, takes your hand and leaves.",
  [18130213] = "The worker is convinced and gets out of your way.",
  [18130220] = "Do all barbers have the gift of the gab?",
  [18131000] = "I want to make beautiful memories out of every outing I have with him...",
  [18131001] = "My legs can barely move, my eyes can barely see. As I'm on the verge of giving up, his face flashes through my mind...",
  [18131002] = "Being with Gavin makes me forget how tired I am.",
  [18131100] = "A couple gets into a fight over what to buy. They ask you to mediate...",
  [18131101] = "Don't want to get involved in others' family affairs. Goodbye!",
  [18131102] = "Stop fighting. Just buy them all!",
  [18131103] = "Hear out their reasons",
  [18131111] = "The fight escalates and almost gets physical. Thank God you quickly get out of there.",
  [18131112] = "They consider it for a moment and decide it's unrealistic to buy everything in the flower shop, so they stop arguing.",
  [18131113] = "After a talk, they realize they're both just trying to make the other happy. They hug it out and go off to buy fruits.",
  [18131120] = "Gavin and I are always on the same page about those things...",
  [18131200] = "On your way back home, Sparky breaks down. You decide to...",
  [18131201] = "Discuss with Gavin how to get Sparky back home",
  [18131202] = "Try repairing it yourself",
  [18131203] = "Search for a repair shop in the area",
  [18131211] = "Gavin parks Sparky by the road and escorts you back home.",
  [18131212] = "You realize you don't have any tools, and so you give up the idea. Maybe next time!",
  [18131213] = "There's a repair shop close by. Sparky gets fixed in no time.",
  [18131220] = "Be strong, Sparky!",
  [18132000] = "Shaw, who's been contacting you regularly, suddenly goes quiet. You decide to go find him.",
  [18132001] = "The world is full of deception. I tire of trying to be perfect... and in my darkest hours... I think of his words...",
  [18132002] = "Where has he gone off to?",
  [18132100] = "Upon arriving at the square where Shaw practices skateboarding, a boy speeds toward you on a skateboard while losing his balance...",
  [18132101] = "Close your eyes and squat down",
  [18132102] = "Step sideways",
  [18132103] = "Turn and run",
  [18132111] = "The boy regains his balance before crashing into you...",
  [18132112] = "You nimbly evade him. It's a close call.",
  [18132113] = "\"Stay away from me!!\" But you can't outrun the skateboard...",
  [18132120] = "Be careful on a skateboard.",
  [18132200] = "A schoolmate of Shaw's recognizes you and asks why you're looking for Shaw...",
  [18132201] = "\"His aunt's neighbor's friend's schoolmate is inviting him over for dinner\"",
  [18132202] = "\"Nothing in particular... just checking in on him!\"",
  [18132203] = "\"I haven't seen him in a while. I'm a little worried.\"",
  [18132211] = "He's confused and tries to tease out the relationships between the people you mentioned.",
  [18132212] = "He finds you suspicious and refuses to tell you anything about his Shaw.",
  [18132213] = "After hearing you say that, he truthfully tells you that Shaw has been rehearsing with his band lately.",
  [18132220] = "Glad to know he's okay...",
  [18133000] = "You meet Shaw and the rest of his band at Live House!",
  [18133001] = "I don't know whether my decision will bring me light or push me towards the abyss. But as I hesitate, a warm voice speaks to me inside my mind...",
  [18133002] = "I'm surprised his band is invited to perform at the music festival...",
  [18133100] = "The lead singer greets you with great enthusiasm and asks if you have any special skills...",
  [18133101] = "Perhaps you can try rap?",
  [18133102] = "Be truthful and say you have training in piano.",
  [18133103] = "Being a lead singer has been a secret dream of yours.",
  [18133111] = "The lead singer goes silent. He seems to be thinking about how to merge rap into his band's songs.",
  [18133112] = "Surprised and excited, the lead singer pats Shaw on the shoulder and then high-fives the other bandmates, leaving you bewildered.",
  [18133113] = "The lead singer says in an aggrieved tone: \"Where would that leave me?\"",
  [18133120] = "Is there anything I can do for the band?",
  [18133200] = "Seeing the questioning look on his face, you decide to impress him by playing a song...",
  [18133201] = "Go for the widely popular song “Two Tigers\"!",
  [18133202] = "You play a pop song in order to showcase your skills.",
  [18133203] = "You're \"auditioning\" for a rock band, so Bohemian Rhapsody is the best choice.",
  [18133211] = "Shaw bursts out laughing.",
  [18133212] = "You have played it well, but Shaw doesn't think it matches with the band's style.",
  [18133213] = "\"Welcome aboard!\" He looks shocked and compliments you.",
  [18133220] = "Don't underestimate my musical talent!",
  [18134000] = "You and the band head off to the music festival, ready to perform on stage...",
  [18134001] = "My legs can barely move, my eyes can barely see. I no longer have the strength to struggle. But as I'm on the verge of giving up, his face flashes through my mind...",
  [18134002] = "Tomorrow is the music festival! I'm so nervous!",
  [18134100] = "Because of a change of route, you've made a few wrong turns and end up straying from your destination...",
  [18134101] = "Use the GPS map",
  [18134102] = "Get to a service station and ask for directions",
  [18134103] = "Trust the driver",
  [18134111] = "The GPS map is outdated and leads you in circles.",
  [18134112] = "Thanks to the convenience store owner, you're back on track.",
  [18134113] = "The driver doesn't trust himself.",
  [18134120] = "Asking for directions is the most reliable way to get back on track.",
  [18134200] = "You've finally arrived at the B&B. Shaw is in a good mood and asks if there's anything particular you want to do...",
  [18134201] = "Let's have one more rehearsal!",
  [18134202] = "Go outside and sing a song to celebrate this rare occasion!",
  [18134203] = "Maybe go to the rooftop to enjoy the view?",
  [18134211] = "Shaw pauses for a moment and then finds himself being dragged to a rehearsal by you. He's utterly confused.",
  [18134212] = "Shaw turns down your suggestion and drags you to the rooftop.",
  [18134213] = "Shaw gives you a broad smile and says he's thinking of doing that too.",
  [18134220] = "Anyway, I wonder what Shaw wants to do right now.",
  [18135000] = "What better way to start a new year than a meal at Souvenir?!",
  [18135002] = "It's not easy just being a helper…",
  [18135100] = "Go help out Victor!",
  [18136000] = "Before heading off to the Rose Festival with Victor, buy some supplies for the trip!",
  [18136002] = "I was already looking forward to the journey when packing.",
  [18136100] = "There are so many things to buy. Gotta make a shopping list...",
  [18137000] = "Lucien seems to be working on a new research project... Can I take part?",
  [18137002] = "Salute to hardworking experts…",
  [18137100] = "Help Lucien record data!",
  [18138000] = "It's always Lucien that brews the tea. For a change, I'm doing it today!",
  [18138002] = "Right rare is a cup of tea at the right temperature.",
  [18138100] = "I'll taste it first to ensure I get it right!",
  [18139000] = "Is Apple Box behaving himself while Kiro is busy with work?",
  [18139002] = "Apple Box is cute as always!",
  [18139100] = "Take a picture of the super cute Apple Box and send it to Kiro!",
  [18140000] = "The sweet dessert is a token of my feelings for Kiro.",
  [18140002] = "You eat my disserts, so you are mine!",
  [18140100] = "Is there a dessert that doesn't fatten me up?",
  [18141000] = "Before Gavin goes away on a mission, I'll move Little Green to my place so I can take care of it for a while...",
  [18141002] = "I hope Greenie will grow big and strong!",
  [18141100] = "I'm going to give Little Green a makeover!",
  [18142000] = "We're at the studio. Pick a suitable photoshoot style with Gavin!",
  [18142002] = "The camera captures the sweetest moments.",
  [18142100] = "We'll be the most striking couple at the studio!",
  [18143000] = "Shaw is asked by his teacher to stay at the studio. I watch as he carefully examines the artifacts...",
  [18143002] = "There's always a story behind every artifact.",
  [18143100] = "Sometimes I forget he's an archeology major...",
  [18144000] = "Never expected I'd perform at a music festival with Shaw. But I don't look like a musician at all...",
  [18144002] = "Ready to shine on the stage!",
  [18144100] = "I'll take this opportunity to get myself a new look!",
  [18145001] = "Every time at the Hacker Consortium, I have to get past Punkilles... I hope this time I get in without a fuss. I also need to consider how to get intel from the hackers.",
  [18145002] = "My mind is completely blank of creative ideas. As I could feel my brain rusting, a figure suddenly slowly appeared in my mind...",
  [18145003] = "I got a pass in, and I also think my l337 speak has gotten better...",
  [18145004] = "Punkilles is there as always. I think I know how to handle him.",
  [18145005] = "I g0t sumth1ng b1g goin' down.\"",
  [18145006] = "Grab him and shake him hard.",
  [18145007] = "\"Restless spirits, reveal the path!\"",
  [18145008] = "Punkilles claps you on the shoulder like an old pal and lets you in, and even gives you a platinum VIP hairdresser's card.",
  [18145009] = "Punkilles takes offense at you messing up his hair-do and refuses to speak to you as he fixes it back up.",
  [18145010] = "Punkilles frowns and refuses you entry.",
  [18145011] = "Thinking back to my first time here and how lost I was, I really have grown.",
  [18145012] = "There are fewer hackers here than before. How will I get any intel out of them?",
  [18145013] = "State that you're close to Key.",
  [18145014] = "Eavesdrop on their conversations.",
  [18145015] = "Say you're making a show about hackers vs. STF.",
  [18145016] = "Someone laughs and says they're Key's university classmate's neighbor's first love's roommate's distant relative.",
  [18145017] = "The hackers mostly just talk about computers and tech. There's nothing helpful.",
  [18145018] = "The hackers confer a bit, then say that as long as you don't expose their real information, they'll gather intel for you.",
  [18145019] = "It seems there's more people unhappy with the STF than I thought.",
  [18145020] = "This time the ones upholding justice exist in the dark underbelly of the city.",
  [18146001] = "I got some useful info from the hackers. As the most potent \"fact bomb\" for the show, I've gotta handle it properly.",
  [18146002] = "My mind is completely blank of creative ideas. As I could feel my brain rusting, a figure suddenly slowly appeared in my mind...",
  [18146003] = "Thanks to the hacker's help, I got a lot of data unobtainable by ordinary means.",
  [18146004] = "One hacker is dutifully helping, but seems to be eyeing company documents...",
  [18146005] = "%s is bold and stands beside the hacker to dispel any possibility of that idea.",
  [18146006] = "%s gets a little too aggressive, and the hacker stops helping and slinks off when no one notices.",
  [18146007] = "%s is affable and tries to get to know the hacker. When they're not looking, the files get copied.",
  [18146008] = "%s takes too long to notice what the hacker's doing, and lots of trade secrets get stolen.",
  [18146009] = "I need to keep an eye on him myself for this kind of thing.",
  [18146010] = "Partnering with these gray-hat hackers really is interesting.",
  [18146011] = "To negotiate a satisfactory pay with the hackers, better ask someone experienced...",
  [18146012] = "%s has a chat with them and then guesses the hackers' ideal price accurately, and the negotiation goes smoothly",
  [18146013] = "%s haggles hard and the hackers become unhappy and almost have a falling out with the company.",
  [18146014] = "%s agrees to the hackers' every demand and gets fleeced.",
  [18146015] = "%s forgets when the negotiation is supposed to occur and stands everyone up.",
  [18146016] = "After all I've been through, negotiating a partnership is nothing. I'll do it.",
  [18146017] = "A win-win and everyone's happy! Maybe we'll get a chance to partner again later?",
  [18146018] = "Boss... is there a problem with our computers?",
  [18146019] = "Is this data they provided really reliable?",
  [18146020] = "I still think the decision about where to source this material wasn't quite right.",
  [18146021] = "Is it not too late to try to remedy this situation and gather new data?",
  [18146022] = "This isn't data at all. It's just random characters, isn't it?",
  [18146023] = "Who in their right mind would seek out hackers to partner with...",
  [18146024] = "Are we ever going to finish this show...",
  [18146025] = "What's done is done. Let's just fix what we can.",
  [18146026] = "After processing this data, I feel like I've gained yet another skill.",
  [18146027] = "This is the kind of data that you just can't buy. You can only get it through special means...",
  [18146028] = "Now our show really has legs!",
  [18146029] = "I'll have to weed out what's true from what's not, but having this much data is still just fantastic.",
  [18146030] = "Who knew working with hackers would go so smoothly!",
  [18146031] = "Naturally one will get outstanding results when using such methods to gather data.",
  [18146032] = "If the hackers are behind us, that means our show really has meaning.",
  [18146033] = "It's great getting to know the ones guarding the city from the shadows.",
  [18147001] = "The data has been gathered. Now to figure out how to use it!",
  [18147002] = "My mind is completely blank of creative ideas. As I could feel my brain rusting, a figure suddenly slowly appeared in my mind...",
  [18147003] = "I've got the proof in my hand. What's left to consider is how to put it out there.",
  [18147004] = "The data reveals fishy things going on at the STF, we need an expert to analyze it!",
  [18147005] = "%s explained everything and wrote a draft with you to ensure the show is truthful and trustworthy.",
  [18147006] = "%s understands all the data, but is not good at explaining it. You don't even understand them.",
  [18147007] = "%s just thinks the data is a gimmick to make people like the show and sloppily shoehorns it in there.",
  [18147008] = "%s has absolutely no idea how to use the data and even asks you for help.",
  [18147009] = "To save time, I'll just do it myself!",
  [18147010] = "Let the facts and data speak for themselves!",
  [18147011] = "To deepen the impact of the data, get an expert to present it to the audience.",
  [18147012] = "%s is well-spoken, always giving clear and concise explanations. Naturally the best choice.",
  [18147013] = "%s is too forceful when explaining things, which makes people suspicious instead.",
  [18147014] = "%s is a nobody with no public profile. Their words just aren't convincing.",
  [18147015] = "%s says things wrong in a lot of places and calls into question the veracity of the information.",
  [18147016] = "You're a decent public speaker. Perhaps you should give it a try.",
  [18147017] = "My body is my top asset. However busy I am, I need to take care of myself.",
  [18147018] = "I get the feeling this data isn't the most reliable...",
  [18147019] = "Reliable or not, how should the data be used in the show?",
  [18147020] = "Excel crashed again...",
  [18147021] = "I can feel my eyes glazing over as I watch this drivel…",
  [18147022] = "At least it's finished. Whether or not it's usable is a question for someone else.",
  [18147023] = "Seeing this data makes me doubt life as a whole.",
  [18147024] = "This assignment was above and beyond!",
  [18147025] = "My hands are leaving the keyboard now. Goodbye, world.",
  [18147026] = "At this rate, the show as a whole should go over pretty well!",
  [18147027] = "Reasonable, evidence-based... our show is really shaping up!",
  [18147028] = "I organized the rest of the data too, don't worry.",
  [18147029] = "I can finally take a rest...",
  [18147030] = "It actually got done ahead of schedule!",
  [18147031] = "This show is sure to create another \"Miracle\".",
  [18147032] = "Our company's potential has no limits!",
  [18147033] = "Great work. You were the major contributor on this one, Boss. You should take a well-earned break.",
  [18148001] = "Maybe Lucien's aide Pete will know something... Might as well start with him, maybe it'll lead to other sources.",
  [18148002] = "Too many masks exist in this world. I'm tired of keeping up a perfect front. Just as I was feeling down, I suddenly thought of his words...",
  [18148003] = "According to Pete, Leto seeking out Lucien wasn't some rare occurrence.",
  [18148004] = "Pete doesn't want to get into particulars with you. How can you get him to open up?",
  [18148005] = "Promise to grant him a wish.",
  [18148006] = "Tell him the importance of the show.",
  [18148007] = "Threaten to delete his experiment data.",
  [18148008] = "\"I can grant my own wishes!\" Pete turns you down.",
  [18148009] = "After considering it further, Pete decides to assist you.",
  [18148010] = "Pete just ignores you all the more.",
  [18148011] = "Just tell it like it is. Your ideas are compelling enough as they are.",
  [18148012] = "There's someone sneaking around outside the door. Could it be Leto's people?",
  [18148013] = "Open the door and confront them.",
  [18148014] = "Change topics with Pete and wait .",
  [18148015] = "Make a break for it.",
  [18148016] = "The person was just delivering some documents. You scared them off.",
  [18148017] = "It's a next-door researcher who overheard you and wants to help too.",
  [18148018] = "\"Why are you running...\" You leave them confused.",
  [18148019] = "I'm getting more and more info. This was really worth the trip.",
  [18148020] = "I'm not alone on the path to the truth.",
  [18149001] = "Ultima Bioresearch staff has been so cooperative providing leads about illegal testing at the observation center. Time to film the evidence!",
  [18149002] = "Too many masks exist in this world. I'm tired of keeping up a perfect front. Just as I was feeling down, I suddenly thought of his words...",
  [18149003] = "These documents will be a powerful source material!",
  [18149004] = "A researcher whose friend was locked up is sobbing, and you can't understand him...",
  [18149005] = "%s soothes the researcher and coaxes him along to continue talking about his friend's plight.",
  [18149006] = "%s makes the researcher finish, but the researcher seems even more offended and doesn't want to cooperate with the show.",
  [18149007] = "%s is extremely kindhearted, and ends up crying together with the researcher.",
  [18149008] = "%s is overwhelmed by the tears and is at a loss for what to do.",
  [18149009] = "I guess I'll just try to calm him down myself.",
  [18149010] = "You must face the terrible truth. Expose the inhumane experiments!",
  [18149011] = "We need an expert to make a write-up based on the data from the research center.",
  [18149012] = "%s's script is moving and powerful. It's sure to be a highlight of the show.",
  [18149013] = "%s excels at humor, and the draft you get just doesn't have the right ring to it.",
  [18149014] = "%s pens some elaborate prose that goes over the audience's head.",
  [18149015] = "%s is deeply moved, but gets severe writer's block and produces nothing.",
  [18149016] = "As someone who went through it first-hand, I should be able to write it.",
  [18149017] = "Writing that makes one think and leads to action is truly powerful.",
  [18149018] = "Boss, are we really going to be able to finish this show...?",
  [18149019] = "The camera kept shaking in the last half. That's not gonna fly.",
  [18149020] = "There's a large amount of material, but the usable stuff is few and far between.",
  [18149021] = "Can we go reshoot this...?",
  [18149022] = "...Well anyway, we can clean up some of this and make it usable.",
  [18149023] = "I'm only just now realizing the light while we were filming wasn't very good.",
  [18149024] = "I just feel like the important parts weren't highlighted well in a few spots.",
  [18149025] = "Was the lens not in focus...?",
  [18149026] = "Now that the material is gathered, the remaining production work is an uphill battle.",
  [18149027] = "With a little polishing, these \"rough stones\" will be sure to sparkle.",
  [18149028] = "This material is chock-full of good stuff!",
  [18149029] = "Hm... I can't help but feel it's missing something. But it's still pretty good!",
  [18149030] = "Now, let's take the best of our material and produce the most awesome show possible!",
  [18149031] = "Boss, where did you get this masterpiece of a script from?! It's incredible!",
  [18149032] = "I almost have an urge to work overtime getting a rough cut together...",
  [18149033] = "Boss, you've outdone yourself! I can't believe how much good stuff you managed to get!",
  [18150001] = "The data has been gathered. Now all that's left is organizing the material and shooting a rough cut!",
  [18150002] = "Too many masks exist in this world. I'm tired of keeping up a perfect front. Just as I was feeling down, I suddenly thought of his words...",
  [18150003] = "This show will definitely leave the audience thinking twice about the STF!",
  [18150004] = "There's a lot of data to go through before deadline. Find an expert to help you!",
  [18150005] = "%s has plenty of experience and quickly edits and organizes the material.",
  [18150006] = "%s is extremely detailed, but takes twice as long.",
  [18150007] = "%s makes a mess of everything, and now you can't find a lot of stuff you'd already prepared.",
  [18150008] = "%s took one look at the work load and decided to throw in the towel.",
  [18150009] = "If I stay late at the office, I can get it done myself.",
  [18150010] = "It's more work than usual, but I'm especially motivated.",
  [18150011] = "Everyone is busy with work and skipping meals. Put someone in charge of catering!",
  [18150012] = "%s is experienced and diligent, providing different meals each day. The well-fed staff's efficiency is doubled!",
  [18150013] = "%s orders some gourmet staff meals, but the expenditure is more than all of last quarter.",
  [18150014] = "%s buys fast food for everyone, and it's tasty, but not healthy long-term.",
  [18150015] = "%s is never on a consistent schedule as it is, so often forgets to order food for everyone. I'm so hungry...",
  [18150016] = "Just set an alarm and remind everyone to eat...",
  [18150017] = "My body is my top asset. However busy I am, I need to take care of myself.",
  [18150018] = "No good... will never finish...",
  [18150019] = "I'm so hungry... Is the food not here yet...?",
  [18150020] = "Zzzz...",
  [18150021] = "Who am I... Where am I... When was the last time I slept...?",
  [18150022] = "I don't know if it's any good, but at any rate, I finished...",
  [18150023] = "Thinking of our upcoming work schedule... is it too late for me to quit?",
  [18150024] = "Just let me sleep another five minutes...",
  [18150025] = "Boss, wake up. You're asleep in the break room...",
  [18150026] = "Tomorrow we should be able to call it a day!",
  [18150027] = "The finish line is in sight! I can hang in there!",
  [18150028] = "I'm dead tired, but I think it was worth it.",
  [18150029] = "Thinking of the finished product gives me another surge of motivation!",
  [18150030] = "Woohoo! Finished!!",
  [18150031] = "I thought this would be a real chore, but actually it went surprisingly smooth.",
  [18150032] = "I feel a little shy to say this, but I'm totally proud of our company.",
  [18150033] = "I'm really looking forward to the day this airs...",
  [18151001] = "Might as well go chat with Goldman and see what he knows. He might even be an \"in\" to contacting more No Man’s Island Evolvers.",
  [18151002] = "My decision could bring me light, or lead me into the abyss. Just as I was hesitating, a gentle voice suddenly sounded in my mind...",
  [18151003] = "Goldman says that he really doesn't know much about this.",
  [18151004] = "Goldman isn't saying anything you didn't already know. How can you dig deeper?",
  [18151005] = "Be honest with him about the show.",
  [18151006] = "Promise to praise him before Victor.",
  [18151007] = "Threaten that you'll report No Man’s Island.",
  [18151008] = "After some thought, Goldman resignedly tells you that this is all he knows.",
  [18151009] = "\"Mr. Victor already knows how good I am!\" Goldman turns you down.",
  [18151010] = "Goldman immediately shouts you off the ship.",
  [18151011] = "Just lay your cards on the table. Your sincerity is enough to move him.",
  [18151012] = "Someone seems to be following you. Could the STF have gotten wind of your plans?",
  [18151013] = "Rush over and question him.",
  [18151014] = "Loitering around on the deck and wait.",
  [18151015] = "Make a break for it.",
  [18151016] = "\"Who's following you?! I'm just passing through!\" He thinks you have a mental condition.",
  [18151017] = "It turns out to be an Evolver staying on No Man’s Island. He seems to have a lot of info to tell you.",
  [18151018] = "The person is scared away by you.",
  [18151019] = "More Evolvers are gathering, sharing lots of leads with you left and right.",
  [18151020] = "The path to the truth always requires calm and patience.",
  [18152001] = "The Evolvers on No Man’s Island are providing lots of leads and talking about unfair treatment. This evidence has to be filmed!",
  [18152002] = "My decision could bring me light, or lead me into the abyss. Just as I was hesitating, a gentle voice suddenly sounded in my mind...",
  [18152003] = "These interviews are sure to be powerful source material!",
  [18152004] = "One Evolver who received unfair treatment was roaring, unable to calm down.",
  [18152005] = "%s soothes the interviewee while calmly bringing him back around to his rational side.",
  [18152006] = "%s tries to get the interviewee to calm down, but misses the mark, and the interviewee storms off.",
  [18152007] = "%s seems affected by the interviewee's experience and flies into rage too.",
  [18152008] = "%s is shaking in fear of the interviewee and can't muster up the courage to approach.",
  [18152009] = "I guess I'll try to bring the interviewee back to his senses myself.",
  [18152010] = "I've gotta let as many people as possible know about the unfair treatment Evolvers face!",
  [18152011] = "You interviewed many Evolvers, now you need an expert to organize the material.",
  [18152012] = "%s writes in a measured yet compelling way. It's sure to help the show shine.",
  [18152013] = "%s is good at free expression and often misses the point in summarizing the material.",
  [18152014] = "%s throws in too many subjective embellishments, and people just don't get it.",
  [18152015] = "%s sat in front of the keyboard a long time, but just isn't good at writing and didn't get out a single word.",
  [18152016] = "Since I was the main interviewer of the Evolvers, I might as well do the write up.",
  [18152017] = "To shout for the voiceless, that is the power of writing.",
  [18152018] = "Boss, can we really air a script like this...?",
  [18152019] = "The picture is so blurry. Can we maybe upgrade our equipment?",
  [18152020] = "There's a big quantity of interviews, but there's almost nothing that's usable.",
  [18152021] = "Can we go reshoot this...?",
  [18152022] = "The acoustics there apparently weren't very good.",
  [18152023] = "Looks like we need to update our lighting equipment.",
  [18152024] = "I just feel like the important parts weren't highlighted well in a few spots.",
  [18152025] = "Why does the camera keep shaking...",
  [18152026] = "With a little post-production, the show should work!",
  [18152027] = "With a little polishing, these \"rough stones\" will be sure to sparkle.",
  [18152028] = "This is a decent amount of material.",
  [18152029] = "Yep... I think I can try a little harder!",
  [18152030] = "With such a wealth of material, I'm sure the finished product will be awesome!",
  [18152031] = "Boss, where did you get this masterpiece of a script from?! It's incredible!",
  [18152032] = "Aaaaaaah! I can't wait to start on the post-production!",
  [18152033] = "Homerun, Boss! I can't believe how much good stuff you managed to get!",
  [18153001] = "The footage has been gathered. Now all that's left is organizing the material and shooting a rough cut!",
  [18153002] = "My decision could bring me light, or lead me into the abyss. Just as I was hesitating, a gentle voice suddenly sounded in my mind...",
  [18153003] = "I hope this show can change everyone's hostile attitude toward Evolvers!",
  [18153004] = "You gathered a lot of material. Find an expert to help you go through it all!",
  [18153005] = "%s really has an eye for this stuff, quickly picking out the best material and organizing it all.",
  [18153006] = "%s is extremely detailed, but takes twice as long.",
  [18153007] = "%s basically does no organizing at all and just makes a big mess of everything.",
  [18153008] = "%s says they don't know a thing about this and throws up their hands in resignation.",
  [18153009] = "If I work late a few nights, I know I can get it done.",
  [18153010] = "It's been hard work, but the team has really gone all out for this show.",
  [18153011] = "There's so much material, you need an expert to catch flaws and fix them!",
  [18153012] = "%s is experienced, detailed, and diligent, quickly finding little problems and fixing them.",
  [18153013] = "%s's vision isn't that great, so they hardly find any problems.",
  [18153014] = "%s is detailed-oriented but doesn't know the first thing about post-production work.",
  [18153015] = "%s is totally careless and almost deletes the material that's already been processed.",
  [18153016] = "I'll just go over everything with a fine-toothed comb. I got this!",
  [18153017] = "A detailed eye will really bring the show up a level in terms of quality!",
  [18153018] = "No way, no way, there's just too much content...",
  [18153019] = "Are you sure this is the post-processed material...?",
  [18153020] = "Zzzz...",
  [18153021] = "The scenes have been edited together so sloppily. Did our post-production staff quit...?",
  [18153022] = "Is this the material for this show?",
  [18153023] = "If this is the level of quality we're putting out, is it too late for me to quit...?",
  [18153024] = "Why is over half of the stuff we already organized missing?",
  [18153025] = "Boss, we don't have much time...",
  [18153026] = "At this rate, everything's going pretty smoothly!",
  [18153027] = "The finish line is in sight!",
  [18153028] = "I'm dead tired, but I can hang in there for this show!",
  [18153029] = "I think the finished product will be alright!",
  [18153030] = "This finished product looks great!",
  [18153031] = "I'm so looking forward to the show airing!",
  [18153032] = "I am proud to be a member of this company!",
  [18153033] = "We couldn't have made such a great show without the hard work of everyone!",
  [18154001] = "Even the tightest of defenses may loosen up. Try to find an STF agent as a first step to gathering material.",
  [18154002] = "Overcoming one hardship after another, I felt burnt out. Just when I was about to give up, a vision of him suddenly flashed in my mind...",
  [18154003] = "Surprisingly, this STF agent was actually on the scene at the bridge incident!",
  [18154004] = "The STF's agents all seem busy. How can you get an interview with one?",
  [18154005] = "Quietly observe for awhile.",
  [18154006] = "Get a megaphone and announce yourself.",
  [18154007] = "Just grab one of the agents.",
  [18154008] = "You find an agent that keeps looking your way. Sure enough, he's got some tips to tell you.",
  [18154009] = "The megaphone is too noisy and you get chased out of there.",
  [18154010] = "The agent hauls you off to an interrogation room.",
  [18154011] = "If you're patient and observant enough, you can sniff out any problems.",
  [18154012] = "This agent still seems hesitant to talk. How can you get him to drop his guard?",
  [18154013] = "Give him cash reward.",
  [18154014] = "Find someplace outside to chat.",
  [18154015] = "Promise you can get him a promotion.",
  [18154016] = "\"I'm not in this for the money!\" The agent feels insulted and storms off.",
  [18154017] = "The agent's eyes light up. Once outside, he can finally relax and speak freely.",
  [18154018] = "The agent thinks you're incredibly unreliable.",
  [18154019] = "Think about the problem from another angle. The dawn might be right up ahead.",
  [18154020] = "On the path to the truth, one can't do without sincerity and care.",
  [18155001] = "You thought STF-related content would be a gap, but you've actually got an agent who was at the bridge! Hurry up and film his interview!",
  [18155002] = "Overcoming one hardship after another, I felt burnt out. Just when I was about to give up, a vision of him suddenly flashed in my mind...",
  [18155003] = "This interview is sure to have a big impact!",
  [18155004] = "This STF agent seems a little nervous. Get an expert to help him relax!",
  [18155005] = "%s is adept at socializing and has the agent completely at ease after a brief chat.",
  [18155006] = "%s tries to get the agent to relax but doesn't have the gift of gab. The agent walks off shaking his head.",
  [18155007] = "%s just babbles incoherently, and the interviewee doesn't understand.",
  [18155008] = "%s is nervous too and almost can't even speak.",
  [18155009] = "I've interviewed so many people. I'll just help him relax!",
  [18155010] = "If this interview goes well, it will be a big piece of the puzzle for the show!",
  [18155011] = "The agent jumbled his recollections, you need an expert to edit the footage.",
  [18155012] = "%s gets everything all lined up in a row. It's sure to be a highlight of the show.",
  [18155013] = "%s isn't the best at grasping things and misses the key points when trying to tie it all together.",
  [18155014] = "%s can't get the timeline straight, so there's not much change from the raw interview footage.",
  [18155015] = "%s is not good at all at writing. After sitting in front of the computer almost all day, not a word gets written.",
  [18155016] = "I've written so many show proposals and scripts, I'll just do the write-up myself.",
  [18155017] = "Leads always pop-up out of the blue. As long as I don't give up, success is ours.",
  [18155018] = "I still think the decision about where to source this material wasn't quite right.",
  [18155019] = "The picture is so blurry. Can we maybe upgrade our equipment?",
  [18155020] = "Do we still have time to try to gather new data?",
  [18155021] = "Can we go reshoot this...?",
  [18155022] = "...Well anyway, we can clean up some of this and make it usable.",
  [18155023] = "Looks like we need to update our lighting equipment.",
  [18155024] = "Did the cinematographer go on strike? Why is it not even in focus?",
  [18155025] = "Why does the camera keep shaking...",
  [18155026] = "With a little post-production, the show should work!",
  [18155027] = "Now that the material is gathered, the remaining production work is an uphill battle.",
  [18155028] = "I think the show is really shaping up now!",
  [18155029] = "Yep... I think I can try a little harder!",
  [18155030] = "This is really great stuff you got this time! I'm so looking forward to the show airing!",
  [18155031] = "Boss, where did you get this masterpiece of a script from?! It's incredible!",
  [18155032] = "Aaaaaaah! I can't wait to start on the post-production!",
  [18155033] = "So even the STF has its doubters on the inside...",
  [18156001] = "The material's all gathered. Now to go through it all and produce a rough cut!",
  [18156002] = "Overcoming one hardship after another, I felt burnt out. Just when I was about to give up, a vision of him suddenly flashed in my mind...",
  [18156003] = "After this show airs, everyone will definitely get to see what's really going on!",
  [18156004] = "The subject is rather serious. Get a celebrity to help make it more popular!",
  [18156005] = "%s knows really well how to drum up popularity and quickly arranges your material so that it's eye-catching.",
  [18156006] = "%s doesn't really get how to make things trendy, and the material just looks flat and stale.",
  [18156007] = "%s doesn't get on the internet much, so knows next to nothing about what's popular online.",
  [18156008] = "%s thinks this task is too hard and just walks away.",
  [18156009] = "I should be able to do it myself, after all, I've been a part of quite a few popular shows!",
  [18156010] = "Draw everyone's attention with the most eye-opening stuff!",
  [18156011] = "To make the show more interesting, get a humor expert to help present it!",
  [18156012] = "%s is full of witty remarks, and the humorous style has viewers watching it over and over on a loop!",
  [18156013] = "%s tries to throw in some jokes, but they just fall flat.",
  [18156014] = "%s is great at newscasting, but the tone is too stern, and people think the viewing experience is dull.",
  [18156015] = "%s stumbles and stutters, making it hard for viewers to watch.",
  [18156016] = "I'm usually pretty funny. How about I give it a try?",
  [18156017] = "Great material mixed with humor is a winning recipe for getting viewers!",
  [18156018] = "My eyes have glazed over in the face of this unintelligible stuff...",
  [18156019] = "Are you sure people really like this kind of stuff...?",
  [18156020] = "This is putting me to sleep...",
  [18156021] = "The scenes have been edited together so sloppily. Did our post-production staff quit...?",
  [18156022] = "After watching this cut, I really want to quit!",
  [18156023] = "At least it's finished. Whether or not it's usable is a question for someone else.",
  [18156024] = "This assignment was above and beyond!",
  [18156025] = "Boss, we don't have much time...",
  [18156026] = "At this rate, everything's going pretty smoothly!",
  [18156027] = "The show is logical and well-organized. I think we've got something!",
  [18156028] = "At this rate, I think we'll hit our viewership targets for sure!",
  [18156029] = "I think the finished product won't be half-bad!",
  [18156030] = "I have a premonition that this show is sure to create another \"Miracle\"!",
  [18156031] = "I'm so looking forward to the show airing!",
  [18156032] = "Our company's potential has no limits!",
  [18156033] = "I think we'll set a new record for views with this!",
  [18185000] = "Arrive on the scene and film the people still working hard in the face of disaster.",
  [18185001] = "There are too many fakers in this world. I'm tired of keeping up a perfect front. Just as I was feeling down, I suddenly thought of his words...",
  [18185002] = "A salute to those who stay their post.",
  [18185100] = "A volunteer on the scene is feeling depressed from all the negative news and needs counseling.",
  [18185111] = "%s has years of crisis intervention experience and resolves the issue quickly.",
  [18185112] = "%s knows the measures to take, but is too indifferent.",
  [18185113] = "%s sympathizes with the volunteer too much and breaks down sobbing.",
  [18185114] = "%s freezes on the spot, not knowing what to do.",
  [18185119] = "I trust the volunteer can pull themself together...",
  [18185120] = "In the face of disaster, everyone needs support.",
  [18185219] = "I trust the volunteer can pull themself together...",
  [18185319] = "I trust the volunteer can pull themself together...",
  [18186000] = "Ask people with first-hand experience. It's sure to make the show's message more forceful.",
  [18186001] = "I don't know if my decision will bring me light, or lead me into the abyss. Just as I was hesitating, a gentle voice suddenly sounded in my mind...",
  [18186002] = "I hope everything will be alright...",
  [18186100] = "The recorder pen runs out of battery in the middle of an interview. Can anyone help out?",
  [18186111] = "%s is very meticulous and has a backup recorder, so the interview goes smoothly.",
  [18186112] = "%s decides to go buy a battery, but no shops are open.",
  [18186113] = "%s provides their phone. The audio is sub-par, but it's usable.",
  [18186114] = "%s silently looks away.",
  [18186119] = "Just use subtitles for this section of the interview...",
  [18186120] = "We can't have these little hiccups again in the future...",
  [18186219] = "Just use subtitles for this section of the interview...",
  [18186319] = "Just use subtitles for this section of the interview...",
  [18187000] = "Aside from filming, is there anything else I can help with?",
  [18187001] = "I don't know if my decision will bring me light, or lead me into the abyss. Just as I was hesitating, a gentle voice suddenly sounded in my mind...",
  [18187002] = "I hope I can become a source of strength for others.",
  [18187100] = "A volunteer looks very tired. Do something.",
  [18187101] = "Urge him to rest.",
  [18187102] = "Give him a bottle of water.",
  [18187103] = "Chat with him.",
  [18187111] = "He shakes his head, saying he needs to finish the work at hand.",
  [18187112] = "He smiles at you appreciatively.",
  [18187113] = "He's forced to use his attention talking to you, making him more tired.",
  [18187120] = "Although it's just a tiny little job...",
  [18188000] = "After gathering enough material, it has to be organized before it can be put to use.",
  [18188001] = "My mind is completely blank of creative ideas. As I could feel my brain rusting, a figure suddenly slowly appeared in my mind...",
  [18188002] = "When it comes to organizing material, I'm getting more and more proficient.",
  [18188100] = "There's just too much material. Too much for one person to finish in a day.",
  [18188101] = "Just bare down and do it.",
  [18188102] = "Leave it for Tomorrow You to do!",
  [18188103] = "See if any coworkers are free. Let's make it a group effort.",
  [18188111] = "You're laid out exhausted on the desk before you can finish...",
  [18188112] = "More things just keep piling up... I can't go on like this!",
  [18188113] = "Everyone lends a helping hand and the work is soon completed.",
  [18188120] = "When exhausted, don't try to push yourself.",
