  [18346211] = "你发现餐厅正好在做活动",
  [18346212] = "你发现即使打折，买不起的也依然买不起",
  [18346213] = "你并没有看中任何一件",
  [18346220] = "民以食为天！吃得好才是真的好~",
  [18346300] = "餐厅推出了充2000送200的活动，你似乎有些心动……",
  [18346301] = "管他呢，冲就对了",
  [18346302] = "抛个硬币吧，正面就充",
  [18346303] = "还是算了，这个月已经花了不少钱了",
  [18346311] = "在美食面前不需要理智",
  [18346312] = "结果是正面，看来这是命运的指引",
  [18346313] = "再也不做“剁手党”了",
  [18346320] = "不如今天的晚饭就在这里解决吧~",
  [18359000] = "Sleeping well is beneficial to physical and mental health. However, longer sleep does not necessarily equate to better sleep. We have invited experts to educate us on how to get healthy sleep quickly.",
  [18359001] = "I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [18359002] = "Does the quick way to fall asleep really work? I can't wait to try it!",
  [18359100] = "A science show not only requires reliable experts, but it also needs a host with sufficient knowledge of the subject.",
  [18359111] = "%s has been hosting science shows for many years and knows all the terminology by heart.",
  [18359112] = "%s pulled an all-nighter before the show to learn about the subject, which meant he had no energy left on the day.",
  [18359113] = "%s knows very little about the subject. He could only bluff his way out when he was asked to elaborate.",
  [18359114] = "%s loves forwarding fake news and pseudoscience online and made a joke of himself on stage.",
  [18359119] = "To be on the safe side, let's have the host talk less and sit still.",
  [18359120] = "Seem to have understood, but not quite all of it.",
  [18359200] = "After the expert's explanation, there is an interactive session with the audience to \"identify fake news.\" Let's find someone who looks more rational from the audience.",
  [18359211] = "%s is so discerning that no fake news escaped his eyes. Experts applauded him.",
  [18359212] = "%s seems rational but still got tricked by some tricky questions.",
  [18359213] = "%s looks like zoning out in class and got named by the teacher. It spiced up the show though.",
  [18359214] = "%s had not a single clue to any of the questions and was quickly booed off by the audience.",
  [18359219] = "The audience feedback wasn't positive, so the interactive session was cut out.",
  [18359220] = "After recording so many shows, I still get nervous for others.",
  [18360000] = "What is your favorite stage play? The crew interviewed several citizens who love plays on the streets...",
  [18360001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [18360002] = "Good works stand the test of time and take root in the heart of every audience.",
  [18360100] = "If we can find an area with more stage play fans through a survey, we can be much more efficient when interviewing on the streets.",
  [18360111] = "%s quickly found a suitable interview location through research and analysis, and the interview went very well.",
  [18360112] = "%s chose the theater entrance as the interview location, but people were in a hurry to get in and had no time for the interview.",
  [18360113] = "The survey %s conducted was in the wrong direction. Most people at the interview location knew nothing about stage plays.",
  [18360114] = "%s found a quiet place with hardly any passersby.",
  [18360119] = "Let's just pick a place randomly for the street interview and see if we're lucky enough to find anyone who likes stage plays.",
  [18360120] = "Adequate preparation improves efficiency.",
  [18360200] = "During the interview, two interviewees argued because of their different views of a play. We need a witty person to settle them down.",
  [18360211] = "%s is persuasive and appeased both sides very quickly.",
  [18360212] = "%s ganged up with one side and got the crew embroiled in the dispute.",
  [18360213] = "%s was too soft, and no one paid attention to him.",
  [18360214] = "%s adds fuel to the argument. The dispute escalated into a fight.",
  [18360219] = "We can't afford to get into trouble, but we can hide. We quietly sneaked away with the camera as the two argued.",
  [18360220] = "People can embroil in fierce fights to defend their favorite characters and works.",
  [18361000] = "As a medium around for relatively much longer, radio has a remarkable significance to our lives. We will take our audience to see what a normal day of broadcasts looks like in the radio station.",
  [18361001] = "Well, I'm all out of ideas. Just as my thoughts start to drift, a familiar figure starts to form in my mind...",
  [18361002] = "With new media available, radio has fewer and fewer listeners but the memories it leaves to us will remain...",
  [18361100] = "The radio personality is used to communicating with his voice and hopes to look his best for his first time being on camera.",
  [18361111] = "%s has been a stylist for many years and quickly styled the radio personality with elegance and class.",
  [18361112] = "%s designed a flamboyant stage look that didn't go with the style of this show.",
  [18361113] = "%s borrowed a suit from elsewhere, which didn't fit the radio personality.",
  [18361114] = "%s has a quirky aesthetic sense and turned the radio personality into a punk rocker.",
  [18361119] = "We didn't bring any stylists and can only tell the radio personality that he looks most attractive with natural beauty.",
  [18361120] = "The voice is irresistible to an auralist!",
  [18361200] = "When the radio show was about to start, the radio personality suddenly realized that the script was left in the lounge upstairs. Hurry and get someone to get it quickly!",
  [18361211] = "%s, known as \"Bolt\", easily retrieved the script before the show started.",
  [18361212] = "%s runs fast but is very forgetful and went to the wrong floor and couldn't find the script anywhere.",
  [18361213] = "%s is too slow. The radio personality had to play three songs and four ads, and still, he wasn't back.",
  [18361214] = "%s is absent-minded and got lost when he went to pick up the script.",
  [18361219] = "We asked the radio personality to get it himself and tried very hard, but the show still didn't start on time.",
  [18361220] = "Radio shows being delayed is a very serious mishap that must be avoided at all costs!",
  [18362000] = "The rise of child actors has been a much-debated topic recently. At the same time, the protection of their privacy has also become a widely discussed point of contention.",
  [18362001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a silhouette appeared in my mind.",
  [18362002] = "We must protect the privacy of our adolescents!",
  [18362100] = "As a talk show, we must have a show host who can control the flow of the discussion.",
  [18362111] = "%s is very well-spoken and displayed stellar performance while on stage. The conversation flowed very well during the show.",
  [18362112] = "%s is very knowledgeable in idol culture, but lacks basic legal knowledge. The result was a big fiasco.",
  [18362113] = "%s managed to get the emotions flowing for the guests, but stuttered a lot during the closing conclusion.",
  [18362114] = "%s couldn't help but join in the conversation and ended up stealing time away from the guests.",
  [18362119] = "Let the guests talk it out. Who needs a host?",
  [18362120] = "Both sides seemed to have a point!",
  [18362200] = "There are too many pointless chitchats in the raw footage. We need someone professional to edit it out.",
  [18362211] = "%s expertly completed the editing job. The result was a fantastically edited piece without any problems.",
  [18362212] = "%s is new to the industry. The editing result was mediocre and unremarkable.",
  [18362213] = "%s was very skilled in postproduction, but forgot to cut out the parts where everyone was yawning.",
  [18362214] = "%s had no knowledge of editing and created a huge disaster of a final product.",
  [18362219] = "Nothing wrong with showing the original footage to everyone.",
  [18362220] = "Hopefully, this will let everyone know a bit more about child actors as a profession.",
  [18363000] = "Star Explorer is a popular children's franchise worldwide. Recently, they wanted to do a promotion for their new novel.",
  [18363001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a silhouette appeared in my mind.",
  [18363002] = "Hope Ace Star will find a new treasure with his friends in this new entry!",
  [18363100] = "We're going to need someone to do a little market research before promoting the new book. Who should I send?",
  [18363111] = "%s was meticulous and delivered a very detailed research report.",
  [18363112] = "%s collected a lot of information, but the report had numerous data mistakes due to carelessness.",
  [18363113] = "%s had great attention to detail, but interviewed people that were of a completely different age group from the novel's intended audience.",
  [18363114] = "%s played games all day and sent in a PPT he downloaded from the internet instead.",
  [18363119] = "We've already done a lot of promotional projects like this. I can probably just use the old template.",
  [18363120] = "Doing prep work gives me the thrill of building something from scratch. How exciting!",
  [18363200] = "Due to it being a book for children, we need an actor with a relevant and suitable reputation to promote the book.",
  [18363211] = "%s put on a stellar performance as a devoted Star Explorer fan. The new book sold extremely well as a result.",
  [18363212] = "%s put up a lot of work on promotion, but overdid it on the performance and became a meme on the internet.",
  [18363213] = "%s fitted well with the book, but forgot all the lines and wasn't able to contribute at all.",
  [18363214] = "%s's appearance did not make a stir at all and was ignored by everyone.",
  [18363219] = "I don't think a big franchise like Star Explorer would require any promotional ambassador.",
  [18363220] = "The book is getting published soon. I'm going to buy one for me, one for keeps, and one to recommend to others!",
  [18364000] = "A platform bought the digital streaming rights of the Star Explorer movie. Now they want you to do a promotion for them.",
  [18364001] = "Sparks of inspiration had long dried up from my head. Just as the flames of creativity began to flicker, a silhouette appeared in my mind.",
  [18364002] = "I'm ready to rewatch the entire Star Explorer franchise!",
  [18364100] = "The platform wants Tony to do an ad, but his father has been a big pain in the backside. We need someone to negotiate with him.",
  [18364111] = "%s was very skilled in dealing with parents. Tony's dad soon agreed to the ad deal.",
  [18364112] = "%s persuaded Tony's father using Tony's contract. However, Tony's dad complained that the person was very unfriendly.",
  [18364113] = "%s got along really well with Tony's dad and completely forgot about the work you assigned.",
  [18364114] = "%s talked about all kinds of nonsense. Tony's dad was furious.",
  [18364119] = "Tony's dad is still mad. Better not deal with him right now.",
  [18364120] = "Words are truly a form of art.",
  [18364200] = "Tony's fans learned of the movie location and arrived ahead of time. We need someone to get them to leave.",
  [18364211] = "%s reasoned with the fans and made them leave willingly.",
  [18364212] = "%s had a bad temper and got in a scuffle with the fans.",
  [18364213] = "%s took a lot of time to convince the fans to leave. By the time they left, the ad filming was already done.",
  [18364214] = "%s is also a fan of Tony's and stood with the other fans to film the set.",
  [18364219] = "Oh well. If they want to watch, then let them watch.",
  [18364220] = "All the Easter Eggs in the ad made me really nostalgic.",
  [18365000] = "Have you ever wondered about the journey the food takes before appearing on your plate? Let's explore their story by entering this plantation.",
  [18365001] = "My mind is completely blank of creative ideas. Just as the flames of creativity began to extinguish, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [18365002] = "The journey of such a simple fruit has been fascinating indeed.",
  [18365100] = "Looks like only an expert can tell us how our food goes from a tiny seed to our dinner plates.",
  [18365111] = "These experts sure know their stuff. Listening to them was a treat.",
  [18365112] = "%s doesn't know anything about farming and gave you completely unpractical knowledge.",
  [18365113] = "%s read something off the Internet. None of it really made sense.",
  [18365114] = "%s is an expert on hair transplants and made you sit through essentially a bunch of advertisements.",
  [18365119] = "I guess I have to rely on myself.",
  [18365120] = "It looks a little more complicated than I thought.",
  [18365200] = "The tripod is still in the car. Someone's got to go back.",
  [18365211] = "%s quickly and swiftly retrieved the tripod.",
  [18365212] = "%s was never good at sprinting and fell into a muddy pit while tripping.",
  [18365213] = "%s is very forgetful and forgot to grab the key to the car.",
  [18365214] = "%s is a slowpoke. By the time the tripod was retrieved, the photo shoot was already over.",
  [18365219] = "Do we have to use a tripod? Can't we hold it by ourselves?",
  [18365220] = "If you want to get the best picture, you've got to use the proper tools.",
  [18366000] = "How does the greenhouse operate? Read our expertly prepared article to find out more.",
  [18366001] = "My mind is completely blank of creative ideas. Just as the flames of creativity began to extinguish, a familiar figure came to my mind.",
  [18366002] = "So that's how vegetables are grown. I learned something new today.",
  [18366100] = "The link to our article returned with an error. Get someone careful to fix it up.",
  [18366111] = "%s soon found the reason. One of the QR Codes in the PowerPoint was incorrect.",
