  [21272303] = "Although there were a lot of lessons shoe-horned in there for the kids, overall it was still a decent film.",
  [21272304] = "I think if we can be this optimistic during these disasters, then everything will be alright!",
  [21272401] = "Aaaaww, little Shimmer, Mama loves you!! You're too cute!!!",
  [21272402] = "Who wouldn't want to have such a clever little robot? Can someone please ask Shimmer for me what color burlap sack he likes, thx...",
  [21272403] = "Can the creator of this film please take some responsibility for this? My child is asking me for the exact same model of robot. Where can one buy such a thing?",
  [21272404] = "It's been a long time since I've seen such a good movie! Yaaay! I laughed until I cried. Go, Shimmer, go!",
  [21273101] = "A boring show. Dreck for the masses. Utterly meaningless!",
  [21273102] = "Don't act all innocent here! Who has brought on these disasters? You have no idea?",
  [21273103] = "When my own personal safety isn't guaranteed, how can we try to come to an understanding through words? Don't try to force people to do the impossible.",
  [21273104] = "Let's get through these disasters first, then think about that stuff. I just want to know what's really going on now.",
  [21273201] = "There's no need to make stories about this at this time. Evolvers won't thank you for it.",
  [21273202] = "The scene is all mixed up. They may have started from a good place, but the logic they followed doesn't fit at all.",
  [21273203] = "I still don't like it and can't accept it. I feel as if I've been threatened.",
  [21273204] = "I think the interviewer was very impolite, with no thought for how others might feel.",
  [21273301] = "If there were more shows like this, maybe there would be less misunderstanding in the world.",
  [21273302] = "It really takes courage to produce a show like this in the current climate. You have my whole-hearted support.",
  [21273303] = "People always look for a scapegoat in times of misfortune. They're not willing to face the truth.",
  [21273304] = "As long as people are willing to come together, the warmth of their hearts will keep each other warm.",
  [21273401] = "This is a show with a conscience! Everyone has a right to exist! Don't go judging people maliciously!",
  [21273402] = "This has warmed my heart. I hope there can be less prejudice in the world, and more love.",
  [21273403] = "Who's chopping onions?! Very well made. As a closeted Evolver, I can merely anonymously click like.",
  [21273404] = "They're not some dangerous thing, and not gods either. They are plain, normal people of flesh and blood just like you!",
  [21274101] = "What is this garbage? Just a bunch of kids making a racket. Can't make out a word they're saying.",
  [21274102] = "There's a kid with a runny nose, fer pete's sake. Can't someone wipe it?",
  [21274103] = "What kind of trash show tries to monetize kids? Can we not have something of substance?",
  [21274104] = "Is this the future of Loveland City? I see no sign of hope then.",
  [21274201] = "If I was the parent, I know I wouldn't let my kid go on this kind of show. Are they that crazy for fame?",
  [21274202] = "I feel like the kids are just reading off cue cards. They sound just like they're reading from a textbook.",
  [21274203] = "Does anyone else think one of these kids is just really annoying? This isn't child-like at all.",
  [21274204] = "Let kids have a happy childhood. This kind of show is pointless.",
  [21274301] = "These kids are so cute. I feel better just looking at them.",
  [21274302] = "I feel like kids today understand so much. Not like when we were kids and only cared about eating goodies and playing.",
  [21274303] = "There's one really cool little kid in here that is for sure gonna grow up to be something special.",
  [21274304] = "These kids are so cute, I want to have a kid... Wake up call: I don't even have a boyfriend.",
  [21274401] = "This feels like the perfect show to watch together with the kids at home. Relaxed and fun!",
  [21274402] = "Hahaha, these kids are just too cute! It's woken up the long-lost kid in me!",
  [21274403] = "They have some rather fanciful ideas, but you can see that their world is a beautiful one.",
  [21274404] = "To maintain a world of peace for the children, we need to work hard!",
  [21275101] = "Unscrupulous scam artists! Whoever buys this is a dupe!",
  [21275102] = "My grandma was tricked into buying one, only to find out it's an ordinary raincoat. And they don't even allow returns. Boycott them, everyone!",
  [21275103] = "If you've got half a brain, you won't fall for this. If you've got money, just go buy some brand-name clothes, amirite?",
  [21275104] = "Livestreams these days really are a circus. Too bad they're only making ill-gotten gains.",
  [21275201] = "Lol, how are they charging this much for this cheap thing? It's practically useless.",
  [21275202] = "Everybody, call the Better Business Bureau! Can't let these devious businesses escape the law!",
  [21275203] = "The product sucks and so does the presenter. It's nothing but brainwashing ad buzzwords. Detestable.",
  [21275204] = "As soon as I saw this infomercial-looking stream, I knew it was fake goods. Only old people would fall for this.",
  [21275301] = "All else aside, this presenter is quite alluring. Without even realizing it, I memorized the ad copy.",
  [21275302] = "Hahaha, this presenter is pretty funny. As for the anti-disaster clothes, forget it. Not safe by the looks of it.",
  [21275303] = "I feel like this thing might really be useful. And if it does work, it'll save your life.",
  [21275304] = "I'm always coming across this livestream. Might as well bite the bullet and buy one. They're probably legit.",
  [21275401] = "I love the presenter, and the ad slogan is the icing on the cake!",
  [21275402] = "I think this platform should sign this presenter to a contract. I could watch her stream all day!",
  [21275403] = "At first I would never buy this, but now I've done a one-eighty. I heard someone really saved their life with this.",
  [21275404] = "This ad copy is so catchy, lol. As soon as I hear it, I can't get it out of my head!!",
  [21276101] = "I don't think this show can provide any help. Just water cooler fodder.",
  [21276102] = "They lack the talent to do anything but pander to the lowest common denominator. Get a life.",
  [21276103] = "What nonsense are they trying to teach. As a professional, all I can say is don't mislead the youth with this drivel.",
  [21276104] = "They have to act all cute even for a survival show? Doesn't that feel contrived? I can't keep watching.",
  [21276201] = "I'd like more genuine news stories and less schlock like this.",
  [21276202] = "I would prefer for them to avoid the unnecessary feigning and winking, please. Thank you.",
  [21276203] = "The standards for a girl group are getting lower and lower. Both for looks and voice.",
  [21276204] = "After watching it, I remembered nothing of use. It was just watching cute girls acting coquettish.",
  [21276301] = "Go, ladies! They're always doing positive things. Let's go!",
  [21276302] = "There are not many idols as proactive as them. I'm proud to be a fane!",
  [21276303] = "After watching this, I only have one thought: those ladies are too beautiful!",
  [21276304] = "The fan club is also always looking for things they can do to help out during the disasters! Full steam ahead!",
  [21276401] = "Aaaaaahh! The show's finally out! You guys are my fav! Let's go!",
  [21276402] = "I introduced my mom to my favorite idols. She said these girls are both pretty and kind, worth being a fan of!",
  [21276403] = "These ladies are so kind! I learned a lot! Very useful!",
  [21276404] = "If nothing else, just the smiles of these ladies has me cured. My depression is totally cleared.",
  [21277101] = "I have a suspicion you guys are just spouting total nonsense out of thin air...",
  [21277102] = "After all that talk, what's the conclusion? If you can't explain yourselves, then don't air the show, right?",
  [21277103] = "I feel like these so-called experts are just blowing hot air. You think we're all just a bunch of sheep?",
  [21277104] = "Dirty money is easy to come by, right? I watched this till the end. It's just garbage! Total let down!",
  [21277201] = "No matter what tricks you try to pull, I'm never trusting the lamestream media again. Really disappointing.",
  [21277202] = "If tomorrow is the apocalypse, I wouldn't even be surprised. Why should I waste my life watching a show like this?",
  [21277203] = "The most consistent thing about the weather report is its inconsistency.",
  [21277204] = "So, did you find a solution for this anomalous weather? If not, why did you waste your time making this?",
  [21277301] = "After watching an episode, I'm still half-confused. I hope the next one will explain things a little more plainly.",
  [21277302] = "When things are bleak, arming people with a little knowledge is a fine idea. Things don't feel like a big question mark anymore.",
  [21277303] = "Only the mainstream media actively disseminating the truth will take the wind out of the sails of rumor-mongers. I support this show.",
  [21277304] = "I hope this frightening weather goes away for good, and everyone can return to their peaceful lives.",
  [21277401] = "The expert's analysis is on point. I feel like I learned a lot. Thanks~!",
  [21277402] = "Lolol, this lecturer is pretty funny. I usually hate sitting in class, but this show is easy to follow.",
  [21277403] = "I just had a weather event in front of my house not too long ago. I hope the disasters stop, and everyone can get some peace and quiet again.",
  [21277404] = "Perhaps we can't totally control everything right now, but as long as we don't give up, we'll succeed. Hang in there, everyone!",
  [21278101] = "We have our front-runner for worst movie of the year! These people have no business trying to make a thriller. The story doesn't make sense.",
  [21278102] = "The first part was a bit suspenseful, but the mystery party was a mess. Waste of time!",
  [21278103] = "I watched this movie because I liked the premise. Really disappointed! Rubbish film!",
  [21278104] = "A production team of this quality actually found investors? Did the money to make this just come from trees?",
  [21278201] = "I'm not that disappointed or anything. Just a run-of-the-mill bad movie.",
  [21278202] = "I feel like there were some loose ends at the end that never got tied up.",
  [21278203] = "This had no tension like a thriller should have. I actually found it comical.",
  [21278204] = "I was crying when I left the theater. Not because it was moving, but for the money I wasted on the ticket.",
  [21278301] = "I can see they put a lot of work into this. The special effects were spot-on, and the plot pacing was intense.",
  [21278302] = "Just as good as those overseas thrillers. I hope our domestic film industry can make more quality films like this.",
  [21278303] = "A good flick. But the screams of the lead actress made my kid cry.",
  [21278304] = "I recommend the faint of heart turn off the sound to watch. The background music will put a chill down your spine.",
  [21278401] = "I'm a total scaredy-cat, so why do I love these types of movies?! I'll be too scared again to go to the bathroom tonight!",
  [21278402] = "What a thrill ride!! It's been a long time since I've seen such an intense flick. 5 stars from me!",
  [21278403] = "I didn't see that ending coming at all. I thought there was no way they could keep up the suspense, but I underestimated this director!!",
  [21278404] = "I watched this shaking under my blanket the whole time. My roommate thought I'd gone mad, and I think this movie really has made me crazy!",
  [21279101] = "It's 2021 and we're still getting such tired old plots! C'mon people!!",
  [21279102] = "I'll bet I'm not the only one who found this hard to watch. Raise your hand if you agree!",
  [21279103] = "The female lead is so poor she can only afford to live in a mansion. Sorry, I'm not even worthy of being poor.",
  [21279104] = "The lead is ugly. This is enough for me to turn it off. This is supposed to be a heart throb show, right?!",
  [21279201] = "I have no interest in a senseless plot like this. Let little girls with no real-world experience fool themselves into liking it.",
  [21279202] = "I feel like the male and female leads are so awkward. They have no chemistry whatsoever. The supporting female had a little charisma though.",
  [21279203] = "Can I just say that I find this one unwatchable? The female lead's face moves around a lot, but she doesn't seem to be able to make many expressions.",
  [21279204] = "I know some people like watching mindless television, but this show just scoops out your brain without any anesthesia and throws it in the trash.",
  [21279301] = "If you just zone out and watch it, it's not bad, and I don't even like these sorts of saccharine sweet, bubblegum-pop shows anymore.",
  [21279302] = "This guy does it for me! The female lead is a little high-maintenance. I think the guy should choose me!",
  [21279303] = "Well, that's it. My kid sister won't shut up about this show's male lead. It's like she's been poisoned.",
  [21279304] = "I like watching sweet shows like this lately. After all, life is bitter enough.",
  [21279401] = "Super cute! The male and female leads are so fetching, and the plot is fun!",
  [21279402] = "I watched this beaming from ear to ear. In my golden years, I just enjoy watching a sweet love story about a couple of nice young people!",
  [21279403] = "Anybody know where to find a boyfriend like that? I'll go get in line right now.",
  [21279404] = "When will such a sweet love be mine! I want that guy toooooo!",
  [21280101] = "This production team seems to think close-up shots are the height of cinematography, but it's actually just boring!",
  [21280102] = "You think that you've saved culture because you made a film about some artifacts? Phhbbtt, get real...",
  [21280103] = "The trailer looked so elegant, but I feel really let down having watched it. There was no historical gravitas at all.",
  [21280104] = "Super boring! Super lousy! I watched ten minutes before I snapped myself out of it and stopped wasting time.",
  [21280201] = "All they did was shoot an exhibition of some artwork. They don't go beneath the surface at all.",
  [21280202] = "They must have done a lot of running around to shoot all this, so I'll give it one star.",
  [21280203] = "Quite boring. I don't feel like these things are worth that much, and they're not useful for anything either.",
  [21280204] = "I just don't get it. I'm not going to pretend to be cultured. I just want to watch something fun.",
  [21280301] = "It really gives you a sense of the times. I think the filming was very well done.",
  [21280302] = "I used to collect ancient artifacts like this. I was really drawn in by the sense of history imbued in them. Nice film.",
  [21280303] = "This is worth supporting. People who make films like this are really dedicated to their craft.",
  [21280304] = "So beautiful. I really wish I could go, but all I can afford is my imagination.",
  [21280401] = "This is fire! There aren't many people left willing to film something like this. People don't have the patience for it.",
  [21280402] = "Such a long wait! Through cultural artifacts, we can come to know the history and spirit of a variety of peoples. What an excellent program!",
  [21280403] = "So beautiful! Craftspeople like this are a dying breed. Machine-made things are always lacking some in beauty.",
  [21280404] = "This documentary is not bad! These crowns have helped us learn about fast-disappearing traditional craftsmanship. I love it!",
  [21281101] = "They're all just acting poorly. It's clear at first sight. You take the audience for idiots?",
  [21281102] = "Who thinks any of these people looks like a celebrity? Where did the production team find these dolts to torture our eyes with?!",
  [21281103] = "I can't take it. The celebrities are train wrecks, and let's not even mention the normal people. I literally can't watch this.",
  [21281104] = "All these interactions feel so staged. It's awkward to watch.",
  [21281201] = "All the good parts got cut out entirely. If the show is trying to make someone look good, don't be so obvious about it!",
  [21281202] = "Some of these contestants are deplorable. What's so great about them? Another win for capitalism.",
  [21281203] = "All worked out and scripted beforehand. Anyone who thinks it's real is an idiot.",
  [21281204] = "I think some celebrities these days can't compare to these normal people. No attacks from fans, please.",
  [21281301] = "It's pretty obvious who is who, but the show is still really funny!",
  [21281302] = "This is must-watch TV for our family every day. Some of these knock-off celebrities aren't so easy on the eyes, but it's fun.",
  [21281303] = "I started watching this show because of all the big celebrities, but the normal people are pretty interesting too. I'm a fan.",
  [21281304] = "I think the production team put a lot of effort into this. It's not easy to get normal people so polished up.",
  [21281401] = "Lololol, this show has gotten a whole year's worth of laughs out of me. Everybody's gotta watch this!!",
  [21281402] = "The post-production on the this show is so cute. Reading all the pop-up captions, I can just see the looks on the editors faces as they wrote them.",
  [21281403] = "I'll just say this, I can play a high note for a whole year. You can't fake that talent!",
  [21281404] = "Does anybody even remember that this is a competition show, hahaha? I feel like everyone's just laughing the whole time, lololol.",
  [21282101] = "When the real heroes are still on the front lines, these beneficiaries are already receiving awards on the stage.",
  [21282102] = "The show sucks. It has nothing to do with the heroes. They're just dragged down by the production team.",
  [21282103] = "It was okay at the start, but it's annoying that the host cries every time.",
  [21282104] = "I'm outraged that a solemn program was made so unprofessionally!",
  [21282201] = "I hope they don't add adverts to this kind of show in the future. Thank you.",
  [21282202] = "Why is there not a single teacher? Are they not good enough to make Loveland shed tears?",
  [21282203] = "The tears are way too fake. There's hardly any substance to the content.",
  [21282204] = "No need to cry. We all just need to do our best.",
  [21282301] = "Where can I download this show? I wanna show it to my students.",
  [21282302] = "Beautiful stories are everywhere. May there always be stories like this.",
  [21282303] = "We can resist shedding tears, but we cannot resist our hearts be moved.",
  [21282304] = "\"These people\" are our heroes, the pillars of Loveland!",
  [21282401] = "Moves the hearts of Loveland City! It's a great show! Let love melt the ice of indifference of the world!",
  [21282402] = "Thankful for people like you! Together we will overcome whatever disasters are ahead!!!",
  [21282403] = "It's so beautiful! Hope we can unite together to overcome this disaster.",
  [21282404] = "Action speaks louder than words. Moves the hearts of Loveland, moves the hearts of you and me! You're all so amazing!",
  [21283101] = "No way! I really doubt that if any one would ever yearn for living in such a big family!",
  [21283102] = "What the heck?! I have no idea what the movie is about.",
  [21283103] = "Details are inconsistent from shot to shot and the narrative pace is not well-managed. Would give it zero stars if I could.",
  [21283104] = "Is there nothing they can shoot? This genre really bores the crap out of me.",
  [21283201] = "The pace is too sluggish and it lacks contents. Nothing interests me.",
  [21283202] = "It's all about a big family leading a cat-and-dog life, just like writing a daily diary. There's not much worth watching.",
  [21283203] = "My head aches whenever I see so many people. We'd better live alone in the modern society today.",
  [21283204] = "It can't be so warm as it seems. Big families are always mired in different kinds of troubles.",
  [21283301] = "It's good indeed. After so many frustrations, I really need something like this to fresh me up.",
  [21283302] = "The most touching part is usually not the sudden explosion of emotions, but something runs deep and slow.",
  [21283303] = "It brought me to tears and I found something melting slowly inside my chest.",
  [21283304] = "This is the life we all dream of. We've never learned how to cherish it until it's gone.",
  [21283401] = "I like the true colors of an ordinary life! Nothing special but everlasting!",
  [21283402] = "I'm so touched!! I didn't expect to be cheered up by such scenes. My soul has been redeemed!",
  [21283403] = "It really heals my soul. I want to live this kind of life for once before the world ends.",
  [21283404] = "Cherish what we have now. I miss my mom.",
  [21284101] = "This really sucks! It drains people of their last hope. It's the worst show ever.",
  [21284102] = "This is embarrassing throughout the whole time!! Since they barely know each other, then why bother to talk? I'm so embarrassed.",
  [21284103] = "I thought it would be a good and thought-provoking show, and I was wrong! It was merely a grandstand!!!",
  [21284104] = "TV stations should be cancelled if that's all that they can offer.",
  [21284201] = "It has gone too far when trying to amuse the audience. I feel a little bit embarrassed.",
  [21284202] = "Am I the only one who feels uncomfortable? They horse around over such a serious thing.",
  [21284203] = "Are they really so persistent? I heard that IFG had provided them with generous funds.",
  [21284204] = "I think they're faking it. I don't believe this kind of people really exist.",
  [21284301] = "They are super nice, very different from my imagination.",
  [21284302] = "Those who are still holding out are real heroes. Salute!",
  [21284303] = "I think they are brilliant. Love them!",
  [21284304] = "I'd like to join them… Where can I apply?",
  [21284401] = "Haha… They are so cute. Interesting souls!",
  [21284402] = "This is the boy band from our Loveland City. Please make your debut ASAP!!!",
  [21284403] = "Hahaha… I can't stop it… Hahaha… What a wonderful show!!!",
  [21284404] = "It made me laugh with tears! I just burst into tears when they took the photo at the end. Wish them all the best.",
  [21285101] = "It's not the time for caring about the plants and flowers! That's insane.",
  [21285102] = "It seems that the host was not well prepared. He couldn't even pronounce their names right. What a shame!",
  [21285103] = "This really sucks. It is not as astonishing as I thought, even though all the mysteries have been solved.",
  [21285104] = "These plants outweigh all human beings. Do they deserve a better life than we do?",
  [21285201] = "A good genre but no highlights. It makes me drowsy.",
  [21285202] = "I was much looking forward to the show, but it turned out to be disappointing.",
  [21285203] = "If I were given another chance, I would never watch this show. It's a waste of time!",
  [21285204] = "The show is full of boring scenes. And it's so long that I even fall asleep.",
  [21285301] = "Every creature is doing its best to survive, so why should we give up?",
  [21285302] = "The green color makes me feel much better. I hope a miracle will happen.",
  [21285303] = "I've always wanted to visit that botanical garden. Thanks to the show, I finally get a glimpse of it.",
  [21285304] = "As a zealous plant lover myself, I really want to take all those plants that I can barely recognize back to my house.",
  [21285401] = "Wow!!! Terrific!! I recommend everyone to watch it!",
  [21285402] = "I found my inner peace after watching this. It feels like hope is back among us again.",
  [21285403] = "People should be in awe of life at any time, and never give it up easily.",
  [21285404] = "I've recommended my whole family to watch it. I feel my soul has been purified somehow!",
  [21286101] = "My concert experience is not so good. It was hot in the hall, and the fans were so noisy that I could not hear the singer clearly.",
  [21286102] = "Emm... How shall I put it? It may have a good starting point, but I feel that he's got a wave to ride.",
  [21286103] = "I really liked him before, but not now.",
  [21286104] = "I think his performance was just average. He was overpraised.",
  [21286201] = "The video is just so so. It is not what I want.",
  [21286202] = "What the hell? The reception is poor. It is the worst live concert I've ever watched.",
  [21286203] = "I like Kiro very much, but the video is really boring.",
  [21286204] = "I think fans may like it, but for others, it is boring.",
  [21286301] = "Any entertainer who stands out now has a sense of social responsibility. Thumbs up!",
  [21286302] = "I didn't expect Kiro's live concert to be so lit. I will go to the concert next time!",
  [21286303] = "I think I'm in love with Kiro. I never thought he was so cool before I saw what he did on stage!",
  [21286304] = "It takes a lot of hard work to hold a charity concert, which deserves our respect.",
  [21286401] = "Ahhhhh! I like you! Kiro, I really like you! You look so cool on the stage!",
  [21286402] = "Kiro! That's my baby boy! What a successful charity concert!",
  [21286403] = "Amazing! Classic Kiro! I want to tell the whole world about him!",
  [21286404] = "I watch the video again and again every day, because I can't get enough of it.",
  [21287101] = "The apocalypse comes together with the anomalous weather. This may be the punishment humans deserve.",
  [21287102] = "Neither the government nor the media can be trusted. No one cares if we live or die.",
  [21287103] = "The data must be fake. I can't believe casualties would be that low. It must be concealed.",
  [21287104] = "I'm going to die anyway. Why am I still watching this kind of news? The day will come sooner or later.",
  [21287201] = "I don't want to see such sad news again. Really.",
  [21287202] = "Whenever I turn on the TV, it's the same news every day. Maybe life is not going to be good.",
  [21287203] = "Feeling depressed. Sometimes I think it would be nice if the end of the world came soon.",
  [21287204] = "I don't know where the next disaster site will be. Perhaps it will happen around me.",
  [21287301] = "I salute all rescuers and the press for their arrival at the disaster scene at the first place.",
  [21287302] = "I have subscribed to this channel. There's probably no other media outlet that would venture into a dangerous situation.",
  [21287303] = "I pray for all disaster victims and thumb up for all rescuers.",
  [21287304] = "It is not easy for journalists to work at the frontline. I am impressed.",
  [21287401] = "The heart is more powerful than the disaster. May we unite as one to weather the hard times!",
  [21287402] = "The program staff risked their lives to bring us a first-hand report from the severely afflicted area. They deserve our respect!",
  [21287403] = "The disaster is said to have been well prevented and controlled. We have renewed hope now!",
  [21287404] = "We humans have so far overcome countless difficulties. We're going to make it through this time, too. Go!",
  [21288101] = "I was a Kiro fan, but I don't like him now. We need an explanation of this matter!",
  [21288102] = "Whatever he said cannot cover for him. Isn't the Evolver issue an undeniable fact?",
  [21288103] = "How dare he speak in public again? I really can't stand it!",
