  [21313101] = "Whoever's promoting this has some skewed values. What if everyone becomes too trusting of others?",
  [21313102] = "These shows today are so irresponsible. If some little kid watches this then gets in a car with a stranger, will you take the blame?",
  [21313103] = "That may all be true, but I'm not trusting others willy-nilly like that!",
  [21313104] = "Too one-sided! Anyone who only looks on the good side will pay the price!",
  [21313201] = "I don't like these kinds of shows. The interviews feel a little fake. Who would say something mean while in front of a camera?",
  [21313202] = "I'm afraid those statistics are fabricated. They seem way off. Anyway, I don't believe it.",
  [21313203] = "There are more than a few young girls who got into danger for trusting the wrong person. Why doesn't the show bring them up?",
  [21313204] = "No matter what you guys think, I won't be doing any hitchhiking. Try to save a few bucks, but you'll end up losing way more.",
  [21313301] = "One rainy day I couldn't catch a cab, and some nice guy gave me a lift home. Not everyone in the world is out to get you.",
  [21313302] = "I feel like this has a point, but I'm still not brave enough to try. Maybe I'm just too cowardly...",
  [21313303] = "The show wasn't encouraging everyone to go out and hitchhike, but it looks like there are still lots of good people out there.",
  [21313304] = "Great. If I see anyone in trouble, I'll give them a lift too. As long as the situation isn't dangerous.",
  [21313401] = "Heartwarming!! Positivity!! There are still lots of good people in the world~",
  [21313402] = "I'm watching and next thing I know, I'm crying! Sometimes, a little trust and warmth like this is just what people need.",
  [21313403] = "Excellently-made show. The people around me have all been noticing this hitchhiking issue lately, and this show has helped me hear the voices of more people.",
  [21313404] = "Personally I think girls should put safety first. If they ever did run into a bad person, the consequences would be unthinkable!",
  [21314101] = "They'll put any old garbage place on TV now!! This is not worth listening to at all!! No thank you!",
  [21314102] = "I was almost going to believe this, but thankfully my little sister has been hoodwinked by this place before. This show is not reliable at all. Don't trust it.",
  [21314103] = "If a place has a lot of people, that means it's got good food and service. This trendy \"hole-in-the-wall dive\" thing is just a fad, right?",
  [21314104] = "I don't understand this at all. You guys have been to the place, so how can you call it a \"dive\" or \"underground\" now? Aren't you just fooling yourselves and others?",
  [21314201] = "This show's production staff is surely getting some money out of this. Do you really want to shop at a store like that? Expensive as hell and doesn't even taste good.",
  [21314202] = "I don't know whose opinion they're following, but it doesn't look like much to me. I have absolutely no desire to go.",
  [21314203] = "If it's so out-of-the-way, then do people really go there? I think that aside from being obscure, everything else about it is just marketing bluster.",
  [21314204] = "I went to one of the spots in this show before and got treated so poorly. I'm not saying which one, but I'll never go there again.",
  [21314301] = "Awww, my little hidden treasure is going to get popular now. It's not mine alone anymore. I'm both excited and sad.",
  [21314302] = "I don't know about the others, but I've been to that fried dumpling place and the food is legit, and the price is fair. There will probably be a line outside after this show airs, won't there?",
  [21314303] = "OMG, isn't that the shop outside our building? How did they find such an obscure place? Hats off to you, producers!",
  [21314304] = "Looks pretty decent. I just don't know if the show is getting some kind of advertising kickback or not.",
  [21314401] = "That last place looked like a paradise on earth. And so mysterious! I've just gotta find it!",
  [21314402] = "I've had the good fortune of going to two of these places, and they truly are super, super awesome. This production team really knows their stuff!!",
  [21314403] = "I've always loved these little hole-in-the-wall dives. When I get time, I'm definitely ticking all of these off my list.",
  [21314404] = "We have a little hidden treasure like this nearby us too. Local people all go, but outside the neighborhood, no one knows about it. Maybe one day the show's team will come here too.",
  [21315101] = "What a lousy show! I was falling asleep listening to it! Completely unintelligible.",
  [21315102] = "Why does a science education show need to invite celebrities on? It just feels like window dressing with absolutely no use!",
  [21315103] = "This is too misleading and harmful. It's spreading incorrect facts to people, and those experts are just pretending they know stuff.",
  [21315104] = "Where did this show find these experts? This wouldn't even fool a little kid.",
  [21315201] = "I don't know if this was supposed to be an educational show or a debate show, but anyway, everything they said was over my head.",
  [21315202] = "??? Our whole family was confused watching this. What on earth were they talking about?",
  [21315203] = "Way off base, and the logic was a mess. I don't know if it was the expert's fault, or the editing.",
  [21315204] = "My son put on your show and had a very sound sleep. Thank you.",
  [21315301] = "It was worthwhile, but some parts are still open to debate. I hope the show does their fact-checking on that.",
  [21315302] = "Hearing the two sides debate was quite interesting. I never thought about it like that before. Very eye-opening.",
  [21315303] = "I never expected XX to have such interesting ideas. Good-looking and well-informed! That's not fair to us normal people!",
  [21315304] = "I've never felt like they're saying when I've seen other people get in fights, but my good friend is really empathic, so I guess it depends on the person.",
  [21315401] = "Wow, I get to see my idol in this show! What an awesome surprise!!!",
  [21315402] = "They were able to explain a lot just from this small phenomenon. No wonder they're the experts! I never thought of all that before!",
  [21315403] = "I learned a lot. Watching these people have a discussion was really enlightening. I hope they put out more shows.",
  [21315404] = "I strongly recommend! You absolutely won't regret it! Much better than watching those shows with no educational value.",
  [21316101] = "After watching this promotional video, I don't even want to go. The way they shot it, it just looks like some flea market...",
  [21316102] = "This video hurts my eyes! My friend said they could've shot it with their feet and done a better job!",
  [21316103] = "Can I just say that this action is really garbage? It's crowded, the service stinks, and the whole experience just couldn't be worse.",
  [21316104] = "I've seen this auction item before. It's a million times prettier in person than in the video. Don't be fooled, everyone!!!",
  [21316201] = "To be honest, it's too down-the-middle. When educational stuff is too dry it's a little boring.",
  [21316202] = "It took me awhile to realize this was a video for an auction. Why are they trying to present themselves as educational content? Are you trying to trick everyone?",
  [21316203] = "It's quite an achievement to make something seem so boring. And the narrator's accent is hard to understand.",
  [21316204] = "That's all there is in this auction? Or did they pick things to film that don't represent the whole auction? I hope it's the latter.",
  [21316301] = "I really want to go. I heard about this auction before, and now this video has helped me learn more about it.",
  [21316302] = "The items up for auction all look pretty good. I think I'll try my luck.",
  [21316303] = "I learned a lot, and they were really rigorous with their facts. I think the film crew really put their hearts into this.",
  [21316304] = "I wish it could've been longer. Before I knew it, I was totally sucked in. Awesome video!",
  [21316401] = "Wow! That's really a feast for the eyes! Too beautiful to look away from!! I feel proud that we have such rich history and cultural heritage!",
  [21316402] = "I feel like every auction piece has a story to tell, and the value of these stories exceeds that of the thing itself.",
  [21316403] = "The lighting and music are perfect complements to each other. Stunning and grand!",
  [21316404] = "I'm definitely going to this auction! Even if I can't afford these precious items, I can still feast my eyes on them!",
  [21317101] = "The safety class in my kids elementary school talked about more than this! There are no real facts to learn from this at all!",
  [21317102] = "This was a waste of time to watch. You really want people to learn such complicated stuff? You must be joking.",
  [21317103] = "A lot of these techniques have been proven long ago to be ineffective. Can the production team please do their homework? Safety is nothing to mess around with!",
  [21317104] = "Not one useful thing. All that watching was a big waste of time. Thumbs down!",
  [21317201] = "The sets are a joke right? Is the show that hard-up for money?",
  [21317202] = "This expert is the least professional person I've seen, always breaking into laughter. This is a serious topic, can't they show a little reverence?",
  [21317203] = "I feel like such an official show should take itself a little more seriously. Why are a lot of these techniques different from what I learned?",
  [21317204] = "Everything else is fine, but the way the host keeps cracking non-sequitur jokes is maddening. It really clashes with the show.",
  [21317301] = "I learned a lot. The demonstrations were very detailed, and my kid was really into it too.",
  [21317302] = "Although it's useful to learn all this stuff, I still hope we never actually have to use it. Have safe lives, everyone!",
  [21317303] = "This show got the whole family interested and learning. Who knows, maybe it will save someone's life someday.",
  [21317304] = "I suggest you make a few more of these, because I feel like there are still situations you didn't cover. How about everyone sends in suggestions for the show to consider?",
  [21317401] = "This show is so useful! A long time ago, I saw a good Samaritan use first-aid techniques like this to save someone's life. I want to be like that too.",
  [21317402] = "Everybody, study this stuff! Maybe people who have never encountered an emergency don't understand how important this can be. But those who know, know it all too well!",
  [21317403] = "I've been waiting my whole life for this!! I've been looking all over for a show that teaches these survival techniques, and I've finally found it!",
  [21317404] = "There's a saying that saving a life earns more merit than building a pagoda of seven stories. This great show is a blessing for everyone! We should earn some good karma just for sharing it!",
  [21318101] = "This kind of subject matter has been done a hundred times, and I don't feel up for watching it again.",
  [21318102] = "The lovingly-crafted message of the original work has been distorted again, and changed into utter trash too, btw! I'm furious!",
  [21318103] = "The pacing is all over the place, and the acting is hard to watch. It's so difficult to find a show that's watchable.",
  [21318104] = "I watched an episode, and I just can't go on. A pure waste of time.",
  [21318201] = "A lot of these stories don't make any sense. Can the scriptwriters make a little effort here?",
  [21318202] = "Heh, not much to say, except that these actors are really average-looking. After closing the page, I instantly forget their faces.",
  [21318203] = "I was kind of looking forward to this after seeing the trailer, but the first episode took all of that anticipation and dashed it to pieces. Sigh.",
  [21318204] = "Before watching, I kind of pitied the show for getting so much flak online, but after watching, I see that there was good reason for it.",
  [21318301] = "The child actor had some truly decent acting skill. He looked realistic and natural. He's quite a prospect.",
  [21318302] = "I've only watched two episodes, but it looks pretty interesting, so I added it to my favorites.",
  [21318303] = "The acting of some of the supporting cast can be a little over the top, but overall it's a solid show.",
  [21318304] = "I never read the original novel before, but I think the TV show is pretty interesting. I'll have to consider going back and reading the original.",
  [21318401] = "Wow, this child actor is so adorable! I just want to take him home with me!",
  [21318402] = "I was only watching this because my idol has a guest role, but to my surprise, I was instantly sucked in. It's really good!",
  [21318403] = "I sit in front of my computer every night waiting for a new one to come out. This TV show is really worth the watch!",
  [21318404] = "Why did I not discover such a good show earlier?! I've already recommended this to everyone I know. If you haven't seen it yet, what are you waiting for?!",
  [21319101] = "What's significant about this building? It has no useful value and is also ugly to boot. I just can't admire it at all!",
  [21319102] = "This show can't get any worse. I have no idea what they're trying to say filming all these kooky buildings.",
  [21319103] = "These weird monstrosities are what pass for creativity these days? You say it's \"unique\" and \"has character\"? I say it's just ostentatious claptrap.",
  [21319104] = "This show is nothing but filler. All of those long shots can be shortened to two seconds. I'm really impressed by anyone that doesn't fall asleep watching this.",
  [21319201] = "I usually quite like shows about architecture, but this one is too boring to keep watching...",
  [21319202] = "One of those buildings in the middle was just straight-up plagiarism, but it's put on such proud display in this show. Where are your morals?!",
  [21319203] = "I spit out the cola I was just drinking. This architect not only makes strange-looking buildings, but his hairstyle also defies description!",
  [21319204] = "I think they totally could've done a better job filming this. The way it looks right now just isn't enticing.",
  [21319301] = "I just love the styles of all these buildings. These architects truly are incredible!",
  [21319302] = "Although I don't think human creativity is a match for the exquisite workmanship of nature, I still respect the meticulous work of these people.",
  [21319303] = "I'm an architectural design student, and I hope one day I can create work with such unique style.",
  [21319304] = "When I first started watching, I thought it was all weird, but the more I watched, the more I liked it. Now I think I even understand the architects' thoughts a little.",
  [21319401] = "I'm floored!! If only I could go see the works of these architects in person someday! However, these photographs are just stunning too.",
  [21319402] = "To be honest, I didn't get enough. I hope next time they'll have on even more architects that I love. It makes me happy just thinking about it!",
  [21319403] = "I could watch this a hundred times and not get tired! The show's production team must have worked hard to find so many genius architects.",
  [21319404] = "I registered an account specially to write some praise for my precious show. I really couldn't love it more. I hope you keep up the good work!",
  [21320101] = "The venue was so chaotic that I couldn't catch a word of the lecture.",
  [21320102] = "The venue was so chaotic that I couldn't catch a word of the lecture.",
  [21320103] = "The venue was so chaotic that I couldn't catch a word of the lecture.",
  [21320201] = "Such a waste of time. Could've just gone to the library and learned a lot more.",
  [21320202] = "Young people these days... they just don't make 'em like they used to.",
  [21320203] = "Boring. I binge-watched a show while there.",
  [21320401] = "It was surprisingly accessible to the layman. I learned a lot.",
  [21320402] = "Professor Lucien naturally lives up to his reputation. I'm ready to learn.",
  [21320403] = "Professor Lucien is the GOAT! So handsome and also knows so much! How are we mortals supposed to compare?!",
  [21321101] = "Everybody knows what level most girl gamers are at. What's the point in trying to make them out to be so incredible?",
  [21321102] = "Isn't this just a random hodge-podge of online videos? Can't you put out a little O.C.?",
  [21321103] = "You remember that incident with the girl streamer who had someone else playing for her? Ever since then, I haven't trusted any of these other elite females.",
  [21321104] = "You're not even good at plagiarizing, are you? The editing of these videos is all over the place. It's unwatchable!",
  [21321201] = "Let's be honest, girl gamers like this are rare. I hope they can learn the most basic gaming common sense.",
  [21321202] = "Boring. These things have been reposted to death online. I can't stand watching it.",
  [21321203] = "Are you trying to teach our youth to play more video games? Can't you give them some proper guidance and instill some respect for society?",
  [21321204] = "Can't they do some things that girls typically do? Do they have to play video games?",
  [21321301] = "Actually, girl gamers today aren't much inferior to their male counterparts, but still there are people who look on others with bias.",
  [21321302] = "Total noobie here! I feel like I can do it again! I'm committed to becoming like this girl!",
  [21321303] = "I think I'm in love with these incredible ladies! Please tell them I love them for me!",
  [21321304] = "I know a girl who's amazing at gaming too. We go to her all the time to help us level up, and we all call her Big Boss Lady.",
  [21321401] = "I've been playing this on a loop! I laugh till I cry every time! This is just amazing!!",
  [21321402] = "That boy being coached by the lady is just off-the-charts adorable. This is exactly how it should be. Learn from whoever has the goods, no matter their gender.",
  [21321403] = "Me! Me! Me! I am a dedicated girl gamer! These incredible ladies have lit a fire under us girl gamers!!",
  [21321404] = "I help coach people all the time, lol. My boyfriend is a lot more noob than me, so he's always riding my coat tails in games.",
  [21322101] = "This is scary? Is someone playing a joke on me?",
  [21322102] = "I don't feel any hint of fear, and kinda want to laugh. Shows these days just don't take things seriously anymore.",
  [21322103] = "I've been to this scary amusement park before. It wasn't that special, and it didn't cost cheap either. Choose wisely, everyone!",
  [21322104] = "What? Is there even an ounce of scary atmosphere here? Is this just what the park is like, or did they do a bad job filming it?",
  [21322201] = "I had made plans with friends to go here this weekend, but looks like I can skip it. Really disappointing.",
  [21322202] = "Last time I went there, it was pretty scary. Why does it look so boring here?",
  [21322203] = "They call this a scary amusement park? There just seems something oddly off about the scenery and the ghosts inside. Kinda find it funny.",
  [21322204] = "The video is so dark, I can't tell what's going on. Maybe in person, it's alright, but the filming of this is rubbish.",
  [21322301] = "Check out what I found. This place looks like so much fun. We've gotta go next time we're free!",
  [21322302] = "Scaredy cats like me should turn off the background music and watch it that way. It makes it less than half as scary.",
  [21322303] = "It's shot just like a horror film. The atmosphere seems perfect. I'm definitely going if I get the chance.",
  [21322304] = "I would love to try being a ghost in this scary amusement park. I bet it would be fun...",
  [21322401] = "This is right up my alley! Horror fans, let's gooooo!!!",
  [21322402] = "Looks like they put a lot of effort into the details, and the atmosphere is on point. My pulse is racing without even leaving my home!",
  [21322403] = "I made a deal with my mom that if I do good on my final exams, she'll take me. I'm going to hit the books now!",
  [21322404] = "I really envy these people! I want to be a haunted house ghost too and scare people out of their wits! Super fun!!",
  [21323101] = "Why are movies these days always about these ephemeral little crushes? There's no depth!",
  [21323102] = "To be honest, I wouldn't like a lovesick guy like this no matter how good-looking he is. Guys should be able to see the bigger picture!",
  [21323103] = "Just telling it like it is, their problem is nothing but too little homework. They're all students, so why don't we just let them study!?",
  [21323104] = "This pace is just glacial. I watched ten minutes, and I had to turn it off. These long, drawn-out scenes are exhausting.",
  [21323201] = "I don't really like this genre of movie, and it's not particularly well-done either.",
  [21323202] = "A lot of these campus love story movies are great films, with both laughs and tears, but this one is clearly just going through the motions.",
  [21323203] = "This film doesn't seem to have been well-funded. I feel like the props are all just laughable. I know it's set on a campus, but they can try to go the extra mile, can't they?",
  [21323204] = "While I was watching this, I was just crying out inside: I hope that boy I like is taking notes!!!",
  [21323301] = "Pretty well-done. It brought up some memories for me. A little sad really, but that's all in the past.",
  [21323302] = "They did a great job choosing this male lead. Probably reminds a lot of people of that one boy from school they had a secret crush on.",
  [21323303] = "In my dreams, I returned to those days in a school uniform. Some things you just can't look back on. As soon as I think of it, it opens the flood gates.",
  [21323304] = "Dear You Know Who, I'm thinking of you again. I guess I missed out and there's nothing I can do about it, but I hope your life has turned out good.",
  [21323401] = "Aaaah! I can't help myself from screaming. I want to know everything about this guy right now!",
  [21323402] = "So good looking! The crew really put their hearts into this film. Those little schoolboy crushes back then! So beautiful.",
  [21323403] = "This brought me to tears!!! The more wonderful something is, the more afraid that you'll actually get it, right?",
  [21323404] = "I want to say thanks to this movie for bringing me back to that time I most want to return to. It was like I was watching my own story.",
  [21324101] = "I really hate these forced laughs. I don't find it funny at all!",
  [21324102] = "Is it really nice to get laughs out of other people's mistakes... And my older brother was actually in two of the clips. That's mean!",
  [21324103] = "Why are there all of a sudden so many of these videos popping up lately? I've watched a handful, and they're all this same boring stuff.",
  [21324104] = "If it was a celebrity that you're a fan of being spoofed like this, would you be happy? I don't think you'd still be laughing.",
  [21324201] = "Aw, they aren't screwing up on purpose. I just don't think this is very nice...",
  [21324202] = "Am I the only one that thinks this isn't funny at all? I feel like this is pandering to the lowest common denominator.",
  [21324203] = "The quality of this video is unsettling. The audio and the images are all garbled. Why did I even click on this?",
  [21324204] = "I think it's pretty average. Not as good as I was imagining.",
  [21324301] = "I recommend anyone not happy to take a look. You're guaranteed to smile.",
  [21324302] = "I don't think anyone means any harm by this. Everyone's had some embarrassing times, and there's nothing wrong with pointing them out and having a laugh.",
  [21324303] = "Can I be the first to snicker at my beloved idol, lololol. I don't usually laugh at others unless I really can't help it!",
  [21324304] = "I usually don't laugh much, and even I can't hold back. This video really is good.",
  [21324401] = "I really never get tired of watching these blooper videos, especially when the editing is so outstanding. I totally love it!!",
  [21324402] = "Hahahaha, that one where he held the mic upside-down was too funny. An instant classic!!!",
  [21324403] = "I laughed so hard I almost threw up!!! I'm definitely sharing this. If it's your idol, it's your job to make fun of them. Don't let others beat you to the punch!",
  [21324404] = "This video is a fountain of happiness for me right now. Every time I think about it, I can't stop laughing.",
  [21325101] = "What was the point of making this show?",
  [21325102] = "They can make money from people just sitting around playing video games? The entertainment industry has really gone down the tubes.",
  [21325103] = "What's worth watching about this old boomer game?",
  [21325104] = "I don't get it... artists with terrible track records can be on TV too?",
  [21325201] = "Wasting my time watching what we did to waste time as kids. I don't really get it.",
  [21325202] = "The games were fine. It's the awkward guests that were the problem.",
  [21325203] = "There's not enough design. Are they adding it in post?",
  [21325204] = "This background music is driving me away. It's too noisy!",
  [21325301] = "It was so easy to make us happy when we were kids. Now I watch a show with funny artists, and there's no guarantee I'll smile.",
  [21325302] = "I know that there's some sensationalism going on in this show, but I still let myself get hooked.",
  [21325303] = "In the past, these show guests had some bad reputations, but after watching the show, I think they're alright people.",
  [21325304] = "Watching this makes me want to be back on the schoolyard, shouting and chasing after my friends...",
  [21325401] = "These guests are too cute!! They perfectly re-enacted the silly stuff I did as a kid!!",
  [21325402] = "It reminds me of ringing my neighbor's doorbell and asking if my friend could come out and play. Makes me kind of miss them...",
  [21325403] = "This new hide-and-seek game had me in stitches. I really feel for the poor cameraman, hahahaha!",
  [21325404] = "Other people laughed from beginning to end. I cried from beginning to end. I really miss childhood! :):):):):)",
  [21326101] = "With all due respect, I really don't understand the lifestyles of these celebrity-chasers. Can't you just live your own life?",
  [21326102] = "The way they filmed this was too one-sided, and nothing left a deep impression. Not to even speak of giving any food for thought.",
  [21326103] = "I didn't get what this was trying to say? Being a fan girl isn't easy either? Who does have it easy?",
  [21326104] = "These celebrity-chasing fan girls ruin social media platforms with all their fan-posting. Is it worth it? It's just a pretty face.",
  [21326201] = "Anyway, I would never chase celebrities, and I just don't get it.",
  [21326202] = "What are these fan girls fanning about? Can someone explain it? I'm really foggy on this.",
  [21326203] = "What are these nice girls doing wrong? Wasting their time obsessing over celebrities.",
  [21326204] = "I clicked on this because I was curious, but I found it too boring to watch. Can you cut to the chase?",
  [21326301] = "I feel like I learned about a world I never knew about before. Every person is deserving of respect.",
  [21326302] = "I've always been curious what these fan girls' lives are like. Apparently pretty tiring. I think I'll just be a fake fan.",
  [21326303] = "Being a celebrity-chaser isn't about blindly following a celebrity around wherever they go. It's about moving in that person's direction and making oneself a better person, step by step. Just wanted you all to know that.",
  [21326304] = "I don't know who she's a fan of. Maybe it's the same person I like? Hee hee hee...",
  [21326401] = "Wow, this was really realistic. I used to be a fan girl too, and naturally this brought back a lot of memories!!!",
  [21326402] = "Everyone has the right to choose how they're going to live their life, and as long as you don't regret it, then great. These people telling others how to live their lives should get a life of their own!",
  [21326403] = "Great stuff!! No one in my family understands the things that I'm doing now, but I don't have any regrets!",
  [21326404] = "I hope everyone finds their guiding light, and then chases after it! (Not saying everyone should go chase after celebrities)",
  [21327101] = "What a boring interview. I'm falling asleep watching it.",
  [21327102] = "What a boring interview. I'm falling asleep watching it.",
  [21327103] = "What a boring interview. I'm falling asleep watching it.",
  [21327201] = "My lovely Kiro doesn't seem to be exactly on his best form today...",
  [21327202] = "To put it simply, it was a let-down.",
  [21327203] = "This exclusive interview wasn't great, and the new single's album sales are down. Could Kiro be in a creative slump?",
  [21327401] = "Aaaah! My handsome boy is so cute and charming! I could watch this on repeat a million times!",
  [21327402] = "The new song is as good as always. Kiro's reputation in this business is still solid gold.",
  [21327403] = "The brightest superstar is back! Kiro is making waves with his new song!",
  [21328101] = "Am I the only one who thinks this new song misses the mark some? Is Little K's creativity drying up?",
  [21328102] = "I don't get why the people in the crowd were so fired up. It seemed pretty so-so to me.",
  [21328103] = "Does anyone know why this person is so popular? I see his face everywhere. What's so good about him?",
  [21328104] = "Anyone like me doesn't like Kiro? Upvote me to the top if you agree!",
  [21328201] = "Ummm, were the acoustics at the venue not that good? Why does the audio quality seem a little off?",
  [21328202] = "Who filmed this? It's not clear at all. The picture quality stinks. How is this supposed to convey how amazingly handsome Kiro is?",
  [21328203] = "I feel like the people Kiro has been working with lately are dropping the ball. This even seemed like a mess. The event holders need to put in some effort!",
  [21328204] = "From the video, it doesn't look that amazing. I hope it was better live.",
  [21328301] = "I waited all this time, and this is what I get? He barely sang a couple songs before they went into this boring fan interaction segment.",
  [21328302] = "I really regret not going to the live show. Next time I'm definitely gonna be there!!",
  [21328303] = "Kiro is still that same old Kiro, the most dazzling being in the whole world!",
  [21328304] = "I've liked Kiro for a long time. I've watched his whole career till now. I feel like a proud mommy!",
  [21328401] = "Aaaaaaaaahh! Everyone, scream with me! Shout his name out loud!!!",
  [21328402] = "Oh, you and your darned old, impossible-to-ignore charm! You're the most dazzling star on the stage!",
  [21328403] = "All the rainbows in the world aren't enough to describe Kiro's beauty. I would protect Kiro for all time!",
  [21328404] = "Kiro is mine, hear that people! No one else gets to have him!",
  [21329101] = "Why should I waste time watching these fights? Aren't the fights between people online fun enough?",
  [21329102] = "What kind of debate show is this? They don't follow any debate rules. Everyone's just saying what they want to say. It's more like old ladies squabbling.",
  [21329103] = "Those debaters all seem so imposing, but they're really hollow inside. I don't know why people like this get famous.",
  [21329104] = "That guy will even say yes to a debate show? Is he that desperate to be famous? A perfectly good internet celebrity shouldn't have to be on a debate show.",
  [21329201] = "I don't feel like this judge is fair at all. I think the other side was clearly better.",
  [21329202] = "Debating is about logic. If your logic is flawed and you just shout people down, then what's the point of this show?",
  [21329203] = "Even the national debate champion got eliminated. This really is a dumbed-down reality show pandering to the masses after all.",
  [21329204] = "My favorite contestant got eliminated, so this show can disappear now.",
  [21329301] = "Wow, I'm really digging this host. It's impossible to stump him. What a consummate professional!",
  [21329302] = "I never watched debate shows like this before. I thought they were all stodgy and serious, but this is actually quite fun.",
  [21329303] = "I feel debate doesn't always have to be cudgeling people over the head with science and facts. Sometimes emotional expression like on this show is more effective.",
  [21329304] = "There are a lot of contestants on here that I like. They're all so innocent and adorable.",
  [21329401] = "I follow every episode!! Sometimes I watch them two or three times! Hope there's a next season!!",
  [21329402] = "I never imagined that I'd be more into my favorite contestants than I am my favorite idol. The sex appeal of the mind is the most infatuating of all!",
  [21329403] = "Some of the contestants actually have speech impediments in real life, and they used debate to be able to communicate with people. It's so moving.",
  [21329404] = "I regret not finding out about such a good show sooner! I'm going to be a loyal fan from this day on!",
  [21330101] = "Isn't everybody's life like this? I don't know what there is to complain about.",
  [21330102] = "I think those couple of submissions are nothing special. The truly pathetic ones probably have no time to submit something.",
  [21330103] = "I don't quite believe it. Aren't most people just normal nine-to-fivers? Where did all these 9-9-6 workers come from?",
  [21330104] = "Nothing to see here, folks. These are clearly all made-up stories. I just don't know if they're made up by people online, or by the show's production team.",
  [21330201] = "Work is hard, but we can't not work, right? Getting together and complaining will only make grievances bigger.",
  [21330202] = "Can we not have some shows with positivity? I'm worn out from working all day, and I have to listen to this whining?",
  [21330203] = "Maybe only people who work overtime understand. I never work overtime, and I don't get it.",
  [21330204] = "If we could live without having to go to work, who would be willing to be a corporate slave?",
  [21330301] = "This show is saying exactly what I'm thinking. It's been two straight weeks with no break for me, and I don't know how much longer I can hold on.",
  [21330302] = "I'm always personally experiencing the most extreme all-nighters. This is normal for me.",
  [21330303] = "Finally, someone's speaking up for us office drones. I hope everyone cares about us a little more.",
  [21330304] = "Young people these days are already having their bodies start to quit on them. Maybe that's the price that our generation pays.",
  [21330401] = "Hahaha, I see that sliver of a smile amidst the misery. Maybe it's just pure self-derision.",
  [21330402] = "This show really pokes me in a sore spot. When is the overtime going to end? I just want to have a rest.",
  [21330403] = "I like working overtime. It brings me joy... As long as the pay is sufficient.",
  [21330404] = "My mom is always saying that my hard work now is nothing compared to how hard they worked in the past. I'd like to let her see this show and tell her why I'm so tired.",
  [21331101] = "Not even an ounce of anything worth paying attention to. If it's not too expensive, then it's too ugly. I wonder if this is just a straight-up marketing scheme.",
  [21331102] = "Nowadays everyone's pushing this value of exquisite egoism. I think it's all flash and no substance.",
  [21331103] = "I didn't feel any warmth. Just expensive.",
  [21331104] = "There is no \"best\", just what's best-suited for you. Chasing these trends will just end up with you looking like everyone else.",
  [21331201] = "This so-called fashion is just going along with the crowd, that's all. I personally never pay any attention to this stuff.",
  [21331202] = "All the things shared on here are as plain as could be. No need to make a whole show about it...",
  [21331203] = "In winter, all I need is a nice, thick quilt on my bed. Can all this gaudy stuff really keep you warm?",
  [21331204] = "Give up. The warmest thing in winter is indoor heating.",
  [21331301] = "They recommended a lot of useful stuff. Winter is here, so go ahead and treat yourself a little.",
  [21331302] = "The hat I bought after watching this really is super warm. I feel happy as soon as I put it on.",
  [21331303] = "Everything on the show looks so cute. I want to buy it all. But then I look at my wallet and say forget it.",
  [21331304] = "I've been wanting to buy myself a little gift lately. Watching these shows is great for reference.",
  [21331401] = "Wow!! With this stuff, I don't think I'll ever be cold in winter again!!",
  [21331402] = "I put in an order on the spot for my BFF. She was so happy.",
  [21331403] = "These recommendations are just perfect for me. Tomorrow, I'm going out in style!",
  [21331404] = "A cup of hot chocolate and a pastry. That's my ideal winter day!",
  [21332101] = "I thought it was a great thing, but after the show aired, it felt like it was turning into a bad thing.",
  [21332102] = "Do these little trivial things need to make the news too? Can we not focus on the big stories?",
  [21332103] = "Maybe I'm being paranoid, but could several schools be in a cheating ring together?",
  [21332104] = "What good are encouraging words at the semester's end like this? The people who can't pass aren't going to now.",
  [21332201] = "I don't like these kinds of shows. I like something more casual.",
  [21332202] = "Is making such big fanfare over this in order to get all the other high schools and universities to follow suit? There's no need to do anything like this.",
  [21332203] = "I still think schools should try to have a more low-key vibe. No flashy announcements. It makes people feel antsy.",
  [21332204] = "They actually made a school principal popular like this? That's a real eye-opener. Are school principals honored to be internet celebrities?",
  [21332301] = "The principals are just pure love and kindness. I graduated years ago, and even I still got choked up.",
  [21332302] = "Just great. I would love to go back to those school days.",
  [21332303] = "I want to go back to my alma mater and check in on the principal. I wonder after all these years if he's still so kind.",
  [21332304] = "I don't know why, but I'm so moved by this. Those principals are like caring older relatives to those kids.",
  [21332401] = "How moving!! My old school's principal is in here! Everyone loves him!",
  [21332402] = "I hope after everyone graduates that they'll remember how their alma mater cared for them and check in from time to time!",
  [21332403] = "Hahaha, you can do it, students! Pass those finals! Let's gooo!",
  [21332404] = "It's the end of the year again. I wonder if all my old teachers are as busy as they were back then.",
  [21333101] = "No need for all this forced sentimentality. These days playing on heart strings is so passe.",
  [21333102] = "Ugh, another one of these shows groaning and moaning about nothing. An affront to the eyes.",
  [21333103] = "Was that song at the end a joke? It had totally nothing to do with the stuff before it, right?",
  [21333104] = "I don't understand why people can't just get over things. As long as you're alive, that's something.",
  [21333201] = "I just think it's kinda over-the-top. We're all adults. Who's got time to dwell on the past?",
  [21333202] = "Looks like everyone's got a story. Am I the only one without a story? It's almost comical.",
  [21333203] = "This show is really boring. The only thing you're consuming is the negative emotions of others.",
  [21333204] = "A lot of people's pain stems from overthinking things. Just keep yourself busy, and you'll be fine.",
  [21333301] = "This show has succeeded in keeping me up all night depressed. Sorry for interrupting.",
  [21333302] = "Some things should not be broached lightly. As soon as you think about it, there's no getting that cat back in the bag.",
  [21333303] = "Some late-night bouts of angst are just wasted tears. Thank you to this show for showing me the way out.",
  [21333304] = "So it turns out there is someone on this earth whose experience is so similar to mine. Keep your chin up, Stranger! Things will get better.",
  [21333401] = "I was just watching and then the next thing I know, I was crying. Especially when that background music kicked in!",
  [21333402] = "Everybody is going to have some regret in their lives. Put that regret inside your heart and live your life!",
  [21333403] = "Everyone has stories hidden away in their heart. Sometimes hearing the stories of others helps you get shed of your own issues.",
  [21333404] = "It's been a long time since I've seen a show that's touched me like this. Without even realizing it, there were tears streaming down this old man's face.",
  [21334101] = "Too many loopholes. Come on, crew.",
  [21334102] = "Who are they fooling? It has wasted so much of my time.",
  [21334103] = "This episode perfectly presented the \"rubbish\" information.",
  [21334104] = "This is just a genius in hindsight. Nothing useful at all.",
  [21334201] = "What is there to discern? They don't have any evidence.",
  [21334202] = "What's the point? People only believe what they want to believe.",
  [21334203] = "What a load of rubbish. A waste of time.",
  [21334204] = "Do these so-called experts have any logic? They only ever talk nonsense.",
  [21334301] = "I didn't know there could be many traps in information. I've learned a lot.",
  [21334302] = "This episode has so much useful information! Look forward to the next episode.",
  [21334303] = "It makes sense and feels very applicable.",
  [21334304] = "The age of information overload is a test of our discernment. We still have a lot to learn.",
  [21334401] = "That makes so much sense! I'll share it with my friends now!!",
  [21334402] = "I hope there will be more shows like this. I want to get smarter.",
  [21334403] = "I used to be gullible and suffered much loss. I'll have to be careful from now on!",
  [21334404] = "I'm gonna share this show in the family group chat so they'll stop posting fake news!",
  [21335101] = "What's this stupid story? I can guess the ending from the start.",
  [21335102] = "Where did they get those players? Do they actually know how to play?",
  [21335103] = "It's making me so anxious! Come on! Are these people really this stupid?!",
  [21335104] = "This murderer mystery plot is too disappointing!",
  [21335201] = "Boring. I never play this kind of game.",
  [21335202] = "It doesn't have a clear logic at all.",
  [21335203] = "This game is only fun if you play with smart people.",
  [21335204] = "The innocent got completely misled!",
  [21335301] = "What a fab plot! So engaging!",
  [21335302] = "I've always loved murderer mystery. I'd kill it if I got onto this show.",
  [21335303] = "I didn't expect the celebrity to be quite clever. I thought she was only pretty to look at.",
  [21335304] = "Wow! So exciting! I wish they were better at it.",
  [21335401] = "How fun! I'm gonna get my friends to play this weekend!!!",
  [21335402] = "I watched it for the guest. He did so well!!!",
  [21335403] = "I'm here to look for pals to play this with!",
  [21335404] = "It's very mysterious at the start, then the truth started to come out, making me more and more nervous!",
  [21336101] = "You call this a rare phenomenon? Who are you fooling?",
  [21336102] = "I feel like I've seen it online. It's nothing new.",
  [21336103] = "Come on. At least make it look good. It's so fuzzy.",
  [21336104] = "No substance and the music is so slow. I almost fell asleep.",
  [21336201] = "How did they manage to make a show like a slideshow?",
  [21336202] = "The scenery is quite pretty, but nothing special.",
  [21336203] = "The photographer seems not very professional. The pictures are blurry.",
  [21336204] = "Another boring show. Nothing appealing.",
  [21336301] = "These astronomical phenomena are so gorgeous! I want to keep replaying them.",
  [21336302] = "Every image is like wallpaper! Love it!",
  [21336303] = "I remember the days when I was in the astronomy club in college chasing after these every day. I really miss it.",
  [21336304] = "A good show needs a few more episodes.",
  [21336401] = "It won't be fair if this show doesn't get popular! It's awesome!",
  [21336402] = "I've seen some of these before but didn't take any pics. It's really stunning!",
  [21336403] = "I wanna try this type of photography too!",
  [21336404] = "So stunning!!!! I'm in awe of the wonder of nature!!!",
  [21337101] = "History gives me headaches. Can't stand it.",
  [21337102] = "It takes skills to make such an exciting subject so tedious.",
  [21337103] = "Why would I waste my time on this instead of skateboarding?",
  [21337104] = "No what I expected at all. So disappointing.",
  [21337201] = "Finally a show on extreme sports, but then it ends up like this.",
  [21337202] = "How boring. It's putting me off extreme sports.",
  [21337203] = "I'm not being picky. This show really has nothing good about it.",
  [21337204] = "Not a single useful piece of information in it.",
  [21337301] = "I haven't tried any extreme sports, but they seem quite awesome.",
  [21337302] = "Not everyone has the guts to put their life at risk.",
  [21337303] = "The show is great. I start to understand why people like dangerous sports now.",
  [21337304] = "It's very meaningful. The more people know about it, the more people will understand it.",
  [21337401] = "Extreme sports are super cool!!! I just don't lack the courage to try.",
  [21337402] = "As an extreme sports enthusiast, I feel better informed and more in love with this hobby!",
  [21337403] = "I used to think that extreme sports are crazy, now I wanna apologize for my ignorance.",
  [21337404] = "I always thought people who love extreme sports people are amazing!!",
  [21338101] = "The film is not engaging at all. Can't watch it anymore.",
  [21338102] = "It feels very superficial and missing the point. They don't really know what we really love.",
  [21338103] = "This is just a gimmick. They didn't make anything clear.",
  [21338104] = "They don't understand the ACG culture. This documentary doesn't appeal to me.",
